window.AKK_THE_VILLAINS_LITTLE_SISTER_IS_SPOILED_BY_THE_MALE_LEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_THE_VILLAINS_LITTLE_SISTER_IS_SPOILED_BY_THE_MALE_LEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: My Brother Is a Villain","paragraphs":["Song Luokui at this moment watched the two \"gangs\" fighting in front of her with some confusion, because she suddenly remembered that she was supposed to be a character in a novel.","In front of her, two chubby boys who still had traces of baby fat were wrestling with each other. The specific reason was not very clear to Song Luokui, probably for \"territorial disputes\"?","And the one at a disadvantage at the moment was her own older brother, Song Luosheng, a handsome boy who had just finished first grade. He was also the antagonist in the book. The one pressing him down and fighting with him was the male lead, Chi Yu, the future prince of the capital circle and the world's richest man.","Song Luokui didn't make a move yet, but someone suddenly shouted, \"An adult is here!\"","With a \"whoosh,\" everyone who had been wrestling instantly separated. After Chi Yu let go of Song Luosheng and ran away, Song Luosheng quickly stood up and ran over to Song Luokui, pulling her hand. \"Little sister, let's pretend to go home.\"","Song Luokui was still holding a small bucket of sand in her hand. At this moment, she was a five-year-old child, and her short legs couldn't keep up with Song Luosheng's pace. She was almost tripped by him. Inside the wooden bucket was a small shovel, which made a \"clattering\" sound as it shook.","Why run so fast pretending to go home? So, there are people keeping watch while you guys fight?","Back at home, Song Luosheng let go of Song Luokui's hand, went to the kitchen to get a bottle of water, and sat on the sofa, gulping down the water. After wiping his mouth, he started to curse, \"Damn Chi Yu, next time I'll definitely beat him until he begs for mercy...\"","Song Luokui put the small bucket aside and walked to the sofa in the living room, thinking about her brother's past records... It seemed like he rarely won...","So worthy of being the antagonist, always at odds with the male lead since childhood?","Song Luokui didn't remember the details of the book very clearly. She only remembered that it was a male-oriented novel, and at the beginning of the story, the male lead hadn't even graduated from college yet, but he was already the prince of the capital circle, surrounded by a group of followers.","The antagonist was also part of the same circle as the male lead, but they were always at odds. Whether it was academic performance, various activities, or fights in the business world, the antagonist was always suppressed by the male lead, to the point where his character became twisted and he wanted to harm the male lead, but ended up being taken care of by the male lead instead.","In the end, the antagonist jumped off a building and died by his own hand. As for the antagonist's family, the book only mentioned that he had a younger sister who died at a young age, and his parents were left with white hair from grief.","So, she was the younger sister who died young?","\"Oh dear! Young Master and Young Miss, where did you go? Why are you so dirty?\" Aunt Gui, the housekeeper, came back with groceries and saw two little kittens in the living room.","\"Young Master, did you take Young Miss to fight?\" Aunt Gui wiped Song Luokui's little face while looking at Song Luosheng.","Song Luosheng felt a little guilty. \"No, we just went to play with sand.\"","Aunt Gui didn't know whether to believe it or not. She picked up Song Luokui and said, \"Little Miss, let's go change clothes. Young Master, you should also change your clothes. When Young Master comes back and sees you like this, you'll probably have to stand in the corner again.\"","Song Luosheng raised his head defiantly, \"Hmph, what's there to be afraid of! It's just standing as a punishment.\" However, as soon as Aunt Gui carried Song Luokui upstairs and into the room, he immediately ran back to his room to change clothes, making sure to put on a tough act with his mouth.","Meanwhile, Song Luokui was being dressed in a beautiful little dress by Aunt Gui. \"Oh dear, my little miss looks so pretty.\"","Song Luokui smiled at Aunt Gui, \"Thank you, Aunt Gui.\"","Aunt Gui's heart felt as if it had been touched by her smile. Her little miss was the most well-behaved and adorable child, and her smile made Aunt Gui's heart feel warm and sweet.","Aunt Gui picked her up again and said, \"Let's go, are you hungry? What would you like to eat tonight? Aunt Gui will make it for you.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"I want to eat fish.\"","\"Alright, alright. Aunt Gui will make delicious fish for my little miss later. You sit here and play for now.\" Aunt Gui placed her on the sofa in the living room and placed some toys in front of her.","\"Okay.\"","\"Our little miss is so obedient.\"","On the other side, Song Luosheng quickly changed his clothes and came out of his room. He sat down next to Song Luokui and said, \"Sister, let's play together.\"","While Song Luokui agreed, she was thinking about how to prevent her own brother from becoming a villain.","Well, first, she should avoid dying prematurely. However, Song Luokui felt that she was quite healthy. She had regular check-ups every year, and although she would occasionally catch a cold or even have a fever during seasonal changes, they were all minor issues.","Before long, their parents arrived home. Both of them were civil servants.","\"Luokui, Mom and Dad are back!\"","Upon hearing the voices, Song Luokui immediately put on her little shoes and ran to the door. \"Mom and Dad, you're back!\"","\"Ah!\" Song Moqian lifted Song Luokui into his arms and gently kissed her cheek. \"My dear Luokui, what did you play at home today?\"","Sheng Rong, after putting away the bags and clothes, also came to Song Luokui's side, holding her small hand. \"Luokui, were you well-behaved at home today?\"","Before Song Luokui could answer, Song Luosheng also walked over. \"Mom and Dad.\"","Song Moqian shifted his gaze to him. As a former reconnaissance soldier, he immediately noticed something was off with his son. Song Moqian narrowed his eyes and, unlike his attitude towards Song Luokui, became serious. \"Did you get into a fight today?\"","Song Luosheng immediately lowered his head, fidgeting with his hands, and didn't dare to meet Song Moqian's gaze. \"No...\"","\"You're lying!\" Song Moqian noticed a small bucket playing with sand on the side. \"Did you take your sister out as well?\"","Song Luokui tugged at her father's clothes. \"Daddy, I wanted to play with sand.\"","Song Moqian's expression immediately changed. \"Good, Luokui must be very good at playing with sand.\" He then turned his head and became serious again. \"Song Luosheng, go face the wall for ten minutes!\"","\"Understood.\" Song Luosheng didn't dare to argue and obediently went to the corner to reflect. He was already used to it.","Aunt Gui came out of the kitchen. \"Young Master and Madam are back, just in time for dinner.\"","Song Moqian nodded, \"Aunt Gui, thank you for your hard work. Luokui and I will wash our hands, and then we'll have our meal. Dad smelled the fish, the one Luokui likes to eat, so we'll have it tonight.\"","Song Luokui glanced at Song Luosheng and asked, \"Where is big brother?\"","Song Moqian replied, \"He can eat after ten minutes.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luokui didn't interfere with her father's way of raising her brother. She had previously pondered that the reason her brother turned into a villain might be because he had been competing with the male lead and constantly losing. It made him doubt his own abilities and twisted his mindset.","She needed to find a way to make her brother stop obsessively competing with that overpowered male lead. Perhaps if he could let go of the male lead, he would realize how beautiful the world could be.","Song Moqian seated Song Luokui at the dining table, and Aunt Gui had already served their meals. Song Luokui glanced at Song Luosheng, picked up a small spoon, and obediently began to eat.","Beside her, Song Moqian carefully removed a fishbone from a piece of fish meat before placing it in Song Luokui's bowl. \"Thank you, Dad,\" she said, using her spoon to pick up a piece of meat for him.","Song Moqian replied, \"You're welcome. Eat up.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","Song Luokui quickly finished the fish meat, and Song Moqian prepared to serve her a second piece. However, she felt a bit embarrassed to constantly rely on her family to remove the fishbones, now that she was practically an adult. She immediately reached out and took the fish meat from him, saying, \"Dad, I'll do it myself. I can remove the fishbones on my own.\"","Song Moqian didn't insist. It was necessary to cultivate his daughter's independence. But he watched as she skillfully removed the fishbones before putting the meat into her mouth. Only then did he feel at ease.","Song Luokui was well aware that she had eaten the fish meat after removing the bones. However, as she swallowed, she felt a sharp pain in her throat. Oh no, she had actually swallowed a fishbone!","Her first instinct was to quickly eat a mouthful of rice to push down the fishbone!","But instead of dislodging the fishbone, it seemed to get stuck even more. She felt something was wrong and immediately put down her spoon, reaching for her throat.","Song Moqian noticed it immediately. \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui tried to speak but found that she couldn't, and she started to feel short of breath. Could it be that she was choking on the fishbone? In her previous life, she had choked on fishbones before, but it wasn't this severe.","\"Cough, cough, cough!\" Although Song Luokui couldn't speak, she could still cough. Song Moqian immediately understood. \"Is the fishbone stuck in your throat?\"","Song Luokui nodded hastily. In an instant, everyone became nervous. Song Luosheng, who had been reflecting on his actions, rushed over without hesitation. \"Sister, what's wrong?\"","Song Luokui's face turned red from coughing, but she felt increasingly uncomfortable. She didn't know why, but suddenly, a line from the novel came to her mind: \"The villain had a sister, but she died young!\"","Holy crap! Could it be that she was going to die from choking on a fishbone? Was the scriptwriter going to eliminate this obstacle now?"]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: Confirmation of the 'Death' Incident","paragraphs":["Song Moqian held her in his arms as they hurriedly ran out, followed by several people. They quickly got into a car and headed to the nearest hospital.","Song Moqian kept comforting her, saying, \"Luokui, take deep breaths. Inhale, exhale, inhale, exhale, don't be afraid.\"","In the car, Song Luokui's coughing became more severe, her face gradually turning redder, and her breathing became even more difficult.","Song Luosheng, who was beside her, was crying and calling out, \"Sister, sister!\"","Sheng Rong and Song Moqian were also extremely anxious, urging the driver, Uncle Kang, to drive faster. Uncle Kang stepped on the gas pedal, and within ten minutes, they arrived at the hospital.","Song Moqian carried her and shouted, \"Doctor, doctor!\"","Song Luosheng also followed, continuously crying out, \"Doctor, save my sister! Sob, sob, sob, please save my sister!\"","The doctors quickly came out upon hearing the commotion, and the nurses rushed over too. Song Moqian ran alongside them, explaining the situation.","Song Luokui only remembered having her mouth opened for examination, blood drawn, and being pushed into the emergency room...","After some time, Song Luokui finally woke up. As soon as she opened her eyes, she saw Song Luosheng's face. \"Sister is awake!\"","Song Luosheng shouted, and then Song Moqian and Sheng Rong rushed over. Song Luokui also saw Aunt Gui and Uncle Kang.","\"Mom, dad, I'm fine,\" Song Luokui smiled at everyone. Her throat still felt uncomfortable, but the suffocating sensation was gone.","Song Luosheng held her hand tightly. \"Sister, you scared me.\"","Song Luokui looked at him and said, \"Brother, I'm fine.\"","Sheng Rong tidied her hair and said, \"Baby, rest well. Mom and dad are here.\"","\"Yeah.\"","Song Luokui still had needles in her hand. She had only swallowed a fishbone, but ended up in the hospital. It was simply unbelievable.","Song Luokui wondered how there could still be a small piece of fishbone even though she had already removed the others. She found it quite strange, but she only briefly entertained the thought of it being the fault of a divine plot.","While Song Luokui was receiving treatment, Song Moqian blamed himself, saying, \"I should have picked out the fishbone for her, or I should have checked again.\"","Aunt Gui beside him also regretted, her face filled with remorse. \"It's also my fault for buying a fish with bones. I really... sigh!\"","Sheng Rong could only console them, \"If that's the case, then I'm also at fault. I should have checked again.\"","Song Moqian and Sheng Rong held hands, praying for the safety of their youngest daughter. Aunt Gui also clasped her hands together, praying.","The incident of Song Luokui swallowing a fishbone and being taken to the hospital spread to their grandparents' ears within a few days. Song Moqian and Sheng Rong were scolded mercilessly, but Song Luokui said, \"It's not mom and dad's fault. I insisted on eating the fish myself. I won't eat fish anymore.\"","Grandma Lin Xianyuan gently touched her granddaughter's small face and said, \"Is my good girl feeling better? If you want to eat fish, go ahead and eat, but from now on, let your parents remove all the fish bones so you can eat it safely. It's not your fault, it's the fish's fault for having so many thorns! We won't buy it anymore!\"","Grandpa Song Ruhui chimed in, \"That's right! Whatever our good girl wants to eat, Grandpa will take care of it for you!\"","Song Luokui pondered for a moment and said, \"Although... the fish isn't really at fault. Moreover, it was already killed.\"","Grandmother Jun Lin squeezed in and touched Song Luokui's face and little hand, saying, \"Does it hurt from the injection, my dear? Grandma scolded that fish for you.\"","Maternal grandfather also joined in, \"You've lost weight, my dear. I asked Aunt Chen to make some nourishing soup for you to drink later.\"","\"Okay, Grandpa, Grandma, maternal grandfather, and maternal grandmother, I'm fine. No need to worry.\" Everyone cared for her so much that Song Luokui felt warm and obedient.","After observing her for a while, they stopped disturbing her and let her rest.","Two days later, Song Luokui returned home, and her family held a discharge ceremony for her. She even received gifts and enjoyed a small cake.","As she looked at her family by her side, Song Luokui couldn't help but sigh. She must have accumulated great fortune from her past life to have such a wonderful family in this life.","The recent little mishap had made Song Luokui worry for a while, but nothing happened during this time, and she thought maybe she was overthinking things.","Just as she let out a sigh of relief, she saw Song Luosheng return home muttering angrily, saying, \"That damn Chi Yu, I'll definitely defeat him next time!\"","Song Luokui thought to herself, she had heard this sentence several times recently.","So, she started thinking about how to keep her brother and the male lead separated. However, their households were currently in the same compound, with the Song family living in the east and the Chi family in the west.","Song Luokui's eyes wandered, and she thought, why not go and stay at her grandparents' place for a while? Song Luokui deemed it feasible.","But before she could mention going to her grandparents' place, another mishap occurred. This time, she nearly fell down the stairs.","Early in the morning, just as she woke up and was still a bit groggy, she was absolutely sure she saw the way clearly. As she took a step down the stairs, intending to greet Song Luosheng in the living room, her foot slipped, and she leaned forward, about to fall down...","Song Luosheng let out a startled cry, \"Ah!\"","Aunt Gui, who had heard the scream, rushed out of the kitchen and saw Song Luokui grabbing onto the nearby handrail with her hand in an unusual position, sitting on the stairs.","With a sharp intake of breath, Song Luokui cried from the pain.","\"Miss, are you okay?\" Aunt Gui hurriedly ran up, followed closely by Song Luosheng. \"Sister! Are you hurt?\"","Song Luokui pulled her hand back, her wrist hurting badly. She had sprained it, and her bottom also ached.","Aunt Gui immediately noticed the swelling on her wrist and quickly ran to the kitchen to get an ice pack. \"Miss, bear with it and don't be afraid. Aunt Gui will take you to the hospital.\"","While carrying her and heading outside, she said to Song Luosheng, \"Young Master, please make a call to Young Master and Young Madam.\"","Song Luosheng quickly dialed Song Moqian's number using his child's watch, and it was quickly answered. \"Hello?\" came the voice on the other end. Song Luosheng immediately shouted at the top of his lungs, \"Daddy, sister got hurt! She almost fell down the stairs. Aunt Gui and I are taking her to the hospital now.\"","\"What!\" Song Moqian immediately stood up, his entire being in a state of urgency. \"Don't worry, Daddy will come right away.\"","However, the secretary came in at that moment and said, \"Director Song, the meeting is about to start.\"","Song Moqian's hurried steps came to a halt as he looked at him. \"Secretary Zhang, help me with something.\"","\"What is it?\"","...","Meanwhile, Aunt Gui arrived at the hospital with the two children in no time. They had already received a call and were waiting. The doctor examined Song Luokui and confirmed that she had sprained her hand and advised her not to hold anything for the time being.","Secretary Zhang also arrived quickly and learned about the situation. Upon knowing that the leader's child had only sprained her hand, he breathed a sigh of relief. He quickly sent a message to report the situation, and then he accompanied the three of them until the doctor finished the treatment and took them back home.","Song Luosheng behaved like a little adult. \"Thank you, Uncle Zhang.\"","Secretary Zhang patted his head. \"Good boy.\"","In the afternoon, after Song Moqian and Sheng Rong hurriedly returned and learned about the situation, Secretary Zhang left.","Aunt Gui said, \"I checked it. The stairs were clean, and there was nothing on them. Miss didn't know how she almost fell down. Miss's shoes are clearly slip-resistant.\"","Song Moqian and Sheng Rong also reviewed the home's surveillance footage, which ultimately proved it was an accident. They could only say that Song Luokui wasn't careful while walking, as she had just woken up and might still be a little groggy.","Only Song Luokui knew it wasn't like that. This time, she was certain. She had walked perfectly fine! Somehow, Song Luokui was reminded of the \"premature death\" incident."]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: The Ultimate Purpose is to Live","paragraphs":["This time it wasn't as serious as last time. Everyone felt it was an accident. Song Luokui could only stay home to recuperate for more than half a month.","However, just as her injuries were healing, another accident happened. Song Luosheng had to go out again to play with his little brothers, and Song Luokui was afraid he would run into the male lead again. She decided to go with him, since they were just going to stay within the residence and it shouldn't be dangerous.","Song Luokui hadn't gone out for a long time while she recovered from her injuries, so going out would also be a good chance to get some fresh air.","So Song Luosheng took her along. He even carried her small bucket and shovel, planning to take her to play in the sand.","When they arrived, Song Luosheng let her play in the sand while he went to play \"Fighting the Devils\" with his little brothers nearby.","Song Luokui wasn't really a little kid anymore and didn't enjoy playing in the sand. She just wanted to take a little walk around, carrying her small bucket like a little old lady.","Suddenly, not far away, a woman saw Song Luokui and her eyes lit up. She looked around and didn't notice anyone else. The little girl in front of her was just too cute and beautiful - chubby little cheeks, big eyes, and long eyelashes that fluttered like tiny brooms.","She would definitely sell for a high price!","The woman immediately walked over and crouched down next to Song Luokui. \"Little sister, where are you going? Which family are you from? Do you want me to take you to find your mom? I can take you if you want.\"","If she was a normal child, she probably would have agreed without much hesitation. But Song Luokui felt something was wrong. She shook her head, \"No need, my family is just up ahead.\"","After speaking, she tried to walk past the woman.","But the woman didn't listen. She picked Song Luokui up and said, \"Come, I'll take you to find your mom. Be good, and auntie will give you candy or fried chicken later.\"","Song Luokui immediately realized she had likely encountered a human trafficker. How could there be human traffickers inside the residence!","Song Luokui yelled loudly, \"Help! Mmph...\"","As soon as she yelled, the woman covered her mouth. \"Don't yell, auntie isn't a bad person. We'll go eat delicious food and find your mom and dad. I'm friends with your parents.\"","Song Luokui struggled, pushing her and shouting \"Mmph! Mmph!\" But the woman was very strong. Song Luokui hurriedly grabbed her small bucket and put it over the woman's head. Then she bit the woman's hand.","The woman yelled in pain and let go of Song Luokui's mouth. She hurriedly pulled the bucket off of her head. In those few seconds, Song Luokui shouted loudly, \"Brother, save me! Brother! Human trafficker! There's a human trafficker! Help!\"","On the other side, Song Luosheng was still going \"biu biu biu\" with his little brothers. \"I think I heard my sister yelling for help?\" he said.","A little brother replied, \"Huh? I didn't hear anything.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Could she have run into Chiyu and them and gotten bullied? I need to go check.\" When he ran over to the sand dunes and didn't see his sister, he immediately started searching around.","Soon he saw his sister being carried by a strange woman whose hand was covering his sister's mouth. He shouted while running over, \"Who are you? Why are you holding my sister?\"","The woman realized things were going badly and prepared to run away with the girl. But suddenly several stones came flying out and hit the woman - one on her forehead, one on her back, and one on her butt. \"Ow! Ow!\" shouted the woman in pain.","By the roadside, Chiyu stood holding stones, throwing them at the human trafficker.","At this time Song Luosheng arrived with his group of little brothers. Song Luokui had just managed to struggle free from the woman's hand covering her mouth. \"Brother, human trafficker!\" she yelled.","Song Luosheng shouted loudly, \"Get her!\"","Song Luosheng and his group of little brothers immediately started beating the woman. Although they were just children, the woman quickly couldn't defend herself and let go of Song Luokui to escape. Not far away, a little boy had brought some adults over.","The woman was soon captured. Song Luokui had narrowly escaped danger.","When Song Moqian and Sheng Rong heard that their young daughter had almost been abducted by a human trafficker, they rushed back in fright. Sheng Rong was so shocked her legs went weak and she almost fell to the ground.","The whole residence was also discussing the human trafficker incident. Everyone was puzzled about how a human trafficker had managed to sneak in and almost succeed at kidnapping someone when security at the residence entrance was so tight.","Song Luokui was also thinking that her premonition had been right - the Hand of Fate truly seemed to want her to suffer misfortune and die to correct the plotline. Maybe the \"her\" in the original story hadn't even lived past five years old.","First was the fish bone incident, then the falling incident, and now the human trafficking incident. Even though security was tight at the residence, how could a human trafficker suddenly appear?","If she hadn't been alert, perhaps she would have already been sold off by the human trafficker and died in the process - that would be a very normal outcome.","So now, the most urgent thing was for her to survive. Struggling against the Hand of Fate felt like quite stressful work!","A shout of \"Kui Kui!\" pulled Song Luokui back to reality. Then she was grabbed and embraced by her parents, who looked her up and down for a good while before finally relaxing and continuing to hug her.","Song Moqian was extremely angry. \"I'm going to thoroughly investigate exactly what happened with the residence! How could they let a human trafficker get inside!\"","Sheng Rong was also furious. \"You go investigate. I'll stay home with Kui Kui.\"","Not only was Song Moqian angry - the other people of the residence were also scared out of their minds. What if it had been their child? They had heard the Song family's girl had perceptively identified the human trafficker and called for help. They sized up their own children, and though they probably didn't want to admit it, at this age their own silly children probably would have been lured away with just a piece of candy.","It didn't even take an hour to thoroughly investigate the incident. It turned out the woman was a nanny working for one of the families in the residence. Her son had recently accrued a lot of gambling debt that he owed people. Someone had told her a child could be sold for a high price, though she didn't dare try at first since everyone in the residence was quite influential. But when she saw Song Luokui, the idea suddenly sprouted in her mind.","Ultimately, the events unfolded as described.","Additionally, she had stolen many of her employer's belongings over time, like jewelry, watches, and various other valuables that she planned to sell to pay off her son's debts.","In the end, the woman was convicted of human trafficking and theft charges, sentenced to 15 years in prison, and ordered to forfeit her illegal earnings. The family she had worked for also came to the Songs' home to apologize, as it was their poor judgment in hiring people that had nearly brought disaster to the residence.","As for Song Luokui, security around her became even tighter. In just these few months, several bad things had already happened. Her family didn't even dare leave her alone.","Song Luokui was also scared of dying, as she had so many family members who loved her dearly. How heartbroken they would be if something happened! And she still hadn't changed the fate of her brother.","She was absolutely determined to struggle against the Hand of Fate to the end!"]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Many Small Accidents","paragraphs":["Because Song Moqian was worried that something might happen to Song Luokui again, he was thinking of hiring another nanny to specially take care of her. After all, Aunt Gui still had to do housework and could not keep an eye on Song Luokui all the time.","Sheng Rong was a little hesitant: \"Would it have a bad influence?\"","Song Moqian also knew it. After thinking about it, he said, \"Or send her to stay with her grandparents for a while? Pick her up again when school starts? We can also take her back on weekends?\"","Sheng Rong felt it was feasible.","The next day, when he knew Song Luokui was going to her grandparents' home, Song Luosheng refused, \"I want to be with my sister!\"","Song Moqian glanced at him and said, \"Then you go too. Remember to do your homework every day. I will check every weekend and ask Grandpa to supervise you.\"","The homework Song Moqian referred to was not real homework, but horse stance boxing and stuff like that.","Song Luosheng: \"...\"","Song Luokui was of course willing to go to her grandparents' home, and her brother went together too. As long as she was not in the villa compound, her brother would have little contact with the male lead.","Before leaving, Song Luosheng also called his little brother and said he was going to his grandparents' place. He asked his brother to keep an eye on the villa compound and report to him immediately if anything happened on Chi Yu's side.","Song Luokui put on her small backpack: \"Brother, let's go!\"","Song Luosheng: \"Coming.\" Then he said \"Remember\" again to the phone before hanging up and ran to Song Luokui to hold her hand and walk out.","At their grandparents' home, the two enjoyed doting care again. However, there were always some minor accidents happening at any time, such as Song Luokui almost choking on water when drinking, or nearly tripping on flat ground when walking.","Fortunately, Song Luokui narrowly avoided those little accidents every time.","The summer vacation passed quickly. When they returned to the villa compound, Song Luokui went to the kindergarten class of Xihua Elementary School. Song Luosheng started first grade.","All children in the villa compound attended Xihua Elementary School. After the child trafficking incident, security patrols in the compound were strengthened. It was only two to three hundred meters from home to school, and guards would also follow them.","Song Luosheng and Chi Yu were arranged in the same class. The two were incompatible from the start. Before long, the class was divided into two factions due to their rivalry.","Later in learning and all kinds of competitions, Song Luosheng had to compete with Chi Yu. Only after returning home did Song Luokui learn from her brother’s complaints about Chi Yu that the two were in the same class.","How could this be?","Constant blows would surely distort her brother psychologically.","However...","\"Brother, why do you have to compete with him? There are many amazing people in this world. We should be open-minded. However strong he is, let him be. When the cool breeze strokes the hillside, just be yourself!\" advised Song Luokui.","Song Luosheng said, \"How can that be? As the boss, I must be the strongest in every aspect.\"","Song Luokui: \"There are so many people in the world. Does my brother have to compare with each of them?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Don't worry about it, little sister. I just don't like Chi Yu.\"","Song Luokui asked, \"Why? What bad things has he done?\"","Song Luosheng was silenced. It seemed there was nothing concrete. It was just that...","\"Once I defeat him, all the children in the villa compound will listen to me. Little sister, you are the little princess here. No one dares to bully you. The sandy beach will be open for you to play anytime, and you can let anyone you like play there.\"","Song Luokui said, \"...I'm not a bandit. The sandy beach should be open for everyone from the start!\"","Song Luosheng: \"That's because the beach is close to our side. You see you have never played in the playground over there. That's Chi Yu's territory. After I defeat her, I'll take you there to play.\"","The villa compound's playground was in the west, while their home was in the east, quite far apart. Song Luokui had never played there before. What's more, being mentally an adult now, she had little interest in such things anymore.","Most importantly, she was afraid something might happen to her if she played there. On school days recently, she either got frightened by mice or nearly got hit by playing children even when she had deliberately moved to the other side. Accidents just kept happening.","Seeing that persuasion didn't work, Song Luokui decided to wait until she survived the doom of dying before 12. Anyway, she was doomed to die before the age of 12. She would make specific arrangements after turning 12. Her life was of utmost importance now.","Time flew. Song Moqian and Sheng Rong were well aware of what had happened to their daughter. But they believed she was just relatively unlucky. Her grandparents even went to the Lingyin Temple to pray for her safety.","Not only that, they had also secretly invited someone to assess her fengshui. Song Moqian and Sheng Rong worked very hard and even donated money and goods under their daughter's name to help children in mountainous areas.","Song Luosheng was also educated not to bully the weak. Song Moqian threatened to break his legs if he dared to do bad things.","Song Luosheng secretly gulped. He knew his father meant what he said. But he really didn't bully the weak. Chi Yu was no weakling. They were rivals. As for others, he didn't care about them at all.","And so, Song Luokui watched her brother compete with the male lead throughout their elementary school years. They would soon enter Xihua Middle School, about two kilometers from the villa compound.","Song Luokui was now 11 and in the fifth grade.","When she was in elementary school together with Song Luosheng, Song Luokui would occasionally advise her brother at school. But now studying at different schools, she could only exhort him the day before he left for school. \"Brother, you are in middle school now. You should be more mature.\"","Song Luosheng: ?","Song Luokui: \"Stop trying to seize territory and antagonizing, you know, that person all day.\"","She saw Song Luosheng suddenly narrowing his eyes. \"Little sister, you mean Chi Yu, don't you? Have you become like those schoolgirls too?\"","Song Luokui was confused: \"What are you talking about?\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Those who go 'Ah! Chi Yu is so handsome! Ah ah ah!' like crazy bitches.\"","Song Luokui slapped his arm. \"What nonsense you're talking! Am I that kind of person?\" Though she admitted Chi Yu was good-looking, in her eyes, her brother was more pleasing aesthetically.","Song Luosheng had a cool and handsome look. He would likely grow up to be firm and masculine like his father. Chi Yu was relatively delicate and gave people a sense of distance. Their styles were quite different.","Song Luosheng asked again, \"Then why ask me not to antagonize him?\"","Song Luokui took a deep breath: \"I'm saying this for your own good. I just don't want you to be obsessed with one person all the time.\"","But Song Luosheng disagreed: \"When am I ever obsessed with him? I'm competing for the top spot. What's wrong with striving to be number one? Father said one should always strive to be the best!\"","Song Luokui: ... He was not wrong, but... She feared he would turn twisted and dark.","Oh well. He showed no signs of distortion or malice at present. There would still be more than ten years to go. If he failed in the future, she could encourage him more, cheer him on, make him know he was excellent. Perhaps he wouldn't become twisted if she praised him enough.","Wasn't his distortion caused by repeated setbacks? She would compliment him in the future to boost his confidence every day!"]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: The Offensive Intensifies","paragraphs":["Song Luosheng went to junior high school, but he still had younger brothers in elementary school. He told his younger brothers at school to take good care of his sister.","\"No matter what, don't let her get bullied by Chi Yu and his gang. If anyone gives her trouble, tell the teacher first, then tell me. Got it?\"","\"Got it, boss. Don't worry, we'll protect your sister.\"","In fact, Song Luokui didn't need their protection at all. She was an excellent student and the teachers' darling. If anyone bullied her, it would be a big deal. Who didn't know this kid was a bit special?","What was so special about her? She was frail...Prone to minor accidents that could easily turn major. Therefore, Song Moqian had specifically told the school teachers about this over the years. By now, the teachers had witnessed what Song Luokui's \"frailty\" meant.","Some clueless boys liked to bully girls back then—catching bugs, pulling their hair and stuff.","Song Luokui was bothered once. She immediately raised her hand to tell the teacher. Then the boy was dragged to the office and educated. Not only did he have to write a self-criticism of several thousand words, his parents were also informed before they took him home for a double parental beatdown. He even had to go to Song Luokui’s home to apologize...","Anyway, no one dared to bully her afterward. Of course, there was also the reason that Song Luosheng had made this clear at school: \"Whoever dares to bully my sister will become my mortal enemy!\"","At that time, Song Luokui still thought he was too melodramatic...","In short, no one at school dared to bully Song Luokui. As for Chi Yu's gang, some people didn't like Song Luosheng either. At first, someone even suggested bullying Song Luokui, but as soon as he said it, Chi Yu glanced at him. Chen Nan next to him laughed and walked over to grab the guy. \"Come on, let me teach you the rules.\"","Then the guy was \"taught the rules\" and left.","After that, no one ever talked about bullying Song Luokui again.","Song Luokui did have friends. Zhang Xiyue, a girl from the same apartment complex, was in the same class as her. The two often went to and from school together. Zhang Xiyue was considered as part of Song Luosheng’s circle because she was close with Song Luokui.","\"I wish I could go to junior high too,\" Zhang Xiyue said enviously.","Song Luokui: \"Just two more years. By then, you might regret it.\"","\"I won't regret it. Everyone else is in junior high while we're still in elementary school. It's boring.\"","Song Luokui: \"Aren't Chen Ke, Lin Wei and Zhang Xinxin still in elementary school?\" Chen Ke, Lin Wei and Zhang Xinxin were also part of their circle.","Zhang Xiyue: \"But I'm not very familiar with them.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm still here, aren't I?\"","\"That's true. Fortunately we have each other.\"","As the two girls walked home chatting, a soccer ball suddenly flew towards them, heading straight for Song Luokui's head.","Zhang Xiyue opened her mouth but no sound came out. Song Luokui swiftly tilted her head left, and the ball sailed past her ear, blowing up strands of her hair.","The ball landed on the ground with a thud. Someone from the other side ran over to apologize, \"Sorry, sorry! Are you guys okay?\"","Zhang Xiyue was very angry. Hands on her hips, she scolded, \"How could you kick it like that? You almost hit my friend!\"","Song Luokui waved her hand. \"It's fine. They didn't mean it. Let's go home.\" She was used to situations like this now. It was best to go home quickly in cases like this, otherwise another ball might come flying.","Over the years, she had experienced all kinds of stray basketballs, soccer balls, badminton shuttlecocks, table tennis balls, volleyballs and more, honing great dodging skills.","Recalling Song Luokui’s condition, Zhang Xiyue paused before pulling her friend away quickly.","They encountered no more incidents on the way home. Song Luokui relaxed with relief. She would turn 12 next year. Just one more year and she should be rid of such misfortune, right?","However, when Song Luokui turned 12, she realized the Powers That Be had intensified their attacks on her!","Specifically, the accidents became much more severe. For example, while walking on the road, a suddenly out-of-control sedan rushed straight for her. Song Luokui’s pupils constricted as she quickly ran to the side. The vehicle crashed directly into the stone pillar.","Song Luokui’s heart pounded. Nearby people ran over to ask if she was alright and dialed for emergency services.","Another time, she and Zhang Xiyue were shopping at the mall and taking the elevator. Zhang Xiyue seemed to have forgotten something so Song Luokui accompanied her. When they came back, the elevator was malfunctioning. Obviously they might’ve been trapped if they hadn’t left earlier.","And walking down the road, she almost got smashed by a flower pot falling from above. Each accident was aimed to take her life!","After discovering the Powers That Be wanted her dead, Song Luokui seldom went out except for school. It was relatively safer to stay at home.","Since realizing the plot set her up for doom, she had also stopped eating fish, installed soft padding around sharp corners in the house, and laid thick carpeting on the stairs. The family went out of their way to ensure her safety.","\"Kui Kui, want to see the junior high games? The basketball tournament is today. Your brother is playing and the opponent is the other gang from our complex,\" Zhang Xiyue called Song Luokui.","Song Luokui fell silent, then rejected due to safety concerns even though she cared about her brother’s match. She feared an accidental ball might hit her there.","\"Xiyue, I won't go. You can. Help me cheer him on,\" Song Luokui suddenly thought of something. \"When you come over later, help me bring something there.\"","Zhang Xiyue came over shortly after. Song Luokui handed her a large megaphone and said, \"Take this with you. If my brother's team scores, press 1.\"","Song Luokui demonstrated. The megaphone blared in her voice, \"Ahhh! Song Luosheng is the best! So handsome! Extremely handsome! More handsome than anyone! Crazy handsome!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"......\"","Song Luokui continued: \"If they lose in the end, press 2.\"","Upon pressing 2, Song Luokui’s voice emitted again: \"It's okay Song Luosheng, you're still the most handsome! You're more handsome than anyone, believe in yourself. Most handsome in the universe Song Luosheng, you're the best!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"......Are you sure your brother won't kill me?\"","Song Luokui: \"He won't. Give it to Zhou Yuan and say I asked him to do it. If my brother says anything, tell him to come find me!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"No problem!\" At least she wouldn't be embarrassed."]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: Come on, Song Luisheng","paragraphs":["Zhang Xiyue quickly arrived at the gymnasium of the junior high department with the trumpet. The competition here was about to begin. Zhang Xiyue quickly found her seat, and Zhou Yuan immediately asked when he saw her, \"Where's your sister?\"","They all called Song Luosheng's sister Song Luokui.","Zhang Xiyue replied, \"Luokui isn't coming, but she asked me to bring this over and told me to tell you that if our team wins, you should press the number 1 button, and if we lose, press the number 2 button.\"","Zhou Yuan patted his chest, \"No problem! Leave it to me!\"","Zhang Xiyue said, \"I hope you can still say that later.\"","The basketball game began quickly, with Song Luosheng closely watching Chi Yu. When the coach threw the ball, the two instantly jumped to grab it, but Chi Yu managed to grab the ball a step ahead. However, Song Luosheng's team didn't lose heart and quickly began to cooperate to defend and steal the ball.","The first point was scored by Chi Yu's team, and soon applause echoed on the court, accompanied by cheers: \"Go Class 7! Go Class 7!\"","Chi Yu was in Class 7.","Song Luosheng's team was in Class 5, but they were not worried. They soon scored a point, and Zhou Yuan pressed the \"1\" button immediately.","Then the voice from the trumpet echoed throughout the venue: \"Ah, Song Luosheng is the best! So handsome! Super handsome! Handsomer than anyone else! So cool!\"","It repeated again and again, reverberating.","Song Luosheng, who heard the voice, staggered for a moment. He glanced at Zhou Yuan holding the trumpet; the voice belonged to his sister.","Lin Xingyan beside him said, \"Hey! Your sister's trumpet is awesome. You see, the cheers from the other side don't match up to your sister's trumpet, impressive!\"","Song Luosheng glanced at him, \"Should I put your name next time?\"","Lin Xingyan chuckled, \"Hehe, if your sister praises me as handsome, I think it's okay.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Dream on!\" After that, he saw Chi Yu holding the ball, and he immediately rushed over to steal it from Chi Yu.","Zhou Yuan was initially startled, but soon he looked at the trumpet, \"Hey, no wonder it's his sister! The cheers from the other side can't compare to Luokui's! Look, the captain is even inspired by her.\"","Zhang Xiyue said, \"...But she just saw the captain stagger a bit.\"","Throughout the game, every time Song Luosheng scored, the entire court was filled with Song Luokui's praises for Song Luosheng!","Song Luosheng went from feeling embarrassed at first to getting used to it later, even feeling proud that his sister thought he was handsome. After all, his sister was the prettiest girl in the school, so if she thought he was handsome, there was no doubt about it!","After \"being handsome\" throughout the game, Song Luosheng's team ultimately lost, by just one point! Someone from the other side even gestured a thumbs-down to them, and Lin Xingyan almost rushed over to fight!","Song Luosheng immediately intercepted him, feeling very angry himself, but he didn't want to resort to violence in public. He planned to settle the score later, but then Song Luokui's trumpet sounded from the sidelines: \"It's okay, Song Luosheng, you're still the handsomest! You're more handsome than anyone else, believe in yourself, the universe's most handsome Song Luosheng, you're the best!\"","Song Luosheng: ...","Lin Xingyan chuckled, no longer wanting to provoke the other party. \"Boss, let's go back. Even though we lost, you're still the most handsome, the universe's most handsome! Tell your sister when we get back, so she can praise me like this next time.\"","The others laughed too. \"I want my sister to praise me too.\"","Someone suggested, \"Next time, let's have the sister say that Class Five's the most handsome!\"","Song Luosheng: \"You wish.\" He immediately went to the sidelines and turned off the trumpet. \"Where's Luokui?\"","Zhou Yuan looked at Zhang Xiyue, and Zhang Xiyue replied, \"Luokui didn't come. She asked me to bring this.\"","Thinking of his unlucky sister, Song Luosheng felt her absence was for the best. \"Is Luokui doing okay at school recently?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"She's doing fine.\"","Song Luosheng nodded, wiped the sweat off, and went backstage to shower and change clothes.","In the evening, Song Luosheng returned home to find Song Luokui watching TV in the living room. She turned to him upon hearing his arrival. \"How was the match today?\"","After putting his things away, Song Luosheng replied, \"We lost by one point.\"","Song Luokui wasn't surprised. \"It's okay, you're still the most handsome.\"","At the mention of this, Song Luosheng picked up the trumpet. \"Your trumpet stole the show today. Who told you to do that?\"","Song Luokui blinked. \"I thought of it myself. Since I couldn't watch your match, this was the only way I could cheer for you. Is it not good?\"","Song Luosheng: \"... Should I do the same for you next time you compete?\"","Song Luokui: \"No need for that. Didn't you say many people were loudly cheering for Chi Yu on the sidelines? I saw you envying him. So, why not give you a taste of that?\"","Song Luosheng pointed at himself. \"Me? Envious?\"","Song Luokui patted him. \"Don't be shy. I know you're envious. According to my calculations, by next year, I shouldn't be so unlucky anymore. When you compete then, I'll personally come to cheer for you. Today was a bit rushed; I'll praise you with more style next time.\"","Song Luosheng: ... Thank you.","Speaking of envy, his friends were indeed envious of him today.","True to her word, Song Luokui competed in October. In addition to the 100-meter race, there were relay races and swimming events.","Song Luokui didn't bother to watch, but she asked Zhang Xiyue to bring the loudspeaker over. Not only that, there was also a performance during the school sports day entrance, and while Song Luokui was watching an anti-Japanese drama, she directly suggested, \"Why not have your class perform killing the devils? And add a line: Never forget history, a strong nation includes me. The motherland can rest assured, Class Two, Grade Five, boldly claims the first place!\"","After saying this, she nodded approvingly; listen to that, it was quite uplifting.","Song Luosheng looked at her, thought for a moment, and felt it was a great idea. He clapped his hands, \"Feasible!\"","Song Luokui: ????","On that morning, Song Luokui got up early to do makeup for Song Luosheng. Today, Song Luosheng was going to be a general, riding a horse and directly beheading \"little devils.\"","There were ready-made clothes too; Song Moqian made new uniforms for him every year. This was Song Luosheng's childhood wish; he found Song Moqian very handsome in the uniform, so he wanted a set every year. Therefore, until now, Song Luosheng had a set every year.","Song Luokui had one too, but she didn't make a wish; her parents wanted to give it to her.","\"Good luck! You will definitely be the most handsome today. The boys defending the country are incomparable in handsomeness; that Chi Yu will definitely not be as good as you.\" Song Luokui saw Song Luosheng off.","Song Luosheng, unable to hide the smile on his lips, said, \"When big brother wins a medal and brings it back, I'll give it to you.\"","Song Luokui: \"That's not important; just remember that you are the best.\" She was afraid he would be discouraged again in today's competition.","\"Don't worry; the first place is definitely big brother's. I'm off.\" Song Luokui didn't stay at home for long and went to school. Zhang Xiyue also had to go to school, so she didn't go to watch the competition today.","\"I really want to go to the junior high school section to watch their sports day; it must be exciting. Kui Kui, shall we skip class?\" Zhang Xiyue suggested.","Song Luokui looked at her books, \"No, you're not allowed to skip class. It's just a sports day, not like we haven't seen it before. Study well; if your grades aren't good, you won't get into Xihua's junior high school section, then you'll have something to cry about.\"","Xihua Junior High School Section required an entrance exam. Although the children in their compound had policy advantages, if the scores weren't enough, they couldn't get in."]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: 12 Years Old","paragraphs":["Zhang Xiyue, upon hearing that Song Luokui would no longer skip classes, dedicated herself to studying with him. She promised, \"I'll check out the sports meet after school and let you know.\"","Their elementary school let out at three o'clock, and since the sports meet was expected to last until five in the afternoon on the first day, there would be time to catch some of the matches after school.","As for Song Luokui, she knew she wouldn't go – crowded places meant danger.","Suddenly, Song Luokui slapped her forehead, \"I forgot to ask my brother to bring the trumpet.\"","Zhang Xiyue replied, \"No worries, there's always tomorrow. I'll bring it when I come back, and we can ask Zhou Yuan to play it.\"","\"Sounds good.\"","That night, when Song Luosheng returned home, Song Luokui examined his expression and noticed something was off. She quickly deduced that he must have lost to the male lead. Eager to lift his spirits, she remarked, \"You were definitely the most handsome at today's opening ceremony, right? Everyone must've thought so.\"","Song Luosheng's face brightened, \"Our class won the Best Creative Award for the opening ceremony!\"","Song Luokui applauded, \"Impressive! That's my brother – the best! I bet everyone was captivated by your heroic spirit, defeating the invaders.\"","Proudly, Song Luosheng said, \"Absolutely.\" The applause and cheers from the audience at that moment were indeed lively. When Chi Yu made his entrance, it couldn't match the excitement. Many even wanted to ride the horse he brought.","However, that was his horse, and only a few of his followers were allowed to ride it. Yes, the horse he rode during the opening ceremony was a birthday gift from Sheng Rong, usually kept in the stable.","Later, Song Luosheng felt a bit disheartened, \"But I lost the 100 meters race by ten milliseconds, just ten milliseconds!\"","Song Luokui immediately reassured him, \"He must have given it his all, running ferociously to take the first place. Unlike you, even though you got second, you maintained your handsome appearance throughout the race. In these 100 meters, you were way more dashing than him!\" Song Luokui gave him a thumbs up.","Song Luosheng playfully poked her head, \"Flatterer!\" When did his sister become such a flatterer? Nevertheless, her words did bring a smile to his face.","The more he thought about it, the more he agreed with his sister. Chi Yu must have run with a ferocious determination to win, unlike him, who maintained a handsome appearance throughout.","Seeing Song Luosheng smile, Song Luokui sighed in relief, \"Brother, I'll cheer for you tomorrow.\"","Song Luosheng frowned, \"Are you going to watch?\"","Shaking her head, Song Luokui replied, \"No, I won't. But not being there won't stop me from cheering for you.\"","Suddenly, Song Luosheng remembered the trumpet. Could it be...","The next day, at the swimming competition, hearing the familiar cheering through the trumpet, Song Luosheng thought, \"...I knew it!\"","\"The unparalleled Song Luosheng, the legendary figure in our midst! Go, Song Luosheng! Go, Song Luosheng...\"","\"Let others be strong, let the gentle breeze brush the mountain top. You're you, unique in your own way. In my heart, Song Luosheng is the best!\"","Despite winning second place, Song Luosheng felt no disappointment. He couldn't help but reflect on how today's cheer was finally not about being the universe's most handsome.","Chen Nan over there handed Chi Yu a water bottle and smiled, saying, \"I wonder who's praising Song Luosheng so much, seems pretty talented?\"","Chi Yu didn't say anything. He knew who it was, Song Luokui, Song Luosheng's sister.","Speaking of Song Luokui, Chi Yu wasn't familiar. Mainly because Song Luokui was from Song Luosheng's side, they wouldn't have interacted for sure. Secondly, Song Luokui rarely strolled around the courtyard, so unless deliberately, the two wouldn't have crossed paths.","\"Let's go,\" Chi Yu grabbed his bag and headed backstage to change clothes.","The next day, Song Luosheng continued to listen to Song Luokui's cheering at the competition. The cheers today were different again, and this time he got first place. Today, Chi Yu and him didn't participate in the same event.","Back home, Song Luosheng handed the gold medal to Song Luokui. \"Here!\" Song Luokui took it, \"Wow! I told you, brother, you're amazing.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Chi Yu didn't participate today.\"","Song Luokui waved her hand, \"Who cares if he participates or not, why bring him up? I just knew my brother would do it!\" Song Luokui gave a thumbs up.","Song Luosheng smirked, \"Do you really think I'm handsomer than Chi Yu?\" Mainly because he had heard it too much, everyone said Chi Yu was handsomer.","Song Luokui patted her chest, \"Of course, I'm not lying. In my heart, you're definitely handsomer than him. He doesn't fit my aesthetic.\"","Song Luosheng grinned, those people just didn't have taste, or maybe his sister had taste. He ruffled her hair, \"You're right. I'll buy you a cake tomorrow, sis.\"","Song Luokui: \"I want chocolate flavor.\"","\"No problem!\"","Winter vacation came quickly, still more than a month until Chinese New Year. Song Luokui just needed to wait for this month to pass, and after New Year, she could completely shake off the title of \"unlucky ghost.\"","The weather was cold, Song Luokui stood on the balcony watching people playing basketball in the courtyard not far away. She couldn't see who it was, but thinking that Song Luosheng wasn't home, she went to the bedroom to get the telescope.","With a look, she saw Lin Xingyan and Zhou Yuan from the Chi Yu group playing basketball opposite. But her brother and Chi Yu weren't there.","\"Could they be having a showdown in some corner?\" Song Luokui thought, but in an instant dismissed the idea. If they were having a showdown, Zhou Yuan and the others should've gone too, they wouldn't be just playing basketball here.","She put down the telescope and didn't look again, turning downstairs. Aunt Gui was in the kitchen preparing dinner.","\"Aunt Gui, did my brother say where he was going today?\" Song Luokui asked. When she woke up in the morning, Song Luosheng wasn't home.","Aunt Gui: \"Young Master seems to have gone horseback riding.\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Oh,\" as long as he wasn't out fighting with Chi Yu.","However, what she didn't know was that at the racetrack, Song Luosheng encountered Chi Yu, and the two even had a horse race, with Song Luosheng narrowly losing!","By the time it was almost six in the evening, Song Luosheng had returned, wearing a gloomy expression. During dinner, he remained displeased, focusing only on eating quickly without saying a word. After finishing his meal, he set down his bowl expressionlessly and uttered, \"I'm full, take your time,\" before heading upstairs.","Everyone exchanged puzzled glances, unsure of what had happened.","Song Luokui swallowed a mouthful of food, clearly noting that the male lead had been disheartened again.","After dinner, Song Luokui cut up some fruit into a small plate, accidentally cutting her hand in the process, causing a bit of blood to trickle out. However, she simply sucked on her finger, applied a bandage, and left it at that.","With the plate of fruit in hand, she knocked on her brother's door upstairs. \"Brother?\"","Before long, the door opened, and Song Luosheng still wore the same expressionless face. \"What are you doing up here?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"Bringing you some fruit. I hurt my hand while cutting it, so you can't disappoint my good intentions.\" She entered the room, showing him her bandaged finger.","Song Luosheng took a deep breath, skewering a piece of fruit with a toothpick and popping it into his mouth. \"Let Aunt Gui do it next time. Why bother yourself? What if you have another accident?\"","Song Luokui waved her hand. \"It's just a small wound, I won't die from it.\"","At her words, Song Luosheng gave her a glare. \"Pah, what's all this talk about dying?\"","Song Luokui mimed sewing up her mouth. \"My bad, I'll live a long life, I promise.\"","Song Luosheng's expression softened slightly. Seeing his change in demeanor, Song Luokui immediately comforted him, \"Did someone get you down again today? What you're going through is nothing compared to my daily misfortunes, but I still manage to stay optimistic, don't I?\"","\"Compared to my streak of bad luck, what you're facing is trivial. It's just a loss; get used to it.\"","Song Luosheng retorted, \"...Is this supposed to be comforting? What do you mean 'get used to it'? And how do you know I lost again?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"I can tell from your expression.\" She patted his shoulder. \"Come on, don't be upset. Believe me, even if you lose, you should lose with style.\"","\"I know I'm the most handsome,\" Song Luosheng replied. \"You don't have to keep emphasizing it.\"","\"Well, if you know you're the most handsome, why be upset? Being handsome is enough.\"","\"...You make a good point,\" Song Luosheng conceded.","\"I'm always right. Trust me, your little sister who's always at the top of her class and never lies! Okay, I'm going to rest now. Remember to wash the plate after you're done eating.\" With that, Song Luokui left.","Watching her retreating figure, Song Luosheng muttered to himself, \"...Is being at the top of the class related to not lying?\""]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Life on the Line","paragraphs":["Song Luokui returned to her bedroom, read for a while, then took a shower and went to bed.","She almost didn't wake up from that sleep.","Early in the morning, Song Moqian and Sheng Rong went out to work, Song Luosheng finished breakfast and went out to play with his friends, while Song Luokui stayed in bed without getting up.","At home, Song Luokui was usually the last one to get up. Her family spoiled her, allowing her to sleep as late as she wanted. Song Moqian and Sheng Rong never said anything about it, they even said that being able to sleep was a blessing.","But Song Luosheng was different. If he got up late, he would get the bamboo stick from Song Moqian.","Until nearly noon, Song Luokui still hadn't gotten up, which made Aunt Gui feel puzzled. Normally, Song Luokui would have been up by around nine, but it was already past ten and there was still no movement.","Aunt Gui immediately went upstairs to check. There was no response when she knocked on the door. Worried that something might have happened, she quickly fetched the spare key and opened the door. As soon as she entered, she saw Song Luokui's face flushed red, burning up with a high fever.","She was unconscious.","Aunt Gui immediately called 120, then called Sheng Rong and Song Moqian. After that, she got some alcohol to wipe Song Luokui's body to bring down the fever. It was a flurry of activity. The ambulance arrived quickly and took Song Luokui away, with Aunt Gui accompanying her.","Meanwhile, Song Luosheng, who was playing football with his friends, heard the sound of the ambulance but didn't pay attention. Everything seemed fine at home when he left today, so he didn't think anything was wrong.","It was a neighbor's kid who ran over to him, \"Boss! Boss! I saw the ambulance at your house just now, it seems like something happened to your sister!\"","!!!","Song Luosheng kicked the ball away and immediately ran back home. However, when he arrived, there was no one at home. He quickly grabbed some money from the cabinet and ran out again, with Lin Xingyan and Zhou Yuan following him.","The three of them took a car to the hospital where Song Luokui often went. By this time, Song Luokui had already been taken into the emergency room.","Aunt Gui was anxiously waiting outside.","\"Aunt Gui, what happened to Kui Kui?\" It was very cold, but Song Luosheng was sweating profusely from running.","Aunt Gui wiped his sweat fearing he might get sick, \"It's unclear yet. When I entered the room, Miss Kui was burning with fever, unconscious. It's all my fault for not checking on her earlier!\"","Song Luosheng knew it wasn't Aunt Gui's fault, \"It's not your fault, maybe Kui Kui just caught a cold.\" He hoped she had just caught a cold, but thinking about past incidents, even a minor thing could turn into a big problem for his sister.","Since she was five years old, the number of times Song Luokui went to the hospital every year had increased dramatically, and they were all sorts of strange accidents. Song Luokui also didn't go out to play much anymore, most of the time she stayed at home.","The family used to shower her with affection, but after this incident, their love for her intensified. It could be said that if they could pluck stars and moons for her, they would gladly do so. Fortunately, Song Luokui wasn't raised to be delicate; instead, she was strong and optimistic. Every time an accident occurred, she would console her family.","Song Luosheng's heart raced; he hoped that this time Luokui would bravely overcome the danger.","Soon, Song Moqian and Sheng Rong arrived. Shortly after, the doctor came out, \"Who is the patient's family?\"","Song Moqian and Sheng Rong immediately stepped forward, with Song Luosheng and Aunt Gui by their side. \"The patient is in critical condition and needs immediate surgery,\" the doctor explained.","They nodded along as the doctor spoke. Regardless of what was said, they agreed. Song Moqian quickly signed the consent form, and the doctor went in for the surgery.","The operation lasted for several hours. When the doctor came out, he said, \"The surgery was successful. The patient will be transferred to the ward soon. Barring any complications, she should wake up tomorrow, but we need to observe her for a few more days.\"","\"Thank you, doctor. Thank you,\" Song Moqian shook the doctor's hand.","\"Thank you, doctor,\" Sheng Rong also bowed to the doctor.","The doctor recognized them and helped them up, \"No need to be polite; it's our duty.\"","Soon after, Song Luokui was wheeled out. Her face was pale, and she still had a breathing machine.","Feeling as if a heavy mountain pressed down on her, Song Luokui sensed her body's weight. Before long, it seemed as if her soul left her body. She witnessed how her brother competed with the male lead and twisted because of her death, seeing the entire family fall apart.","What's going on? She wasn't dead.","Song Luokui tried to wake up, but no matter how hard she tried to open her eyes, it felt as if she was being held down by a ghost. She kept shouting, \"Wake up, wake up!\"","No matter how loud she screamed, she couldn't seem to wake up. She even started pinching herself, but... no pain!","She was dumbfounded; she was in a dream!","On the side, Song Luosheng watched Song Luokui. Seeing her eyes moving, he immediately shouted, \"Sister! Luokui! Are you waking up?\"","Sheng Rong, hearing this, also looked over, \"Luokui! Luokui!\"","Amidst the calls of \"Luokui,\" Song Luokui finally woke up. She smiled at Sheng Rong, \"Mom.\"","Sheng Rong's eyes instantly teared up as she hugged her, \"Luokui, you scared us.\"","Song Luokui realized she was back in the hospital, but why she ended up here was still unclear. She remembered sleeping. Did someone play ball and accidentally hit her room late at night, almost smashing her to death?","No, her room's window was closed, and the glass quality was strong. A soccer ball shouldn't have been able to break it.","After several days of recovery, Song Luokui finally figured out how she ended up in the hospital, hanging by a thread.","Because she cut her hand while cutting fruit, just a small wound, and even though she applied a band-aid afterwards, in just a short time, bacteria and viruses had already entered her body.","...This seems to be the doing of the plot god. It's probably because the Chinese New Year is approaching, and once she grows a year older after the New Year, she won't be suppressed by the plot god anymore. Therefore, at this critical moment, the plot god wants to kill her.","Hey, her life is resilient, they can't kill her!","A few days before the New Year, she finally could leave the hospital and go home, with her grandparents and other relatives coming over to celebrate the New Year together.","During these days preparing for the New Year, Song Luokui didn't step out of the door at all, and she didn't even do any chores. Buying New Year goods, pasting couplets, cleaning the house, buying new clothes, etc., were all taken care of by Sheng Rong and the others.","She just needed to stay at home quietly, and she wasn't even allowed to enter the kitchen now, just because of that tiny wound, everyone was afraid to let her do anything.","Song Luokui was obedient too, spending her days chatting with the elderly, watching TV, etc. She became cautious even in her walks, fearing that the plot god might pull a big one and cause her to fall to her death.","She didn't fall to her death, but when she was taking a shower, the warm water suddenly turned scalding hot. Luckily, she didn't use the shower directly; she was planning to take a bath and tested the water temperature with her hand, almost yelping from the heat.","The family rushed to apply medicine to her, and luckily Song Luokui quickly rinsed with ice water, preventing her hand from blistering.","Until the eve of the New Year, the plot god couldn't manage to kill her. Song Luokui passed the New Year's Eve unharmed, and as the countdown approached, she kept her eyes on the time, ten, nine, eight, seven... one!","\"Happy New Year!\" Everyone on the TV and in reality was wishing each other a happy New Year. Song Luokui also received several big red envelopes.","Watching the fireworks outside, Song Luokui felt that her new life was about to begin!"]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: The drama is Gone.","paragraphs":["The next day when Song Luokui got up, she felt much more relaxed. It must be very lively outside on the first day of the new year, and Song Luokui definitely wanted to go out and have fun, but she wasn't sure if the plot god was still around or not, so she didn't dare act rashly.","First she walked and jumped around at home, and even deliberately spilled a little water on the floor and then stepped on it herself.","She didn't fall!","Good!","When Song Luosheng was about to go out, Song Luokui immediately said, \"I want to go too.\"","Song Luosheng flatly refused: \"You stay at home, don't go.\" The others were also against her going out. Now there were a lot of people outside, and according to Song Luokui’s constitution, they were all afraid some kind of stampede incident might happen.","Although Song Luokui was a little disappointed, she didn't insist on going out to play. She compromised and asked, \"Can I walk around the courtyard? I won't leave the courtyard.\"","Song Luokui asked everyone tentatively.","Sheng Rong also knew that his youngest daughter hadn't been able to go out and play for a long time, and they felt a little guilty. Song Moqian looked at this person and that person, and the elderly didn't have the heart to refuse either. Finally Song Moqian said, \"Okay, dad and mom will take you around the courtyard, okay?\"","The elderly on the side were unhappy. \"What do you mean you? We want to go along too!\"","\"That's right, we want to take a walk with Kui Kui too!\"","Song Luokui walked over and took her grandmother's hand. \"Grandma, you guys are so nice.\"","Song Moqian pinched her nose. \"It was Dad's idea. Isn't Dad good too?\"","Song Luokui said, \"Yes, Dad is good too, and Mom is good too. You are all good.\" Her words made everyone laugh.","The weather today was not bad. Although it was cold, the sun was still out. Song Luokui wore a red jacket, wrapped in a dark red scarf, with a black hat on her head, all bundled up like a little bear. She held her dad's hand in one hand and her mom's in the other as she walked out the door, while Song Luosheng had gone out early to play with his brothers.","The family walked down the road, running into other people from the courtyard. Everyone congratulated each other and occasionally stopped to chat.","Song Luokui also ran into Zhang Xiyue, who was on her way out to play. \"Kui Kui, happy new year! Are you going out to play too? Have you recovered from your illness?\"","Knowing her little friend had been hospitalized before the new year, Zhang Xiyue had almost cried. Fortunately she later heard it was nothing serious, otherwise she would have been unhappy all year.","Song Luokui shook her head. \"I still can't go out to play yet, maybe after a while. I've recovered now.\" Song Luokui took some candy out of her pocket. \"Xiyue, happy new year.\"","Zhang Xiyue took it. \"Thank you, Kui Kui.\"","The two chatted for a while, then Zhang Xiyue waved goodbye and Song Luokui continued strolling around the courtyard with her family before returning home. The entire courtyard was bare in winter without much to see.","On the way home, Song Luokui skipped along ahead. Suddenly another ball flew toward her from the front, but stopped one meter in front of her. If this had happened before, the ball would definitely have flown straight at Song Luokui's head.","Song Luokui raised her eyebrows. It looked like the plot god really couldn't do anything anymore.","For several days in a row, Song Luokui didn't have any more accidents. What's more, she didn't have the ghost pressing on her when she slept at night either, which had happened from time to time over the past few years, so her sleep had not been very good.","In addition, without much exercise or going out, her complexion was paler than others'. Her skin was originally fair, so she looked rather frail. But in fact Song Luokui only looked weak; if she were truly frail, she would probably be dead from a common cold.","With good sleep and a relaxed state of mind, her spirits had completely changed. The winter vacation quickly passed and school started again.","Zhang Xiyue looked at Song Luokui in front of her: \"Oh my god! You look so much better! Your face is rosy!\" Zhang Xiyue held her face as she looked at her. \"I know you're pretty, but I just realized you look even prettier now!\"","Song Luokui said, \"Maybe because of the new year, new look?\"","\"Let's go, school first.\"","\"Let's go!\"","When they got to school, her little friends all said she was looking better.","\"She used to be a sick beauty, now she's a super beauty!\"","Song Luokui thought to herself, did she really look so frail before? They even called her a sick beauty.","Perhaps because Song Luokui hadn't had any mishaps for days, she was finally allowed to go out and play.","But Song Luosheng had to go with her, so in the end he could only take her skating. Song Luokui skated for a while then sat on the sidelines to rest, but when she came back from the bathroom, her brother had already confronted...","The male lead and his buddies had also arrived, and the skating rink instantly split into two camps. Song Luokui thought...in a blink of an eye, her brother was fighting with the male lead.","Zhang Xiyue was also on the side: \"Kui Kui, let's quickly go over to cheer your brother and Zhou Yuan on!\"","Song Luokui didn't move. \"Let's just watch from here. If my brother loses later I'll go comfort him.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Lose? I don't think your brother and the others will lose!\"","Song Luokui didn't say anything. If her brother could beat the male lead, he wouldn't be the villain.","Soon the result came out. As expected, her brother lost. Then the two sides said something to each other, argued, and soon a fight broke out.","Song Luokui was still looking at the pictures of her brother she had edited to make him look more handsome to comfort him later. But next to her Zhang Xiyue suddenly shouted, \"Kui Kui, they're fighting! Let's hurry up and help!\"","When Song Luokui looked up, they had already rolled over into a melee.","She and Zhang Xiyue rushed over immediately. Zhang Xiyue was still holding a helmet and swung it directly into the fray. Song Luokui didn't even get a chance to stop her. \"Don't fight! Don't fight! Stop fighting!\"","Song Luokui shouted at them to stop, but no one listened to her and she suddenly flashed back to a scene in a TV series of two people fighting dramatically in the rain, with the female lead shouting, stop fighting, stop fighting!","Oh right, she wasn't the female lead. She was just cannon fodder. She rushed directly to Chi Yu and Song Luosheng's side. \"Stop fighting! Tell everyone to stop fighting. If you keep going I'll tell your parents!\"","Song Luokui grabbed Chi Yu directly because he had Song Luosheng pinned under him. Chi Yu's back happened to be exposed to Song Luokui and she first grabbed his clothes. In their struggle, she happened to grab his pants. No one knew how, but with their big movements, there was suddenly a \"rip\" sound...","Song Luokui looked at the scrap of fabric in her hand and blinked to see a flash of white...","Chi Yu’s hand paused as he looked at Song Luokui: ???","Song Luosheng also paused: ???","Everyone else: ???","All eyes turned to Song Luokui, oh wait, to the scrap of fabric in Song Luokui's hand...","Song Luosheng hurriedly shoved Chi Yu. \"Damn! Cover yourself! You flashed my sister!\" While saying so, he rushed to Song Luokui's side to cover her eyes. \"Kui Kui, don't look, you'll damage your vision!\""]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: Skip Grade","paragraphs":["Song Luokui only felt her eyes go dark, thinking in her mind: They're all little brats, how would they know how to sew.","Chi Yu who was at the other side also came back to his senses, Chen Nan had already taken off his coat to cover him up, looking here and there, also not knowing what to say.","The main thing was his pants got torn by a girl, this... can't hit, scold... also seems like can't scold...","Chi Yu was also only embarrassed for a moment, and quickly left with his people, got to go home and change pants!","After the people left, Song Luosheng lowered his hand covering Song Luokui's eyes, Song Luokui looking at the fabric in her hand: \"...this... what to do?\"","Song Luosheng snatched it over, \"Throw it away, throw it away!\"","Zhang Xiyue walked over giving her a thumbs up, \"Still have to be Luokui!\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Hahahaha, Luokui did good!\"","Lin Xingyan: \"Haha, next time can use this matter to mock them. Forgot to take pictures.\"","Zhou Yuan clapped his hands: \"That's right! But isn't there surveillance cameras? We'll go get the surveillance footage!\"","However when they wanted to go get the surveillance footage, it had already been taken away by someone.","Yet Song Luokui felt somewhat awkward, at that time it really was an accident...","For several consecutive days, Song Luokui didn't dare to go out, fearing that she would run into Chi Yu's group.","Later after going out she also avoided people all the time, mainly because she still felt awkward when remembering it.","After several months passed by, she gradually forgot about this matter, and she also started middle school, while Song Luosheng was in 9th grade.","She went to the Xihua Middle School branch, every morning going to school together with Song Luosheng, but it was merely a year, and Song Luosheng went to the Xihua High School branch, 8 kilometers from home, Song Luosheng rode his bike to school everyday.","Only Song Luokui was left going to the middle school branch by herself, Zhang Xiyue occasionally went with her too, but the two's times were sometimes not aligned, mainly because they were not in the same class when starting middle school.","After Song Luosheng started high school, Song Luokui didn't hear much about things happening to him in school anymore, not knowing if it was because he reached puberty and had heavier academic workload, Song Luosheng came home relatively late everyday, and also didn't tell her much when she asked him some things.","Song Luokui slowly also didn't inquire anymore, but she would observe his expression every time, and seeing that he didn't become darkened was good enough.","Occasionally Song Luokui would hear some news, for example Chi Yu was always first in grade, while her brother was perennially second in grade, and things like some female students privately voting on who's the most handsome, Song Luokui had even gotten the voting link from Zhang Xiyue, she directly voted for her brother, yet in that voting Chi Yu was still first, her brother still second.","Not to mention the various competitions at school, things like English speech contest, physics competition, chemistry competition etc., as long as Chi Yu participated, her brother would also participate, and the results were very obvious, Chi Yu first, her brother second.","This feeling made Song Luokui feel like the ending was unchangeable.","Since my life could change, my brother's destiny should also be changeable, Song Luokui thought later on.","One day, Song Luosheng said when he got home: \"I'm going to skip grades!\"","Everyone at home felt it was somewhat inconceivable, skipping grades?","Song Moqian was relatively more respecting of the children's ideas: \"You can skip grades if you feel your grades allow it.\"","Sheng Rong also had no objections.","Song Luokui: \"Why skip grades for no reason?\" Although one wall full of awards at home had the majority that belonged to her brother, Song Luosheng's grades were indeed not bad too, but she had always thought he would attend school normally.","Song Luosheng didn't speak, he was skipping grades no matter what, the two adults at home also agreed.","Later, Song Luokui knew what was going on, Chi Yu had skipped grades...","With just this skip in grades, when Song Luokui started high school, Song Luosheng was already in college, Peking University, 10 kilometers from home, also not very far, just half an hour by bus, but Song Luosheng lived on campus, normally only coming home once a week, sometimes even once a month, it became even harder for Song Luokui to understand his circumstances at school.","It wasn't until her last year of high school that Song Luokui went to Y Country as an exchange student for half a semester, mainly because she had gotten an invitation letter from the Royal College of Y Country when she was in 10th grade, hoping that she would attend school there after finishing high school.","Apart from this school, she also received invitation letters from some other schools, but Song Luokui felt the Royal College was quite good, although she had to make her brother avoid his ending, she also had her own plans.","She didn't have any accidents these few years, everyone at home felt her luck had perhaps become better, thus they also didn't restrict her anymore, letting her go wherever she wanted. When she said she was going to Y Country, her family also agreed to it, and it was merely half a semester, just a bit over 3 months, very quick.","Regarding the foreign safety conditions Song Luokui also understood, she had just arrived for not long when she encountered employee strikes, protests and demonstrations etc., she didn't dare to go out at night, and truly going out once made her realize home was the safest.","Song Luokui lived near the school, it was still relatively safe here, just that today Song Luokui's eyes kept jumping, she thought it was because she didn't rest well recently, until she was about to lie on her bed and sleep, her window suddenly opened, a person directly jumped in, Song Luokui stared blankly at the person.","If she hadn't seen it herself, the person before her eyes was Chi Yu, but why was he here? And why would he climb in through the window?","Song Luokui looked down and saw him clutching one side of his belly, that spot had already been dyed red with blood, Chi Yu's entire body also collapsed to the floor, Song Luokui stared even wider, \"You...\"","Song Luokui suddenly thought of something and immediately went to look outside from the window, discovering two people running over not far downstairs, Song Luokui promptly shut the window.","She immediately roughly knew what the situation was, if she didn't do something, they would probably discover it very quickly. Song Luokui promptly supported Chi Yu up, \"Let's leave here first.\"","Song Luokui supported Chi Yu walking to the room next door, this was her friend here Jia Nasha's room, as for the key, Jia Nasha would always leave it under the mat in front of the door, after setting Chi Yu to the side, Song Luokui went back to her own room and started cleaning up traces, she also made some traces that showed someone ran from the door to the stairs.","Very quickly, Song Luokui returned next door, the lights weren't turned on, afraid, she hid together with Chi Yu under the bed.","Very quickly, footsteps sounded from next door, and the sounds of the cabinet, bathroom door opening could also be heard, then footsteps sounded from the hallway outside too, not knowing what one of them said, then the footsteps left.","Song Luokui let out a breath, but didn't dare turn on the room lights, she crawled out from under the bed, searched around and finally found the medical kit, using her phone's light she started bandaging Chi Yu's wounds.","Luckily he wasn't shot, but the distance wasn't far either, his lower abdomen was directly grazed by the bullet, and also because his clothes were white, looking at his blood dyed clothes it appeared more horrifying. Not only that, Song Luokui also saw some other wounds on his body.","Song Luokui didn't dare inquire why Chi Yu would be here, why he was injured, she only bandaged his wounds for him. Afraid those chasing him would come again, after Song Luokui finished bandaging him, she hid together with Chi Yu back under the bed.","Chi Yu's complexion looked rather pale too, soon falling asleep. Song Luokui's eyes remained wide open until dawn before sleeping for a bit."]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: What Do You Want","paragraphs":["When she opened her eyes again, Chi Yu next to her had also woken up. The two of them came out from under the bed, and at this moment Jia Nasha had just come back from outside. As soon as she opened the door, she saw Song Luokui and Chi Yu sitting on the floor. Song Luokui lifted Chi Yu's clothes to take a look at the wound.","Jia Nasha blinked: \"Hey, baby, you had quite a wild time?\"","Song Luokui immediately stood up and waved her hands, \"I'm very sorry, Jia Nasha. Something happened last night so...\"","Song Luokui then explained what had happened last night about Chi Yu being robbed and almost killed, so she brought him here to hide for a while.","As for Chi Yu, Song Luokui said he was her friend.","Only then did Jia Nasha realize she had misunderstood.","Back in her own room, Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu beside her, and he was also looking at her, \"I won't ask what happened last night, but you have to leave now.\"","Chi Yu lowered his eyes, his expression unreadable, \"You saved me, so what do you want?\"","Song Luokui handed him a piece of bread, \"Breakfast. Just let my brother win next time you face him.\"","Chi Yu glanced at her and bit into the bread before leaving. As he left, he said, \"It's not safe here, you should find another place to live.\"","Song Luokui ate her bread while packing up her things, \"I know.\" She planned to move today, and not only that, she also persuaded Jia Nasha next door to move with her.","Chi Yu left quickly. He called his people and soon got into a car. He didn't expect to almost get killed here just coming to discuss business. He was careless. He won't forget this, Jia Lesi!","As for what Song Luokui said...letting Song Luosheng win once wouldn't hurt.","Chi Yu didn't expect to run into Song Luokui so coincidentally. Although they hadn't seen each other for a long time, Chi Yu recognized her at first glance. He didn't expect her to be in Y Country. Could she be studying abroad?","As people belonging to different \"gangs\", the two had never spoken before. Chi Yu automatically forgot about Song Luokui tearing his pants off. Anyway, they didn't really talk at the time.","The two were not familiar at all. Although they knew each other, it was the kind of relationship where if they ran into each other on the street, they definitely wouldn't greet each other. They weren't even as familiar as Song Luosheng.","Chi Yu didn't think too much about it and quickly focused on his own affairs again.","Money makes the world go round. Song Luokui quickly moved to a new place. Indeed, that night, some people came looking for her at her old residence. Jia Nasha's place was also broken into, but she wasn't home that night so she didn't know.","Fortunately, after coming once, those people didn't come again.","Jia Nasha said, \"Baby, I can't eat good Hua Country food without you.\"","Jia Nasha didn't listen to Song Luokui's advice to move. She took out a gun at the time, \"Kui, don't be afraid, I have a gun, and I have good aim. Anyone who dares to come, I'll biubiubiu them.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" She was a little scared, having forgotten that guns were not banned abroad, so it was still safer in China... When the exchange ended, she would go back. Her idea of studying abroad had been suppressed.","Thinking that the male lead had also gotten biubiubiu'd here, she felt it was even more dangerous. Maybe the god of plot would come back someday. It wasn't safe to stay in this foreign country. Wouldn't she be more likely to die tragically?","\"Jia Nasha, next time I'll give you more dumplings.\"","\"Oh, thank you darling, I love you.\" Jia Nasha kissed her hand, \"If I have time in the future, I will definitely go to your country for a visit.\"","Song Luokui: \"You're welcome. I'll be sure to show you a good time when you come.\"","\"It's a deal then.\"","After that, Song Luokui didn't see Chi Yu again. Time passed quickly, and she was going back now.","Landing in Hua Country, breathing the fresh familiar air, Song Luokui breathed a sigh of relief. Heaven knows she felt so relieved when she got on the plane, because a shooting had occurred at the airport on the other side right after her plane safely took off. Song Luokui now truly felt that continuing her studies at home was better. As for going abroad, traveling would be fine.","Her family didn't object to her decision. As long as she didn't break the law, she could do whatever she wanted, because she wouldn't be studying abroad. So she would take the college entrance exam in China.","Song Luokui decided to study hard for the next six months. She didn't even have time to care about her brother.","Her brother Song Luosheng gradually came home less and less as he entered university. She heard he had even opened a company outside, and although he hadn't graduated yet, he was already considered a successful person.","Song Luosheng also had his own place outside school. She heard he had already earned all his credits at school, so unless he occasionally had things to do at school, he was either at his company or his place outside.","That day, Song Luosheng had an appointment at the racetrack with a business partner to discuss business. Unexpectedly, Chi Yu also came with his people to the other side. The circle in Jing City was so small that running into each other was quite normal.","On one side, Song Luosheng was going to race horses with his business partner, while on the other side Chi Yu was doing something similar. In the end, it became a competition between Song Luosheng and Chi Yu. The two rode their horses galloping on the racetrack, neither willing to let the other win, leaving their business partners far behind.","In the final lap, Chi Yu suddenly recalled something and his horse slowed a little. Not long after, Song Luosheng won first place!","Song Luosheng let out a breath, looking very spirited. After being suppressed by Chi Yu for so long, he had finally won...","Lin Xingyan also happily ran over. Song Luosheng arrogantly glanced at Chi Yu before remembering his business partner and immediately went to apologize.","Chi Yu also dismounted. His expression didn't change much. Chen Nan walked over, \"Why did you suddenly slow down?\" He had clearly seen Chi Yu suddenly slow down.","Chi Yu glanced at Song Luosheng, who was happily chatting with people on the other side, \"Letting him win once doesn't hurt.\"","Song Luosheng's return home for dinner today also surprised Song Luokui. Moreover, Song Luosheng looked very happy. He was even humming a tune when he came home, \"So happy? Did you win the lottery today?\" Song Luokui asked.","Song Luosheng raised his brows, \"No, I closed a business deal.\"","Song Luokui said, \"I've never seen you so happy after closing a deal before.\"","Song Luosheng put a piece of meat in her bowl, \"Guess.\"","Song Luokui's eyes turned, \"Could it be you beat that person?\"","Song Luosheng looked very proud, \"Hmm.\" He talked about what happened at the racetrack today.","Song Luokui ate the meat. It had been a few months since that incident. That person should have forgotten too. If he hadn't forgotten, would he have listened to her and let her brother win? At that time, she had just said it casually and didn't expect the person to agree to let her brother win.","But it was just one win, nothing major. After all, he would probably lose even more in the future. Therefore, Song Luokui said, \"Winning and losing are both normal. Don't be discouraged if you lose, and don't be arrogant when you win. The world is unpredictable, both winning and losing are normal. Life consists of more than just winning and losing.\"","Song Luosheng looked at her, \"Are you trying to get into a teaching college?\"","Song Luokui: ?","Song Luosheng: \"So many principles, perfect for being a teacher.\"","Song Luokui puffed up her cheeks, \"I just want you to not obsess over winning against that person. Haven't you noticed you're too obsessed with beating him? Someone who doesn't know better might think you like him.\"","Song Luosheng was so disgusted that he got goosebumps all over. \"Kui Kui, you're grossing me out. Ugh!\"","Song Luokui: \"...\""]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: High School Graduation","paragraphs":["The annual \"gaokao\" college entrance exam had arrived again. To support little Song Luokui in taking the important test, the whole family took time off. Sheng Rong even put on a cheongsam, while Song Luosheng returned home too.","The family of three sent Song Luokui to school and then stood outside the school gates to wait, along with many other parents. Most of the mothers were dressed in cheongsams, representing their wish for triumph.","The 2.5 hour Chinese language exam passed quickly for Song Luokui, but those waiting outside were rather anxious.","When the end-of-exam bell rang, the first student emerged from inside the school. Reporters nearby immediately swarmed over to interview them.","Meanwhile, Song Luosheng's family kept their eyes on the gates, waiting for Song Luokui to come out. About five minutes later, Song Luokui followed most of the other students outside. Dressed in her school uniform with her long black hair in an ordinary ponytail, her beautiful face stood out from the other students.","A reporter nearby noticed her and wanted to come interview her, but Song Luokui saw Sheng Rong waving at her from within the crowd. She smiled and rushed over, completely ignoring the reporter who wanted to interview her.","\"Why are you guys still here? It's so hot out. You could have just waited at home!\" Song Luokui said, but she was very happy to see them.","Sheng Rong stroked her little face, \"It's fine, time passed quickly. Let's go, Aunt Gui made your favorites at home.\"","\"Okay, let's go back,\" Song Luokui replied.","The family quickly left the school, though some people did snap photos of them.","The two intense days of testing were over very fast. Song Luokui felt relieved after finishing the exams. She was confident in herself that getting into Peking University would be no problem. Her family had asked about her aspirations before and knew she wanted to attend Peking University, where Song Luosheng was also studying. It would be convenient for them to look after one another there.","After the exam, the students were like horses let out from the gates, finally able to do things they couldn't before. Many girls put on heavy makeup, wore pretty dresses and gaudy jewelry. There were various confessions of admiration and trips to drink at bars.","This post-exam class gathering took place at a bar. Many bottles of beer were delivered to their private room. The class president raised a bottle and cheered, \"I wish everyone future success and happiness, able to achieve whatever they desire! Cheers!\"","\"Cheers!\" came the chorus of responses.","The private room was very lively, with some chatting and drinking, some playing games, and some singing songs.","Song Luokui slowly sipped her drink while listening to the singing, feeling very relaxed. Suddenly a boy appeared in front of her saying, \"Song Luokui.\"","Everyone else looked over too and started cheering loudly.","The backlighting prevented Song Luokui from clearly seeing the nervous boy's face, but she guessed what this was probably about and felt rather awkward.","\"Song Luokui, I...I just want to tell you, I like you,\" the boy said, his voice shaking.","\"Oooo!\" \"Wow!\" \"Clap clap clap!\" Everyone watched with great amusement.","Song Luokui just smiled. \"I'm sorry.\"","The boy clearly knew he would be rejected. Hearing Song Luokui's response, he felt somewhat relieved—at least he had finally bravely spoken his feelings. \"It's...it's okay. I just wanted you to know.\"","Song Luokui smiled at him again but said nothing more.","The boy left as his friends comforted him.","With so many people there, the class president had just gotten confessed to as well. Everyone shifted their attention away, allowing Song Luokui to relax. Her classmate Yu Tao suddenly tugged at her sleeve whispered, \"Can we go to the bathroom together, Luokui? I've never been here before.\"","\"Sure, I was wanting to go too,\" Song Luokui replied, standing up.","The two girls quickly left the private room. The outer area was also very lively with people singing and dancing enthusiastically. They wove through the crowds until finally reaching the bathroom.","After using the toilet, Song Luokui and Yu Tao headed back. Passing by one private room, there was suddenly a loud crash. Song Luokui immediately looked over to see a group of men dressed in black suits inside the room. One man had fallen to the floor and was being stepped on by another man, while two more men were kneeling.","Both Song Luokui and Yu Tao jumped, shocked by the scene. Song Luokui’s eyes shifted to the man sitting in the middle—it was Chi Yu. He wore a tailored black suit, an expensive watch around his wrist. In the dim lighting, his striking features seemed even more refined and charming.","Legs spread wide and hands clasped over his knee, he coldly stared at the men on the floor. Suddenly he looked up, meeting Song Luokui’s eyes just as she reached the door. The indifference lingering there had not yet faded.","Song Luokui was fine but Yu Tao was badly frightened. She immediately pulled Song Luokui away. By the time they returned to their private room, Yu Tao had her hand over her heart gasping, \"So scary! Do you think they might kill us to keep us quiet? Were they those 'yakuza' mobsters talked about on TV?\"","\"No...don't be afraid. They were law-abiding citizens,\" Song Luokui answered.","Still filled with fear, Yu Tao said, \"Really? Then why were they acting like that in the room?\"","\"Maybe those men did something wrong to anger them. But don't worry...we were just passing by. Perhaps they didn't even see our faces clearly in such dim lighting,\" Song Luokui reassured.","Yu Tao touched her chest, \"I guess you’re right.”","In the other private room, Chi Yu was also caught off guard seeing Song Luokui, though he quickly regained composure. After the men were taken out, he glanced again at those still kneeling before him. \"Send them to the police station. If they dare defy the law, then let them be punished by the law.\"","The two kneeling immediately collapsed limply to the ground begging, \"Young Master Chi, we were wrong, we...\" Before they could finish, Chen Nan nearby kicked them yelling, \"Wrong about what? We gave you chances but you only grew more reckless! Take them away!\"","After the three were dragged off, Chen Nan walked to Chi Yu's side and whispered, \"Just now...\"","One look from Chi Yu instantly silenced him.","Chi Yu said simply, \"It's fine, she won't do anything.\"","Of course Chen Nan would believe his boss’s words.","It was past 11 pm and Song Luokui thought about heading home. Some others wanted to stay out all night continuing their fun, while Yu Tao left with Song Luokui to catch the last bus. Song Luokui decided to call her family to pick her up.","Yet before she could even dial, a familiar face appeared as a Volvo pulled up nearby, its window rolling down. Chi Yu’s suit jacket was off, the top buttons of his white shirt undone to reveal a bit of his elegant collarbone. His sleeves were rolled up to his forearms as he rested his hands atop the steering wheel, glancing her way. \"Get in,\" he said.","Song Luokui took a step back. \"No drinking and driving. It's against the law.\"","Chi Yu paused briefly. \"...I didn't drink.\"","Song Luokui didn’t quite believe that, having seen all the alcohol at his table earlier.","Chi Yu suddenly glanced behind her. \"I really didn't drink. Or would you rather stay in this dangerous place?\"","Song Luokui looked back to see the dark alley beside the bar. Occasionally some drunkards would stumble out. Some rowdy drunks loitered around the bar entrance too. Song Luokui noticed a girl almost get harassed by one before she screamed and ran off.","Song Luokui realized it really wasn’t safe for a young woman here this late at night. And getting a free ride would save Uncle Kang the trouble of picking her up. She opened the passenger door and got in, buckling the seatbelt. \"Okay, let's go.\""]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: See you Again","paragraphs":["Chi Yu started up the vehicle quickly, and the car left the entrance of the bar. The windows were open, and the smell of alcohol on them soon dissipated with the wind. After driving for a while, things started slowing down in front suddenly, as there were traffic police checking for drunk driving ahead.","Song Luokui looked ahead, then back at Chi Yu. \"They're checking for drunk driving.\"","Chi Yu tapped his fingers lightly on the steering wheel. \"I really didn't drink.\"","Soon it was their turn. Chi Yu rolled down the window and blew into the device twice. The machine didn't light up, and the traffic police let them go quickly.","Song Luokui felt relieved.","Chi Yu glanced at her. \"I really didn't drink.\"","Song Luokui: \"Oh.\" So he went to the bar not to drink but to beat someone up?","Neither of them spoke after that. After all, they didn't know each other well and didn't have much to talk about.","The car soon stopped at the entrance of the estate. Song Luokui got out and said a simple \"Thank you.\" Chi Yu responded with an \"Mm-hmm\" before driving off. He wasn't living in the estate anymore either, only occasionally coming back, similar to Song Luosheng, living in a house outside instead.","Once Song Luokui got home, she drank some digestive tea, took a bath, and went to rest soon after.","Since she was on break, of course she wanted to have a good time. Song Luokui went on a graduation trip with Zhang Xiyue and a few good friends. They traveled domestically, going south to the seaside, climbing mountains, and had a crazy month of fun before returning to the capital city.","A few days after coming back, it seemed Song Luosheng couldn't stand seeing her so free. He said, \"Since you have so much free time, go bring me meals every day, or come experience what working life is like. What if you turn stupid from staying home and doing nothing all day waiting for your sister?\"","Song Luokui lifted her eyes from where she was lying on the sofa. \"What??? Are you crazy? You want me to go work?\"","Song Luosheng: \"It's called experiencing life.\"","\"Thanks but I don't need that kind of life experience.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Then bring me meals.\"","Song Luokui: \"I can do that when I'm free.\"","Song Luosheng: \"What could you possibly be busy with staying home all day?\"","Song Luokui: \"Girls have their own stuff, don't worry about it.\"","Song Luosheng: ...","The next day after lunch, Aunt Gui prepared a meal for Song Luosheng. Song Luokui picked it up and headed out. \"I'm going then.\"","\"Be careful on the roads, young miss.\"","\"I will~\".","She soon arrived at Song Luosheng's company, which was in a tall building downtown occupying half a floor on the 30th floor. The company name was \"Song Technology\".","Upon entering, the receptionist politely asked, \"Hello, do you have an appointment?\"","Song Luokui waved her hand. \"I'm looking for Song Luosheng. I'm bringing him lunch. Oh, I'm his younger sister.\"","Receptionist: \"One moment please, let me call the boss.\"","\"Thanks.\"","Soon, under the receptionist's lead, Song Luokui was brought to Song Luosheng's office. On the way she ran into Zhou Yuan, who had a file in his hand and looked excited to see her. \"Hey sis, what brings you here?\"","Song Luokui waved to him in greeting. \"Bringing lunch for my brother.\"","\"Oh I see, so the boss is making you deliver meals. That must be tiring, sis.\"","Song Luokui: \"I gotta go now, you look busy.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Alright.\"","After entering Song Luosheng's office, Song Luokui put the food on his desk. \"Lunch time.\"","Song Luosheng was still typing away on his computer. \"Coming.\"","With the food delivered, Song Luokui looked around his office, over here and over there, even walking to the window to gaze at the scenery in the distance.","\"How come you don't have a lounge? Don't big bosses usually have a lounge connected to the office with a bed, wardrobe, and shower so they can rest or clean up since they work overtime so often, and sometimes bring girls there to lounge around with?\"","Song Luosheng nearly choked on his soup upon hearing that. \"You said it yourself - those are big bosses. I'm not a big boss. Who wants to overwork themselves to death?\" He could only afford to rent half a floor right now. Sure he occasionally slept over, but that was just napping on the sofa.","Song Luokui turned to face him. \"So what are you if not a big boss? What, a poor overworked employee?\" She smirked. \"I figure you're still better off than average workers out there.\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Are you trying to make me choke so that you won't have to bring meals anymore in the future?\" How come his cute little sister had gotten snarkier after growing up?","Song Luokui knocked her forehead. \"Oh right, I forgot you haven't graduated yet. You're not quite a big boss or rich enough.\" Future Song Luosheng will become an impressive boss man, but that's still years after graduation. Present-day Song Luosheng doesn't have that commanding air yet.","Song Luosheng: \"...Want me to have someone give you a company tour? Come intern here for credits whenever you want in the future. Now please stop interrupting my meal with that nonsense.\"","Song Luokui: \"No need, I'm going to the bathroom.\"","She quickly left. After asking the receptionist for directions, she headed over swiftly. The washrooms were communal for the entire floor. Despite being quite clean, there were only five stalls, which led to a bit of lineup with so many female employees between the two companies on this level.","Taking a look at the queue, Song Luokui decided to try the floor above instead. But upon climbing the stairs, she discovered a lineup there too. What was going on? So many people using the bathroom at noon?","She went up one more flight and finally found no lineup on that floor. After quickly using the facilities, she got a call from Zhang Xiyue about a new movie premiere. Zhang Xiyue asked if she wanted to see the movie together and go shopping. She was on XX Street nearby.","Checking the location, it was quite close by. \"Hang on, I'm in the area. Be right there.\" Song Luokui said.","\"Great!\"","Song Luokui texted Song Luosheng to bring the food containers home himself tonight since she was going out to have fun now. As she headed towards the elevators on that floor to go down, she discovered quite a crowd waiting given the lunch rush hour traffic. After a good while, the elevator finally arrived. But when the doors opened, Song Luokui found herself looking straight at the occupants inside.","Song Luokui: ?","Inside stood five men in black suits, with Chi Yu in their center, hands in pockets. Chen Nan held some documents and seemed to be explaining something while the other three also had documents in hand.","Upon spotting Song Luokui, Chen Nan promptly stopped talking. Song Luokui quickly edged to the side as Chi Yu walked out. She slipped into the elevator and directly pressed for the ground floor as the doors closed up again swiftly.","Chen Nan: \"She wasn't sent to spy for intel, was she?\"","Eyes on the shut elevator, Chi Yu simply said, \"No, please continue.\"","Chen Nan: \"Continue what? Oh right, that proposal...\" Though how did the boss know she wasn't?","In the descending elevator, Song Luokui felt rather surprised too. So Chi Yu's company was in the same building on the floor above her brother's?","She immediately texted Song Luosheng: \"Just saw that guy, his office in the same building?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Which guy? Who?\"","Song Luokui: \"The one who always beat you.\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Speak properly. Yes, Chi Yu's company is upstairs. You saw him? Did he bully you? I'll go over and beat him up!\"","Song Luokui: \"No no, just curious. Your companies are right above each other, so you see each other often? Do you get in frequent fights? Or rather, does he beat you up a lot?\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Can't you wish me well? We're grown men now, not impulsive youths about to brawl all the time.\"","Song Luokui: \"Oh I see, it's business rivalry now right? The kind where you trash talk each other's companies online?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Go enjoy your shopping. Bro will transfer you some money.\" He promptly sent over 50,000 RMB to forestall any more nonsense.","Song Luokui shrugged. It seems she ought to drop by more frequently from now on."]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: The Club Is Fighting.","paragraphs":["Song Luokui soon met up with Zhang Xiyue on XX Street. The two strolled down the street, watched a movie, and made it back home before dinner.","The next day, as usual, Song Luokui brought a meal to Song Luosheng. While waiting for the elevator, she also saw Tu Shanyue surrounded by several men coming over too.","She was going to the 30th floor while Tu Shanyue was headed to the 32nd floor, so they took the same elevator.","The two glanced at each other without saying anything. The elevator arrived quickly. Once inside, Song Luokui shrank into the corner alone in her white dress, quite conspicuous among the crowd of men in black suits surrounding Tu Shanyue.","Clutching the lunchbox, Song Luokui didn't dare let her eyes wander. Was she intruding into enemy territory?","Tu Shanyue looked at the lunchbox in her hands and spoke up, \"Bringing a meal?\"","Song Luokui lifted her head. \"Oh, yeah.\"","With Tu Shanyue speaking up, all the men in black suits looked over at Song Luokui. She hugged the lunchbox tightly. Fortunately the elevator arrived at her floor swiftly. Song Luokui bid goodbye before quickly rushing to her brother's company and making a turn, heading straight to his office. The receptionist stood up, \"Ms. Song, let me take you to the boss's office.\"","\"No need, thanks. I can go myself,\" Song Luokui replied.","Song Luokui briskly entered Song Luosheng’s office and handed him the food.","\"Why so enthusiastic today?\" Song Luosheng asked.","\"Well, you did give me some pocket money yesterday. I'm someone who remembers favors,\" Song Luokui quipped.","\"Fifty thousand bucks for a lunch delivery, what a bad deal,\" Song Luosheng shot back.","\"At least it's not for nothing,\" retorted Song Luokui.","Unable to defeat her, Song Luosheng opened the lunchbox and ate. Meanwhile, Song Luokui sat on the sofa and asked, \"Recently your company hasn't been competing with the 32nd floor, right?\"","Song Luosheng looked up, \"Why do you care so much about me competing with Tu Shanyue?”","Song Luokui replied, \"Oh no reason. I'm just worried that if you lose to him again and go bankrupt, then I won't get any more pocket money from you. I'm concerned about you...I mean, I'm concerned about our company.\" She fiddled with the potted plant's leaves next to her.","Song Luosheng exclaimed, “Can’t you be a little more supportive of your brother? Go bankrupt? If we did, I'd jump off this building!\"","Song Luokui immediately sprang up in alarm. \"Take that back! Don't say that! No jumping off buildings. Even if bankrupt, as long as we have each other it'll be fine. I have savings that I’ll give you to start over. You can't jump off buildings or what'll we do then?!\"","The villain in the original book did go bankrupt and commit suicide by jumping off a building!","Song Luosheng was touched. \"Don't worry, we won't go bankrupt.\"","Song Luokui said, “Even if bankrupt, don’t do anything rash. Remember what I told you before, even if defeated, be the most graceful loser. Failure itself is nothing. Running away from failure is the dumbest thing to do.”","Listening to Song Luokui’s streams of wisdom, Song Luosheng kept nodding. “You’re right about everything. Sis, even if I fail, I won't jump off buildings. At worst I'll start over, but don’t forget to give me your money.”","His little Kui Kui really was suited to be a teacher.","\"It's a deal,\" Song Luokui replied.","After another round of brainwashing Song Luosheng, Song Luokui left, saying she felt tired and wanted to take a nap.","For several days in a row, Song Luokui arrived punctually to deliver meals to Song Luosheng. On two of those days she ran into Tu Shanyue again, each time feeling like his company was filled with a bunch of gangsters with everyone dressed in black suits.","The two didn't speak, only nodded to each other.","Later, Song Luosheng went on a business trip and so Song Luokui stopped bringing him meals. When he returned, she didn’t resume the practice either.","Right after dinner one day, Zhang Xiyue called her up. “Kui Kui, want to go have some fun?”","Song Luokui didn’t know what she meant.","Next, Zhang Xiyue brought her to a place called Unnamed Mountain Lake, a club. Aside from Zhang Xiyue, there was also Tu Shanyue and Zhou Yue. Zhou Yue lived in their apartment complex too and was Zhou Yuan’s sister.","Seeing the four muscular men lining up, Song Luokui sat up straight and swallowed, asking “This is what you mean by fun?”","Zhang Xiyue waved her hand. “Dance for us!”","The club music started and the men began dancing in a popular style.","Zhou Yue stood up shaking her body. “The vast horizon is my love...ohhh...”","Zhang Xiyue and Tu Shanyue also got up dancing, with Zhang Xiyue pulling Song Luokui. “Kui Kui, come on, together!”","Song Luokui thought: This is quite thrilling.","Soon she also stood up and danced...","They danced from that popular song to other hits, everyone incredibly hyped up. Song Luokui even saw Zhang Xiyue feeling up one man’s abs, Zhou Yue following suit.","Maybe from being too hyper, some passersby peered in curiously then two girls came into their private room. “Can we join you guys?”","Zhang Xiyue was ecstatic. “Yeah, come on, let’s hype it up together!”","Before long, several muscular men danced vigorously up front dripping in sweat, while many girls watched excitedly from the seats, occasionally getting up to dance a little. Song Luokui, tired from dancing, sat to the side drinking water.","Suddenly the private room door slammed open forcefully, hitting the wall with a loud thud. Everyone stopped and looked towards the doorway where an affluent lady had entered, yelling, “Who ordered my sweetie Guo Yu? Don’t you know he’s exclusively mine?”","The room was still blasting the song “I’m From the Grasslands”...","Song Luokui swiftly turned off the stereo, quieting the room down. One girl sneered, “Oh it’s just Fatty Liu Ziru. Yours exclusively? Starting today he’s mine. With your physique, aren’t you worried you’ll crush poor sweetie to death?”","Liu Ziru shouted, “Wu Yahui! So you stole my sweetie?!”","Wu Yahui retorted, “Stole? Isn’t it whoever pays more gets the boy toy here? Care to guess who sweetie would rather be with, you or me?”","Liu Ziru looked towards the least manly pretty boy among the men. “Sweetie, tell us who you pick?”","The one called Guo Yu glanced between them, clearly preferring Wu Yahui but also afraid to offend Liu Ziru.","Seeing his reaction, Liu Ziru glared at Wu Yahui. “I’ll fight you for him, stealing my man!”","She then lunged at Wu Yahui. Liu Ziru’s friends followed to attack while Wu Yahui’s clique also jumped in to defend her.","From her corner, Song Luokui watched wide-eyed. “What’s going on here...?”","Next second, she saw Zhang Xiyue also jump into the fray. Seeing Zhang Xiyue almost get hit, Song Luokui immediately rushed in to join the fight..."]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Ha ha ha Ha","paragraphs":["Midway, someone called the police, and then the police came...","When the police understood the situation, they were shocked and also found it a bit funny. Then, everyone who was fighting was taken away, Song Luokui and the others were no exception.","The boss of the club was alarmed too. Moreover, the boss of the club, Song Luokui, also knew Chen Nan, who was beside Chi Yu and also from the residence.","Of course, Chen Nan also knew Song Luokui and Zhou Yuan and the others. After all, they were from the same residence, just not very familiar. However, when he saw a room full of crazy ladies, he also wanted to laugh.","Song Luokui covered her face. Why did she rush over at that time!!!","Zhang Xiyue was still cursing, \"Who hit my chest in the end? Fuck, I don't know if it's flattened.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\"","When Song Luosheng was notified to pick them up, he was shocked. His pupils dilated, \"What!\"","The four sat in Song Luosheng's car. Song Luosheng asked, \"Tell me, which man made you get into a fight?\"","Zhang Xiyue was a coward now. She shrank behind without daring to speak. Zhou Yue and Tu Shanyue were even more so.","Seeing they didn't speak, Song Luokui had to speak up, \"It wasn't because of a man, it was because of sisterhood.\"","Song Luosheng glanced at her, \"You like both men and women? How capable are you?\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" No, this was an accident. \"It's just...\" Song Luokui recounted what happened, \"We were all affected. How would we know they would fight over a man?\"","Song Luosheng sneered, \"Then why didn't you run when you saw people fighting? Why did you join in?\"","Song Luokui was at a loss. She lowered her head, \"I saw Xiyue was going to be hit...\"","Zhang Xiyue immediately spoke up, \"I saw Yueyue being hit.\"","Zhou Yue: \"I saw Shanyue being hit.\"","Tu Shanyue: \"...I was closer to Wu Yahui at that time. When they started fighting, I was affected.\" She was hit, so of course she would hit back.","Song Luosheng: \"So why did you go to Unnamed Mountain Lake today?\"","The four were silent: ...","Song Luosheng: \"Speak!\"","Song Luokui: \"We just graduated and wanted to see something exciting.\"","Song Luosheng sneered, \"It was quite exciting, exciting enough to get into the police station.\"","Song Luokui had no rebuttal. She lowered her head, \"...\" Wuwuwu, she didn't dare speak.","After sending the few back to the residence, Song Luosheng said, \"Don't go there anymore in the future!\"","Song Luokui & Zhang Xiyue & Zhou Yue & Tu Shanyue: \"Got it.\"","On the other side, Chen Nan called Chi Yu, \"Do you know who I saw at Unnamed Mountain Lake today? Hahahaha, it was Song Luosheng's sister, and Zhou Yuan's sister was also there, and two other girls were also from our residence, all Song Luosheng's gang.","Do you know what they did at the club? Hahahaha...\"","Chi Yu: \"...What did they do?\"","Chen Nan: \"It seems they fought over a man in our club. The private room was filled with women fighting, like crazy ladies. Hahahahaha.\"","Chi Yu: \"They fought over a man?\"","\"That's what I heard.\"","Chi Yu's eyes lowered. \"Impossible.\"","Chen Nan: \"How would I not know what happens in my club?\"","Chi Yu: \"Others may be possible, but not that person you mentioned.\"","\"Hey...\"","Chen Nan scratched his head. After inquiring about it, he found out that it was two regular rich lady customers who fought over a male model at the club. The rest were just helpers or got dragged in...","After this incident, Song Luokui rarely went out again. She also felt quite embarrassed.","Time passed quickly. The notice of admission from Peking University soon arrived. To celebrate this good news, Song Moqian booked a private room to celebrate with grandparents from both sides.","Not only that, Song Luokui also received quite a lot of red packets and gifts.","The family ate and chatted happily in the private room. Midway, Song Luokui drank too much water and went to the bathroom. Shortly after using the bathroom, someone also walked out from the private room next door. Song Luokui was about to move aside to let the person through when she glanced and saw it was someone familiar.","Previously, the probability of Song Luokui bumping into Chi Yu was quite low. Even though they lived in the same residence, she rarely saw him. However, recently, she noticed their frequency of meeting had become quite high. For the first time, she felt Beijing was a bit small. She didn't expect to bump into someone even when eating out.","Chi Yu was also somewhat surprised. He was here mainly for business meetings and had just drunk a bit, coming out for some air.","Good upbringing made Song Luokui nod at him, intending to leave. Unexpectedly, Chi Yu spoke, \"I heard you're going to Peking University?\"","Song Luokui: \"Mm.\"","\"Congratulations.\"","Song Luokui was astonished for a moment. \"Thanks. I...will head back first.\"","\"Mm.\"","Song Luokui quickly left. Chi Yu also looked at her back and headed towards the washroom.","After the celebration ended, Song Luokui held Sheng Rong's arm, standing at the door waiting for Song Moqian and Song Luosheng to drive the cars over. At this time, Chi Yu also walked out with some people, chatting while walking.","Seeing Song Luokui and the rest, Chi Yu even walked over to greet them, \"Auntie Sheng.\"","Of course, Sheng Rong recognized Chi Yu. After all, they were kids from the same residence. \"Chi Yu, you're eating here too. What a coincidence.\"","Chi Yu nodded.","Next, Sheng Rong greeted Chi Yu's family while he answered one by one. Although Song Luosheng was at odds with him, there was no grievance between both families. The interaction between the adults was quite harmonious.","As for the children's interaction, the adults all felt they were just young. It was just child's play.","Soon, Song Moqian and Song Luosheng drove the cars over. Sheng Rong hurriedly bid Chi Yu farewell. Until they left, Song Luokui didn't speak at all. She didn't think there was anything for her to say to Chi Yu.","Watching the cars leave, Chi Yu also bid the others farewell and got in the car to leave.","Time passed quickly. School was starting at Peking University. At home, Song Luokui packed her things. She had to live on campus this time, so there were many things to prepare.","On the first day of school, it was Song Luosheng who sent her there. As for Song Moqian and Sheng Rong, Song Luokui felt their identities were a bit special, so she didn't let them go.","The car went directly to Peking University. The male students who came to welcome the newcomers brightened up when they saw Song Luokui walking in front carrying her bag. Just as they were about to run over to welcome her, they saw Song Luosheng behind Song Luokui and immediately stopped in their tracks.","Peking University was filled with talented people, each extremely outstanding. But within the outstanding, there were also top outstanding people. Song Luosheng was one of them, and another whose reputation was even greater was Chi Yu. These two seniors were known to all in school.","Apart from them completing all credits without graduating, they had also established companies and became leaders of companies. As for the various honors they had won for the school, those were trivial matters.","Other than their capabilities, there were also their good looks and background. It wasn't very clear, but everyone knew the two were locals of Beijing, and their usual attire and such could tell they had quite a good background.","Song Luosheng looked at the male students who came to welcome them. His eyes narrowed, \"I'm bringing my sister to register. She's in the Faculty of Arts.\"","\"Senior Song is good. The Faculty of Arts is this way.\"","Song Luosheng brought Song Luokui to the Faculty of Arts. After registering, he brought her to the dormitory. Not long after they left, many people already knew Senior Song brought his sister to register."]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: New Term Military Training","paragraphs":["\"Senior Song's little sister is super good-looking with fair and delicate healthy skin, clearly well taken care of.\"","\"She looks very elegant. Senior Song has not shown up at school for a long time. I didn't expect the first thing he did when he appeared was to bring his sister to enroll.\"","\"The two of them look quite alike and both so good-looking.\"","\"If Senior Song was not here, those people would have already rushed up to ask for her WeChat.\"","......","Song Luokui soon arrived at her dormitory. It was a four-person room with beds upstairs and desks downstairs. Her roommates had not arrived yet.","Song Luosheng helped her wipe all the beds clean and put on new bedsheets. He then swept the floor of the dormitory and even wiped the sink and bathroom before leaving with her.","\"Are you hungry? I'll take you to the cafeteria to eat. I feel the food at Cafeteria 5 and Cafeteria 8 is not bad. If you can't get used to the food, you can go home to eat or eat out. Get Aunt Gui to bring food for you if needed.\"","Song Luokui said with some speechlessness: \"I'm not that delicate to need Aunt Gui to bring me food...\"","Song Luosheng said: \"It's not about being delicate. If there are better options available, don't choose the worse ones.\"","Song Luokui found this perspective quite refreshing. \"Let's not trouble Aunt Gui. I'll try out the good food you mentioned first.\" After all, home was not very far. She could just go home to eat if the food was no good.","Song Luosheng brought Song Luokui to Cafeteria 5. The cafeteria had two levels. He directly brought her to Level 2 where he ordered a small stir-fry dish. Song Luokui noticed there were also small private rooms on Level 2.","The food came very quickly. Song Luokui thought it was not bad.","Song Luosheng also topped up 1,000 yuan into her meal card. \"Tell brother when you run out of money.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luosheng also brought Song Luokui around the living area, Faculty of Liberal Arts, and the library before sending her back. Peking University was too huge to finish touring in one go.","The next afternoon after her meal, Song Luokui went to school alone. She did not get Song Luosheng to send her but took the public bus by herself. She would likely often commute between home and school by public bus in the future.","When she arrived at her dormitory, her roommates were already there. After introductions, they quickly became familiar.","Other than Song Luokui who was from Jing City, the rest were from other provinces. Wang Sisi was from City Q, Su Ziyuan from City T, Zhang Jingfeng from Province H.","Wang Sisi and Su Ziyuan were from the Business School while Zhang Jingfeng was from the Faculty of Foreign Languages.","Military training started early the next morning. Everyone got up reluctantly at dawn to put on their uniforms, had breakfast at the cafeteria filled with students in military training uniforms, before assembling at the parade ground.","The school opening ceremony began quickly...","Military training officially started in the afternoon. Commands like \"Attention!\", \"Turn Left\", \"Turn Right\" continuously sounded across the parade ground.","During the 10-minute break, Song Luokui wiped her sweat and went under a tree to drink water from her bottle. The weather was hot and sunny. She was truly tired.","Many girls next to her took out sunblock from their bags and generously applied it on their faces, also taking out small mirrors to check themselves. Song Luokui lamented how feminine they were.","What she didn't know was that she was also considered a scenic view in others' eyes under the tree - an elegant young lady in military uniform with slightly damp bangs on her forehead. Her small face was rosy as she had rolled up her sleeves to her elbows, revealing fair and tender little arms. She was using her cap to fan herself, making for a pleasing sight.","Not far away, people were softly discussing her. \"She's so pretty!\"","\"Her skin is so fair and her face so small.\"","\"I talked to her just now. She speaks super gently.\"","\"I overheard too. She smells nice all over even when sweating. She's called Song Luokui. Even her name sounds nice.\"","\"I was standing next to her during military training. She does smell nice.\"","......Time passed quickly and military training was to resume.","Military training continuously lasted two weeks. Although there were occasional night programs like singing performances or talent shows for entertainment, Song Luokui still felt tired.","She was always the first to sleep after training ended and she showered and blow dried her hair back in her dormitory.","As two weeks ended and the military training rally finished, while others tearfully bid the instructors goodbye, Song Luokui boarded the bus home.","That day, Aunt Gui cooked many delicious dishes for her. \"My young miss has become thinner. Is the school food not to your taste? Or should Aunt Gui make food daily to send over?\"","Song Moqian and Sheng Rong had no objections to Aunt Gui's suggestion. Back then when Song Luosheng jokingly made this request, he was beaten badly by Song Moqian and scolded for having \"rotten thoughts\".","When it came to Song Luokui, Song Moqian even suggested: \"Why not rent a place near school for Aunt Gui to take care of Luokui while we eat at the school canteen?\"","Song Luosheng asked: \"Can't we hire another maid?\"","Song Luokui quickly waved her hands. \"No need, no need. The school cafeteria food is fine. I'll just eat there or come home to eat if it's no good. I can also meet Mum, Dad, and Aunt Gui that way.\"","Song Moqian said: \"It's quite troublesome to commute.\"","Song Luokui righteously declared: \"It's not troublesome at all. As Dad and Mum's daughter, such hardship is nothing. As a socialist successor, I can't be defeated by such tiny hardship. How else can I serve the country in future!\"","Actually it was truly no hardship at all. Her parents just doted on her.","Song Moqian looked extremely happy and proud. \"Good! Worthy of being my daughter.\"","Song Moqian also posted Song Luokui's words in the family group chat. Before long, grandpa, grandma, granduncle, and grandaunt started praising her again.","Song Luokui lamented... With such a family, she had grown up properly into an obedient, polite, law-abiding good child without any deviance. She was awesome!","That day, she told her dorm mates she would not be returning to the dormitory and spent the night at home instead, only taking the bus back to school early next morning.","Song Moqian had wanted Uncle Kang to send her but she declined.","When she returned to her dormitory at noon, Song Luokui sat at her desk looking through newly delivered books. Wang Sisi beside her suddenly asked: \"Luokui, there's a freshman ball tonight. Are you going?\"","Song Luokui: \"Ball? What ball?\"","Seeing that she did not know, Wang Sisi immediately showed her the notice in their year's group chat. There was a freshman ball every year for new students to get to know seniors too.","Wang Sisi: \"We don't have gowns yet and are going out to buy them later. Do you want to join?\"","Song Luokui's family had gowns. \"I won't go. My family has gowns I can ask them to send over.\"","\"Alright, we'll go to the ball together tonight then.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luokui directly asked Aunt Gui to send her white diagonal-strap evening gown to the school entrance. The simple and elegant design just needed some light makeup and an updo hairstyle to complete the look.","The ball was organised proper grandly. There was even a red carpet to walk as well as a stand for autographs and photos. Song Luokui did not stop for any of that but stood below watching Wang Sisi and the rest go up. After they were done, the group entered the ball together.","There was a constant flow of people in the main hall. The men were dressed in suits, handsome fellows all competing to shine the brightest. The ladies were in evening gowns, each meticulously dressed up like flowers striving to be the fairest.","As they had not eaten dinner, the few girls first collected some food before standing at a side chatting. When Wang Sisi and the rest saw classmates from their class, they went over.","Song Luokui sat alone at a corner eating. She had originally wanted to participate in this school event to integrate into campus life. However, being here now felt rather boring.","The ball quickly started. Someone came over to invite Song Luokui for a dance but she rejected it. After that, she slipped outside for some fresh air. There were too many people inside and it felt rather stuffy."]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: Roommate, Boyfriend, Dinner.","paragraphs":["Song Luokui went outside and sat for a while, but found there were mosquitoes. So Song Luokui went back to the lobby again. Soothing music was playing in the lobby, with many people dancing in the middle.","People came up wanting to invite Song Luokui to dance, but she declined them all. It was fine after declining. Song Luokui was also asked for her phone number, but she didn't like adding strangers, so she declined again. She felt a little bored in the end, so she sent Wang Sisi and the others a message before going back.","University life was always like that, with classes everyday, and there were associations to join and activities to participate in. There were also all kinds of competitions to sign up for.","Song Luokui wasn't very interested in any of that. Her days were just going to and from class. If she had evening classes that day she would stay at school, otherwise she would go home.","Song Luosheng and Chi Yu were already fourth year students. If they didn't have anything absolutely essential to do, they wouldn't stay at school. But legends about the two of them were still circulating around campus.","Song Luokui could only sigh that he really deserved to be the male lead villain. He had become an outstanding figure among his peers even before graduating. Of course, she was also very proud, after all Song Luosheng was her brother.","Zhang Xiyue was also at Peking University with her, but Zhang Xiyue was in the dance academy while she was in the Chinese literature academy. Their dorms weren't even in the same building. Peking University was so big that they could only occasionally meet up for meals. Usually they didn't even run into each other.","There were many girls in the literature academy. And since Song Luokui kept a low profile, dressed ordinarily, and usually just took the bus home, she didn't stand out at school. She just looked like an ordinary, albeit very beautiful, student.","Wang Sisi seemed to have recently started dating. She would often chat away sweetly on the phone with her boyfriend in their dorm room. According to convention she had to treat everyone in the dorm to a meal together.","Wang Sisi's boyfriend was also a business major like her. He seemed to be from a wealthy family, and had chosen quite an upscale restaurant.","When Song Luokui, Su Ziyuan and Zhang Jingfeng arrived, Wang Sisi and her boyfriend Lin Chen had already gotten there.","\"You're here, come on in, order whatever you want,\" Wang Sisi said, handing them the menu.","Lin Chen sized up his girlfriend's roommates as well. When he saw Song Luokui his eyes widened in surprise, but that was it. He just appreciated her looks and didn't think much of it.","Suddenly he seemed to recall something. He looked Song Luokui up and down again feeling like she resembled someone, but couldn't remember who. Wang Sisi noticed right away and pinched his arm. Her expression had already turned unhappy. Only then did Lin Chen come back to his senses and said with a smile, \"Order whatever you want.\" Then he whispered to Wang Sisi, \"It's not what you think. I'll explain later.\"","Any girl would feel unhappy if her boyfriend was ogling another girl. When Wang Sisi invited her roommates, she was actually a little worried. After all Song Luokui really was gorgeous, everyone acknowledged she was good looking. It seemed she just kept a low profile, and was a bit of a homebody, otherwise word would have already spread.","There were rankings for the campus beauties at Peking University, but Song Luokui wasn't on them. Wang Sisi felt she simply didn't care about things like beauty rankings.","But she had invited Song Luokui over in the end. It was a test for her boyfriend, after all.","Su Ziyuan opened the menu and saw that even a simple stir fried vegetable dish cost over 100 RMB. The specialties were over 1000 RMB, even tens of thousands.","Su Ziyuan cried out, \"So expensive!\" She didn't even dare order anything.","Lin Chen said, \"Don't worry about it, order whatever you want.\"","Wang Sisi also said, \"He's treating anyway, so order whatever you feel like Ziyuan.\"","Su Ziyuan didn't dare order. She passed the menu to Song Luokui, \"Luokui, you order.\"","Song Luokui didn't stand on ceremony. Song Luosheng had brought her here once before, but afterwards she felt it wasn't worth it and Aunt Gui's cooking at home was better anyway.","Song Luokui flipped through the menu and ordered two dishes, before passing the menu to Zhang Jingfeng. Zhang Jingfeng looked through it unsure of what to get, so she randomly picked one dish. Finally she passed the menu to Wang Sisi.","Wang Sisi had Lin Chen order. He ordered several more dishes.","The atmosphere at the meal was good. Lin Chen kept the conversation flowing smoothly, so that it didn't get awkward. Everyone also ate their fill satisfactorily. It was expensive after all, so the taste was decent.","When the meal ended, Wang Sisi and Lin Chen went to pay the bill. Wang Sisi asked him softly, \"It's time for your explanation. I saw you sneakily checking out Luokui several times. Don't think I didn't notice.\"","Lin Chen said, \"I just suddenly realized she resembled someone, but I've forgotten who. You know how it is with my family. Our looks are nothing special in Beijing. There are so many big shots here. My family tells us to keep a low profile outside and remember certain people, otherwise we might offend someone without realizing it.\"","Of course Wang Sisi understood Lin Chen's family circumstances, otherwise she wouldn't have accepted his pursuit either. After all Lin Chen was just average looking, but very generous. It would benefit her plans to develop her career in Beijing in the future too.","It was rather practical, but Wang Sisi was very clear on what she wanted. And after getting to know him for a while, she felt Lin Chen was polite to others, and not a bad guy overall. So currently, she was quite satisfied with him.","\"Luokui is a local girl. She usually keeps a pretty low profile, wearing ordinary clothes and all that. I think she normally just takes the bus home. We're not in the same major so I'm not familiar with her family circumstances either. Could she be from your social circle too?\"","Lin Chen shook his head, \"I don't know. I've never seen her in our circle before.\" If there was such a beauty in their circle, someone probably would have already made a move.","\"Maybe she's from another circle then,\" Lin Chen added.","Wang Sisi asked in puzzlement, \"Another circle?\"","Lin Chen pointed upwards, \"A level higher up, and lower levels too. You'll understand later. Don't worry, I'm certain I didn't act that way because I'm interested in her or anything. You're still the one I like best,\" he said, then kissed her.","Wang Sisi cheered up a little too. \"Alright, let's go pay first.\"","\"Okay.\"","The meal had cost over 20,000 RMB. It was pocket change to Lin Chen, but still felt expensive to Su Ziyuan and Zhang Jingfeng. At least they got to experience high society a little. Wang Sisi also felt a sense of vanity, and secretly glanced at Song Luokui several times. She discovered Song Luokui seemed totally unfazed. Wang Sisi wondered to herself, could Luokui's family really be loaded too?","After the meal, the five of them walked out of the restaurant. Lin Chen was about to go get his car to drive the four girls back to campus. Just then a car pulled up in front of the restaurant. The attendant at the door went up to receive the guests. The driver opened the door and got out, then went around to open the rear door. A pair of long legs in tailored trousers and leather shoes emerged first, followed by a familiar figure.","Chen Nan also got out from the other side of the car.","Lin Chen instantly burst into great enthusiasm and a radiant smile as he went up, \"Senior Chi, Senior Chen, what a coincidence running into you here!\"","Chen Nan looked puzzledly at Lin Chen, \"You are...?\"","Lin Chen quickly introduced himself, \"I'm Lin Chen from Lin's Timber Industry. I'm also at Peking University, a second year business major student.\"","Of course Chen Nan knew of Lin's Timber Industry. The ones he usually saw were the head of the Lins, Lin FeiHong. Chen Nan wasn't very familiar with his sons and daughters. But he still shook Lin Chen's hand, \"Nice to meet you.\"","\"Nice to meet you, nice to meet you!\" Realizing Chi Yu and Chen Nan must have business here, Lin Chen didn't dare disturb them further either. \"I'll get going first then. You guys must be busy.\""]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: Come across","paragraphs":["Lin Cheng was talking to two people, while Song Luokui just stood behind without saying anything. Wang Sisi and the others next to her were a little excited, but they didn't come forward either. They had been at Peking University for over a month now, and they knew about some of the rumors circulating around campus.","They didn't expect to actually see the person from the rumors!","The legendary Senior Chi Yu was as impressive as the rumors suggested. They only dared to glance at him briefly without staring for long. They just knew he had a noble temperament and heavenly good looks, with an air of detachment surrounding him that made him difficult to look at directly.","They also knew of Senior Chen Nan. He was also quite handsome, but not as dazzling as Senior Chi Yu when standing next to him.","Lin Cheng waited for the two people to leave before sending Wang Sisi and the others back. Unexpectedly, the usually unapproachable Chi Yu suddenly looked towards the people behind him and asked, \"Going home?\"","Lin Cheng: ?","Lin Cheng raised his head in surprise. He realized Chi Yu was looking at someone behind him. His mind jolted alert, and he looked towards Song Luokui next to Wang Sisi.","Song Luokui had not spoken this whole time. She also didn't expect Chi Yu to ask her a question. That sentence was clearly directed at her, since his gaze was fixed on her.","As soon as Chi Yu spoke, Chen Nan also looked over. He raised an eyebrow. \"Oh my, little sister Song is here too.\" Although he didn't get along well with Song Luosheng, he had to admit that the Song family had good genes. His little sister Song Luokui had grown into a real beauty. If she wasn't in the institute but outside instead, she probably would have been taken advantage of already.","Thinking of all the girls in the institute, this girl from the Song family was undoubtedly the best.","Song Luokui nodded lightly at them. \"Yes.\" Then she answered Chi Yu's question, \"I'm not going home, going back to school.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll have someone take you back.\"","Song Luokui immediately shook her head. \"No need, Senior Lin Cheng will take us back.\"","Lin Cheng immediately said, \"Haha, don't worry seniors, I'll send them all back safely.\"","Chi Yu didn't insist. He murmured in agreement, then left with Chen Nan.","Lin Cheng immediately went to get his car to send the four people back to school. The car ride was silent. Lin Cheng kept looking at the rearview mirror like he wanted to say something, and exchanged meaningful looks with his girlfriend.","Wang Sisi understood his intention. She coughed and asked, \"Luokui, you...know Senior Chi Yu and the others?\"","Song Luokui: \"...We're acquainted, but not very familiar.\" They were indeed not very familiar, and what's more, they were considered \"enemies\" — after all, the younger sister of the villain should be a villain as well.","Although she had exchanged a few civil words with Chi Yu before, if in the future her brother Song Luosheng really ended up in a life-and-death struggle with Chi Yu, then of course she would stand by her brother's side. Of course, she would try her best to prevent that kind of situation from happening.","Currently, although Song Luosheng and Chi Yu disliked each other to some extent, the main issue was still that Song Luosheng wanted to surpass Chi Yu. Their relationship was one of rivalry, not yet at the stage of mortal enemies. Things were still quite harmonious between their families. In the eyes of the older generation, the poor relations between the two young men was seen as just harmless child's play.","Yes, although both were already in their fourth year of university, in the eyes of the older generation they were still naughty youngsters. Their usual disagreements were regarded as childish squabbles. They would come to understand right and wrong when they grew up a bit more.","Seeing that Song Luokui didn't want to say more, Wang Sisi didn't ask further either. They soon arrived at the female dorms. Song Luokui, Su Yiyuan, and Zhang Jingfeng got out of the car first, leaving Wang Sisi alone to bid Lin Cheng goodbye.","After the others left, Lin Cheng instructed his girlfriend, \"Be a little nicer to your roommate from now on. Oh, no need for that actually, just act normal. The main thing is not to offend her.\"","Wang Sisi asked, \"Is Senior Chi Yu really amazing?\" This was also the first time she had seen her boyfriend act so subservient.","Lin Cheng: \"I told you before that my family is just one of the lower levels. There are still higher levels above us. As for Senior Chi Yu and the others, they are the highest level. Based on what I saw, it looks like your roommate knows them too.\"","Wang Sisi felt somewhat relieved that she hadn't done anything bad to Song Luokui previously. \"I understand. I'll get along well with her.\"","Lin Cheng: \"You don't need to deliberately fawn over such people either. That could backfire. Just act normal.\"","\"Okay, got it.\"","\"Alright, go on up first. Rest well. I'll bring you breakfast tomorrow.\"","\"Okay.\"","The two kissed goodbye. Then Wang Sisi returned to the dorm.","This little incident soon blew over. In the dorm, everyone just knew Song Luokui had an extraordinary family background, but no one probed further. Their attitude towards her was still perfectly fine as usual.","As before, Song Luokui remained gentle and soft-spoken. It seemed she just went home more often now. That was because the weather had turned cold, and she was afraid of the cold, so she went home to keep warm. After all, she was more comfortable at home.","This year, it seemed to start snowing unusually early. When Song Luokui got up early in the morning, the area outside was already covered in snow. On the TV downstairs, they were reporting that Beijing would experience heavy snow today, and reminding everyone to take safety precautions.","Song Luokui put on a thick down jacket and a hat. Her little face was buried in a scarf, while her hands were tucked into her pockets. She stood not far from the institute's entrance waiting for the bus.","A car suddenly stopped in front of her. The window rolled down to reveal Chi Yu's face as he turned to look at her. \"Get in the car. I'll take you to school.\"","Song Luokui waved her hands. \"We're not going the same way. You should go about your business.\" She knew his company was in the opposite direction.","Chi Yu said, \"I'm going to the school today too.\"","Song Luokui: \"Oh.\" After hesitating for a moment, she obediently got into the car. \"Thanks.\"","Once she was in the car, warm air blasted her. Song Luokui instantly felt much more comfortable. She adjusted her scarf, revealing her little face, not knowing how Chi Yu had recognized her when she was bundled up so thickly.","The drive passed in silence. They soon arrived at the school. Remembering the rumors about Chi Yu, Song Luokui wanted him to drop her off not too close to the school gates. But Chi Yu ignored that, directly sending her to the gates of the Literature Department.","Song Luokui quickly got out of the car. \"Thanks.\" Then she hurried into the department building, afraid someone might see her.","Chi Yu also drove off very soon after. Actually he didn't have any business at the school today.","Song Luokui thought the semester would continue to pass by uneventfully like this. But that night, she had a class that ended at 8:30pm. Since the next day was weekend, she planned to just go home directly.","When she reached the school gates and was about to hail a cab, her phone suddenly rang nonstop. Song Luokui looked and saw it was Wang Sisi. \"Hello?\"","On the other end, Wang Sisi was crying. \"Luokui? Luokui, please save Lin Cheng! I really don't know what to do! Please, I'm begging you, save Lin Cheng!\"","Song Luokui immediately tried to calm her down. \"What happened? Where are you? Don't panic, tell me what's going on first. I'm coming over right now, don't be scared.\"","Wang Sisi: \"I'm at the Red Leaf Bar... Ah! Don't...!\" Suddenly there were sounds of commotion from Wang Sisi's side. The call cut off. When Song Luokui called back, no one picked up.","Song Luokui immediately caught a cab to the Red Leaf Bar. The Red Leaf Bar wasn't far from Peking University, just about a 10-minute ride. Although Song Luokui went over by herself first, she also gave Song Luosheng a call. He didn't pick up, so she sent him a message and also called Zhou Yuan.","\"My friend might be in trouble at the Red Leaf Bar. I'm going over now. Call my brother to come if he's free.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Your brother is still in a meeting. I'll let him know later. I've asked some other people to head over first.\"","\"Please hurry, it's an emergency.\"","\"Got it.\""]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: Rescue","paragraphs":["Entering the Red Leaf Bar, Song Luokui immediately went to the VIP area, not even giving face to Lin Cheng's people. Song Luokui thought he might be a big shot.","Before long, Song Luokui saw there were people guarding a private room. She rushed over immediately but was stopped by the people outside.","\"This room is already booked. You've got the wrong one.\"","Song Luokui vaguely heard screams coming from inside. Her small face tensed up as she lifted her chin, crossing her arms over her chest. \"Do you know who I am? How dare you stop me? Your boss wouldn't even dare stop me, so who do you think you are?\"","Seeing Song Luokui's overbearing demeanor, the two hesitated, wondering if this girl really knew their boss. Song Luokui took the chance to rush right in.","With a bang, the private room door opened. Song Luokui saw Lin Cheng curled up and beaten, blood dripping from his head, already passed out on the floor. Other people were also beaten unconscious on the ground. Wang Sisi was pinned underneath someone, screaming as her clothes were ripped open.","There were other men in the room, each embracing women engaged in acts. A burst of anger exploded in Song Luokui's heart. She grabbed a nearby bottle and smashed it at the man about to violate Wang Sisi, yelling \"Bang!\" Everyone was shocked stiff!","The man was also stunned for a moment, raising his head to look at Song Luokui, then touching the back of his head which was now bleeding.","Wang Sisi took the chance to push away the man and ran trembling behind Song Luokui, clutching her clothes. She cried while recounting what had just happened.","Song Luokui listened while seeing the man still wasn't passed out. She grabbed another bottle, ready to smash it again. But this time the man caught it, yelling \"Damn it! Quick, grab this crazy bitch!\"","The others came up, trying to take the bottle from Song Luokui's hand. Song Luokui grabbed the broken shards and held them to the man's throat. \"Let's see who dares!\"","Seeing the man's neck pierced and bleeding, the others stopped in their tracks. Only then did the man get a good look at Song Luokui's face. He suddenly laughed. \"Stop, the little beauty is just playing around with me. I didn't expect another beauty, no, a great beauty to show up too. Hahahaha.\"","The man lecherously looked Song Luokui up and down, finally settling on her face. \"I didn't know Jing City had such a hidden beauty!\"","Song Luokui looked on coldly: \"You're committing a crime!\" Then she told Wang Sisi: \"Call the police.\"","Wang Sisi's voice still trembled. \"My phone was smashed.\" It was smashed when she called Song Luokui earlier.","Song Luokui gave her own phone to Wang Sisi. The man took the chance to break free and twist Song Luokui's hand, making the shard fall.","Song Luokui was pulled down and pressed under the man. Wang Sisi was about to step forward but was quickly restrained by another man, the phone also taken away.","Pinned and unable to move, Song Luokui said: \"Not even your parents would dare touch me, how dare you?\" She had miscalculated, she should've waited for her brother's people before coming. But then Wang Sisi would've suffered at their hands.","The man was puzzled, thinking of Jing City's influential families and their children, yet he had never seen Song Luokui before. He laughed again. \"I've never seen you, so I can certainly afford to offend your family.\"","\"Is that so?\" A sudden voice came from the door. Everyone looked over. Song Luokui couldn't see clearly who it was. She just saw the person stride over in two steps, pick up the man like a little chick and throw him aside onto a table, smashing the bottles and glasses.","The other men who tried to rush forward were all subdued by the black-clad men accompanying him.","\"Ah!\" The man was pierced by the broken glass, his forehead split open. He cried out in pain, \"I'm Yu Zhong! My dad is Yu Yan! Don't you dare touch me!\"","The person was about to give an order when someone burst in from outside. \"Who dares bully my sister!\"","Song Luosheng came in followed by a group. Seeing Song Luokui standing next to Chi Yu, the blood smear on her face made it seem like she was cut.","Song Luosheng also saw Chi Yu next to Song Luokui. Thinking Chi Yu had bullied his sister, he immediately rushed forward. \"Chi Yu, I didn't think you were so despicable to even bully girls. What kind of man are you!\"","Song Luosheng's fist was about to land on Chi Yu when Song Luokui stopped him. \"Brother, you're mistaken! It wasn't him!\"","Song Luokui held onto Song Luosheng. \"It wasn't him, it wasn't him! It was that man!\" She pointed at the ashen-faced man.","Song Luosheng paused, looking at the man. \"He bullied you?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yes, it was him! He even tried to take advantage of me!\"","Hearing this, Song Luosheng's blood rushed to his head. He punched the man to the ground. The room was filled with the sounds of collisions. No one else dared make a peep.","Song Luokui was afraid he'd beat the man to death. \"Stop hitting him, brother. Just call the police. My friend needs treatment first, take him to the hospital.\"","Song Luosheng gave the man another kick, telling him to call an ambulance and dialed 110 to understand the situation.","After getting the full story, he realized Chi Yu had actually saved his sister. Song Luosheng felt a bit awkward for a moment, but admitted his mistake nobly. Looking at Chi Yu, he said: \"I owe you one! You can leave now.\"","Chi Yu didn't mind either. He glanced at the blood smear on Song Luokui's face, then left with his men.","The police arrived quickly. Wang Sisi thanked Song Luokui profusely before leaving with Lin Cheng in the ambulance. Song Luosheng also brought Song Luokui back home.","\"You're too reckless going there alone like that.\" Song Luosheng poked Song Luokui's forehead.","Song Luokui rubbed her forehead, pouting. \"I know I was wrong. Sisi was in grave danger. And didn't I call you right away? You just didn't pick up. Zhou Yuan said he already sent people over first. How did you get there faster than them?\"","Song Luosheng: \"If I wasn't fast enough, wouldn't you have gotten into trouble?\"","Song Luokui: \"How could that happen? Wasn't someone else there?\"","Thinking of Chi Yu put Song Luosheng in a complicated mood. \"How did he happen to be there? And even save you? Do you two know each other?\""]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: Return the Favor","paragraphs":["Song Luokui had a completely unconcerned look on her face. “Why wouldn’t I recognize him? Aren’t we all from the residences here? We’ve seen each other before.” As for her and Chi Yu having seen each other a couple of times and even greeting each other when they met, she decided not to mention that to her brother to avoid angering him.","Song Luosheng said, “That’s true. But keep your distance from him and don’t forget which side you’re on. As for him helping you out this time, I’ll repay him for that so you don’t need to concern yourself with it anymore. Just walk away if you run into him from now on.”","Song Luokui replied, “Ok ok, I’m definitely on your side. I’ll be sure to keep my distance from him.”","After sending Song Luokui back home, Song Luosheng went out again. He headed to the police station. Anyone daring to bully his family would have to pay the price.","Song Moqian and Sheng Rong soon found out about this incident too, and they showered Song Luokui with care and concern again. It wasn’t long before someone wanted to come to her home and personally apologize, but Song Moqian did not let her meet with them. The rest was handled by her family, and Song Luokui soon went back to school.","Lin Cheng had suffered a concussion from the beating and needed to stay at the hospital for observation. The Lin family was also furious, but the main perpetrator had already been punished, and they clearly couldn’t afford to offend the Song family either. Moreover, they heard that the Song family had already helped punish the offender, so they even sent the Song family gifts, which were declined.","According to Song Moqian’s rationale, it was just about “serving the people.”","The Lin family didn’t do anything more. They just remembered this favor in their hearts. Aside from Lin Cheng himself, some of his friends who were there that day also remembered this act of kindness.","Wang Sisi also thanked Song Luokui profusely. “Thank you. If it wasn’t for you, something horrible could have happened to Lin Cheng and me that day...”","Wang Sisi shuddered just thinking about it. It had been Lin Cheng’s birthday that day originally. He had booked a private room to celebrate with his friends when they ran into that horrid Yu Zhong character. That vile man had actually demanded that Lin Cheng let her “serve” him.","No self-respecting man could tolerate something like that. Of course Lin Cheng didn’t agree and even wanted to hit the guy. But he knew clearly that he couldn’t afford to offend Yu Zhong. He had planned to take Wang Sisi away at first, but unexpectedly, Yu Zhong was so audacious that he directly laid hands on her.","Lin Cheng couldn’t endure anymore and immediately fought back, but Yu Zhong had brought more people with him, including bodyguards, so Lin Cheng ended up getting beaten to that state. His girlfriend had almost been assaulted as well.","This was not even close to Yu Zhong’s first offense like this. But his family had helped smooth things over for him in the past. He just didn’t expect to provoke someone untouchable this time.","Song Luokui patted Wang Sisi’s hand. “It’s over now. Remember to call the police right away next time something like this happens in the future.”","Wang Sisi suddenly recalled the person she saw later and hesitated for a moment before asking outright, “So you’re Elder Brother Song’s younger sister?” How could she and Song Luosheng and Song Luokui not make the connection sooner?","Song Luokui quickly “shushed” her and said, “It’s confidential.” She herself had only learned of her elder brother’s reputation on campus shortly after starting school this semester. Recalling how certain people had looked at her when she had registered, she felt it was better to keep a low profile. As for her identity as Song Luosheng’s sister, there was no need to advertise that detail to everyone.","Wang Sisi promptly covered her mouth and nodded, giving Song Luokui a thumbs up sign.","On Song Luosheng’s side, Lin Xingyan entered Song Luosheng’s office holding some documents. “According to our intel, several companies have already eyed that land, including Chi Yu’s side. Are we going to compete for it? I have inside information that barring any surprises, we can obtain it.”","Song Luosheng looked over the documents briefly and pondered for a moment. “Let Chi Yu have it. Consider it as me repaying him.”","Lin Xingyan was also aware of the earlier incident where Chi Yu had apparently helped Song Luokui when she was bullied, so he didn’t say anything more about it.","Song Luosheng added, “Pay attention to that plot of land in the north of the city. That’s the key plot. The one in the east is important too but the northern one takes priority.”","“Got it. I’ll organize the data.” Lin Xingyan replied. “Don’t forget we’re having dinner with Chairperson Shen’s side tonight.”","“Mm.”","On the other side, Chen Nan was also telling Chi Yu about the land plot in eastern part of the city. “The materials for the eastern plot are already prepared. Song Luosheng’s man Song Hua downstairs will also be competing for it.”","Chi Yu simply said, “Proceed according to plan.”","“Understood.”","Chi Yu continued, “Prepare the documents for that land plot in the north too. That one is more critical.”","“Alright.”","The next day, Chen Nan came to Chi Yu’s office again. “The downstairs side isn’t competing with us anymore. And not only that, they even gave us their insider data, saying it’s to repay Chi Yu’s kindness. Should we accept?”","Zheng Quanjun, who was also present, asked incredulously, “Brother Nan? What kindness is the Song family owing to the Boss? ”","Chen Nan just coughed twice without answering, looking to Chi Yu instead.","Chi Yu glanced up slightly, “Since that is the case, then let us accept.”","“Understood.”","Knowing that Chi Yu’s side had accepted their offer of information, Song Luosheng also breathed a sigh of relief. After all, from now on his precious baby sister would have no debts or obligations to what’s-his-name over there. Ever since she was little, if it wasn’t for him protecting Song Luokui, who knows how much trouble she could have gotten into with unsavory types already. Of course, his sister also seldom went out.","So when Song Luosheng witnessed how Chi Yu had actually saved his sister Song Luokui, alarm bells went off instantly in his mind. He was admittedly rather presumptuous, but Song Luosheng did fear that Chi Yu might take a liking to his Luokui. He also worried that something might develop between Song Luokui and Chi Yu.","His innocent and naive sister could surely never outmaneuver someone like Chi Yu. He feared she would get hurt. But for the time being, it seemed neither side had developed any special feelings or interest towards the other, much to Song Luosheng’s relief.","The winter break arrived quickly. After exams had concluded, Song Luokui went straight home. With nothing much else to do, Song Luosheng asked her to come deliver meals to his office occasionally. “You can’t just stay cooped up at home every day without getting exercise. Start coming out to bring me food tomorrow.”","Song Luokui complained, “...Can’t you just let me relax in peace?”","Song Luosheng countered, “I’ll add another 10,000 to your allowance.”","Song Luokui immediately agreed, “I’ll definitely come by tomorrow then.” She would never say no to money after all.","The next day when Song Luokui came to deliver food, Song Luosheng seemed extremely busy. By the time she arrived, he was still in a conference that showed no signs of ending anytime soon. Song Luokui didn’t stick around long. After dropping off the lunchbox in his office, she left.","Upon returning to the residence compound, she realized it had been awhile since she properly walked around. So she decided to take a leisurely stroll and look around. After a bit, she felt tired and sat down on a nearby bench to rest.","The weather today was quite cold. One could see the foggy mist formed from exhaled breath. But there was also sunlight today. Under the warm rays, Song Luokui felt rather comfortable.","She sat on the long bench and gazed up at the grassy area not too far away. A stray cat from some household was sprawled lazily over there. It would meow occasionally and stretch before its body went limp again. Sometimes it would roll over too.","Song Luokui watched it for a long time. Then she looked up towards the cloudless sky. Once in awhile an airplane would fly by, leaving a contrail across the blue expanse. She realized she hadn’t thought about her past life in quite some time.","Her past self didn’t seem to have done much besides staying at hospitals frequently. Who knew she’d get another life after that one. Perhaps she had accrued some good karma, like persistently planting trees on Taobao every day. *","While Song Luokui was lost in thought, Chi Yu had just emerged from his residence over on his side. Still on a phone call, he started heading out the compound gate when he caught sight of the lone figure sitting on a roadside bench up ahead after walking for a bit.","* Taobao reference is to how users can plant virtual trees on the shopping platform by engaging in certain activities."]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: Please Eat","paragraphs":["The person sitting in the seat was lost in thought, her small face flushed from the cold, a strand of hair blown by the wind gently caressing her face, her eyes out of focus.","Chi Yu suddenly remembered that a long time ago, how did he remember Song Luokui? Was it because she was Song Luosheng's sister?","No. Song Luosheng was Song Luosheng, and Song Luokui was Song Luokui. When they fought Song Luosheng when they were young, he knew Song Luosheng had a younger sister, and occasionally saw Song Luosheng bring his sister to play while they fought on the other side.","But at that time, Song Luosheng's sister was just a symbol to him. He didn't remember this person at all, because to him there was no need.","It wasn't until one day when he returned from a competition outside, walking on the road in the courtyard, Song Luokui at that time was also sitting in a chair. It was summer then, and the weather was very hot. Song Luokui wore an ordinary T-shirt and shorts, her hands and feet were exposed and very fair, and she wore a jade bracelet on her wrist that set it off even more beautifully.","But the Song Luokui at that time was not as carefree as she is now. Her eyebrows were slightly furrowed, her eyes were also looking into the distance, but her eyes were filled with a vast expanse of bleak emptiness, as if this world was all empty.","Anyway, that look was definitely not one a minor would have. I don't know if she sensed something, but Song Luokui suddenly turned her head and looked at Chi Yu at that time. Chi Yu stopped in his tracks directly, because he actually felt that the girl had a feeling that she wanted to kill him.","However, just one second later, her eyes changed back, her eyes turned back to that of an ordinary little girl. Someone called to her from not far away, \"Little miss, come back for dinner!\"","\"Oh!\" She responded and got up with a clip clop sound running back to the other side.","Later when he saw her again, she had grown up a bit, standing next to Song Luosheng. Chen Nan said at that time: \"Everyone in the yard said that the Song family's sister is the most beautiful in the yard, and she really lives up to her reputation. If she wasn't related to Song Luosheng, I would want to give the Song family's sister gifts.\"","At that time, Chi Yu inexplicably asked, \"What's her name?\"","Chen Nan: \"Her? Oh, Song Luosheng's sister, called Song Luokui. Everyone calls her Kui Kui. It seems that she wasn't in good health before, she always stayed at home except for going to school, she rarely went out. It seems that even at school she seldom left the classroom.\"","Of course, not being in good health was false. She was just unlucky and had accidents that sent her to the hospital from time to time.","After that, he didn't meet Song Luokui much, just catching a glimpse of her figure occasionally when he returned to the yard. After that was the time in country Y, unexpectedly she helped him...","The grown up Song Luokui was more beautiful than when she was a child. Every time Chen Nan saw her afterwards, he lamented why Song Luosheng had such a beautiful sister or why such a beautiful sister belonged to the Song family. If she wasn't from the Song family, he would also want the beautiful Song sister to call him brother.","\"I'll go over there in a while, get ready first,\" Chi Yu said to the other end and then hung up the phone. He walked towards Song Luokui.","Hearing the footsteps, Song Luokui finally came back to her senses. Turning her head, she saw Chi Yu. She had promised Song Luosheng earlier to stay away from Chi Yu, but now that they had run into each other, she thought that since he had saved her once, it would be better if she greeted him.","Song Luokui stood up and nodded slightly to him, then wanted to leave.","Unexpectedly, the man in front suddenly asked her, \"Have you eaten?\"","Song Luokui looked up, \"Ah? Yes, I have.\" She tucked her hands into her pockets, fingering her clothes. \"I...\" I'll be on my way first.","\"I haven't eaten yet,\" Chi Yu said.","Song Luokui swallowed her words. \"Er...\" Why tell me this? Does he want me to treat him to a meal?","Chi Yu: \"Last time at Red Leaf...\"","Song Luokui: \"Let me treat you to a meal. Thank you for saving me last time.\"","\"Alright,\" Chi Yu started walking outside the yard. After taking two steps and Song Luokui didn't follow, he turned to look at her.","Song Luokui: \"...\" Help! Why did she blurt that out just now!","Song Luokui immediately caught up. The two walked out of the yard one after the other. Chi Yu’s car was parked outside the yard. The car was originally parked at the company, and was driven back by Zheng Quanjun today. Since no one brought Zheng Quanjun in, he couldn’t enter the yard, so Chi Yu had him park not far from the yard gate.","When the two went out, the guard at the door took a special glance at them.","Arriving at Chi Yu's car, Chi Yu opened the car door first for Song Luokui to get into the passenger seat. He still held his hand on the car door to prevent Song Luokui from hitting her head. Then he walked around the car and sat in the driver's seat, driving towards downtown.","\"What do you want to eat?\" Chi Yu asked while driving.","Song Luokui: \"Anything you want.\"","Chi Yu understood and she heard him make a reservation. The two soon arrived at the restaurant, an antique-styled place. Chi Yu had booked a private room where you could also see the scenery outside from the room.","The menu came up quickly. Chi Yu let Song Luokui order. Song Luokui thought to herself that it was his meal, so why let her order? But she still ordered a dish, then Chi Yu ordered two more dishes.","The food came up quickly, and with it came the owner of the restaurant to greet them. \"Young Master Chi, I didn't expect you to come back today. It’s on the house today.\"","Chi Yu shook the man's hand. \"No need.\"","The man suddenly noticed the girl sitting across from Chi Yu. Seeing the girl's outstanding beauty, he was greatly surprised and instantly understood. \"Sorry to disturb you. Please take your time eating. I'll go out first.\" He also sent over another dish.","After the man left, he breathed a sigh of relief. Then he thought to himself, Chi Yu was actually having a meal with a girl. My god, who is that girl?!","Chi Yu put a piece of meat in Song Luokui's bowl. \"Let's eat.\"","Song Luokui looked at the meat in her bowl and finally picked up her chopsticks to eat some. Fortunately she didn't eat much for lunch, otherwise she might not be able to walk from eating too much. The food here was really good. This was also the first time Song Luokui ate at this restaurant.","So she accidentally ate too much. Although she was a little concerned, her stomach still felt a little bloated.","Song Luokui touched her stomach. Chi Yu noticed, of course. He wiped his mouth and hands, then stood up. \"Do you want to go for a walk?\"","Song Luokui immediately nodded. She had to digest the food. When it was time to check out, she originally wanted to pay since she was the one who asked him out for the meal. She even took out her payment code. But the staff said Chi Yu had already paid.","Chi Yu: \"You can treat me next time.\"","Song Luokui: \"Next time?\" Would there be a next time? She was afraid her brother would find out about this time!","Chi Yu: \"Yeah.\"","Song Luokui sighed inwardly and followed him out of the restaurant. The two slowly walked along the sidewalk. Song Luokui glanced at the man next to her and lowered her head again. Then after a while raised her head to look at him again.","Chi Yu of course noticed. \"What do you want to say?\"","Song Luokui: \"...Er... Don't you have work? If you're busy you can go first. I can go back by myself.\"","But Chi Yu didn't speak, just kept walking forward. And he asked her, \"Which college are you in?\"","Song Luokui didn't expect him to ask this suddenly and was stunned for a moment before answering, \"Literature.\"","Chi Yu: \"Oh. I'm in Finance.\"","Of course Song Luokui knew he was in Finance. After all, there were many legendary stories about him at school."]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: Sugar, Sugar","paragraphs":["Song Luokui didn't know why he was telling her this, so she just responded with an \"uh huh\" and didn't say anything else. The silence would feel awkward if she didn't speak, so Song Luokui said: \"The business school seems pretty far from the literature department.\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah, it's a bit far.\" Actually it was only two kilometers, not far at all if driving or riding a bike.","As they walked, there was a stall on the roadside selling sugar figures, with a sign that read 10 yuan each. Song Luokui glanced at it twice, and Chi Yu beside her suddenly walked over saying, \"I'd like one.\"","Owner: \"What would you like?\"","Chi Yu looked towards Song Luokui: \"What would you like?\"","Song Luokui's eyes widened in surprise. \"Huh? You're buying one for me?\"","Chi Yu didn't reply, but his intention was obvious. Song Luokui, worried that the owner was getting impatient, immediately said: \"Just make a sunflower.\"","\"Sure!\"","The owner quickly made one and Chi Yu handed over 10 yuan. Song Luokui held the sunflower-shaped sugar figure, slightly stunned as she looked up at Chi Yu.","Today Chi Yu was wearing a long black coat with a full suit underneath, his hair combed up to reveal a smooth forehead. He was a full head taller than her 1.65 meters; Chi Yu was probably around 1.85 meters.","His side profile had perfectly smooth lines, thick earlobes, and surprisingly pierced ears, although he wasn't wearing any earrings.","Chi Yu suddenly turned his head to look straight at her, and Song Luokui's heart jumped as she immediately turned her head saying, \"Let's get going.\" She took off walking as she said this.","In just two long steps Chi Yu caught up with her. Sensing that passersby kept glancing at Chi Yu when they walked by, Song Luokui immediately stopped and said, \"Let's head back.\"","Chi Yu had no objections. The two returned to the car parked near the entrance of the compound. Song Luokui got out of the car, then Chi Yu left to drive somewhere else.","Song Luokui was still holding the sugar figure as she walked into the compound. The guard at the entrance glanced between her and the now distant familiar car, a gossipy gleam in his eyes.","...","\"Song Hua is also involved in that plot of land in the north of town, and it seems they're confident they'll get it,\" Chen Nan said to Chi Yu.","Chi Yu was fiddling with a piece of candy in his hand without responding. Chen Nan wondered what was so fun about playing with candy. The packaging did look cute, could the boss be looking to break into the candy business?","Chi Yu clasped the candy in his palm. \"Let that plot of land in the north of town go, and get the Hui City project instead.\"","Chen Nan was shocked. \"Huh? You're letting it go?\"","Chi Yu: \"Mm.\" Set up a meeting with the CEO of Golden Tech. Tell him I've invested in his project, but I want 60% of the shares.\"","Chen Nan: \"No one has dared touch that Golden Tech project. People in the industry all say it's not worth it, one wrong step could lead to bankruptcy.\"","Chi Yu: \"Go prepare for the meeting. It won't go bankrupt.\"","Upon hearing this, Chen Nan didn't question him further. From a young age he had witnessed Chi Yu's brilliance countless times. That time in high school when Chi Yu turned 10,000 yuan into over a million in just a few weeks, Chen Nan was thoroughly convinced of his money making abilities.","After Chen Nan left, Chi Yu unwrapped the candy and put it in his mouth. It really was very sweet. Song Luokui had taken the candy out of her pocket and handed it to him when she got out of the car, saying \"Thank you, please have this candy.\"","At the time, Chi Yu stared at the candy in his hand for a good while before driving off.","In business circles, many people came to know that Chi Yu would be investing in Golden Tech's project. Most said he was too hot blooded and rash due to his youth. \"Throwing away money at such a young age.\" \"At least my own son only spends a bit more, he won't lead us to bankruptcy.\"","Of course Song Luosheng knew about this. He couldn't figure out why Chi Yu would invest in that project. Lin Xingyan laughed loudly, \"Boss, let's just wait for their bankruptcy!\"","But Song Luosheng didn't see it that way. Knowing your enemy is the best way to defeat them. Song Luosheng narrowed his eyes. \"We'll invest too.\"","Lin Xingyan: \"Huh?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Hurry up and prepare. Set up a meeting with Golden Tech's CEO.\"","\"But...fine.\" Although he didn't understand, Lin Xingyan could only do as told.","However, a few days later Lin Xingyan said, \"They don't need investors anymore. I heard Chi Yu is taking 60% of the shares and will be the one in charge going forward.\"","Song Luosheng frowned, pondering for a bit. \"Then forget it. First secure that plot of land north of town.\"","\"Alright.\"","Recently Song Luokui hadn't brought Song Luosheng meals anymore because she felt too nervous. She was most worried about running into Chi Yu again. She even imagined what would happen if she shared an elevator ride with Chi Yu and her brother was there too. What if Chi Yu asked her to eat with him again while her brother was right there?","She still owed him a meal. Even if not eating, what if he greeted her? So Song Luokui stopped going over.","And the Lunar New Year was approaching, so her parents were also busy. She happened to go shopping for New Year goods with Aunt Gui. The supermarket was cramped with people squeezing past each other. Song Luokui pushed her cart until she got shoved into a corner while Aunt Gui powered through to the front, soon returning with bags hanging from both hands.","They didn't leave until two carts were full. Song Luokui helped clean the house when they got back.","\"Miss, go play. Auntie Gui can take care of this,\" Aunt Gui said.","With a rag in hand wiping a vase, Song Luokui replied, \"It's fine, just let me help Auntie. I've got nothing else going on at home anyway.\"","Aunt Gui said: \"What do you mean nothing else? Miss can go out and play with friends like Miss Xi Yue. You can also practice piano or calligraphy, or watch TV even.\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah I don't feel like doing any of that today. I want to get some exercise. Don't worry, I'll just wipe these vases.\"","\"Alright Miss, just slowly wipe those vases. Auntie can handle the rest.\"","\"Okay.\"","Despite what she said, in the end she still helped mop floors and even took the trash out, \"I'm going to the shop to buy snacks, I'll throw out the trash on the way.\"","Aunt Gui: \"Then let Auntie give you some money to get plenty of tasty stuff. Remember not to go off with strangers!\"","Song Luokui laughed. \"I know, I have money. Be right back!\" Aunt Gui was treating her like a little kid.","After dumping the trash bag in the bin, she had told Aunt Gui she was going to the shop, so Song Luokui still walked over, planning to just buy some milk.","The compound's little shop was near where she used to play in the sandpit when small. There were also some kids from the compound there who greeted her one by one upon seeing her.","\"Kui Kui sister!\"","\"Kui Kui sister!\"","\"Kui Kui sister, I'll buy whatever you want!\"","\"Go away, I have more money. I'll buy for Kui Kui sister!\"","Because she was pretty, the compound kids quite liked her.","Song Luokui chuckled and patted one little girl's head. \"No need guys, Kui Kui sister has money. What do you want to eat? Kui Kui sister will buy some for you.\"","\"I want candy!\"","\"Me too!\"","Song Luokui said: \"Sure, but just one piece each. And you have to brush your teeth when you get home, otherwise your teeth will all fall out and you won't look pretty anymore!\"","\"We know!\"","Song Luokui bought a pack of candy, giving one piece to each kid while putting the rest in her pocket to bring home. Holding the milk bottle in one hand and pockets full of candy, she prepared to head back.","But she had barely walked out of the shop when a car suddenly pulled up beside her."]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: A Favor","paragraphs":["Song Luokui looked at the familiar car, and her eyelid twitched. The car window rolled down, and the person driving was indeed familiar.","Song Luokui raised her hand and waved, \"Hi.\" Then she felt a little silly and put her hand down awkwardly.","Chi Yu looked at the milk in her hand. Song Luokui didn't know why she handed the milk over, \"Do you want to drink it?\"","When she handed it over, she regretted it. But then she thought that Chi Yu was probably not going to take it. However, before she could take it back, the milk was already in Chi Yu's hand, \"Thank you. This is a token of appreciation.\"","Chi Yu handed her a box of chocolate.","Song Luokui hesitated before taking it. It was AP chocolate, a box probably cost over three thousand yuan, \"Thanks. I...I'll go back first.\"","\"Hmm.\"","After Song Luokui walked out of the sight of Chi Yu's rearview mirror, Chi Yu started the car and drove home.","Back at home, Aunt Gui was already preparing dinner in the kitchen. Hearing the sound, she asked, \"Little miss is back. Did you buy anything tasty?\"","Song Luokui hid the chocolate behind her back and said to the kitchen, \"No...nothing. I just bought some candy.\" She took it out of her pocket and put it on the living room table, \"I put the candy on the table. I'll go back to my room first.\"","\"Okay.\"","Only Song Luokui was eating at home. Song Moqian and Sheng Rong had been very busy recently. Song Moqian was not in the city recently on a business trip. Sheng Rong had already stayed at the company for several days.","As for Song Luosheng, he had also been busy recently, and had not returned home for several days, living in a house outside.","It wasn't until New Year's Eve that everyone in the family came back and the family was finally reunited.","The winter vacation ended quickly and the new semester began.","In the dormitory, apart from Song Luokui, the other three girls had joined student organizations. Wang Sisi was in the external liaison department of the student union. Su Ziyuan was in the debate team. Zhang Jingfeng was in the chess club. Only Song Luokui had not joined anything.","Recently, Wang Sisi was a little worried. She didn't get along well with An Tingting in the department. The two competed on grades, looks and boyfriends. They both wanted to run for vice president of the external liaison department.","Finally, the president said that the department's funds were tight recently, and whoever obtained the most corporate sponsorship would become the vice president.","Wang Sisi originally wanted her boyfriend to help, but An Tingting said, \"Some people's boyfriends are rich. What if she just lets her boyfriend sponsor? That's not fair.\"","The chairman thought for a while, \"I have a list of companies here that can be provided. You can each choose some companies from it to ask for sponsorship. Whoever gets the most sponsorship will become vice chairman.\"","Wang Sisi was very angry, but there was no way. She was venting about An Tingting in the dormitory.","Zhang Jingfeng said, \"Since he can't let your boyfriend from Lin Cheng sponsor you, you can use your connection with Lin Cheng. See which company Lin Cheng can help you with.\"","Wang Sisi snapped her fingers, \"Good friend, you're right!\"","She quickly called Lin Cheng and listed a bunch of company names. Finally, there was only one that Lin Cheng had some connection with, but the relationship was so-so. People probably wouldn't give him face if it wasn't his father who went.","Wang Sisi also knew her boyfriend's difficulty, after all he hadn't joined his family business to help out either, still being a student.","On the side, Song Luokui was listening to the list of company names, and heard a familiar one: Songhua Technology.","Wasn't that her brother's company?","After Wang Sisi hung up the phone with her boyfriend, Song Luokui immediately raised her hand and said, \"Um... I can help with one company.\"","Wang Sisi's eyes lit up as she looked at her, \"Which one? If you can help, I can buy you breakfast for a month!\"","Song Luokui said, \"That Songhua Technology. When do you want to go?\"","Wang Sisi: \"Tomorrow!\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Okay, I'll go with you tomorrow afternoon.\"","\"Great, thank you! You are beautiful and kind! Starting tomorrow I will buy you breakfast.\"","Song Luokui waved her hand, \"No need, no need.\"","Wang Sisi insisted, \"I have to. Even though we haven't succeeded yet, I'm already very happy that you want to help me.\"","The next morning when Song Luokui got up, breakfast was already on her desk. Wang Sisi said, \"I forgot to ask what you like to eat, so I bought steamed buns, fried dough sticks, soy milk and millet porridge. If it's no good I can go buy something else.\"","Song Luokui said, \"...Thank you, I can't eat that much. This is enough.\"","Wang Sisi said, \"It's okay, eat whatever you want. Give me what you don't eat.\"","In the end, Song Luokui ate the steamed buns and drank the soy milk. \"Let's meet at the school gate after class.\"","\"Okay.\"","At noon after class, Song Luokui went to the school gate. Wang Sisi was already waiting there. The two took a bus directly there.","Last night, Wang Sisi sent Lin Cheng a message. Lin Cheng told her, \"Songhua Technology is the company opened by Senior Song.","Wang Sisi was a little surprised, \"Ah? Really?\" Although she knew about Song Luosheng’s legendary status at school before, and that he had created a company early on, she really didn’t know the company was called Songhua Technology.","Lin Cheng: “It’s true. This time, thank Song Luokui properly on my behalf since she’s helping you out.\"","\"Okay, I plan to buy her breakfast for a whole month.\"","\"That works too.\"","...","They soon arrived downstairs at Songhua Technology. After explaining their purpose, they were let in quickly. Song Luosheng was not at the company, but Zhou Yuan was.","“You want a sponsorship? How much?\"","Wang Sisi held out a palm. Zhou Yuan stroked his chin, \"Fifty thousand? That's doable too. Let me tell the boss.\"","Wang Sisi immediately shook her head, \"No no no, five thousand.\" She had originally only wanted five hundred or so. She didn't expect Senior Zhou to open with fifty thousand. This was the world of rich people!","Zhou Yuan said, \"Only five thousand? Then there’s no need for boss’ approval. I can give it to you directly.\"","Wang Sisi immediately bowed, \"Thank you, Senior, thank you Senior!\"","Zhou Yuan waved his hand, \"No need to thank me. I’ll have someone take you to get the money from the finance department. I’ll have them liaise with you afterwards.\"","\"Okay, thank you Senior!\"","\"You’re welcome. I have to help out my sister’s friends.\"","Wang Sisi left with the person, while Song Luokui sat there drinking tea waiting. \"Why isn't my brother at the company today?\"","Zhou Yuan said, \"Today there is an important bid. Boss went over for that.\"","Song Luokui didn’t ask further.","Wang Sisi quickly finished up her business and the two girls prepared to return to school. Song Luokui still had classes in the afternoon."]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: Owe It Again","paragraphs":["Wang Sisi had just gotten to the first floor when she ran into her arch-nemesis, An Tingting.","When An Tingting saw Wang Sisi, she was taken aback at first, then rolled her eyes and flipped her hair. \"You knew I was coming to Senior Chi's company so you wanted to get here first? Don't tell me you thought Senior Chi's company would sponsor you.\"","However, Wang Sisi was puzzled. \"What company of Senior Chi? I came to Senior Song's company.\"","An Tingting said \"Oh,\" then asked, \"Senior Song? Which Senior Song?\" Then she seemed to realize something and looked directly at Wang Sisi. \"The company of Senior Song Luosheng? You dared to think of that? You must have gotten kicked out, right?\"","In her opinion, getting sponsorship from Senior Song's company was much more difficult than from Senior Chi's company. Although she had never contacted either company before, or even truly met the two seniors, she had heard about them and seen pictures of them.","The two seniors were outstanding in their own right, but she preferred Senior Chi's looks, so she came to the company Senior Chi had founded to take a look.","Wang Sisi smiled. \"I already got the sponsorship. Ha ha, pisses you off.\"","An Tingting was indeed extremely pissed off. Her chest heaved sharply, but there were people coming and going here. She also had to maintain a good image, so she just rolled her eyes again. \"Just wait and see. I'll get a 100,000 yuan sponsorship from Senior Chi's company.\"","Upon hearing this, Wang Sisi also scoffed. \"100,000 yuan? You really dare to think big! If you can get 100,000 yuan, I'll let you take the vice department head position!\"","An Tingting lifted her chin. \"Just wait for me!\"","Wang Sisi pulled Song Luokui, preparing to leave. At that moment, Chi Yu entered with a group of people behind him. An Tingting turned around, saw him, and immediately rushed over. \"Hello, Senior Chi.\"","Chi Yu took a step back. His bodyguards immediately blocked An Tingting. Chen Nan also came over. \"You are...\"","An Tingting looked at Chen Nan, \"Hello Senior Chen. I'm An Tingting, a first year student in the School of Economics and Management, and also a member of the external liaison department at Peking University. I came over this time because I have a project that I wanted Senior Chi to take a look at.\"","After hearing this, Chen Nan knew it was people from their alma mater coming to ask for sponsorship funds. He immediately looked at Chi Yu, but Chi Yu was looking at Song Luokui, who was preparing to sneak away not far behind An Tingting.","Chi Yu left them with, \"Chen Nan will take care of you,\" then abandoned everyone and went to Song Luokui. \"You saw me but didn't say hi?\"","Song Luokui, who was about to slip away, felt her heart skip a beat. She immediately looked left and right, afraid her brother would suddenly appear.","Chi Yu said, \"Your brother should still be busy right now.\"","Song Luokui stroked her chest and looked up. \"Hi.\"","Chi Yu asked, \"Here to deliver food?\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"No no, I came with a friend.\"","Wang Sisi immediately greeted him. \"Hello, Senior Chi. Thanks again for your help at the Red Leaf Bar last time.\" Although it wasn't to help her.","Chi Yu only glanced at her and looked back at Song Luokui. \"Here to ask for sponsorship?\"","Song Luokui looked at Wang Sisi. Wang Sisi had no choice but to reply, \"Yes, we came to Senior Song's company to ask for sponsorship.\"","But Chi Yu asked Song Luokui, \"Which external department are you with?\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"I didn't join one. I just came with her.\"","After thinking for a moment, Chi Yu understood what was going on. He looked at Wang Sisi, \"Want sponsorship funds? Go talk to Chen Nan.\"","Wang Sisi immediately understood what he meant. She was instantly delighted. \"Thank you, Senior!\" Then she ran over to Senior Chen Nan.","Chi Yu asked Song Luokui again, \"Have you eaten?\"","Song Luokui: \"No... Oh, I did eat.\" She actually hadn't eaten.","Chi Yu said, \"Let's go, time to eat.\"","Song Luokui: \"I really ate.\"","Chi Yu had already called to book them a table.","Seeing Wang Sisi waving goodbye to her as she followed Chen Nan upstairs, Song Luokui could only follow along beside Chi Yu.","The two came to the familiar restaurant again. This time, four dishes were ordered. Song Luokui went to the restroom halfway through the meal, still planning to foot the bill. This time, she was determined to pay. However, the front desk told her the bill had already been settled.","Song Luokui: \"??? When was it paid? Who paid?\" She hadn't even seen Chi Yu come out to settle the bill.","Front Desk: \"Mr. Chi has paid already, electronic receipt.\"","Song Luokui: \"......Fine.\"","When she returned to the private room, Chi Yu glanced at her, and Song Luokui also glanced at him. Then they ate quietly.","After eating their fill, Chi Yu even sent her back to school. Before Song Luokui got out of the car, Chi Yu added, \"Next time, I'll definitely let you pay.\"","Song Luokui's face turned red. She didn't say anything and got out of the car. After Chi Yu left, Song Luokui thought to herself - next time? What next time? She didn't want there to be a next time! And it seemed she owed this person another favor...","When school ended that afternoon and she returned to the dorm, Wang Sisi immediately rushed over to give her a big hug. \"Hahahaha, thanks Luokui! You really are my patron saint! I got another 50,000 yuan sponsorship! Hahahaha, 100,000 yuan total!\"","Song Luokui: \"50,000 yuan?\"","Wang Sisi: \"Mm-hmm. Since An Tingting wanted 100,000 yuan sponsorship, and we were from the same department, Chen Nan finally said he'd just give 50,000 yuan each. Hahahaha, An Tingting's face totally turned green then.\"","\"Oh right, An Tingting still wanted to ask for Senior Chi's WeChat ID, but Chen Nan didn't give it to her. Luokui, do you have the senior's WeChat ID?\"","Of course Song Luokui didn't. \"You want it?\" What would she do with Chi Yu's WeChat ID?","Wang Sisi immediately waved her hands. \"No no, I was just casually asking.\"","In the end, Wang Sisi got to be the vice department head of the external liaison department like she wished. She also bought Song Luokui a month's worth of breakfasts.","An Tingting found out that the reason Wang Sisi obtained the 50,000 yuan sponsorship from Songhua Technology was because of her roommate Song Luokui. At that time, she was busy talking to Wang Sisi and hadn't noticed the girl beside Wang Sisi.","An Tingting immediately looked into Song Luokui's background. Based on her findings, she was just a girl from the Faculty of Liberal Arts. She'd heard the girl was very beautiful, looking very gentle and delicate.","An Tingting's heart was still irritated. Very beautiful? She must have seduced the senior! A thought flashed in her mind. Gentle? Wasn't it said that gentle girls were easiest to attract bad boys?","The weather had turned much warmer recently. Just wearing a T-shirt every day was fine now. At night you could occasionally add a jacket. Song Luokui didn't have a lot of clothes at school, so she decided to go home today.","On the night she returned home, under her dorm building, a boy had arranged a circle of candles in the shape of a heart. He held a bouquet of flowers in one hand and a mini speaker horn in the other. In the busy walkway, a crowd soon gathered, everyone wanting to watch the excitement. Some had even taken out their phones to record it.","\"It's obviously going to be a confession.\"","\"It looks so romantic. I wonder which girl it is.\"","\"But the boy doesn't look that good.\"","\"The boy looks quite rich though. Look at those shoes, over 2,000 yuan!\"","\"That expensive?\"","The crowd grew bigger and bigger. The boy immediately grabbed the speaker horn and shouted upstairs, \"Song Luokui from room 305, can you come down for a bit?\"","\"Song Luokui? Who's Song Luokui?\"","\"Which department is she from?\"","\"I know her. She's from the Faculty of Liberal Arts. Wow, someone is actually confessing to Song Luokui? To be honest, I don't think this guy matches up to her.\"","\"You know her? What's that Song Luokui like?\"","\"I know her. She's a super pretty girl, but very low-key. When she comes down later you'll see.\"","However, the crowd did not see the girl named Song Luokui come downstairs."]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: The Pursuit","paragraphs":["Wang Sisi and the others of course heard the sound of the loudspeaker. At first, they thought they had misheard. But when they went out to the balcony, they saw that someone was actually confessing their love to Song Luokui with a loudspeaker!","\"Have you seen that guy before?\" Wang Sisi asked.","Zhang Jingfeng and Su Ziyuan both shook their heads, \"No.\"","Wang Sisi said, \"I haven't seen him either. Luokui is not from the same college as us. Maybe he saw Luokui one day and fell in love at first sight so he came to confess?\"","Zhang Jingfeng said, \"But Luokui went home today. He didn't even find out clearly right? How could he not know?\"","Su Ziyuan said, \"Don't tell me he doesn't even have her WeChat ID to message her?\"","The three of them were unclear. Mainly because they were not from the same college as Song Luokui. And when Luokui was on campus, other than going to class, the cafeteria and her dorm, they never saw her go anywhere else. They also never heard of her going out with any male students. Plus she often went home.","\"Let's tell the guy downstairs that she's not here. Oh right, let's take a picture and ask Luokui if she recognizes him,\" Wang Sisi said.","\"Okay.\"","Wang Sisi stuck her head out from the balcony and shouted loudly, \"Hey you downstairs! My roommate Luokui is not in the dorm today. You didn't even find out clearly right?\"","The male student confessing his love below was also stunned for a moment. She's not here?","\"Did she go to the library? Will she be back tonight?\" the male student asked.","Wang Sisi: \"She won't be back tonight. She went home and will be back tomorrow.\"","Male student: \"...\" He screwed up! How could she not tell him?","When the spectators below heard that the girl being confessed to was not in her dorm and had gone home, they figured the excitement was probably not happening anymore. They started dispersing one by one.","Some people gossiped among themselves, \"What's going on? He confessed without finding out clearly?\"","\"What a waste of effort.\"","\"Maybe the girl just didn't want to accept and tricked him. There are situations like that too.","\"That's possible too.\"","On the other hand, when Song Luokui saw the video Wang Sisi sent telling her someone was confessing with a loudspeaker below their dorm, she was baffled.","She looked carefully at the video. Although it was a bit dark, she could still make out the guy's silhouette clearly. \"I don't know this person. Just ignore it.\"","Someone she doesn't know confessed their love to her? The more she thought about it, the more dreadful it felt.","Wang Sisi and the others felt it was pretty normal though. After all, things like this weren't uncommon on campus. Confessions happen. Maybe he had a secret crush on her before this?","Song Luokui thought the matter was over. But unexpectedly, the next day when she went to school, the guy actually came looking for her. When Li Zifeng saw her, his eyes lit up. He immediately became serious and handed her the flowers, \"Song, I like you. Can you be my girlfriend?\"","Song Luokui was so shocked she took a step back, \"Who are you?\"","The male student quickly introduced himself, \"Song, I'm Li Zifeng from the freshman business administration class. I liked you when I first saw you.\"","Song Luokui took another step back, \"I'm sorry, I don't like you.\" She got ready to leave. Right now they were standing on a pedestrian sidewalk on campus with people coming and going. Many of them looked over.","Seeing she was about to leave, Li Zifeng quickly blocked her path, \"Song, it's okay if you don't accept me now. Can I add your WeChat? We can just be friends.\"","Song Luokui continued rejecting him, \"I'm sorry, I don't have a WeChat. Please excuse me.\"","Song Luokui quickly left. She thought he would give up after being rejected so directly. But in the days that followed, she didn't know how he managed to find out her whereabouts. He showed up in front of her every day.","He would somehow pop up beside her when she was eating at the cafeteria. Acting all familiar, he would say \"What a coincidence Song! I ordered two chicken drumsticks today. Let me give you one.\" And he would put a drumstick on her plate.","Of course Song Luokui rejected it. But he shamelessly left the chicken drumstick on her plate anyway. Song Luokui instantly lost her appetite and left.","For many days after, Song Luokui did not eat on campus. Even when she had night classes, she would directly take the bus home to stay.","But the guy did not give up at all. He would inevitably show up in front of her. Being pestered like this, Song Luokui was furious. The next time he appeared, she warned him directly, \"I'll say this one last time. I don't like you. Please don't appear in front of me again. Otherwise I'm telling the school you are harassing me. Have some self-respect.\"","The bus had just arrived. Song Luokui was preparing to take it home. Unexpectedly, the guy actually followed her onto the bus. From the front door to her seat, Li Zifeng stuck close behind her the whole way.","\"Song, give me your WeChat. I won't bother you anymore after that okay?\"","Song Luokui: \"Piss off!\"","Li Zifeng reached out trying to grab Song Luokui's hand. A man next to them couldn't stand it anymore. \"What do you think you're doing? She told you to piss off!\"","Li Zifeng: \"What's it got to do with you that I'm arguing with my girlfriend?\"","Song Luokui immediately shook her head, \"I don't know him. He is harassing me.\"","Li Zifeng: \"Luokui don't throw a tantrum. I'll buy you that L family necklace if you want.\" As long as people thought they were a couple, no one would interfere.","He had succeeded getting his way countless times with this method of pestering relentlessly.","Hearing that, the people around them didn't dare say anything either. Perhaps the two really did know each other?","But Song Luokui felt even more disgusted. Her eyes were icy cold. \"Schoolmate, this is your last warning. You won't be able to bear the consequences if you continue provoking me.\"","But Li Zifeng did not feel she could do anything. He reached out trying to grab her hand again. Song Luokui swiftly lifted her leg, kicking straight at his crotch.","\"Ah!\"","A miserable shriek. All the men on the bus felt a twinge below when they witnessed it, as if they had been kicked instead. Everyone kept silent, watching the spectacle.","Li Zifeng was also bent over in pain, his face pale white. \"You... Aren't you afraid... if I become impotent... you can only marry me in the future?\"","Song Luokui was completely fearless. \"I was acting in self-defense.\"","It was their stop soon. Song Luokui slipped past him to get off the bus. Li Zifeng still bent over also followed her off the bus. The passengers stretched their necks trying to watch. But the bus left quickly.","\"That girl is ruthless.\"","\"I think that guy was harassing her. Otherwise why would the girl kick him right?\"","\"That girl is so pretty. The guy can't be trying to scam her right?\"","\"Oh no, the guy also followed her off the bus. Will the girl be in danger?\"","\"Damn, just now we were all tricked by that guy into thinking they knew each other. And I thought they were both from Peking University since they got on at Peking University Station.\"","\"Should we call the police?\"","The passengers on the bus discussed calling the police and someone did end up reporting it. After Song Luokui got off the bus, she realized Li Zifeng had alarmingly followed her off and was still not giving up after the warning? She decided she would get the security guards at her place to beat him up.","Song Luokui walked very quickly. By the time she crossed the road walking towards her housing compound gates, Li Zifeng had recovered enough to catch up to her and reached out to grab her. \"Luokui, I really l...\"","He didn't get to finish his sentence before someone seized him. An icy male voice sounded, \"You really what?\""]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: The Favor +03","paragraphs":["Song Luokui heard the sound and also turned around. Behind her, Li Zifeng was grabbed by the shoulder by Chi Yu and couldn't move his whole body.","Li Zifeng turned his head to see Chi Yu. With one look, he knew this man was not to be trifled with. Not to mention the look in his eyes when he looked at him was like looking at a dead man. He was a whole head taller than him. Everything he wore was customized. Just the watch on his hand could buy a house in Beijing.","Chi Yu repeated: \"Really what?\"","Feeling the pain in his shoulders, Li Zifeng said, \"Who are you? I didn't offend you.\"","At this time, Song Luokui walked over and asked, \"Why are you here?\"","Chi Yu didn't answer her question, but instead asked her, \"How do you want to deal with him?\"","Song Luokui said, \"I was going to have the doorman beat him up.\"","The doorman over there was just wanting to watch the fun, but didn't expect Chi Yu to suddenly beckon him over.","When the doorman came over, he heard Song Luokui say, \"Uncle Zhou, this man has been following me and harassing me. I want to teach him a lesson.\"","Upon hearing this, Uncle Zhou, the doorman, no longer cared about gossip. He immediately became serious, grabbed the man from Chi Yu's hand, and looked at Song Luokui, \"Miss Song, don't worry, I will definitely treat him well.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Well, thank you, Uncle Zhou.\"","Li Zifeng stared wide-eyed, wanting to say something, but was immediately silenced by Uncle Zhou, who carried him away.","\"Thank you,\" Song Luokui thanked Chi Yu. How did she owe him another favor? Added up, that was three favors now. Song Luokui frowned. How did she end up owing more and more?","But Chi Yu asked, \"Who was that man?\"","Song Luokui said, \"Just a harasser. It's taken care of now.\" She figured that after Uncle Zhou's lesson, that man wouldn't dare come around again.","What she didn't expect was that the police came to inquire about the situation. Only then did Song Luokui know that someone on the bus was afraid she would get in trouble and called the police.","Song Luokui lamented that there are still good people. In the end, Song Luokui had Uncle Zhou take care of things on that side.","Uncle Zhou said, \"We suspect the man is a spy. We will have someone take care of things on our side. Still, thank you all.\"","Upon hearing it was a spy, the police no longer interfered since that was out of their jurisdiction.","On the other side, Li Zifeng was locked in a pitch black room without windows. His heart thumped wildly. He finally felt some fear.","No longer paying attention to this man, Song Luokui was going to go home, but Chi Yu asked, \"Have you eaten yet?\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" What was up with this guy? Why did he keep asking if she had eaten?","Song Luokui glanced at him and Chi Yu said again, \"I haven't eaten yet.\"","Okay, she understood. After all, she owed him one. \"Let me treat you to a meal to thank you for today,\" she offered.","They went to the same place in Chi Yu's car and got the same private room, ordering four dishes again.","Before starting the meal, Song Luokui said, \"It's my treat this time.\" After a thought, she added, \"You said so last time.\"","There was a flicker of smile in Chi Yu's eyes. \"Yes, I did.\"","Song Luokui felt relieved.","After eating, Song Luokui thought to herself, one less favor owed! Good, now she only owed this man two favors. Treating him to two more meals would clear the slate between them.","Wanting to repay her favors and draw boundaries as soon as possible, Song Luokui asked, \"Are you free tomorrow afternoon?\"","Chi Yu looked at her.","Song Luokui felt a little embarrassed. \"Let me treat you to another meal to thank you for today.\"","After wiping his mouth, Chi Yu said, \"You just treated today.\"","Song Luokui waved her hand. \"That was to repay the previous time.\"","Chi Yu: \"Repay?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yes, to repay what I owed you last time. You helped me again today, so I'll treat you to a meal tomorrow.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm not free tomorrow. Add me on WeChat. I'll let you know when I'm free.\"","Song Luokui: \"Sure.\" She then added Chi Yu's WeChat.","Chi Yu's WeChat name was just a letter C. His profile picture was just the default gray silhouette for a new user.","After the meal, Chi Yu dropped Song Luokui off at her residence. She didn't have afternoon classes that day, so she didn't go back to school. And Chi Yu left after dropping her off at the entrance.","On the other side, Li Zifeng was about to have a mental breakdown. He really didn't expect things to turn out like this from following Song Luokui here.","At that moment in the room, the bright light bulb kept shining in his face. His eyes were blinded so he couldn't open them. There was always someone in front of him asking, \"Why did you come here? Are you trying to steal secret information?\"","Li Zifeng was given no food or water. He was interrogated nonstop without even being allowed to sleep. Finally, Li Zifeng broke down. With snot and tears streaming down his face he cried, \"Someone just told me to pursue her and then cruelly break her heart and abandon her. That person said to turn her into ruined goods and then dump her. But when I saw her, I changed my mind. I just wanted to pursue her, that's all. I really didn't know outsiders weren't allowed in this place. I really didn't know.\"","\"Someone? Who was that person?\"","\"It was An Tingting from the Business School.\"","...After being interrogated for a full day and night, the school counselor who came to retrieve him almost went weak in the knees when notified.","An Tingting felt her eyelid had been twitching all day. She thought to herself that it must be Wang Sisi trying to push more difficult tasks onto her again. Ugh, it was all because she found herself a rich second generation boyfriend to help her out. Who did she think she was acting all high and mighty all the time?","\"An Tingting, the dean wants to see you,\" someone came to notify her.","An Tingting was puzzled. \"The dean wants to see me? What for?\"","\"Not sure.\"","An Tingting was confused but went to the dean's office nevertheless. Inside, apart from the dean, were two uniformed men.","Upon seeing her, those two immediately stood up, took out their badges, and said, \"You're An Tingting, right? We suspect you of being a spy. Please come with us.\"","An Tingting: !!! What the hell!","Although she looked completely dumbfounded, she was still taken away.","On the other side, when Li Zifeng was returned a week later, he was a lot more silent than before and didn't dare bother anyone from the Literature Department again.","That afternoon right after class, someone came looking for him. \"Li Zifeng, someone from the student council is asking for you.\"","Li Zifeng: \"The student council?\"","\"Yes, at the student council president's office.\"","\"Okay.\"","Still confused, Li Zifeng went to the student council president's office. Beijing University was quite wealthy, so its student council was also well funded. The entire student council took up a 10-story building. The top floor was the university-wide student council president's office, while the floors below housed the individual school's student councils.","Li Zifeng took the elevator up to the 10th floor and knocked. Someone inside responded, \"Come in.\"","Upon entering, Li Zifeng first saw the student council president sitting behind the desk. This was his first time seeing the university-wide student council president face to face.","He then looked towards the man sitting on the couch—custom-fitted clothing from head to toe, an air of superiority and nobility about him. One hand lazily draped over the top of the couch, tapping lightly. His eyes held that same look from before.","Li Zifeng's legs went soft and he almost kneeled. He turned to leave but the door was locked, a man also standing guard.","Li Zifeng immediately knelt down on the floor. \"I...I'm wrong! Please spare me!\"","Seeing him like this, the man frowned slightly. Everyone else also held their breaths upon seeing his reaction, thinking this guy was really foolish to provoke the Chi family's young master.","On the side, the student council president also stood up and walked over. \"Bro, do you want...\" He made a throat slitting gesture.","Li Zifeng instantly pissed his pants in fright.","The frown on Chi Yu's face deepened even more. \"Ji Xiao... Have you forgotten you're a law student? All that studying gone to the dogs?\"","Holding up four fingers, Ji Xiao said, \"Bro... I was just trying to scare him. I swear I'm a law-abiding good student.\"","Chi Yu stood up, thinking his appointment with Song Luokui was almost time. \"You take care of it. I'm leaving first.\"","\"Yes, bro. Have a safe trip.\""]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: A Guilty Conscience","paragraphs":["Song Luokui was walking to the east gate of the school at that time. Chi Yu had sent her a message saying that he was also at the school and would come to pick her up later.","Song Luokui was so scared that she immediately said she would go over instead, anyway just not let him directly pick her up at the school gate.","Chi Yu: \"I'll wait for you at the east gate of the school.\"","Waiting at the east gate of the school was also fine. She would quickly get on the car when the time came, anyway just don’t let others see.","As she walked out of the east gate, she saw the familiar car. Song Luokui got on and fastened her seat belt, “Why are you at school today too?”","Chi Yu: “I have some things to do.”","Song Luokui didn't ask further when she heard that. Chi Yu drove the car towards the place where the two had eaten before.","Soon they arrived. The front desk staff who were already very familiar with them led the two to a familiar private room.","As always, Song Luokui only ordered one dish, while Chi Yu ordered three dishes, a fish, a soup, a lamb hot pot, and a vegetable. Fruits and desserts were always there by default.","When Song Luokui saw the fish, she blinked. She hadn't had fish for a long time, even if there was no more plot prodigy, she still didn't touch it.","No talking during meals. The two slowly ate their food. Chi Yu noticed that Song Luokui didn't even touch the fish, \"Don't you like fish?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"Not really, uh... because of some reasons I didn't eat it.\"","Chi Yu immediately called the waiter to take away the fish and replace it with a new dish.","Song Luokui said, \"You can keep it if you like it.\"","Chi Yu said, \"No need.\"","Song Luokui didn't say anything more and continued eating with her head down. In the end, it was still Song Luokui who paid the bill. She heaved a sigh of relief when paying the bill, just one more favor left to return.","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu, \"Check when I can treat you to dinner again.\"","Chi Yu raised his eyebrows, \"Just once?\"","Song Luokui's eyes drifted for a moment, \"Uh... I'll just be free this Saturday this week, no time for the rest, that's what I meant.\" She meant that she would only have time once this week.","Chi Yu: \"If not this week then next week.\"","Song Luokui lowered her head, \"Okay.\"","Chi Yu sent her back to school and then left.","That night, Chi Yu sent Song Luokui a location in Country F.","Song Luokui: \"?\"","Chi Yu: \"Anything you want from there?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, no need, thanks.\"","Chi Yu: \"We are friends. Country F has good perfume.\"","At this point, Song Luokui who was hiding under the quilt was shocked. Chi Yu actually said they were friends!!!","Oh my god!","Had she infiltrated the enemy?","In Song Luokui’s mind, scenes had already played out where she infiltrated the enemy as an undercover agent to obtain important information about the male lead for her brother. Her brother inflicted heavy losses on the male lead but the male lead was the male lead after all. She was caught by the male lead and suffered capital punishment...","She shivered. Song Luokui quickly typed and sent back: No need, I don’t like perfume.","After that, Song Luokui didn't say anything more. She thought he should know her attitude after seeing that sentence.","On Chi Yu’s side, he kept looking at the neon lights outside, waiting for a while before Song Luokui sent another message. Chi Yu took a look and scoffed, throwing the phone aside. His secretary knocked and came in quickly.","“Boss, there is a charity gala invitation tomorrow night.” He handed over the invitation card. Chen Nan didn’t come with him this time and was commanding operations in the country.","Chi Yu took a glance, “Help me arrange it.”","“Yes.”","The next day, Song Luokui checked WeChat. After she sent that sentence, Chi Yu didn’t send any more messages. She was really shocked when he said they were friends.","Although they had eaten together a few times and greeted each other when they met, she felt that the two were not that familiar... Well, since they had eaten together a few times, it seemed they really were friends.","Song Luokui felt guilty. She felt even more guilty when she saw her brother at home.","In the morning during breakfast, Song Luosheng poked her head, “Did you do something to wrong me? Why do you keep looking at me apologetically?”","Song Luokui immediately shook her head vigorously, \"No, absolutely not.\"","Song Luosheng glared at her, \"There must be something! Say what's the matter?\" Song Luosheng suddenly narrowed his eyes, \"Could it be someone...\"","Song Luokui's mind turned, \"You mean you know about someone harassing me at school?\"","Song Luosheng immediately widened his eyes, “What? Someone's harassing you at school?\" Song Luosheng put down his bowl and chopsticks with a clatter, “Tell me, which guy is harassing you? I’ll go teach him a lesson.\"","Song Luokui: “Uncle Zhou has already taught him a lesson.”","Song Luosheng had already stood up, “What? He even chased you home to harass you? Tell me everything from start to finish.”","Song Luokui told him the whole story, hiding Chi Yu’s part in helping her midway.","“In short, Uncle Zhou has already helped teach him a lesson, you don't need to do it anymore.”","Song Luosheng looked at her, “Why didn’t you tell me before?”","Song Luokui shrugged, “What’s there to say, I’m an adult now, isn’t it normal for someone to pursue me?”","Song Luosheng: “How can that be okay? You're still young.” Moreover, he felt that none of those people outside deserved his cute little sister. His little sister was pretty, had a nice personality, good grades, in short, perfect in every way.","Song Luosheng: “Apart from that person, tell me if anyone else is pursuing you.”","Song Luokui shook her head, “No one else.”","Song Luosheng: “Remember to tell me first thing if anyone wants to pursue you in the future, got it?”","Song Luokui obediently replied, “Got it.”","Song Luosheng sat down again to continue eating. Song Luokui heaved a sigh of relief on the side. But she couldn’t stand it and said, “No way! I have to go find Uncle Zhou to ask about the situation!”","She put down her bowl and left.","Song Luokui had just relaxed her guard a bit after diverting her attention. She suddenly remembered that Uncle Zhou did see Chi Yu standing on the side when the incident happened too. Shoot! Would Uncle Zhou mention Chi Yu too?","Song Luokui ran out to call Song Luosheng back, but he was already gone.","Song Luokui could only wait at home, hoping that Uncle Zhou wouldn't mention Chi Yu too.","After waiting for a long time, Song Luosheng finally came back expressionless. Song Luokui kept worrying in her heart, but didn't dare make eye contact with him either. She turned on the TV and pretended to watch it while waiting for Song Luosheng to sit next to her. Song Luokui could even hear her own heartbeat.","Song Luokui glanced at him from the corner of her eye. She broke the silence by speaking out, “What did Uncle Zhou say?”","Song Luosheng: “Uncle Zhou said he interrogated the guy like a spy before letting him go.”","Song Luokui: “Anything else?”","Song Luosheng: “The man also said someone instructed him to do it, An Tingting. Do you know her?”","Song Luokui thought for a while. An Tingting? She suddenly remembered An Tingting, who her roommate Wang Sisi often cursed at in the dormitory.","“From the External Affairs Department?”","Song Luosheng: “Yes.”","Song Luokui: “I don't know her. My roommate knows her. They... don't get along well. I was probably implicated.”","Song Luokui told him about the competition between Wang Sisi and An Tingting for the deputy head of the External Affairs Department. “I took her to your company to ask for sponsorship fees. It was probably because of this that she hated me.”","Song Luosheng: “You don't need to worry about this matter, I’ll handle it.”","Song Luokui: “Well...nothing else right?”"]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Graduation Photo","paragraphs":["\"It's over. Next time, tell me right away.\"","\"Okay, okay.\" Song Luokui felt relieved.","The next day, Song Luosheng sent someone to investigate Li Zifeng and An Tingting.","\"Boss, Li Zifeng and An Tingting have withdrawn from school. Neither of them goes here anymore. What's more, they were punished by the school. Not only that, I heard that Li Zifeng had taken advantage of quite a few girls in the past, and those girls' families went to his house and beat him up.\"","Song Luosheng: Could it be that after being interrogated by Uncle Zhou, they got scared and withdrew from school?","\"Forget it then. No need to investigate further.\"","\"Got it.\"","On Song Luokui's end, two days later, she received a big package sent to her from overseas. Song Luokui was quite puzzled about who had sent it. Could it have been delivered to the wrong address?","When she saw it was sent from Country F, her heart skipped a beat. She immediately took the package back to her room and locked the door before opening it. Upon opening it, she saw bags from Brand D inside, and it was a globally customized, limited edition bag, the only one of its kind globally.","Apart from that, there was also a set of pearl jewelry, two boxes of chocolate, and a full set of cosmetics...","She had just received the gifts when a message came from Chi Yu's side, \"Did you receive the presents?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yes... received them. They are too valuable.\"","Chi Yu: \"You can treat me to a meal in return.\"","Song Luokui: ...Is this a meal I can never finish treating you to? Ah ah ah!","Chi Yu: \"I won't accept returns.\"","Song Luokui chickened out a little. \"Okay. When I'm free, I'll treat you to a meal. Thank you.\"","After thinking for a bit, she asked again, \"Are you back in the country?\"","Chi Yu: \"No, going back tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui: \"Oh, okay.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll tell you when I'm back.\"","Song Luokui: \"No need, no need.\" It's a little scary. Why does he need to report to her when he returns?","\"Knock, knock.\" Suddenly, there was a knock on her door. Song Luokui: \"Who is it?\"","Song Luosheng: \"It's me. Why did you lock the door? I just heard Aunt Gui say someone sent you stuff?\"","Song Luokui quickly tidied up the gifts before going to open the door. As soon as Song Luosheng entered, he saw the empty package. \"Who sent you these? A guy?\"","Ever since there was a guy pestering Song Luokui last time, Song Luosheng had been keeping an eye out for any other guys daring to bother his sister.","Song Luokui: \"No, my friend overseas sent me gifts. Mailed over from abroad.\" Her brother definitely wouldn't know who it was anyway.","Song Luosheng: \"A guy or a girl? Which overseas friend? How come I don't know about it?\"","Song Luokui: \"Just... Kana Shana.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Alright then. I'll send you to school tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui made an X with her arms across her chest to reject him. \"No need. Why send me?\"","Song Luosheng: \"To let everyone know you're my sister, so no one will dare bully you recklessly.\"","Song Luokui wrinkled her nose and pushed his hand away. \"Don't mess up my hair. I'm not rejecting you. Who made you become a legend on campus already? I really don't want to become a monkey for people to gawk at.\"","\"Fine. Get Uncle Kang to fetch you from now on anyway. When you get your license, you can drive yourself.\"","\"Alright...\"","Speaking of getting a license, Song Luosheng helped sign her up for classes the very next day. Song Luokui started practicing for the theory test.","On the other side, Song Luosheng and his senior year classmates had returned to school to take graduation photos.","The weather was great on the day of the photoshoot. As soon as Song Luokui finished class, Song Luosheng called her to get her to come to the lakeside garden on campus.","\"Come over to take graduation photos with me.\"","Upon hearing it was for graduation photos, Song Luokui certainly wouldn't turn him down. She quickly made her way to the lakeside garden. The place was filled with seniors dressed in graduation gowns.","Song Luokui soon spotted Song Luosheng. He was also dressed in a graduation gown, tall and sturdy in stature, very good-looking. Quite a few people were sneaking looks at him.","Zhou Yuan, Lin Xingyan and the rest were around too, including Zhang Xiyue. She immediately waved Song Luokui over when she saw her. \"Kui Kui, I'm here!\"","Song Luokui walked over and handed the bouquet of flowers to Song Luosheng. \"Brother, congratulations on your graduation!\"","Song Luosheng smiled as he accepted the flowers. \"You're finally showing some conscience.\" Then he put his arm around her shoulders and said to Lin Xingyan, \"Xingyan, take a few photos of Kui Kui and me.\"","\"You got it!\" Lin Xingyan picked up the camera and started snapping away at the two of them.","After that, photos were also taken with Zhou Yuan, Lin Xingyan and the rest, as well as a group photo with everyone.","As Song Moqian and Sheng Rong's identities were rather sensitive, and both seemed quite busy lately, they did not show up.","Not long after, it looked like there were people from other departments coming to look for Song Luosheng to take photos together too. Seeing her brother surrounded by so many people, Song Luokui wanted to take her leave.","She messaged Song Luosheng about it, but unexpectedly, Chi Yu messaged her instead. \"At the lakeside garden?\"","Song Luokui looked left and right. \"How did you know? Are you here too?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes. Do you want to come over?\"","Song Luokui rejected right away upon seeing that. \"No, no, congratulations on your graduation.\" She'd be doomed if her brother caught sight of them together!","Song Luokui promptly left the lakeside garden, but not long after, Chi Yu sent her another message. \"Come to the student council office block.\"","Song Luokui: ?","The next second, Chi Yu actually called her on WeChat. After checking her surroundings left and right, Song Luokui answered the call. \"Hello?\"","Chi Yu: \"The student council office block. Your brother won't come here.\" The student council president was one of his people, so Song Luosheng definitely wouldn't come here at all.","Song Luokui: \"Huh?\"","Chi Yu: \"Shall I go get you instead?\"","Song Luokui: \"...I'll head over now.\" The risk of exposure would be even greater if he came to her!","Chi Yu stood by the window of the student council president's office, watching. Soon, he spotted that approaching figure in the distance, still holding a bunch of flowers.","Chi Yu kept his eyes fixed on that figure until she entered the student council office building. After glancing at his watch, Chi Yu opened the door. Just then, Song Luokui's figure appeared at the doorway. Song Luokui was even slightly surprised. She was just about to knock when the door opened.","Upon entering, Song Luokui first handed the bouquet to Chi Yu. \"Congratulations on your graduation.\"","Chi Yu accepted it. \"Thanks.\"","Song Luokui was just about to ask what this was about when she caught sight of someone else sitting there holding a camera.","Song Luokui looked quizzically at Chi Yu. Ji Xiao then introduced himself. \"I'm Ji Xiao, the current student council president. If there's anything you need in future, you can come look for me.\" Ji Xiao winked at Song Luokui.","Song Luokui blinked. \"Nice to meet you.\"","Chi Yu looked towards Ji Xiao. \"Alright, help us take some photos.\"","Song Luokui: ???"]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Graduation Photo 02","paragraphs":["Chi Yu was wearing his bachelor's gown and standing next to Song Luokui. Ji Xiao picked up the camera and with a \"click\" took a picture of Chi Yu and Song Luokui.","Song Luokui still had a somewhat bewildered look in the photo. Ji Xiao set up the camera again, \"Let's change the background. Why don't you two go over to the balcony? The view is nicer over there.\"","Chi Yu immediately walked over towards the balcony, and Song Luokui scratched her head and also went over. The two of them stood on the balcony, Song Luokui had her hands clasped together hanging below her abdomen, and Chi Yu was also standing up straight, holding a flower, with a blue sky in the background.","Ji Xiao: \"Don't stand so far apart, get a little closer. Yes, closer. Closer again, smile, don't look so serious you two, smile!\"","Song Luokui shifted a little, and so did Chi Yu. Their clothes touched, and when Song Luokui heard Ji Xiao say to smile, the corner of Song Luokui's mouth curled up in a smile.","\"Click\" and another photo was taken.","After the photo shoot, Chi Yu took off his bachelor's gown. Underneath he had on a shirt and trousers. \"Let's go, time for lunch.\"","Song Luokui was still a little confused. \"Huh?\"","Chi Yu repeated himself, \"Go eat lunch? Aren't you hungry?\" It was already after 12.","Song Luokui immediately waved her hands. \"You go ahead, I won't go.\" If she went to eat with Chi Yu on campus, she wouldn't even make it to the next day before her brother found out.","Chi Yu knew her concerns. \"The car is parked in the basement parking garage. Your brother isn't there.\"","Song Luokui fiddled with her hair to try to think of a way to refuse, but then Chi Yu said, \"Didn't you say you would treat me to a meal last time?\"","Song Luokui: \"Alright...\"","The two left the student council office one after the other. Ji Xiao watched their departing figures and tsk tsk tsk'd several times. He looked at the photos again. He had to admit, they looked good together. This was the first time he had seen Brother Chi stand so close to a girl.","The two got into Chi Yu's car again. The car drove out from the underground parking garage below the student council building onto the main campus road. As the car was driving, a familiar group of people suddenly appeared walking towards them on the pedestrian path.","Song Luokui immediately crouched down to hide below the driver's seat. She saw her brother! And there was also Lin Xingyan, Zhou Yuan and the others.","Zhang Xiyue was also there. \"I wonder where Luokui went. I'll call her to come join us for lunch.\" She took out her phone to call Song Luokui.","Meanwhile, Chi Yu glanced at Song Luokui crouching beside him. \"They passed, you can get up now.\"","Song Luokui let out a breath in relief and tidied her hair. Just then Zhang Xiyue's call came through.","\"Luokui? Where are you? Let's eat lunch together. Your brother's here too. Where did you go just now?\"","Song Luokui: \"There were so many people that I got hungry, so I left first.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"I see. Have you eaten yet? Let's eat together, we're on the 2nd floor of the 5th cafeteria. Your brother was asking for you too.\"","Song Luokui: \"I've eaten already. A teacher needed me for something, so I won't join you guys.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Okay then. But we're celebrating at the East City Clubhouse tonight, remember to come.\"","\"The East City Clubhouse? Okay, got it. I'll be there.\"","\"We'll go together then. I'll talk to you later, bye!\"","\"Bye!\"","After hanging up, Song Luokui let out a sigh. One lie required many more lies to cover it up.","Chi Yu next to her then said, \"Going to the East City Clubhouse tonight?\"","Song Luokui glanced at him. \"Yeah.\"","The same restaurant, the same private room. After the meal Chi Yu sent her back.","In the afternoon after school let out, Song Luokui met up with Zhang Xiyue at the school gate. Soon Song Luosheng pulled up in his car, and the two girls got in to head to the East City Clubhouse.","Entering the private room, the table was covered in all kinds of food and drinks. Balloons and banners were hung on the walls that read \"Congratulations on your graduation!\"","Song Luokui sat next to Song Luosheng. The private room was nearly filled with people, some of whom Song Luokui was meeting for the first time.","\"Who's that beauty next to Brother Sheng? How come I've never seen her before?\"","\"That's his sister, Brother Sheng's little sister. She goes to our Peking University too.\"","\"What! Brother Sheng actually has such a pretty little sister too. Hey, what are my chances if I went after her you reckon?\"","\"...You'd be asking for death.\"","\"Hahaha joking joking. Brother Sheng's sister is my sister too of course.\"","The wine glasses were filled. \"Cheers!\"","\"Cheers!\"","\"Congratulations on your graduation!\"","\"Congratulations on graduation!\"","The club manager came in with a cake and several ten thousand dollar bottles of red wine. \"Just a little gift to congratulate Young Master Song on his graduation. Please help me convey my regards to your boss.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Thank him for me.\"","The manager quickly left after delivering the gifts, and everyone kept celebrating.","Song Luokui drank quite a few glasses and her whole face was flushed red, her eyes bright and limpid. She sat there quietly like a well-behaved, delicate doll. The people around couldn't help but gasp when they saw her - Brother Sheng's little sister really was a beauty. Many couldn't take their eyes off her.","Song Luosheng had been chatting but soon felt the attention. He looked over at Song Luokui just as she drank another glass. He immediately took the wine glass from her hands, seeing her little face as red as a monkey's bottom. He waved his hand in front of her eyes, then looked around warningly. The others quickly averted their eyes.","Song Luokui pushed his hand away forcefully. \"Stop waving. I'm not drunk.\"","Song Luosheng: \"All drunks say they're not drunk.\" Song Luosheng waved Zhang Xiyue over from her dice game. \"Help keep an eye on her, don't let her drink anymore.\"","He then told Zhou Yuan, \"Get some juice over here.\"","\"Yes Boss.\"","Now that she couldn't drink, Song Luokui didn't make a fuss. She started eating the pitaya fruits from the table, eating one after another, stuffing her cheeks. Soon the juice arrived and Song Luosheng poured her a glass.","Song Luokui had drunk quite a lot and now needed to pee urgently. She saw the private room's bathroom was occupied. Unable to hold it in any longer, she stood up wanting to run out to find a bathroom.","Zhang Xiyue turned back periodically to check on her. \"Luokui, where are you going? I'll go with you.\"","Song Luokui: \"Bathroom. I c-can go m-myself.\" Song Luokui spoke a little slowly but enunciated clearly. Zhang Xiyue thought she still seemed fairly sober, plus there was a bathroom in the private room, so she went back to her game.","But Song Luokui walked unsteadily out of the private room by herself. Although tipsy, she could still make out the bathroom sign. She swayed a little as she walked towards it. A server in the hallway asked where she was headed.","\"Going to the bathroom.\"","\"The bathroom is this way, please watch your step.\" The server was very enthusiastic.","Song Luokui gave him a smile as she headed for the bathroom, unaware that her smile had left the server stunned.","After quickly using the bathroom, Song Luokui staggered back the same way towards their private room. She seemed to remember it was Room 356."]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: League Building","paragraphs":["Song Luokui walked directly into room 365. A group of men in black suits immediately looked over at her. The private room was very quiet. Song Luokui suddenly became sober and looked at the room number. She took a step back, \"Sorry, wrong room.\"","Song Luokui immediately turned and ran away. After asking the server, she found out the room was actually 356 instead of 365.","When she returned to room 356, she was still a bit nervous. Alcohol is dangerous! She was right!","Song Luokui drank a glass of juice to calm her nerves. Just then, her phone vibrated. A message from Chi Yu popped up.","Song Luokui immediately pressed her phone against her chest and looked left and right. Her brother seemed to be discussing business with some people, while others were happily playing games and not paying attention to her.","What she didn't know was that some people occasionally glanced over at her.","Song Luokui leaned back against the sofa, and picked up her phone to look at the message Chi Yu sent: Why did you run away?","Song Luokui: ?","The other side was quickly typing. Soon, a sentence came through: Room 365.","Song Luokui stared with wide eyes and typed quickly with both hands: Were you there just now?","Chi Yu: Yes. Do you want to come over?","Song Luokui immediately declined: No, no.","Chi Yu didn't insist either: Have you been drinking?","Song Luokui: How did you know? Yes, a little.","Recalling the blushing girl with slightly blurred eyes that he saw earlier, Chi Yu guessed: Really just a little?","Song Luokui: Of course, just a few drinks.","But Chi Yu thought to himself that she couldn't handle much alcohol at all and was already tipsy after a few drinks.","Song Luokui had class tomorrow, so Uncle Kang came to pick her and Zhang Xiyue up before 10 pm per Song Luosheng’s request.","As for Song Luosheng and the others, they planned to stay until midnight or 1 am.","It wasn’t until early morning that Song Luosheng decided to call it a night. The group walked out of the private room towards the parking garage. Designated drivers had already been arranged.","As soon as the group reached the parking lot, Chi Yu and his entourage happened to walk over from the other side. The two groups directly faced each other.","With his hands in his pockets, Song Luosheng exchanged glances with Chi Yu, then led his people past Chi Yu without giving them any warm greetings. The two groups eyed each other as they passed by without exchanging pleasantries.","After they left, Chi Yu lowered his eyes and glanced at his phone to read Song Luokui’s latest message before getting into the car and leaving with his people.","The next day, Song Luokui almost arrived late to class. And her head still hurt a little. She really shouldn’t drink too much.","Just as she was rubbing her temples, the class monitor Xu Jiarong walked over to the front seat in front of her and kindly asked, “Song Luokui?”","Song Luokui immediately opened her eyes and sat up straight. “Monitor, what can I do for you?”","At this moment, Xu Jiarong thought to herself: Ah! Song’s skin looks so good. She looks even more delicate and beautiful up close. The legendary fairy doll lives up to her name.","Yes, Song Luokui had a nickname in class called “Fairy Doll” that everyone secretly called her behind her back without her knowing.","\"Monitor?\" Seeing that Xu Jiarong didn't respond, Song Luokui asked again.","Xu Jiarong immediately came back to her senses. \"Oh, uh, I was wondering if Song Luokui would like to participate in the class team building activity? Since we've gotten to know each other better this semester, in order to enhance class cohesion and demonstrate teamwork, our class plans to organize a team building event. Song, do you have time to participate?\"","The main reason was that Song Luokui didn't seem to have participated in any school events before and kept a low profile, rarely talking in the class chat group. Xu Jiarong was worried she wouldn't want to participate.","Song Luokui would participate in this kind of group event. \"Sure, when is it?\"","Xu Jiarong: “You agreed?”","Song Luokui tilted her head in confusion. “Why wouldn’t I agree?”","Xu Jiarong: “Oh, this Saturday. I posted a message in the group chat, but you may not have seen it. That's why I asked you in person. Let's meet at the east gate of the school at 8:30 am that day. I will post the itinerary in the class group later.\"","\"Sorry, there may have been too many chat messages that I missed seeing. Let me check.\" Song Luokui immediately opened her phone to browse through the class group messages. After scrolling for a long time, she did see the message Xu Jiarong posted about the Saturday event. She was free that day and could participate.","Seeing that she agreed, Xu Jiarong happily returned to her seat.","Soon, the team building itinerary was posted. They would visit a museum in the morning, have lunch together, tour the Summer Palace in the afternoon, and have dinner and karaoke at night.","No one had any objections.","Early Saturday morning, Song Luokui got out of bed. Sheng Rong and Song Moqian happened to be home today, as well as Song Luosheng. The three were quite surprised. \"Why up so early? Why not sleep in a little more?\"","Song Luokui yawned. “I’m not going back to sleep. I have to go to school soon for a class team building event today.”","As soon as Aunt Gui heard that, she said, \"Miss, let me quickly pack some food for you to bring.\"","Song Luokui: \"No need, we already booked a restaurant for lunch.\"","Sheng Rong: “What’s today’s team building event?”","Song Luokui: “Visiting a museum in the morning and the Summer Palace in the afternoon.”","Sheng Rong instructed Aunt Gui in the kitchen: “Aunt Gui, please help pack some snacks and fruits for the little miss. She can eat them herself if hungry or share them with classmates.\" Then she looked at Song Luokui again, \"Bring some food with you. You can eat if you get hungry halfway, or share with your classmates.\"","Hearing this, Song Luokui agreed, “Alright.”","After the family of four had breakfast, Song Luokui grabbed her bag and prepared to head out. Song Luosheng waited for her at the door. \"I'll drive you to school.\"","Song Luokui: “Don’t you have work today, brother?\"","Song Luosheng: “It’s Saturday. Your brother has weekends off too.”","Song Luokui shrugged. “How would I know? Don’t you occasionally work overtime on weekends when busy?”","Song Luosheng: “I was a bit busy recently, but it’s fine now. And I can spare the time to drop you off.” He then grabbed her bag, “Let’s go.”","Song Luokui immediately followed him out.","Once seated in the car, Song Luokui added: “Later when we get to the school's east gate, you can't get out of the car or open the windows to let others see you, got it?”","As Song Luosheng started the engine, he joked, “What, embarrassed to be seen with your brother?”","Song Luokui: “On the contrary, you are too eye-catching. Just pretend to be my driver later. Otherwise, I won't ride your car anymore.”","Song Luosheng: \"...Yes your highness, your command shall be obeyed.\"","Song Luokui laughed with eyes squeezed into slits.","The car soon arrived at the school's east gate where some students had already gathered. After taking off her seat belt, Song Luokui bid farewell, “I’m going now, bye!”","Song Luosheng: “Have fun. Call your brother if anything comes up.”","\"Got it.\"","Song Luokui grabbed her bag and got out of the car. As soon as she closed the door, she headed straight for Xu Jiarong, who was doing a headcount. Seeing Song Luokui get out of the car, Xu Jiarong immediately waved at her.","Only after seeing his little sister join the group did Song Luosheng drive away.","Soon after, the headcount was complete. The chartered bus had long since arrived. Under Xu Jiarong and driver uncle's arrangement, everyone boarded the bus.","\"Fasten your seatbelts, fasten your seatbelts after boarding!\" the driver uncle shouted.","After getting on the bus, Song Luokui sat in the second seat from the front and obediently fastened her seatbelt. Xu Jiarong boarded last and sat right next to her."]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: Team Building 02","paragraphs":["The car quickly headed towards its destination, and after forty minutes or so, arrived at the museum. The tickets had already been booked in advance, so they could go straight into the museum.","Song Luokui had been to the museum twice before, but every time she came, there were new discoveries. Xu Jiarong didn't require everyone to stay together either. They could explore on their own if they wanted.","As long as they gathered outside by 12 noon, it was fine. The restaurant for lunch was nearby so it wouldn't take long to get there.","Song Luokui took her time looking at each exhibit carefully. It didn't matter if she couldn't see everything, she could always come back another time.","After wandering around for a while, Song Luokui started to feel a little tired. She found a place to sit down and rest, and took out the food from her bag. Aunt Gui had prepared a two-tiered lunchbox for her, with fruits, mainly lychees, and some small cakes and pastries.","In addition, Song Luokui's bag also contained chocolates, candy and water.","Xu Jiarong, who happened to walk by, swallowed hard when she saw the food, as she had been busy gathering everyone in the morning and hadn't even drank any water, only eating a steamed bun for breakfast.","When Song Luokui saw her, she held up the lunchbox, \"Class monitor, would you like some?\"","Xu Jiarong immediately sat down, \"Then I won't stand on ceremony.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Class monitor, eat more if you're hungry. I still have more food in my bag.\"","Looking at the exquisite lunchbox in her hand, Xu Jiarong popped a small cake into her mouth. Her eyes instantly lit up with delight. After swallowing it, she said, \"It's so delicious! Where did you buy this? And this lunchbox looks so high-end.\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"It wasn't bought, my family made it.\" She handed Xu Jiarong another piece.","Xu Jiarong asked, \"Song, your family is local right? Which area do you live in? Dongcheng District? Xicheng District?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"In the same district as our school, half an hour away.\"","Xu Jiarong's eyes also caught sight of the jade bangle on Song Luokui's wrist. Although she didn't know much about jade, she could tell at a glance that it was very high quality from how clear it looked. She figured it must be expensive.","Everyone in private had discussed that Song Luokui's family must be very wealthy, judging by her delicate skin, her general attire and accessories which all looked very refined. Just her hair alone, didn't have a single strand out of place.","However, Song Luokui seemed quite low-key towards everyone and was very gentle.","The two chatted casually as they ate. After resting for a bit, they got up to continue their stroll. Before 12 noon, everyone had gathered outside already, so when Song Luokui saw it was almost time, she also walked out of the museum.","Xu Jiarong did a headcount and upon seeing everyone was present, led them towards the restaurant she had booked a large private room at, able to accommodate more than 30 people.","There were more girls than boys in their class, only a handful of boys among the 30 over people, the rest were girls. No one was interested in drinking alcohol, plus they still had activities in the afternoon.","The dishes came out very quickly. As Song Luokui had eaten a bit earlier, she wasn't very hungry and didn't eat much.","However, someone thought she didn't like the food.","\"Song, how come you're eating so little? Are you unsatisfied with the dishes the class monitor ordered?\" Yan Suxue, who sat opposite Song Luokui, suddenly spoke up.","Song Luokui looked up at her, and after thinking for a while, recalled that the girl's name seemed to be Yan Suxue.","Seeing that Song Luokui was looking at her without saying anything, Yan Suxue continued, \"Song, why aren't you saying anything? Did I guess correctly?\"","Xu Jiarong immediately said, \"Don't say that, Song ate with me earlier, she's probably not very hungry now. Look, I'm not eating much either.\"","Song Luokui blinked and responded, \"The food is quite tasty, I'm just a little full.\" She then looked at Xu Jiarong and said, \"The class monitor ordered very nice dishes.\"","The others quickly chimed in as well, \"I also think the food is pretty good.\"","\"Yeah, it's quite tasty. Song, you shouldn't have eaten so much earlier. Now there's so much delicious food but you can only have a little.\"","Song Luokui smiled at the classmate and said, \"You're right.\"","Xu Linghua didn't expect Song Luokui to smile at her. She was stunned for a moment, shaking the hand of her friend next to her under the table, whispering to her friend, \"Ahhh she looks so pretty.\"","Yan Suxue didn't expect so many people to stand up for Song Luokui. She harrumphed but didn't say anything more. Some others exchanged looks, and everyone stopped talking and busied themselves with eating.","After the meal, they rested for a bit before boarding the bus towards Summer Palace.","Along the way, everyone chatted excitedly, occasionally stopping to take photos. Midway, Xu Jiarong gathered everyone to take a few group pictures, before letting them roam freely again.","Song Luokui walked slowly at the back of the pack, strolling around leisurely. Suddenly, a girl in front turned around, \"Song, can I take a photo with you?\"","Song Luokui was surprised for a moment but nodded in agreement, \"Sure.\"","The girl immediately passed her phone to another girl beside her, then stood next to Song Luokui, both doing a 'Yeah!' pose. Song Luokui also smiled and did the 'Yeah' pose.","Unexpectedly, after the shot, the girl who took the photo also came over, \"I also want to take a photo with Song. Help me take a few shots, let's stand over there Song, the scenery is nicer.\"","\"Okay.\"","After taking pictures with many classmates, Song Luokui gradually got to know everyone better.","\"Let me tell you, Yan Suxue wanted to smear you just now. I think she's just jealous of you,\" said Xu Linghua to Song Luokui.","Song Luokui asked, \"Jealous of what about me?\"","Xu Linghua replied, \"Jealous that you're prettier than her!\"","Song Luokui said, \"...There's no need for that. She's quite pretty too, everyone has their own characteristics.\"","Xu Linghua giggled, \"Actually we all think you're the prettiest!\"","Song Luokui said, \"...Well, thank you all for the compliments then.\"","\"You're welcome, you're welcome!\"","Summer Palace was huge and beautiful. They even took a boat ride, feeling the gentle breeze as they drifted along the waters. Everyone felt very relaxed.","As the boat ride was nearing its end, class monitor Xu Jiarong suddenly announced, \"Remember to write a short essay of around 800 words when you get back.\"","As soon as she said that, everyone groaned in unison, \"Ahhhhh there goes the good mood...\"","\"Why do we have to write an essay?\"","Xu Jiarong grinned, \"Because someone added Teacher Zeng as a friend on WeCircle and posted photos, so Teacher Zeng came looking for me to assign homework.\"","\"Ah!\"","\"Who was it?\"","\"When's the deadline?\"","Xu Jiarong replied, \"Just submit it by next weekend, no rush.\"","\"Okay then, that's fine. Mood slightly better now.\"","\"Anyway let's just have fun first, don't think about it yet.\"","Xu Jiarong checked the time, \"Alright, it's about time, we're heading to our next destination. No more coach bus, we booked it just for the morning and lunch. We'll have to take taxis over, partner up yourselves, the address has been posted in the group chat.\"","\"Those who don't want to participate in the evening activities or need to head back to school for whatever reason can go back on your own.\"","After that, two classmates didn't join the evening activities and went back to school first. The rest called taxis to the next destination - KTV Kade."]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: To Country A","paragraphs":["Song Luokui was familiar with places like this. She found that people around her quite liked gathering at clubs and KTVs.","She suddenly thought that she would often run into Chi Yu at places like this, and hoped she wouldn't today. Song Luokui prayed in her heart.","Luckily she didn't encounter anyone, because the school dorms closed at 11pm, so they finished at 10 to go back. Song Luokui didn't go back to school, she was going home.","Before this, she had already told her family. Uncle Kang would come pick her up.","Xu Jiarong knew she was going home. Afraid she wouldn't be safe alone, she said \"Why not go back to school tonight? I'm worried about you going home alone. Or should I have Shen Ziyan take you back?\" Shen Ziyan was one of the few boys in their class.","Song Luokui waved her hand. \"No need, no need. My family will come get me.\" Just then, Uncle Kang's car arrived. \"My family is here, I'm going first.\"","\"Okay, be safe.\" Xu Jiarong was relieved when she heard that, she was calling a car to go back with the others, and saw the car that picked up Song Luokui. A middle-aged man in a suit and white gloves got out.","The man walked around to the back door and opened it. \"Miss, please get in the car.\"","Song Luokui waved to Xu Jiarong and got in the car. Uncle Kang closed the door and got in the driver's seat. He started the car and drove away.","Xu Jiarong: \"Did you guys hear how the driver called Song?\"","Xu Linghua immediately raised her hand. \"I heard it, he called her Miss.\"","Another girl: \"I heard it too. So Song really is from some wealthy family?\"","Xu Jiarong: \"That driver was even wearing a white-gloved suit. Our guesses were right, Song's family really is rich.\"","\"It suddenly feels magical that I'm in the same class as an heiress.\"","\"Song really fits my image of what an heiress should be like.\"","Meanwhile, Song Luokui quickly arrived back at the estate. As they entered, another car followed behind them. The two cars entered the estate one after the other, then split off at the intersection up ahead.","What Song Luokui didn't know was that Chi Yu was sitting in the car behind them.","...","Recently Song Luokui had been working hard learning to drive. She had passed her written exam, and was now practicing for the road test.","As soon as she passed the written, Song Luosheng got her a gift, a 3 million dollar car.","Song Luokui held the key Song Luosheng gave her. \"I just passed the written.\"","Song Luosheng: \"The road test isn't hard either, the third test is even simpler. You'll get your license soon.\"","Song Luokui: \"I hope so.\"","However, she failed the road test...","Song Luokui returned home depressed. \"I failed the road test.\"","Song Luosheng: \"It's fine, you'll pass next time. If not, I'll just hire you a driver instead of you driving.\"","Song Luokui: \"...No need, I'll try harder next time.\"","By the time summer vacation came, Song Luokui finally got her license. After getting her license, Song Luokui drove the car Song Luosheng gave her slowly around the estate, practicing. At first she would have Uncle Kang or Song Luosheng sit in the passenger seat, but eventually she could drive by herself.","When Chi Yu came back from outside, he saw Song Luokui practicing driving, glanced at her license plate, and went on his way.","Song Luokui didn't notice Chi Yu was in the car that drove by. Her focus was entirely on driving the car.","...","\"My company moved to the north side of the city, I sent you the address. Don't get it wrong when you bring me meals in the future.\" Song Luosheng told her as soon as he got home one day.","Song Luokui looked up. \"North side?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Yes, come take a look when you have time. It works out, I had a lounge room renovated in my office, like you suggested before, with a bed, bathroom, and closet.\"","Song Luokui gave him a thumbs up. \"Great, you're practically a CEO now. You'll definitely meet your Cinderella someday!\"","Song Luokui looked him over again. \"Bro, you should also get some silver-rimmed glasses, that would give you more of a CEO image.\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Have you been reading weird novels? I don't need glasses, what would I wear them for?\"","Song Luokui: \"You don't need to be nearsighted to wear them. Oh right, your company is separate from that person's now right?\"","Song Luosheng lifted his chin. \"Of course, I won't have to see Chi Yu's pretentious face again. Oh, I might run into him at business dinners and such.\"","Song Luokui: \"You two haven't fought over anything recently right?\"","Song Luosheng: \"How could that happen? Market share is still something to compete over. Our companies are rivals after all, but you don't need to worry about it. Just focus on your studies.\" Song Luosheng patted her head.","Song Luokui was a little worried. \"What if... you lose to him in business competitions?\"","Song Luosheng: \"If I lose I'll just start over. I can take losses too. And I've lost who knows how many times already. I can still take the pressure.\"","But Song Luokui thought that the Song Luosheng in the novel didn't have this attitude. So did her brother's values change? Because of her long-term praise and encouragement?","\"Bro, what business is your company doing now?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Bro does everything - games, software, etc.\"","Song Luokui: \"Do you have enough capital?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Don't worry about that, bro has money.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"I'm going abroad on a business trip next week. Let me know if you want any souvenirs, or if you want to come with me. I'll have someone take you sightseeing.\" Song Luosheng added.","Song Luokui: \"Which country?\"","\"Country A.\"","Song Luokui thought that she didn't have much to do at home anyway, going abroad to play could be fun. \"Okay. Will there be bodyguards?\" Song Luokui didn't trust the public security abroad.","Song Luosheng: \"There will be. Don't worry, arrangements have been made there.\"","\"Okay.\"","Here, after Song Luosheng told her the company moved to the north side, Chi Yu sent her a message that night: [Share location] This is the new company address, if you ever bring friends for sponsorships just come here.","Song Luokui: ...","She didn't expect Chi Yu to send something like that. Still, Song Luokui opened the address, and found Chi Yu's company's new location was in the south side of the city.","One north, one south, very far apart. Great!","What Song Luokui didn't know was that in the original novel, that north side location was taken by Chi Yu. So Chi Yu's company's new address was set in the north, not far from Song Luosheng's company.","With the two rival companies located close by, many entanglements occurred. But now the two were very far apart.","In the end, all Song Luokui could reply was: Okay.","The following Monday, Song Luosheng and Song Luokui flew to Country A. On another plane, Chi Yu was also heading to Country A.","The three arrived in Country A one after another, and checked into different hotels.","The next night, the two ran into each other at the same business dinner party. As soon as Song Luosheng saw Chi Yu there, he immediately turned and started talking to the person next to him. Dammit! He didn't expect Chi Yu to show up too!","Chi Yu didn't notice him, he was greeting the host of the party."]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: Run Away","paragraphs":["On the other side, Song Luokui, who came as Song Luosheng's female companion, happened to have gone to the bathroom.","Song Luokui soon came back and stood next to her brother as a well-behaved mascot. Whenever he introduced her to others, people would exclaim, \"Wow! Your younger sister is like a Chinese porcelain doll, very beautiful!\"","At times like this, Song Luokui could only keep smiling.","Over there, Chi Yu followed the target person he came with this time upstairs. The two of them stood overlooking the first floor, chatting about cooperation.","\"Mr. Shi Laisi, I can provide you with the goods you need, and I can also help your company enter the Y Country market, but I have one condition regarding Hailin Mining. I want 80% of the shares.\"","\"80%? That's too much.\"","\"Mr. Shi Laisi, I've already acquired some small shareholdings, and my shares have reached 60%. Those remaining 20% don't really matter that much.\"","Shi Laisi hesitated: \"Let me think about it.\"","Chi Yu: \"Take your time thinking about it, Shi Laisi. I have something to take care of downstairs.\"","\"Alright.\"","Chi Yu hadn't originally planned on going downstairs, but he suddenly saw a familiar person here!","That Song Luosheng actually brought her here!","At this time, Song Luosheng was chatting with a technology tycoon from Country A, seeking new cooperation.","Just as they were chatting happily, a voice Song Luosheng hated rang out, \"Mr. Boston, hello.\"","With just that one sentence, Song Luokui immediately turned her head, making eye contact with Chi Yu for a second before quickly turning her head back.","And Song Luosheng also paused for a moment, quickly interjecting, \"Mr. Boston, I have a business opportunity here...\"","Before he could finish speaking, three gunshots suddenly rang out in the banquet hall!","\"Ahhhhh!\" Screams instantly erupted.","Song Luokui immediately panicked, grabbing Song Luosheng's arm tightly. \"Brother...\"","Song Luosheng put his arm around her. \"Don't be afraid, let's go first!\"","Over there, some people were already rushing towards the main entrance, trying to get out.","But two brawny men wielding AKs were guarding the entrance, and the doors had already been closed.","\"This way!\" Behind them, Chi Yu suddenly said.","Although they were at odds with Chi Yu, now was not the time to talk about that. Song Luosheng brought Song Luokui along to follow Chi Yu, and the three of them quickly came to a side door of the castle. But people were also guarding this side door.","Chi Yu and Song Luosheng exchanged a glance, then hid under the nearby staircase when the robber guarding the door looked over.","In the hall, several men wielding AKs were also standing on the second floor. One of them with a big beard held a megaphone and shouted at the people below, \"Everyone, don't move! Otherwise my gun here won't listen!\"","Next to the big bearded man, Mr. Shi Laisi, who Chi Yu had just spoken to, was now being held hostage with a gun pointed at his head.","These men weren't specifically targeting him, he just happened to be on the second floor.","The people below kept making a commotion, so the big bearded man immediately fired a shot at the ceiling. With a \"bang\", the shot hit the large chandelier overhead, sending shards of glass crashing down. Some people immediately screamed and ran to the sides. The big bearded man yelled, \"Anyone else who makes noise will end up like that chandelier!\"","With that one sentence, it was as if everyone's throats had been grabbed, some collapsing silently weeping on the ground.","Seeing that everyone had settled down and stopped yelling, the big bearded man spoke into the megaphone again, \"If you want to leave, you have half an hour to transfer 10 million to this card. Whoever transfers the money can leave!\"","\"Remember, only half an hour!\"","Over here, Chi Yu and the others had of course heard what the big bearded man said too. The three didn't run out, but tried to figure out how to escape.","It was better to rely on themselves than trust a robber.","Chi Yu kept watching the robber guarding the side door, mentally rehearsing how to knock him out. Song Luosheng next to him was thinking the same thing.","In between them, Song Luokui's heart was thumping rapidly. This was her first time encountering such a situation. She had never experienced anything so thrilling back in Y Country, so was this because of Chi Yu? Or because her brother was here?","After all, it seemed like the male lead or the villain would encounter all kinds of disasters and difficulties while doing business, and only after overcoming various crises could the male lead or villain become the domineering CEO of the future.","Song Luokui looked back and forth between them. These two should be fine, the main thing was...she was worried about herself. There was no role for her in the plot ahhhhhh!","Almighty scriptwriter, please don't come out again!","While Song Luokui was thinking this, Chi Yu and Song Luosheng suddenly stood up at the same time, ready to go out. The two glanced at each other instantly, knowing each other's thoughts. There is a saying that your greatest enemy understands you best.","Song Luokui also looked at them puzzled.","Song Luosheng whispered to Song Luokui, \"Hide, cover your ears, don't be afraid. I'll be right back.\"","Song Luokui immediately did as he said, curling up in the corner. \"Be careful.\"","Chi Yu also looked at Song Luokui. Song Luokui mumbled something as Song Luosheng turned to leave, silently telling Chi Yu \"Be careful\" as well.","Chi Yu's fingers curled slightly as he followed Song Luosheng out.","\"Who's there?\" The robber guarding the side door immediately pointed his gun at them when he heard the sound.","Chi Yu and Song Luosheng both raised their hands. \"We're going out to transfer money to your boss.\"","Song Luosheng: \"That's right.\"","The robber still had his gun trained on them. \"Go over there!\"","\"Alright.\" Chi Yu and Song Luosheng looked very obedient, slowly turning around and slowly walking towards the main hall, but keeping their ears on the sounds behind them.","Seeing that they were being cooperative, the robber was about to lower his gun, when Chi Yu and Song Luosheng suddenly whipped around. One kicked the gun out of the robber's hand, while the other kicked him in the mouth to keep him from making any noise. Then they knocked him out with a few quick punches.","From her hiding spot not far away, Song Luokui only heard the thuds of fists meeting flesh, then silence. She didn't dare come out until Chi Yu and Song Luosheng walked over.","Song Luosheng pulled her up. \"Shh, don't speak.\"","Song Luokui nodded, grabbing Song Luosheng's arm as they followed the men out. Chi Yu walked behind, staring at Song Luokui's hand clutching Song Luosheng's arm.","They quietly opened the side door, preparing to leave, but when Song Luosheng poked his head out, he saw that there were also people guarding the castle gardens outside.","Song Luosheng made a few hand signals at Chi Yu, who immediately understood.","The robbers were on the right, so they could go left. There was foliage for cover there. The three managed to sneak by successfully, but robbers were also guarding the main gate outside. Their main concern now was how to get out.","To get out of the gardens, there was a wall over two meters high that they'd have to climb over. Chi Yu and Song Luosheng could probably manage, but Song Luokui definitely couldn't climb it."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Hold and Run","paragraphs":["Three people stood under the high wall. Song Luosheng immediately squatted down and patted his shoulder to signal Song Luokui to step on. Song Luokui took off her high heels, and her snow-white feet immediately stepped on.","Song Luokui held the wall with her hands, and then Song Luosheng slowly stood up while Song Luokui struggled to climb onto the wall. She was wearing a white split long skirt today which was a bit inconvenient, but she was wearing shorts inside. She simply pulled up her skirt and tucked it into her waist, using both her hands and feet to desperately climb up.","Next to her, Chi Yu held out his hand to support her in case she fell down. Unexpectedly, as she did that, her fair thighs came into view. Chi Yu immediately turned his head away, not daring to look, only his Adam's apple moved.","After Song Luokui climbed up, she could only sit there. She lay there to observe if there was anyone around.","Below, Song Luosheng and Chi Yu moved back from the wall for a few steps. After a running start, the two climbed up the wall in just a few strides, before climbing down the other side of the wall.","Song Luosheng stretched out his hand to Song Luokui on the wall above and said softly, \"Jump down, brother will catch you.\"","Song Luokui looked at the height and was a little afraid and nervous, but she knew she couldn't be afraid now. She swallowed and prepared to jump down when the patrolman on the side discovered them, shouting, \"Hey! Don't move!\"","Damn, they were about to be discovered. Song Luokui instantly jumped down and Song Luosheng caught her. He staggered back two steps, almost falling over. Chi Yu immediately supported him from behind.","\"Run quickly, they discovered us!\" Chi Yu said.","Song Luokui immediately slipped out of Song Luosheng's arms. The three ran towards the bushes across the road. They could still hear the gunshots behind them.","The three did not stop and kept running forward. Song Luokui followed the two men without saying a word, even though her feet were already covered in wounds.","She had thrown her shoes over the wall. Even if she hadn't, it was impossible for her to run in 10cm high heels. She would have probably sprained her ankle after a few steps.","After running for who knows how long, Chi Yu suddenly stopped, and Song Luokui and Song Luosheng following behind also stopped.","Song Luosheng immediately said, \"Chi Yu, what are you doing, keep running!\"","\"Bang bang!\" Two more gunshots sounded from behind!","\"Damn! They actually chased over!\" Song Luosheng swore.","At this time, Chi Yu walked over to Song Luokui and picked her up before running forward quickly again!","Song Luosheng blurted out: \"F*ck! Chi Yu what are you doing! Don't touch my sister!\" He was stunned for a moment before catching up.","Chi Yu: \"Didn't you notice her feet were injured?\"","Song Luosheng immediately looked at Song Luokui's feet. By now, her feet were pitch black, and although the moon was very round tonight and visibility wasn't bad, he still couldn't see very clearly.","However, thinking that Song Luokui had been running barefoot all this way, he knew what had happened! His heart tightened instantly. His little Kui Kui was injured yet he didn't even notice.","When Chi Yu picked her up abruptly, Song Luokui was also shocked. She had no choice but to put her arms around Chi Yu's neck out of fear, her whole body bouncing with Chi Yu's running.","\"I'm fine, put me down, I can run by myself.\" Song Luokui said.","Chi Yu didn't speak and just kept running while carrying her, clearly refusing.","Next to them Song Luosheng said, \"Chi Yu, give my Kui Kui to me to carry! You don't have to!\"","Chi Yu didn't even look at him. \"Now is not the time to talk about this.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Only I can carry my sister! Chi Yu, give me Kui Kui!\"","Chi Yu: \"No!\"","Song Luosheng: \"Give her to me! I won't compete with you for the next project if you do!\"","Chi Yu: \"No, compete all you want, you'll lose anyway!\"","\"Damn!\" Song Luosheng wanted to hit him. \"Are you gonna give her to me or not! If not I'll snatch her!\"","\"No!\"","\"Give her!\"","\"No!\"","Song Luokui: \"Stop arguing, you two. Let's get away first.\" She really didn't understand how the two were arguing yet still running quite fast. Clearly she was dragging them down earlier, and now she couldn't even hear the sounds behind them anymore.","The two immediately shut up!","Soon, they crossed through the woods and ran out to another main road. Not hearing any sounds behind, the three crouched down in the bushes by the roadside while Chi Yu called his men.","In the castle on the other side, the police had also surrounded the area. They were currently negotiating...","Chi Yu's men arrived quickly. This time it was Zheng Quanjun who came. Seeing the miserable state of the three, he was relieved they were alright. He also knew what had happened at the castle. He originally brought men to rush over when Chi Yu called.","Seeing Song Luosheng and Song Luokui, he was also somewhat surprised. He didn't expect the boss to be with the enemy. But thinking of tonight's situation, it was not so strange. Although they were opposed on the surface, they were all Hua Country People, and their parents were actually acquaintances who would still help each other when abroad.","Soon, they got into the seven-seater car, with Song Luosheng and Song Luokui in the back, Zheng Quanjun and Chi Yu in the middle row, and the driver plus a bodyguard in front.","By now, Song Luokui had put her skirt back down, but one could see her calves and feet wrapped in bandages, her soles completely blackened, and scratches on her arms as well. Her fair complexion was full of terrible looking wounds.","Chi Yu said: \"Go to the hospital first.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","Song Luosheng didn't speak. He took off his suit jacket and put it on Song Luokui, then helped pick out the grass in her hair and checked her injuries. \"Does it hurt? It's all brother's fault. If I had known, I wouldn't have brought you here today.\"","Song Luokui replied: \"It's fine, doesn't hurt. It has nothing to do with you, how would we know there were bandits!\"","Song Luosheng stroked her hair. \"How could it not hurt? Don't try to fool brother like when we were young. Every time you said that, we still ended up in the hospital. Don't you remember that time you accidentally cut your hand with a knife when slicing fruit as a kid and almost died from blood loss in the hospital?\" As he spoke, his eyes turned icy cold. \"Brother will avenge you for this.\"","Song Luokui: \"I was just unlucky as a child. Now it's just small wounds.\"","In front, Chi Yu was listening to their conversation. When he heard that Song Luokui almost died from accidentally cutting her hand as a child, he immediately turned to look at her.","Feeling his gaze, Song Luokui also looked over. Their eyes met and she quickly looked away in embarrassment.","Song Luosheng also looked over, but Chi Yu had already turned away.","Soon they arrived at the hospital. After examining her, the doctor first treated her foot swelling, applied medication, and finally wrapped up her entire feet in bandages. If one didn't know better, they'd have thought she was disabled!","But that wasn't all, her arms were treated the same way...","When she was discharged from the hospital, Song Luokui was sitting in a wheelchair...","In the next few days, Song Luokui stayed in the hotel to recuperate. Her wounds were healing well, with many small ones already scabbing over. Song Luosheng was afraid of scarring and bought her some scar removal ointment... well, it was rather expensive, over a million for just a small bottle.","While Song Luokui was recovering, aside from going out for business dealings, Song Luosheng was also out for revenge.","As for the hostage case at the castle, it shocked the entire Country A. No one expected the audacity of those bandits, bold enough to rob so many tycoons at once, all of them rich men, with no idea the castle would be occupied by bandits.","Song Luokui didn't get much information, only knowing that the bandits demanded 10 million per person for people to leave safely, and yet some were still beaten to death for some reason.","When the police came to rescue them, the bandits actually clashed and opened fire, resulting in many injuries and deaths.","In the end, a few bandits escaped, including the leader with the big beard. His wanted posters were all over the streets now - Fu Ke · Walte, the Big Bearded Bandit."]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: Cruise Play","paragraphs":["A week had passed, and Song Luokui had recovered. Although there were still some traces, they didn't affect her walking.","She felt a bit bored in the meantime. Song Luosheng had someone push her to go shopping at the mall and let her buy whatever she wanted, saying, \"When my brother has some free time in a few days, he'll accompany you.\"","\"Yeah, you go ahead and do your thing.\"","Just then, in the afternoon, Chi Yu messaged her, \"Are you feeling better now?\"","Song Luokui remembered how Chi Yu had carried her before, as if... she owed him a favor again... Song Luokui rubbed her face and replied, \"I'm fine now.\"","Chi Yu: \"Do you want to go out and have some fun?\"","Song Luokui: \"?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll come pick you up.\"","Song Luokui's fingers flew across the keyboard as she typed, \"My brother won't agree.\"","Chi Yu: \"He won't be able to come back tonight, don't worry.\"","Song Luokui: \"How do you know?\"","After that, Chi Yu didn't reply.","Before long, someone knocked on her room door. Song Luokui looked through the peephole and saw that Chi Yu was already there!","Song Luokui quickly opened the door. \"How did you get here so quickly?\" She looked around, afraid that someone might see them.","Chi Yu's gaze fell to her feet. At this moment, Song Luokui was wearing shoes, with a long skirt that reached her ankles. Chi Yu couldn't see how her feet were doing, but since she was wearing shoes, they should be fine. He looked up at her face. She hadn't put on any makeup. \"Are you okay now?\"","Song Luokui still had some hesitation, her hand resting on the doorknob. \"Is my brother really not coming back?\"","Chi Yu: \"No, even if he does, it will be very late.\"","In fact, Song Luosheng had arranged for someone to take her out to play. As long as she made a phone call, someone would come. She did want to go out and have some fun, after all. She hadn't been out much during her recovery, and she didn't like to trouble people.","Chi Yu stood quietly with his hands in his pockets, without urging her.","Suddenly, Song Luokui looked up. \"Wait for me for a moment.\" She quickly grabbed a bag, prepared her identification and some cash, and grabbed a coat before following Chi Yu out.","She had been worried that her brother would suddenly come back before they left the hotel.","Once they were in Chi Yu's car, Song Luokui asked, \"Where are we going?\"","\"To Duolun Port.\"","Song Luokui was puzzled. What was there to do at Duolun Port? But when she arrived at Duolun Port and saw the enormous cruise ship, she realized where Chi Yu had brought her.","Princess Olivette Cruise Ship, an incredibly luxurious cruise ship. Song Luokui counted and found that it had twenty floors!","Chi Yu led her onto the ship and then took her to the topmost floor. They stood on the deck, feeling the sea breeze and sipping the drinks brought by the waiters. There was also live music playing on the deck.","The sun hadn't completely set yet, preparing to descend. The two of them stood there, watching the sunset on the sea's horizon. The sea sparkled and shimmered, creating a beautiful sight.","Song Luokui's hair fluttered in the wind, and a strand of hair fell messily on her face. Suddenly, Chi Yu pulled out a shiny hairpin. \"Here.\"","Song Luokui's eyes widened when she saw the hairpin in his hand. She even took a step back. Chi Yu's gaze remained on her face. \"Let me pin up your hair.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" However, she found it very strange! Why would Chi Yu have a hairpin? And why did he give it to her?","Chi Yu: \"Shall I help you put it on?\" he said, taking a step closer to her, preparing to lower his head.","Song Luokui quickly intercepted it with a quick hand, placing the drink aside. \"Thank you... I can do it myself.\"","She quickly clipped the hairpin by her ear, and Chi Yu stared at it for a while.","The sun quickly set, and the sea became pitch black, but the cruise ship was brightly lit. \"Are you hungry? Let's have dinner.\"","\"Okay.\" Song Luokui followed behind Chi Yu as they entered the cruise ship and arrived at the restaurant. The waiter quickly brought the menu.","Song Luokui noticed that there were no other people on this floor, only the two of them. \"Why isn't anyone else here?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"Hmm, I booked the entire floor.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Oh.\"","The food arrived quickly, and everything was exquisite and delicious. They started with appetizers, followed by main courses, and finally, desserts were served one by one.","There was also a live band in the restaurant, and the music changed several times.","After finishing the last dessert, a small cake that was neither too sweet nor too heavy and melted in the mouth, Song Luokui felt satisfied.","After wiping her mouth, Chi Yu suddenly reached out and gently swiped his thumb across her face. \"There's still something here.\"","Song Luokui's face instantly turned red. She quickly took a tissue and wiped her face, looking at Chi Yu. A storm was raging in her heart. What is he doing? Is he trying to seduce me to blackmail my brother?","Song Luokui imagined Chi Yu as a big bad wolf, grabbing her and smiling wickedly in front of her brother, and eventually her brother kneeling down to beg him...","Snapping back to reality, she saw Chi Yu's calm expression. He wiped his hand and looked at her. \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui immediately shook her head.","Chi Yu looked at her red earlobe, and a slight smile appeared on his lips.","Then, Chi Yu took her to explore the cruise ship. The ship was large with various recreational areas such as a cinema, amusement park, swimming pool, cafe, theater, KTV, and gym.","Finally, they watched a movie together. The entire cinema was empty except for the two of them. Before midnight, Chi Yu escorted her back to the hotel.","\"Goodnight.\"","\"Goodnight. Thank you for tonight,\" Song Luokui felt that she had enjoyed the evening. \"Thank you for helping me escape last time. I'll treat you to a meal when we get back.\"","Chi Yu raised an eyebrow. \"No need to wait until we get back. We can do it tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui chuckled awkwardly. \"Haha, let's just wait until we get back.\" Tonight, she had already been daring enough. She felt it would be better to behave a little more restrained from now on.","Chi Yu didn't insist. \"Alright.\"","Afterwards, Chi Yu left, and Song Luokui quickly went to rest. That night, Song Luosheng indeed did not return.","The next day at noon, Song Luosheng returned from outside, accompanied by his secretary and a bodyguard.","He was talking on the phone while waiting for the elevator. Three people approached from the side, but Song Luosheng didn't pay attention. However, his secretary noticed.","At this moment, the elevator arrived, and six people entered. Song Luosheng was still on the phone when his secretary pulled his arm to remind him.","Song Luosheng turned his head to look at his secretary, who gestured for him to look to the side.","Upon looking, Song Luosheng saw Chi Yu and his entourage.","Song Luosheng's face darkened. \"What are you doing here? I remember you don't live here!\"","Chi Yu replied, \"I started living here today.\"","Song Luosheng narrowed his eyes. \"What's your motive?\"","Chi Yu said, \"What motive could I have? I'm just living here!\" Song Luosheng didn't believe it. His mind spun, and he noticed that the button for the thirty-fifth floor was lit up, while the others were not. They also lived on the thirtieth floor.","Suddenly, Song Luosheng grabbed Chi Yu's tie, his gaze icy. \"Why are you on the thirty-fifth floor too? What do you want with my sister?\"","Thinking back to when Chi Yu held his sister and ran, anger surged within Song Luosheng. Although it was a matter of survival, he couldn't help but feel that Chi Yu had malicious intentions!","Could it be that he wanted to use his sister to threaten him into giving up the project?"]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: What are You Doing","paragraphs":["Just as the elevator arrived on the 35th floor, when the doors opened, Song Luokui saw this scene right away: Song Luosheng was holding Chi Yu's tie in his hand, while the two secretaries behind them were grabbing and pulling at each other, saying \"you grab this hand, I'll grab that hand.\" Their bodyguards were also wrestling with each other, tangled up together.","Apparently, when Song Luosheng had grabbed Chi Yu's tie, Chi Yu's secretary had tried to help, so Song Luosheng's secretary immediately moved to stop him. Then the two bodyguards instantly started using their hands...","\"What are you guys doing?\" Song Luokui blinked.","The three people in the elevator instantly let go of each other and tidied up their clothes, then walked out of the elevator.","Song Luosheng walked over to Song Luokui's side. \"It's nothing, where are you going?\"","Song Luokui: \"I was going to go downstairs to eat.\"","Song Luosheng: \"I'll go with you.\" After speaking, he followed Song Luokui into the elevator again. When the elevator doors closed, Song Luokui glanced up and her eyes met Chi Yu's, but the doors closed quickly.","Song Luosheng said: \"Chi Yu also lives on the 35th floor. Kui Kui, stay away from him and don't talk to him. Even if he talks to you, ignore him.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\" However, she had just gone out to play with Chi Yu yesterday.","Song Luosheng: \"Brother will be free tomorrow to take you out to play.\"","\"Okay.\"","Over the next few days, Song Luosheng took Song Luokui to quite a few places to play, and they went shopping at the mall where he bought lots of gifts to be shipped straight home to give to his family and friends.","After spending half a month in Country A, the two finally prepared to return home. They were both in business class. Not long after they sat down, a familiar person came to the seat next to them - Chi Yu.","Song Luosheng clenched his fist tight, feeling a sudden pain in his head. He hadn't expected to be on the same flight as Chi Yu! Of course Chi Yu saw them too. Naturally, Song Luokui didn't dare to greet him. Song Luosheng rolled his eyes as if he didn't see anything. He called the flight attendant to bring a blanket and handed it to Song Luokui, \"Cover yourself and sleep well. You'll be home after waking up.\"","\"Yeah Yeah.\"","The morning flight arrived in Jing City late at night. After returning home, it was almost dawn.","They distributed the gifts to family members before Song Luokui first went to rest.","The vacation wasn't over yet. Song Luokui was relaxing at home, occasionally going out with her little girlfriends to go shopping and play. None of them dared to go to the club to find excitement again. They went to music concerts, plays, occasionally participated in some fragrance meetings, reading meetings and other activities organized by girls in their circle.","During this time, Song Luokui and the others also went to Country F to watch a fashion show. They also met top celebrities in China and even got autographs and photos taken with them.","She was spending her days very leisurely. Meanwhile, Song Luosheng was not so leisurely. Song Hua Technology was in a period of rapid expansion, already becoming a famous technology company domestically.","It was a technology company, but the industries involved were not limited to the technology industry. Other investments were also slowly covering more industries. The original company with about 100 people expanded rapidly to several hundred people and was still expanding.","So Song Luosheng was especially busy. On this trip to Country A, they also gained some new partnerships. They planned to set up a branch company over there in Country A, ready to expand their influence overseas.","It was similar on Chi Yu's side. Moreover, his expansion was even faster. All industries were integrated into one Shan Yu Group, divided into Shan Yu Technology, Shan Yu Gaming, Shan Yu Real Estate, and so on.","Chi Yu was also extremely busy, with schedules packed full every day, flying to Country Y today, Country A tomorrow, Country H the day after...","If Song Luokui knew, she would surely say: this was just a small part of the male lead's early period assets and industries. Later on, Shan Yu Group's industries will be involved in all walks of life and every corner of the globe will have Shan Yu Group's industries. And Chi Yu would also become the richest man in the world!","Time flew by quickly and it was time to start school again. Song Luokui became a sophomore student. Although Song Luosheng and Chi Yu were terribly busy every day, both of them were already graduate students at Peking University, which they had directly gotten in through protections at the time.","The two of them didn't need to apply. Their secretaries directly helped them handle the registration with credentials.","In the dormitory, Wang Sisi, Zhang Jingfeng and Su Ziyuan all needed to welcome the new students, so they had come to school very early. Song Luokui only needed to return when school opened. The three also brought local specialties from home for Song Luokui.","The night before school started, Song Luokui returned to campus. Oddly, the other three were not there. Song Luokui tidied up her bed a bit, looking at the class group notice. Suddenly, there were chattering noises outside and the door was pushed open. Wang Sisi was followed by several people behind her.","The people who had been talking and laughing saw Song Luokui and froze in place, going silent. But Wang Sisi just laughed. \"Luokui, you're back! I brought local specialties from home. Hold on a minute.\"","Then she walked to her bed, took out a big bag of snacks from the cabinet, and handed two packs to Song Luokui before taking out several more packs for those who came with her.","\"They are all our juniors.\" Wang Sisi introduced them to Song Luokui.","Song Luokui nodded at them. \"Hello.\"","Those junior sisters each respectfully bowed their heads. \"Nice to meet you, Senior Sister.\"","Wang Sisi laughed seeing this. \"Alright, don't be so nervous. Let's go. Weren't you curious about which cafeteria has the tastiest food and where the handsome brothers congregate? I'll show you around.\"","Before leaving, Wang Sisi said to Song Luokui: \"I'll show them around campus.\"","Song Luokui: \"Thanks, you go ahead. Thanks for the snacks too.\"","Wang Sisi: \"I'll ask my family to send me more if you like it.\"","After they walked downstairs out of the dorm building, a junior sister asked Wang Sisi softly: \"What's that senior sister's name?\"","Wang Sisi turned to look and saw that those juniors were all gazing at her hopefully. Wang Sisi burst out laughing. \"My roommate is gorgeous, isn't she?\"","The juniors' eyes sparkled and they all rushed to speak.","\"Super gorgeous!\"","\"I felt cupid's arrow shoot straight into my heart when I walked in. She really is so beautiful!\"","\"I really want to be friends with her. I wonder if Senior Sister joined any campus clubs? I want to join the same club as her.\"","\"She doesn't have a boyfriend does she! If she did, I'd love to see which creep got my senior sister's favor!\"","For some reason, Chi Yu's face suddenly flashed through Wang Sisi's mind, then she shook her head. Luokui said she wasn't close to Senior Brother Chi, so it shouldn't be possible.","\"My roommate is called Song Luokui. She doesn't have a boyfriend yet. And nope, your Luokui senior sister hasn't joined any clubs either, so it's not possible to join the same one.\" Wang Sisi answered.","\"Then what department is Senior Song from?!\"","Wang Sisi: \"Literature Department.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, a junior sister exclaimed, \"Ahhh! She's in the same department as me!\"","Other juniors: \"Damn! I want to be in the same department as Senior Sister too. I wonder if I can still change departments now?\"","Wang Sisi: \"No need to go that far...\""]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: Catch a Traitor","paragraphs":["Wang Sisi returned to the dormitory and told Song Luokui about the incident, \"The juniors are so cute, each one wants to be in the same college as you. Oh, they all think you are very good-looking and asked me about you. I only told them your name and college, nothing else. Is that okay?\"","Song Luokui waved her hand, \"No problem.\"","That day, Zhang Xiyue sent Song Luokui a message: \"Babe, I'll tell you something.\"","Song Luokui: \"Oh? What is it?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Shy, I have a boyfriend now!\"","Song Luokui: \"!!! What does he look like? Where is he from?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"He's also from our school, the Physics Department. He's from J Province. [Picture] This is his photo, isn't he handsome? Of course not as handsome as my big brother, but I think he's very smart.\"","Song Luokui looked at the bespectacled man in the photo. He looked rather refined, certainly not as handsome as her brother. Of course, in Song Luokui's eyes, her brother was the pinnacle of handsomeness of all the men she had seen. Oh, and there was another person - her father. Her brother looked a lot like her father.","As for Chi Yu, in her aesthetic, he was truly not as handsome as her brother, although many people thought Chi Yu was more handsome than her brother.","Song Luokui: \"Congratulations!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Haha, having a boy toy can be fun too. Luokui, don't you want to find one? Men can be quite amusing sometimes.\"","Song Luokui: \"......I don't have any thoughts about that right now. Be careful, don't get played by the man when you're just playing with him, like that previous time you were looking for thrills and ended up thrilling the police station.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Don't worry, that won't happen.\"","After Zhang Xiyue started dating, she rarely asked Song Luokui to go out and play anymore. Whenever she contacted Song Luokui, it was to talk about her boyfriend.","Occasionally when chatting with Song Luokui, a girl's name kept coming up in the conversation - Qi Shenyan’s female classmate who he often conducted research together with.","Zhang Xiyue complained a bit about this at first. Everything was fine initially; she only grumbled once or twice that her boyfriend seemed to be in frequent contact with that girl. Slowly, Zhang Xiyue’s complaints increased.","Until one day, Zhang Xiyue messaged Song Luokui: \"Luokui, I can't take it anymore! I want to give that bastard couple a beating, but I can’t bear to. What should I do?\"","As soon as Song Luokui saw this, she knew something was wrong. \"Where are you now?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"I'm on the street in front of the west gate of the school, opposite Old Li's BBQ shop.\"","Song Luokui immediately rushed out of the dorm. Wang Sisi and the other two roommates looked at each other blankly. This was the first time they had seen Song Luokui in such a hurry.","Song Luokui quickly arrived at the street in front of the west gate of the school. Old Li’s BBQ was quite popular with tables filled with Beijing University students.","Opposite Old Li’s BBQ was a milk tea shop. Zhang Xiyue was sitting by the window, staring at a table with two people beside the BBQ shop.","As soon as Song Luokui arrived, she saw Zhang Xiyue. She walked up to Zhang Xiyue and looked in the direction she was staring. With one glance, she spotted Zhang Xiyue’s boyfriend Qi Shenyan and the girl beside him.","The two were sitting together, not facing each other, but side by side. Opposite them sat two other men.","Song Luokui also saw the girl suddenly peel a shrimp and feed it directly to Qi Shenyan’s mouth!","Song Luokui immediately took out her phone and snapped a video. Zhang Xiyue instantly stood up with immense fury, but quickly sat back down again.","Song Luokui grabbed her hand and pulled her up right away. \"I don't even know why you’re being so cowardly! Zhang Xiyue, do you still remember who you are? Come with me!\"","Song Luokui dragged Zhang Xiyue across the street and stood right in front of the adulterous couple.","Upon seeing Zhang Xiyue, Qi Shenyan was taken aback for a moment but quickly became self-righteous. \"Didn't I tell you I was having dinner with a friend? Why did you come over?\"","Beside Qi Shenyan, Zhao Liya said, \"Hello Zhang. We were just having dinner, don't get the wrong idea.\"","The moment Zhang Xiyue heard her speak, she exploded with rage. \"Don't think I don't know your intentions!\"","Seeing Zhao Liya’s hurt expression, Qi Shenyan quickly stood up to shield her. \"Zhang Xiyue don't make trouble unreasonably! Apologize to Liya immediately!\"","Zhang Xiyue’s eyes instantly turned red and tears nearly spilled out!","Beside her, Song Luokui shouted, \"Zhang Xiyue! Don't cry! Hold it in!\"","Zhang Xiyue looked towards Song Luokui. \"Sob... Luokui...\"","Song Luokui handed her a tissue. \"Do you still remember where you’re from? What’s there to cry about over a worthless man? Hold it in!\"","Seeing Song Luokui's stern expression, Zhang Xiyue instantly held back her tears. Luokui suddenly became so scary.","Only now did Qi Shenyan and Zhao Liya notice Song Luokui. The two men in front of them also took notice of Song Luokui. The four had varied expressions, though a flash of jealousy showed on Zhao Liya's face. How did she not know there was someone like this at their school?","Qi Shenyan spoke up. \"Xiyue, who is this?\"","Song Luokui arrogantly glanced at Qi Shenyan. \"A worthless man does not deserve to speak to me.\"","Qi Shenyan: \"You...\"","Song Luokui: \"What do you want? Aren't you the worthless man who cheated on his girlfriend and had dinner with another woman? The one eating shrimp handfed by another woman is not you? Just classmates, huh! That is just laughable! Xiyue, you should know what to say to him now! Don't disappoint me!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Luokui...\"","Song Luokui raised her chin. \"Go on! Or do you want me to take action instead?\"","Zhang Xiyue walked up and slapped Qi Shenyan hard twice, instantly reddening his face. She then grabbed the drinks from the table and poured them over the man's head. \"Scumbag! We're through!\"","Qi Shenyan was stunned for a second and tried to retaliate, but Song Luokui immediately kicked his knee. \"Ah!\" he cried out in pain as he kneeled down directly. Zhao Liya rushed over to check on him. \"Shenyan, are you okay?\"","Song Luokui said, \"You still dare to hit women? Worthless men will forever be worthless! Xiyue, let's go!\"","Zhang Xiyue immediately followed her lead. After walking several steps, Song Luokui stopped and looked back at the adulterers. \"Oh right, a bitch and a dog belong together for eternity. I wish you both eternal bliss! Xiyue, let's go back!\"","\"Yes!\" said Zhang Xiyue. Song Luokui's path created a lane for people to give way. The surrounding onlookers had originally been watching the commotion.","After the two had left, everyone returned to their seats, whispering to each other about what happened at Qi Shenyan’s table.","The two men seated opposite Qi Shenyan also felt very awkward. They hesitated for a moment before standing up. \"Shenyan, something came up and we have to leave first.\"","After the men left, only Qi Shenyan and Zhao Liya remained. A girl from another table said, \"Seeing scumbags and sluts here ruins my appetite. How can they still remain here with such thick skin!\"","Just as Zhao Liya was about to stand up to retort, Qi Shenyan stopped her. \"Liya, let's go back first. We have clear consciences. I can hold my head high.\"","Zhao Liya said, \"Alright, I'll help you home.\"","The girl at the other table said, \"Hilarious! Clear conscience? Does he think everyone else is blind?\"","Qi Shenyan paused for a moment without speaking, and left with Zhao Liya."]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: The Lesson","paragraphs":["Over here, Song Luokui sent Zhang Xiyue back to her dormitory, \"Has your lovesick brain sobered up yet?\"","Zhang Xiyue scratched her palm with her hand: \"......Sobered up.\"","Song Luokui: \"Take a shower and get some good rest. Next time if you want to play with men, we can go to the clubhouse. I'll get you some eight or ten out of tens for you to choose from, there are plenty of men!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Aren't you afraid of the boss?\"","Song Luokui blinked: \"My brother has been super busy lately, we can sneak in without letting him know.\"","Zhang Xiyue smiled immediately, \"Then it's a deal.\"","Song Luokui: \"Go back and rest.\"","\"Okay!\" Zhang Xiyue immediately opened the door of the dormitory and went in, Song Luokui also returned to her own dormitory.","As soon as Zhang Xiyue entered the dormitory, the three girls in the dormitory all looked over. Zhang Xiyue thought they knew about her breakup and felt a little embarrassed, \"What's up?\"","Liang Yuhan: \"Just now, did your friend say... taking you to a clubhouse to choose concubines from ten or eight men was real? Can we really make selections?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"......I don't think she said anything about choosing concubines.\"","Liang Yuhan's eyes lit up: \"So it's true!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Haha, it's true. Do you guys want to go too?\"","The three of them: \"Yes!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"......\" So they wanted this...","On the school forum, the video of the two being caught cheating has been circulating.","\"F**k! Who's that girl? Is she from our school too?\"","\"F**k! @Slender Flying @xixi @Super Big Hero, come and see this beauty!\"","\"Is she really from our school? Do we have such a good looking girl in our school?\"","\"She's so beautiful and cool! I was there at the scene, the beauty lifted her chin arrogantly and slowly spit out a few words: Cheap men are not worthy to speak to me!\"","\"So no one is scolding that cheating couple?\"","\"I seem to recognize that cheating couple...\"","\"I just want to know what the beauty's name is! Which college is she from! It's been a minute and no one has found out yet!\"","Just as someone was about to post a comment, the post was deleted in the next second.","???","Soon someone reposted it again, and the post was deleted again in less than ten seconds!","Someone else posted vaguely: Reveal the one in the cheating couple's post...","Shortly after, it was also deleted.","Over there, Ji Xiao saved the video and had people monitor the forum, instructing them to delete all related posts. She then sent the video to someone else.","On the other side, still in a company meeting, Chi Yu opened it and saw the arrogant person in the video. The corner of his mouth slightly lifted up as he saved the video. Then he looked at the table full of people and resumed his expressionless look, \"Continue!\"","The group reporting: ...Although the boss only smiled for a second, he seems to be in a much better mood now, so what did the boss just watch?","......","The next day, Zhang Xiyue recovered her mood. She had already blocked the scumbag. As she walked down the dorm building, Qi Shenyan suddenly rushed out from the side, startling Zhang Xiyue. \"Xiyue, let's talk!\" Qi Shenyan wanted to grab Zhang Xiyue's hand.","Zhang Xiyue took a step back, \"Get lost! I made it very clear last night!\"","Qi Shenyan: \"Yuya and I really have nothing going on, you got it all wrong!\"","Zhang Xiyue looked at him sarcastically: \"Who cares if you have something going on or not, we're over anyway. It's none of my business if you have something going on with her. I hope you don't show up in front of me from now on, or I won't be polite!\"","Her mind must have really been clouded before, now looking at this man, what did she even find attractive about him? He's not handsome enough, has a bad personality, grades aren't top-notch either. Compared to the little friends in the Grand Academy, he doesn't measure up at all!","Qi Shenyan: \"Xiyue... I hope you won't say things in anger. We can calm down, but...\"","Zhang Xiyue waved her hand and slapped him again. Passersby around instantly stopped to watch the commotion.","\"F**k! Can't you understand human words? Dead scumbag!\" Zhang Xiyue directly kicked towards Qi Shenyan's crotch. Qi Shenyan was in so much pain that he immediately squatted down sweating profusely.","Some of the male students waiting for their girlfriends downstairs saw this and immediately felt a chill down there... Ouch...","After kicking once, Zhang Xiyue didn't even glance at the scumbag before leaving.","Qi Shenyan stayed in place for a long time to recover before leaving. He wanted to text Zhang Xiyue but suddenly remembered he was blocked. He called directly but it was quickly hung up. Calling again, he found the call couldn't go through, so he must have been blocked!","Just after blocking the scumbag, Zhang Xiyue suddenly stopped in her tracks. She still felt unsatisfied thinking to herself. She had bought the scumbag many gifts and was considerate of his studies, buying him lots of food. She couldn't just let this go!","Zhang Xiyue immediately called Zhou Yuan: \"Brother Yuan, I have something I want you to help me with...\"","On the other end, as soon as Zhou Yuan heard a little friend was being bullied, how could this do?","\"Leave it to brother! Anyone who dares to bully our Grand Academy's people, I'll take care of him for you!\"","\"Great! Thank you Brother Yuan.\"","On the other side, Song Luokui had morning classes. She was already sitting in the classroom studying diligently when her phone suddenly popped up a message: \"I heard you were quite fierce last night?\"","Song Luokui looked and it was from Chi Yu: \"What fierce?\"","Chi Yu immediately sent over the video of her venting her anger for Zhang Xiyue.","Song Luokui: \"......Where did the video come from? Is it circulating online?\" Her image...","Chi Yu: \"The online videos have been deleted.\"","Song Luokui searched online and didn't find the video, feeling relieved. \"Thank you.\" Another favor added, the owed favors just kept piling up.","Song Luokui finally added another message: \"When you have time, my treat for a meal.\"","Chi Yu: \"Ok.\"","Not long after getting back to the dorm after school, Zhang Xiyue came looking for her. \"Kui Kui!\"","Seeing her in good spirits today, Song Luokui figured she must have moved on.","The other roommates weren't in. Zhang Xiyue dragged over a stool and sat next to Song Luokui, chattering away about what had happened with the scumbag that morning.","\"He actually still had the nerve to look for me after I blocked him. He told me to calm down! I was so angry I kicked him down there. After thinking about it, I still felt it wasn't enough, so I got Brother Yuan to get revenge for me!\"","\"Last night Shan Xue and Zhou Yue also asked me about it. I told them everything too. Wuwuwu, they really are good sisters, everyone helped me scold the scumbag.\"","Zhang Xiyue hugged Song Luokui, leaning her head on her shoulder. \"Of course Kui Kui is still the best.\"","Song Luokui: \"Remember to keep a clear head in the future. Lovesickness is no good.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"I know, I know.\"","Just then, Wang Sisi and the others also came back from outside. Zhang Xiyue immediately returned the stool. Wang Sisi and the others greeted Zhang Xiyue as well.","Zhang Xiyue had come to Song Luokui before, so they knew Zhang Xiyue was Song Luokui's friend. It was also obvious from their conversation that the two grew up together and lived in the same place.","Leaning on Song Luokui's desk, Zhang Xiyue said, \"Kui Kui, you didn't forget your promise to get me ten or eight men right?\"","As soon as it was said, Wang Sisi and the others all looked over!","Men? Ten or eight?"]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: Dot the Man","paragraphs":["Song Luokui: \"Haven't forgotten, when do you want to go?\" She had to ask her brother about his recent schedule, it would be best not to be in Jing City, going abroad would be even better, to avoid being discovered.","Zhang Xiyue: \"Let's go this weekend? Saturday?\"","Song Luokui: \"Hold on.\" Song Luokui immediately sent Zhou Yuan a message: \"Is my brother busy recently? Will he be home on Saturday?\"","Zhou Yuan: \"What's up? Has my sister been bullied by someone too?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, I'm just asking. My brother seems to be very busy recently, so I'm concerned about him.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Eldest brother has indeed been very busy recently, he probably can't go home this week. According to his schedule, he should be on a business trip abroad over the weekend. Xing Yan will go with Eldest Brother, I'll stay at home, call me if you need anything.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, you're busy, also let my brother know to eat properly and take care of himself.\"","\"OK.\"","Since her brother wouldn't be home on the weekend, then it was okay!","Song Luokui looked at Zhang Xiyue again: \"Saturday is fine, I'll book a private room right away.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Shanyue, Yueyue are also coming, and my roommate wants to come along to see men...cough, the world.\"","Zhang Xiyue looked at Wang Sisi and the others again, \"Do you guys want to come along too? To have fun?\"","Wang Sisi and her two friends' eyes lit up, \"Can we really come?\"","Everyone looked at Song Luokui, Song Luokui nodded, \"Of course you can come, you must come! I'll book a big private room.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Then it's settled! I'll drive there, do you want to drive too?\"","Song Luokui: \"I'll drive too!\"","Soon it was Saturday afternoon, a little after 5 pm, Song Luokui took her car keys and left home, \"Aunt Gui, I'm going out to play with my friends, I don't know if I'll come back tonight, if I do come back it will be very late, you guys don't have to wait for me.\"","Aunt Gui: \"Okay, have fun young miss.\"","Song Luokui drove the car Song Luosheng had gifted her to the dorm building, then sent Wang Sisi and the others a message. In a few minutes, the three of them came down.","Having seen a lot following her own boyfriend, Wang Sisi could tell with one look that Song Luokui’s car was expensive, and it was very comfortable to sit in.","Once everyone was seated, Song Luokui drove towards their destination, Unnamed Mountain Lake Store No. 1. Because they had embarrassed themselves at No. 7 last time, she had booked a room at another branch this time.","Unnamed Mountain Lake Store No. 1 was the flagship store, even more luxurious on the outside, with flashy cars parked around. When Song Luokui drove up, a doorman came over to help open the door. Song Luokui gave the valet her keys to go park the car, while the four of them headed inside first.","The lobby was also extremely ostentatious, the huge chandelier on the ceiling particularly dazzling, studded with many gems.","Song Luokui: \"You guys go sit first, let me ask if Xiyue and the others have arrived.\"","\"Hello? When will you get here? We're already here.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Wait two more minutes for me, I'll be there soon, you guys go in first.\"","\"Okay, hurry up.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","Song Luokui beckoned Wang Sisi and the others over, then followed the server to the private room. The four of them sat in the room as Song Luokui ordered food and drinks from the menu.","She swiftly ordered a bunch of food and drinks, which the server on the other end went to prepare right away.","Wang Sisi and her friends, on the other hand, were already looking around wide-eyed.","\"Oh my god, the chandelier in the lobby is so gorgeous!\" Su Ziyuan said.","Zhang Jingfeng: \"I wonder how much that chandelier costs.\"","Wang Sisi: \"At least a million to start.\"","\"Wow!\" Su Ziyuan and Zhang Jingfeng took a deep breath. \"Corruption! Corruption! The owner of this club must be so rich to decorate a club so lavishly.\"","Soon, the private room door opened and Zhang Xiyue came in with some people - Shanyue and Yueyue had come along too.","Song Luokui directly opened the \"Handsome Men List\" and handed it to Zhang Xiyue: \"Today is to comfort you, order whoever you want, it's on my tab!\"","Zhang Xiyue took it over, \"Luokui! You're my sister today! Sister Song!\"","Song Luokui then looked at the others again, \"Each of you can also order one person.\"","The others immediately started looking through the \"Handsome Men List\".","\"Wow, this one looks good, six pack abs!\"","\"This cute one looks pretty good to me.\"","\"No, this one looks too greasy.\"","\"Are there any middle-aged ones? I like the middle-aged ones.\"","\"I like younger ones, how about I order a younger one?\"","Meanwhile, Zhang Xiyue stared at the top entry. She smiled at Song Luokui as she pointed to the handsome man in the booklet and pleaded, \"Luokui~ I want this one! I won't order any others, I just want this one~\"","Song Luokui looked at where it said: Appearance fee starting from 1 million.","Song Luokui waved her hand grandly, \"Order him!\" Today was about making her sisters happy no matter what!","\"Ahhhh! I love you so much!\" Zhang Xiyue hugged Song Luokui.","Song Luokui said, \"Just remember not to be lovesick anymore after this, this million bucks will not have gone to waste.\"","Shanyue and Yueyue chimed in from the sides: \"What's with your brain, how could you fall for a scumbag like that? If I were you, I'd be dating ten or eight guys at once.\"","Zhang Xiyue was a dance student, tall and gorgeous, the campus belle of the dance academy. Countless male students pursued her, yet she ended up choosing this kind of man. Fortunately she has now seen the error of her ways.","Zhang Xiyue: \"From now on I must date ten or eight guys at once. Luokui, same for you, if I looked like you, I'd be dating a hundred guys at the same time!\"","Shanyue poked her on the forehead. \"Don't say that, I'm afraid those men will get beaten up by your brother!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"That's true, if Luokui started dating, her brother would have to approve first.\"","Yueyue: \"Eldest Brother is too outstanding, I don't know who could compare to him. Anyone not as good as Eldest Brother wouldn't be worthy of Luokui.\"","Shanyue lifted her chin. \"There is one, the other one from the Academy.\"","Song Luokui, from the side: \"Alright, are you guys still ordering or not?\"","\"Ordering!\"","Soon, food, drinks and the men they ordered all arrived. However, the top entertainer didn't show up. The manager himself came over to apologize: \"I'm so sorry ladies, Yu Tang has been booked out tonight. Can we have Yan Xing come keep you company instead? Drinks will be on the house tonight.\"","Zhang Xiyue immediately frowned. \"Can't we pay extra to get him? 2 million!\"","The manager hesitated, but still refused: \"I'm afraid that's not possible...\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"3 million!\" Zhang Xiyue held up three fingers.","On the side, Wang Sisi and her friends were already stunned speechless.","After the manager left, Zhang Xiyue's roommate Liang Yuhan gave her a hug. \"Ahhhh, rich lady, don't be so fixated on gender okay?\"","Zhang Xiyue pushed her away. \"Cough cough, I like men!\"","On the other side, the manager called Chen Nan."]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: I'm Hungry Now","paragraphs":["Chen Nan: \"Isn't Yutang supposed to be on a mission in Box A tonight?\"","Team Leader: \"The ladies over there insisted on having him, and they've already offered three million.\"","Chen Nan chuckled, \"Only three million? Decline them!\"","Team Leader: \"They are the young ladies from the Zhang family, as well as the young ladies from the Song, Zhou, and Tu families... It wouldn't be wise to offend them.\"","Chen Nan: \"Which Zhang family are you referring to?\"","Team Leader: \"The one from the same place as you, Young Master.\"","Chen Nan: \"...Is the one from the Song family named Song Luokui?\"","Team Leader: \"Indeed, Miss Song Luokui made the reservation for the private room.\"","Chen Nan: \"...Hold on a moment.\"","\"Alright, I'll wait.\"","Chen Nan hung up the phone, walked into the office, and said to Chi Yu, \"Do you remember when I told you about the incident with Song Luo Sheng's sister going to the police station?\"","Chi Yu immediately looked up.","Chen Nan continued, \"Now, the four of them are at Unnamed Mountain Lake Store No. 1, and they're planning to spend three million on Yutang. Yutang is supposed to gather information in Box A tonight. Moreover, they've also requested several men. What do you think... Should I inform their families?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"No need... Let Yutang go, but advise him to be polite. We'll send Yan Xing to Box A instead.\" With that, he stood up. \"You keep an eye on the Haicheng project. I'll go ahead.\"","Chen Nan: \"...Polite?\"","Chi Yu glanced at him, and Chen Nan quickly raised his hand, understanding the message. \"I got it, I got it. He will definitely be polite!\"","In the private room, they had been waiting for the responsible person for several minutes, but he still hadn't arrived. Zhang Xiyue said, \"Could something be wrong?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"If it doesn't work out, we can switch to Yan Xing. We can always come back next time.\"","Just as she finished speaking, a refined and elegant young man walked in. \"Hello, I'm Yutang.\"","Zhang Xiyue immediately tightened her grip on Song Luokui's hand. \"I must have been blind before. How could I have fallen for Qishen Yan? This young man is a thousand times better than him!\"","Song Luokui: ...","Zhang Xiyue patted the space between her and Song Luokui. \"Yutang, come sit over here.\"","Yutang glanced at Song Luokui, smiled gently, and walked over to sit on the right side of Zhang Xiyue. \"I'm sorry, sitting here might be better.\"","Zhang Xiyue looked at Song Luokui, who said, \"You go ahead and have fun. I'm not interested.\"","Zhang Xiyue waved to the other men. \"You, come over and accompany my sister! Remember, she's the goddess of wealth tonight.\"","The young man hesitated as he looked at Yutang. They had just received orders through their earpieces not to sit next to the most beautiful girl in the private room or engage in conversation with her.","Zhang Xiyue's face turned cold. \"What's wrong with you? Sit down!\"","Yutang said, \"Miss, don't be angry. He thought that the other girl is too beautiful and felt unworthy to sit beside her. I apologize for him.\"","Zhang Xiyue felt relieved upon hearing this. \"You're right, they're all not good enough.\" Zhang Xiyue then looked Yutang up and down. \"You're not that great either.\"","Yutang: ... The first time someone said he wasn't good enough.","Song Luokui waved her hand. \"I don't need it. Tonight, you're the main character.\"","Zhang Xiyue immediately leaned over and hugged her, saying, \"My Kui Kui is the best!\"","Soon, Zhang Xiyue was chatting and laughing with someone on his left and someone on his right. Everyone else was also having a great time. Meanwhile, Song Luokui was eating and drinking when her phone vibrated. She glanced at it and saw a message from Chi Yu: \"Are you at Unnamed Mountain Lake?\"","Song Luokui: *cough* *cough* *cough*! She almost choked and quickly grabbed a tissue to wipe her mouth and hands before replying, \"How did you know?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm at the entrance. I'm hungry now. Didn't you say you'll treat me to a meal?\"","Song Luokui looked at the lively crowd around her, got up, and quietly ran outside. As soon as she reached the gate of Unnamed Mountain Lake, she saw Chi Yu leaning against a car, typing on his phone. After a while, Song Luokui's phone vibrated again.","Song Luokui paused her steps and then slowly walked over. When Chi Yu noticed her, he looked up, and the two locked eyes.","Song Luokui immediately shifted her gaze and pressed her hand against her lips. \"Uh, um...\"","Damn it! Why did she suddenly feel a bit guilty? He's not her brother!","Chi Yu: \"Hmm?\" Chi Yu waited for her response.","Song Luokui put her hand behind her back, intertwining her fingers. \"Um... Is it too late for you to have dinner?\"","Chi Yu: \"Hmm, I'm waiting for you to treat me.\"","Song Luokui pointed behind her. \"Um... Can we do it tomorrow? I have something to do right now.\"","Chi Yu tightened his grip on his phone. \"Something to do? Is it hanging out with those guys?\"","Song Luokui laughed awkwardly. \"Haha... No, it's just that my sister had a breakup, so I brought her here to relax.\"","Chi Yu: \"Let her relax. How about you and I go for a meal together? If you want to play with men, why not play with me?\"","\"What?\" Song Luokui took a step back, doubting if she had misheard him. \"What did you say?\" Song Luokui's face was filled with disbelief.","Chi Yu looked at her retreating steps, his eyes dark. \"It's nothing. When will you be done?\"","Song Luokui: ...So she did misunderstand.","\"Well, I'm not sure when it will end. At the latest, it should be after ten o'clock.\" She was worried that the others would go back to the dormitory. If she didn't go back, it would be even later.","Chi Yu: \"Then I'll wait for you until eleven.\"","Song Luokui immediately waved her hand. \"No need, you can go eat first.\" Just then, her phone rang. It was Zhang Xiyue calling her. \"Kui Kui, where are you?\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah, I'm in the restroom. I'll be back soon.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Hurry back. We're having a great time here.\"","\"Okay.\"","After hanging up the phone, Zhang Xiyue muttered, \"The private room has a restroom. Why did she go outside?\" But she quickly dismissed the thought because the guy next to her just told her a joke that cracked her up.","Song Luokui immediately bid farewell to Chi Yu, saying, \"I have to go back now. You should go eat. I'll treat you to a meal tomorrow.\" After speaking, she walked back.","Chi Yu stood there and watched her go inside. Even after she disappeared, he continued to stand there. It's unclear how long it took, but he finally returned to the driver's seat and sat there.","Song Luokui quickly returned to her room, and Zhang Xiyue immediately waved at her, saying, \"You're finally back. I thought you fell into the toilet or something.\" She handed her a microphone and said, \"Come on, let's sing! Let's do a duet of 'Cheap Men.'\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" In the end, she reluctantly joined in and sang along. Tu Shanyue, Zhou Yue, and the others beside them cheered.","As for those male models, they were all well-trained and enthusiastically applauded. The millions spent on them were well worth it.","In a corner, Wang Sisi sent a video to her boyfriend, Lin Cheng. Lin Cheng on the other side: \"???\"","Lin Cheng: \"!!! Don't hang out with those guys!\"","Lin Cheng: \"Where are you? I'll come pick you up in a bit.\"","Lin Cheng: \"Which place? I'm on my way now.\"","Wang Sisi took a long time to reply: \"Don't come, I'm not hanging out with those guys. I'm just out with my girlfriends to broaden my horizons. By the way, my friend Luokui hired a male model for three million yuan. I finally understand the joy of being a wealthy woman!\"","Wang Sisi: \"You know, girls also have social engagements, you know?\"","Lin Cheng: \"!!! Does Song senior not know? Which club? I won't go in, I'll wait for you outside.\"","Wang Sisi: \"Unnamed Mountain Lake Store No. 1, I think that's the name. I'll send you the location.\" [Location]","Lin Cheng: \"I'll be there soon.\"","Wang Sisi no longer paid attention to him and continued dancing with everyone else."]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: Have you been waiting outside","paragraphs":["Inside the private room, there was a lively atmosphere. Outside, Chi Yu sat in his car, with a laptop on his lap and slender fingers tapping on the keyboard. He was wearing headphones and working.","Meanwhile, Lin Cheng quickly arrived at the Unnamed Mountain Lake Store No. 1. Initially, he had intended to go inside, but upon further thought, he decided against it. His girlfriend was right—girls also needed socializing.","Lin Cheng waited outside, sitting in the driver's seat. He looked around and suddenly felt a sense of familiarity with the car in front of him. Upon closer inspection of the rearview mirror, he saw someone sitting in the driver's seat.","Oh my god! It's Chi Yu! He's actually here!","Lin Cheng saw this as an opportunity to get to know Chi Yu better. Although they had met before, Chi Yu probably didn't remember him since important people tend to forget things easily. Lin Cheng could seize this chance to say hello again.","He got out of the car and approached Chi Yu. As soon as Chi Yu heard a voice, he looked up and saw Lin Cheng. His memory was good; he had seen this person before. He was probably the boyfriend of her roommate.","\"Hello, Chi Yu,\" Lin Cheng greeted immediately. \"I didn't expect to see you here. Are you here to have fun? Or perhaps for business?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"No, I'm waiting for someone.\"","\"Oh, I see,\" Lin Cheng responded. \"What a coincidence! I'm also waiting for someone—my girlfriend. She and her roommate are inside playing. Although I wanted to go in, they're all girls, and I don't want to go against my girlfriend's wishes. By the way, Miss Song seems to be inside too...\"","As Lin Cheng said this, he paused, recalling the scene he had witnessed earlier. Could it be...no way...","After hesitating for a moment, Lin Cheng asked, \"Chi Yu, are you waiting for Sister Song?\"","Chi Yu nodded.","Lin Cheng's heart raced. Oh my god! He heard something! Ahhh!","Taking a deep breath, Lin Cheng said, \"Haha, what a coincidence. I'll go back then. I'll be over there, so if you need anything, just let me know.\"","Chi Yu suddenly called out to him, \"Wait, let's exchange contact information.\"","Lin Cheng replied, \"Huh?\"","Back in the car, Lin Cheng still couldn't believe it. He had actually added Chi Yu's personal messaging account! But why did Chi Yu add him? Lin Cheng suddenly looked towards the club. So...was it for Sister Song?","Inside the private room, Zhang Xiyue had drunk a lot and was already drunk. The others had also had some drinks, but Song Luokui, who knew her alcohol tolerance, only had non-alcoholic beverages. It was getting late, around ten o'clock, and she was thinking about how to take all of them back.","She briefly considered asking Zhou Yuan to come over, but immediately dismissed the idea. What would Zhou Yuan say to her brother?","\"If Miss Song doesn't know how to take her friends back, there are rooms upstairs where they can rest for the night. It's absolutely safe and quiet,\" Yu Tang suggested.","Song Luokui looked at her friends, who were swaying and stumbling, and accepted the suggestion. \"Okay, help me bring them up.\"","After settling everyone in, Song Luokui hesitated whether to stay or drive back home. Yu Tang, who was standing at the door, told her, \"Miss Song, someone is waiting for you outside.\"","Song Luokui: ?","Ah!","She wondered who it could be. Suddenly, she thought of Chi Yu. Could he still be waiting?!","Song Luokui immediately rushed out in a panic. As she went outside, she saw that Chi Yu's car was indeed still there. The driver's window was open, and she could see Chi Yu working on his computer.","When Chi Yu saw Song Luokui approaching, he raised his head and saw her. \"Is it over? Can we go eat now?\"","Song Luokui lowered her head and suddenly felt a twinge of guilt. \"...You've been waiting outside?\" She felt guilty for a second, but then shook it off. Guilty about what? Forgetting the song she sang tonight, \"Despicable Man\"? Besides, it wasn't her who asked him to wait.","Most importantly, Chi Yu was the enemy! Enemy! Enemy! Her mind emphasized it three times. She looked up at Chi Yu, then quickly lowered her head again. Damn it! She couldn't look at his face. Looking at him would only make her feel guilty.","Chi Yu: \"No, I was working.\"","Song Luokui muttered softly, \"Liar... Never mind, since we want to eat, there probably isn't any restaurant open at this late hour. Let me take you for a late-night snack.\"","Song Luokui prepared to get into his car. After all, she owed him a favor, so she should be polite. Once she repaid the favor, she wouldn't need to pay attention to him anymore.","Just as she was about to open the car door, someone suddenly ran over from the other side. \"Junior Sister Song, sorry to bother you. I wanted to ask about my sister...\"","Lin Cheng was already feeling a bit tired from waiting. He was about to fall asleep when he startled awake and saw Junior Sister Song standing in front of Senior Brother Chi Yu's car. The two of them were talking about something. As expected!!! Senior Brother Chi Yu was waiting for Junior Sister Song!","He leaned over in the driver's seat, trying to eavesdrop. Although he couldn't hear what they were saying, he had a feeling that their relationship was not as unfamiliar as Junior Sister Song had previously claimed!","Soon he saw Junior Sister Song getting ready to get into Senior Brother Chi Yu's car. He immediately ran over because his girlfriend still hadn't come out.","Song Luokui didn't expect Lin Cheng to be here too, and he even saw her about to get into Chi Yu's car...","Song Luokui: \"...Sisi is resting in a room at the club. Don't worry, it's safe here. Do you really have to take her back?\"","Lin Cheng scratched his head. \"I'll take her back.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Okay, I'll have someone take you there.\"","At that moment, Chi Yu spoke up, \"I'll have someone come out to take him in.\" Chi Yu made a phone call, and soon Yu Tang came out. Song Luokui looked at Yu Tang and then at Chi Yu.","\"You...\"","Chi Yu said, \"He's my partner here. Let's go, where do you want to eat?\" Chi Yu started the car. \"By the way, don't worry, I won't let him spill anything.\"","Song Luokui: \"Um, thank you.\" How did he know she didn't want anyone to find out?","\"Let's go to Fat Uncle Barbecue Stall,\" Song Luokui shared her location and then looked at the suit Chi Yu was wearing. \"Hmm... Can you eat at a barbecue stall?\"","Mainly because she couldn't imagine Chi Yu, a wealthy young man, eating at a barbecue stall.","Chi Yu: \"Sure.\" Chi Yu turned his head to glance at Song Luokui and then looked back at the road. \"I've eaten at a barbecue stall before.\"","Song Luokui: \"That's good.\"","The two of them arrived quickly. Although it was late, there were still many people, all here for supper, and the air was filled with the aroma of grilled food.","They sat down at an empty table. Song Luokui handed him the menu. \"You can order.\"","Chi Yu glanced at it. \"Do you eat chives?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yes, I do.\"","\"What about lamb skewers?\"","\"I eat them. No, wait, you can order whatever you like. I'm fine with anything.\" It was clearly her treat, so why was he asking her?"]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: Enemy Enemy Enemy","paragraphs":["In the end, Chi Yu ordered chives, lamb skewers, stir-fried clams, and more, as well as some drinks.","Song Luokui had already eaten at the club, but she still accompanied him in eating a little.","Song Luokui thought Chi Yu might not be used to it, but unexpectedly, he ate very quickly. His mouth was flushed red, perhaps from the spiciness. Song Luokui glanced at him and immediately lowered her head, as his masculine charms were captivating.","In her heart, a little white person was fighting a little black person, with the little white person shouting loudly: \"That's the enemy! Enemy! Enemy!\"","Song Luokui didn't dare look at him again, instead letting her gaze wander to some people nearby. There was a married couple eating, a group of men eating and chatting, and some other men and women eating together, with a rich sense of everyday life.","Song Luokui turned to look at the stalls, where the boss was busily working...","Suddenly, there was a loud \"crash!\" as a bottle was smashed on the ground. Song Luokui was startled, and when she turned to look, she saw that one group of men and another group of men and women had started fighting.","The two groups were throwing tables and bottles at each other, shouting curses that Song Luokui couldn't make out.","Suddenly, a bottle was thrown in their direction. Song Luokui immediately hugged her head, while Chi Yu swiftly pulled her into his embrace, shielding her as the bottle smashed next to them.","Song Luokui looked up at Chi Yu, then at the broken bottle behind him, relieved that no one was hit. Chi Yu stood up and pulled her aside to a safe area, took out his phone, and dialed 110: \"Hello, there are people fighting here, the address is XXX.\"","After the call, their table had been overturned too, and the other onlookers had also run outside to avoid getting caught up in it.","Chi Yu: \"Don't be afraid, the police will be here soon.\"","In less than two minutes, the police indeed arrived and took control of the fighting groups.","Song Luokui quickly helped tidy up the tables, and then paid the bill. The boss gave her a box of barbecue and drinks, \"Sorry about that, and thank you.\"","Song Luokui handed the barbecue to Chi Yu: \"Weren't you still hungry? Here, have this.\"","As Chi Yu took it, Song Luokui noticed scars on his hand. She immediately grabbed his hand, and there were shards of glass in the wound, which she realized must have been from when the bottle smashed on the ground.","\"You're hurt?\" She asked, then pulled him towards the car parked on the side of the road. \"Is there a first aid kit in the car?\"","Chi Yu didn't say anything, just looking at their joined hands.","Song Luokui opened the car door and released Chi Yu's hand, ready to search for the first aid kit, but then realized it wasn't her car. She turned and asked, \"Where's the first aid kit?\"","Only then did Chi Yu respond, \"In the trunk.\"","Song Luokui went to the trunk, \"You get in the car first, I'll bandage you up in a bit.\"","Chi Yu obediently got in.","Soon, Song Luokui returned with the first aid kit and sat in the passenger seat. Chi Yu immediately extended his hand. Song Luokui first removed the glass shards with tweezers, then cleaned the wound with iodine, asking, \"Does it hurt? Tell me if it hurts.\"","Chi Yu's eyes never left her face. \"It doesn't hurt.\"","After disinfecting with iodine, Song Luokui applied bandages over the two wounds.","\"All done.\" As she looked up, her eyes met Chi Yu's, and she could clearly see her reflection in his eyes.","Song Luokui abruptly released Chi Yu's hand, put away the first aid kit, and cleared her throat. \"Ahem, we can go now. Do you need me to drive?\"","Chi Yu also turned back in his seat. \"No need, I'll drive. Back home?\"","\"Yeah.\" Song Luokui calmly fastened her seatbelt, while the little white person inside her was shouting: \"When did your relationship become so close?\"","\"Wasn't that too intimate just now?\"","\"He's the enemy! Keep your distance! You're not on the same team!\"","\"No more meals together from now on! Even if you need to repay a favor, you don't have to treat him to a meal! You can just give him a gift instead!\"","On the way home, Song Luokui's expression was cold, with a furrowed brow and not a word spoken. Chi Yu glanced at her a few times, wondering why she seemed displeased but didn't dare ask. He dropped her off at home, and as Song Luokui closed the car door and walked a few steps, she paused and turned to say, \"Thank you,\" before entering the house.","Chi Yu stayed in the car for a while, took out his phone, and messaged her: \"Did I upset you somehow?\"","Seeing the message, Song Luokui sprawled on the couch. It wasn't that he had upset her – it was that she suddenly felt they should keep their distance since they weren't on the same team. Her brother was still quite important to her.","Song Luokui didn't reply, silencing her phone before showering and going to bed.","Chi Yu, not receiving a response, eventually went home.","The next day at noon, Chi Yu messaged Song Luokui again: \"Dinner together tonight?\"","Song Luokui hesitated before replying: \"I'm not upset.\"","\"Sorry, I'm not free tonight.\"","The first line was in response to the previous night, and the second was declining his dinner invitation.","Seeing the reply, Chi Yu walked to the window, looking out at the busy traffic. Chen Nan entered, \"Boss, the meeting with Jin Xun is about to start.\"","Chi Yu glanced at his phone. \"Got it, you go ahead.\"","As Chen Nan was leaving, Chi Yu called him back. \"Wait, Nan, why would someone be upset for no reason?\"","Chen Nan was puzzled. \"Huh? Who's upset? A man or a woman? There are plenty of reasons they could be upset.\"","Chi Yu: \"A woman.\"","Chen Nan: \"Oh, a woman? Huh, a woman?\" Chen Nan stared at Chi Yu in surprise. \"Is it Auntie?\"","Chi Yu: \"Never mind who it is.\"","Chen Nan scratched his head. \"In that case, I don't know. If it were my mom, she might be going through menopause or got upset after comparing herself to other wealthy ladies and losing. Or maybe my dad upset her.\"","Chi Yu: \"It's a young woman...\"","Chen Nan: \"...In that case, I'm not sure. Online it says they could be on their period, or maybe they didn't get something they wanted, or ran into someone they don't like. Lots of reasons really. But to cheer them up, usually a milk tea or a gift works. If it's period-related, they probably just need some care and attention until it passes.\"","Chen Nan: \"Boss, who are you trying to cheer up? Maybe I can offer some advice, tailor it to the situation!\"","Chi Yu gave him a sidelong glance. \"No need. Go investigate the CEO of An Sheng Group instead. That would be useful.\"","\"Got it.\""]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: Go to S Market","paragraphs":["Chi Yu looked at the chat window with Song Luokui and then started searching on his computer browser: How to comfort a girl on her period?","Soon, many methods appeared, and Chi Yu read through them one by one. It wasn't long before Chi Yu downloaded a delivery app and placed an order.","Meanwhile, Song Luokui was doing her homework in the dorm. She didn't have classes in the afternoon, so she actually had free time today, but she didn't want to accept Chi Yu's invitation to eat together and owe him a favor, so she directly declined.","However, shortly after, her phone rang with ten delivery calls. Song Luokui was a little puzzled as she answered: \"Hello?\"","She hadn't ordered any delivery, and the school's deliveries were usually left at the campus delivery station.","\"Hello, your order has arrived.\"","Song Luokui: \"Huh? What order? I didn't place any order.\"","Delivery person: \"Someone ordered it for you. Your phone number is XXX, right?\"","\"Yes.\" Song Luokui stood up and walked to the balcony, seeing the delivery person in a yellow uniform downstairs.","Delivery person: \"Then it's for you. I'm downstairs at your dorm building.\"","Although puzzled, Song Luokui went downstairs. The delivery person handed her an exquisite box: \"Please give me a good rating.\" Then they left.","Song Luokui found the box familiar, wondering if it was delivered to the wrong address. Back in her dorm, she suddenly realized it was the box from the restaurant she and Chi Yu often went to for meals. She had seen it at the front desk before.","Song Luokui opened the box to find brown sugar water and some blood-replenishing foods inside.","Song Luokui: ???","She sent Chi Yu three question marks, certain that he was the one who sent it. And why did he think she was on her period? Even if she was, why would he send her brown sugar water? He wasn't her significant other or anything.","Chi Yu quickly replied: \"How are you feeling? Better?\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm feeling fine...\"","Sitting in his office, Chi Yu couldn't help but cover his face. \"Sorry, I thought you were upset because of that.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\"","Chi Yu: \"My apologies.\"","Song Luokui: \"You don't need to apologize to me.\"","After sending that, Song Luokui felt her tone and attitude weren't very good, and he was just being considerate...she seemed a little ungrateful.","Although Song Luokui's eyes were on her book, she wasn't focused. She looked at the chat record again, thinking about how the usually aloof and decisive Chi Yu had actually said \"sorry\" to her.","Song Luokui sighed, \"Never mind, forget it.\"","In the end, she looked at the exquisite box and decided not to waste the food, so she ate it. It was quite delicious.","However, she later transferred the money for it to Chi Yu.","Chi Yu didn't want to accept it, so he returned the transfer. But Song Luokui sent it again, saying, \"Take it!\"","Chi Yu: \"Oh.\"","And he accepted it immediately.","Chi Yu's gesture of sending her a gift inspired Song Luokui. Recalling the package he had mailed her from abroad previously, she felt she could return the favor in a similar way.","That Saturday, Zhang Xiyue, who had just become single again, came to visit her. \"Kuikui, how about a spontaneous trip?\"","Song Luokui: \"Huh? Where to?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"To S City, to hang out with our girlfriends. Isn't Cheng Wu studying at a university in S City? I'll go see her. She says S City is quite fun. Let's go, let's go! We'll leave tonight and be back tomorrow night, so it won't interfere with classes.\"","Since she had nothing else to do, Song Luokui decided to join.","That evening, the two flew to S City, arriving within a couple of hours.","Song Luosheng had just returned home but found Song Luokui wasn't there. \"Auntie Gui, where's Kuikui?\"","Auntie Gui: \"The young lady went to S City with Miss Zhang to visit friends.\"","Song Luosheng slumped onto the sofa. \"She's living the good life.\" He started peeling an orange.","Auntie Gui: \"The young lady said she would buy gifts for the young master.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Not a waste of my pampering her.\" He took out his phone and transferred a large sum of money to Song Luokui.","Song Luokui quickly received it and sent a heart emoji back.","Song Luosheng: \"I'll be waiting for my gift.\"","Song Luokui: \"No problem.\"","In S City","Song Luokui and Zhang Xiyue checked into a luxurious hotel. Standing at the floor-to-ceiling windows of the 40th-floor presidential suite, they had a view of S City's iconic landmarks and the city's nightscape, which looked quite beautiful.","Cheng Wu soon arrived after learning they were in town. As soon as she entered, she hugged them both, \"Ahhh! Long time no see!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"What do you mean long time no see? We just saw each other during the break.\"","Cheng Wu: \"Well, a day without seeing you feels like three autumns.\" She then hugged Song Luokui. \"Wuwuwu, Kuikui is so fragrant and soft. I want to sleep with Kuikui tonight.\"","Zhang Xiyue pulled her away. \"No way, I'll sleep with Kuikui.\" She hugged Song Luokui.","Cheng Wu: \"I want to sleep with Kuikui too.\"","Song Luokui: \"We'll all sleep together!\"","Cheng Wu snapped her fingers. \"It's settled then! Come, let me show you the good food and nightlife in S City.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Let's go, I can't wait!\"","...","Under Cheng Wu's guidance, Song Luokui and Zhang Xiyue had a wild time in S City. Since their flight back was at 7 PM the next day, they went shopping at S City's famous mall in the afternoon to buy gifts for their families.","Of course, Song Luokui didn't forget her brother's gift. She picked out the latest luxury watch model and some ties. As for food, everyone had some.","As they passed a men's fragrance store, Song Luokui suddenly stopped. This was perfect timing to return the favor! She went in and bought a bottle of cologne. Zhang Xiyue thought she was buying it for Song Luosheng.","Later, Song Luokui felt that the gift Chi Yu had sent her was too expensive, and her current gifts didn't adequately return the favor. So while Zhang Xiyue went to the restroom during check-in, Song Luokui went to a luxury goods store and bought another watch.","They had bought so many things that they couldn't carry them all back, so most were shipped directly.","For this, Song Luokui even opened her chat with Chi Yu to find the new company address he had previously sent her.","That evening, after returning to Jing City, Song Luosheng came to pick them up. \"Did you buy me gifts?\"","Song Luokui: \"I did, I'll give them to you when we get home.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Kuikui bought a lot. You'll see when we get back, Big Brother. Some of it, we shipped directly, so it hasn't arrived yet.\"","Song Luosheng: \"As long as you remembered.\"","Within a couple of days, the packages arrived. Chi Yu also received a package from S City and was wondering about it when Song Luokui's message came through: \"You got the package, right? It's for you, as a return gift for what you sent me before.\"","Chi Yu didn't expect it was from her. He quickly opened it to find, in addition to some S City specialties, a men's cologne and a watch.","Chi Yu quickly replied: \"Yes, received. Thank you.\" She shouldn't be angry anymore."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: The Favor Is Over","paragraphs":["Chi Yu was thinking about inviting Song Luokui out for a meal again when he had time, but just a few days later, he received another gift from Song Luokui - an expensive tea set and figurines.","Song Luokui: \"Sorry, I haven't had time to take you out for a meal recently. Consider this a treat on me.\"","Chi Yu immediately understood. He stared at the tea set and figurines without saying a word for a long time, then called Song Luokui directly.","\"Hello?\" Song Luokui answered casually.","Chi Yu didn't speak right away.","\"Hello?\" Song Luokui called out again, then looked at the caller ID - Chi Yu?","\"Chi Yu?\" Song Luokui lowered her eyelids, not sure what she was thinking.","Chi Yu finally spoke, his voice a bit hoarse: \"Are you... still mad at me?\"","Song Luokui: \"Huh? No, I'm not mad.\" She wasn't angry, but she was quite conflicted, and why did Chi Yu always think she was angry?","Chi Yu: \"Then... when do you have time to take me out for a meal?\" Chi Yu fiddled with the figurine as he spoke. The figurines Song Luokui gave him were a full set of national fighter jet models. If it wasn't about \"taking him out for a meal\", he would probably be delighted.","Song Luokui was also fiddling with the succulent she was raising. \"I'm... not very free recently.\"","There was silence on the other end for a while. Song Luokui felt a bit guilty and took a deep breath. \"How about... next week, next Friday night.\"","The last time!","Chi Yu: \"Okay.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'll book the restaurant. I'll send you the details later.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mmhmm. I'll come pick you up then.\"","Song Luokui: \"No need, I'll drive myself.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay.\"","After hanging up, Chi Yu put the figurines away and took them home, but he left the tea set at the office.","Meanwhile, Song Luokui lay on the table and sighed. Just yesterday, she overheard her brother Song Luosheng on the phone, apparently a project had been snatched away, and she vaguely heard Chi Yu's name mentioned. She figured the two companies might be competing in the business arena.","She couldn't very well tell her brother Song Luosheng not to compete with the male lead. A company's survival depends on competing with others - she could only keep an eye on her brother and make sure he didn't become psychologically twisted if he failed.","As for herself, she should just save up money. Maybe if her brother failed in the business arena in the future, she could fund his comeback!","But she really couldn't go out for meals with Chi Yu anymore. This would be the last time to return the favor.","Soon, the agreed-upon time arrived. As soon as classes ended on Friday, Song Luokui drove to the place she had booked, and to return the favor, she even booked an especially expensive restaurant.","When she arrived, she didn't expect Chi Yu to already be there. \"Sorry, I'm late.\"","Chi Yu: \"No, I just got here too.\"","Song Luokui: \"You order first.\"","Chi Yu ordered two dishes and handed her the menu. Song Luokui simply ordered all the signature dishes.","The dishes soon arrived one by one, each a small portion but exorbitantly priced. The cheapest dish was just a plate of boiled cabbage.","After the meal, Chi Yu suddenly took out a box and handed it to her. \"This is a thank-you gift for the presents you gave me before.\"","Song Luokui paused, not taking it. She looked at Chi Yu, and he was looking at her too.","Song Luokui pushed the gift box back. \"No need, I don't want to owe you any more favors.\"","Chi Yu's eyelids lowered. \"So... you took me out to return a favor? And you sent me gifts to return a favor too? Everything was just to return favors?\" Chi Yu looked straight at Song Luokui. He set the gift box aside. \"Then tell me, what favors did you owe me?\"","Song Luokui counted on her fingers: \"That time you helped me when I was being harassed, the sponsorship for Sisi, and the gifts you sent me from Country F before.\" It seemed like there were quite a few times, she'd even forgotten some.","Chi Yu: \"If we're counting, then you missed one - the incident in Country A. You still need to treat me to another meal.\"","Song Luokui thought about it, and realized he was right. She looked up at Chi Yu, but immediately lowered her gaze when she saw he was still watching her. \"Then I'll just get you another gift instead of a meal.\"","Chi Yu simply looked at her without responding.","Song Luokui didn't dare look up and just played with her fingers.","Suddenly, Chi Yu stood up. \"No need. You don't have to return anything.\"","Song Luokui: \"I have to, I need to return the favor.\"","Chi Yu took a deep breath. \"Sorry, I said you don't need to. I have something to take care of, I'll leave first.\"","Song Luokui immediately stood up too. \"Hey? Wait a minute.\"","Chi Yu paused.","Song Luokui: \"You forgot to take your box.\"","Chi Yu clenched and unclenched his fist. \"Don't want it.\"","Song Luokui chased after him and tried to hand him the box. \"You can't not take it, that would be wasteful.\"","Chi Yu looked her straight in the eye. \"Why do we have to keep such clear accounts?\"","This time, Song Luokui didn't avoid his gaze. \"Because I'm Song Luosheng's sister. I won't be friends with you.\"","Chi Yu: \"...Does that matter?\"","Song Luokui: \"It does. We should be considered enemies, not friends. Thank you for your help before, I'll send you one last gift to return the final favor. We shouldn't go out for meals together anymore. I'm afraid my brother will find out.\"","Song Luokui stuffed the box into his arms, nodded at him, and left.","She did as she said and immediately went shopping, instructing someone to deliver the gifts directly to Mountain Corporation the next day. Now she had returned all favors owed.","Song Luokui breathed a sigh of relief. From now on, she wouldn't feel guilty when facing her brother.","On the other side, Chi Yu took the gift box and drove out of the city until he reached Jinming Mountain on the outskirts. This place was used for illegal street racing at night, and when Chi Yu arrived, he immediately pushed his car's speed to the extreme.","He kept thinking about what Song Luokui had said: \"I won't be friends with you.\"","There happened to be a street racing competition going on at Jinming Mountain, with many spectators lining the roads. Drones were livestreaming the race as two cars sped along, chasing each other through the mountain's eighteen hairpin turns. One wrong move and they could crash into the mountainside or plunge off a cliff - that was the thrill!","Suddenly, a black car appeared in the livestream footage, lagging behind. The viewers were puzzled. \"Whose car is that? How did it get up here?\"","\"Damn! It's so fast!\"","The black car quickly caught up to the white and yellow sports cars in front. After navigating the twists and turns, the black car took the lead with a drift maneuver, overtaking both other cars to take first place!","The drivers of the white and yellow cars were stunned. Where had that car come from?","The person controlling the drone quickly moved to film the driver's face. On the screen appeared a man in a black suit with refined, noble features. Suddenly, the man turned to look straight at the drone camera, his gaze filled with cold disdain.","The drone operator was startled, causing the drone to wobble for a moment.","The black car suddenly accelerated, rolling up its windows. Soon, it reached the mountaintop and descended from another direction.","The spectators were equally dumbfounded. Two sports cars couldn't even beat a sedan? Just what car was that? More importantly, who was the person driving it to be so skilled?"]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: War of Commerce and Billiards","paragraphs":["During Monday's work, Chi Yu received another package in his office, but he didn't open it, just placing them in a cabinet.","Chen Nan entered, \"Boss, the deployment in Ancheng has been completed. We need your signature to proceed.\" Chen Nan handed him a document, \"Also, Chen, the boss of JinXun, is caught up in a sex scandal and other serious negative public opinions. He's temporarily suppressed. If exposed, it might affect JinXun, and he's asking for our help.\"","Chi Yu glanced at the information for two pages, sarcastically smiling, \"Acquire his shares. If he refuses, tell him we'll deliver the evidence to his wife. Oh, and remember to report it to the police afterward.\"","Chen Nan: \"I'll go right away... Oh, almost forgot. This is about Songhua Technology preparing to release a new product. It has some similarities with ours. If they release it before us, people might accuse us of plagiarism. Song Luosheng will likely deploy a cyber army against us.\"","Chi Yu, upon hearing Song Luosheng's name, immediately thought of what Song Luokui said last night: \"Because I'm Song Luosheng's sister, I won't be friends with you.\"","Chi Yu: \"Why are they somewhat similar? Information leak?\"","Chen Nan: \"No, the investigation shows it's accidental. Our designer's ideas coincided with theirs.\"","Chi Yu: \"When do they launch?\"","Chen Nan: \"In a week, precisely next Monday.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then we'll release on Sunday.\"","Chen Nan: \"Good, I'll inform the team.\"","On Song Luokui's side, having resolved one matter, she faced Song Luosheng with indifference. However, Song Luosheng was busy, dealing with the growing company and numerous matters. Song Luokui could even see him on the phone or in video conferences when he came home.","One night, when Song Luokui got up to drink water, she surprisingly saw the study's light on. Song Luosheng was inside, seemingly having a meeting with overseas personnel.","Thinking of her brother working so hard to earn money, and considering the hostile relationship between Song Luosheng and Chi Yu, Song Luokui felt her actions were right. She's Song Luosheng's sister; she should be aligned with him externally. How could she have relations with the enemy?","Moreover, on her birthday this year, Song Luosheng directly gifted her a set of houses. This meant a portion of the money he earned was for her. If her brother knew she was dining with the enemy, it would be heartbreaking.","The more Song Luokui thought about it, the more convinced she was right.","Soon, the weekend arrived, and Song Luosheng finally had some time to rest at home. Song Luokui had breakfast with him, and with Song Moqian and Sheng Rong also at home, she suggested having a meal together with grandparents.","Everyone agreed, and Song Luosheng was about to book a private room when Lin Xingyan suddenly called, \"Boss! Shan Yu Group has just released their product, and it has some similar features to ours.\"","\"What?\" Song Luosheng immediately stood up. \"Compile detailed information and have everyone come to the company for an immediate meeting.\"","\"Yes.\"","Song Luokui and Sheng Rong exchanged glances, unsure of what was happening.","Watching Song Luosheng rush out, Song Luokui put down the oranges in her hand and whispered, \"So... are we still eating?\"","Sheng Rong replied, \"Your brother's company must have something urgent. We probably can't eat tonight, let's wait until next time.\" Then she instructed Aunt Gui, \"Aunt Gui, prepare something delicious and have Uncle Kang deliver it to Luosheng later.\"","\"Okay, Madam.\"","Song Luokui, curious about what Song Luosheng had just heard about product releases, immediately searched online for information.","She quickly came across an article: \"Shan Yu Group Releases New Product Ahead of Schedule, Songhua Technology Slightly Behind?\"","The article introduced Shan Yu Group's new product and mentioned insider information claiming that Songhua Technology's new product, scheduled for release on Monday, shared some similarities with Shan Yu Group's. The article remained neutral, expressing confusion about which side was copying whom, but noted that since Shan Yu Group had released first, Songhua Technology was at a disadvantage.","Song Luosheng soon arrived at the company and, after discussing with everyone, decided to proceed with the product launch on Monday.","As for the rest, they would face the challenges as they come.","That day, as Song Luokui returned home from school, she noticed a car entering the compound at the same time. It belonged to Chi Yu, but he wasn't in the driver's seat; instead, a chauffeur was. The windows were tightly shut, and Song Luokui couldn't see anyone inside.","Nevertheless, she immediately turned to take another path home. She knew it was childish, but with her brother's recent busy schedule, she felt a surge of resentment towards Chi Yu.","She understood that the business world was ever-changing, and competition through legitimate means was allowed, even beneficial for strengthening companies.","Understanding was one thing, but resentment was another. After all, she was only human and prone to bias.","Chi Yu in the car glanced at her retreating figure before lowering his head to focus on the computer screen.","Song Luokui thought she wouldn't have any more interactions with Chi Yu. Once Song Luosheng had finished dealing with the product launch, he finally found some free time and decided it had been a while since they'd had fun. So, he took Song Luokui and his brothers to the Billiards Club to play.","Song Luokui had never played billiards before and initially watched Song Luosheng and the others play while she sat on the side, sipping her drink, feeling a bit bored. Eventually, she moved to another table to try playing herself.","Zhou Yuan ran over. \"Sister, let me teach you how to play. You don't know how, right?\"","Song Luokui nodded. \"Yeah, I don't.\" It was her first time playing.","Zhou Yuan stood behind her, \"You can't lean like that. It should be like this... the posture should be like this, no, it's like this.\" Zhou Yuan helped her adjust her posture. Actually, Zhou Yuan was a bit cautious, his hand did touch hers, but their positions weren't too intimate.","It was just a normal teaching gesture, but it didn't look that way to others.","At this moment, Chi Yu was standing on the second floor, looking down through the glass, his eyes fixed on Zhou Yuan's hand placed on Song Luokui's hand.","As Song Luokui followed Zhou Yuan's guidance and finally got the ball into the basket, she happily high-fived Zhou Yuan and then continued playing.","With a \"snap,\" the cup in Chi Yu's hand was directly crushed by him, his hand covered in blood. Suddenly, a violent and terrifying aura spread in Chi Yu's eyes, but it was quickly suppressed.","While playing, Song Luokui always felt like someone was watching her. She looked up at the second floor but didn't see anything. The glass on the second floor was too dark to see inside.","Song Luokui felt like she might be overreacting.","Before long, Zhang Xiyue and Zhou Yue also came over to learn with Zhou Yuan. The group played together, celebrating with high fives whenever the ball went into the basket. They were all quite happy.","However, the happiness didn't last long. Song Luokui heard her phone vibrating and ran over to check. It was a message from Chi Yu."]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: I Will Teach You","paragraphs":["Chi Yu: \"Playing pool?\"","The first thought that crossed Song Luokui's mind when she saw this message was how did he know? Was she being watched? Song Luokui looked around, but there was no one else besides their people.","Just as she was about to ask Chi Yu, Song Luosheng walked over, \"Kuikui, come here, let me teach you how to play.\"","Song Luokui was startled and quickly put her phone on silent and into her bag. \"Zhou Yuan just taught me. I already know how to play.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Then let's play a game.\"","Song Luokui picked up a cue, \"You'll have to go easy on me.\"","\"No problem, I'll definitely let you win.\"","On the other side, Chi Yu, who was sitting on a chair, grew impatient after waiting for her response for too long and placed his arm over his eyes in frustration.","Song Luokui and Song Luosheng played one game and then stopped. \"I don't want to play anymore. You guys continue.\" Song Luokui went to sit on the side to rest.","Song Luosheng didn't mind and started a new game with others.","Seeing them playing seriously, Song Luokui took out her phone from her bag and immediately sent Chi Yu a message. By this time, more than half an hour had passed.","Finally, Chi Yu felt his phone vibrate. Seeing it was a message from Song Luokui, he exhaled. At least she would reply to him.","Song Luokui asked him: \"How did you know? Are you here too?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah, I'm on the second floor.\"","Song Luokui immediately looked towards the second floor but could only see the dark glass, unable to see inside.","Chi Yu sent another message: \"Do you want to come up and play?\"","Song Luokui: \"No.\" Song Luokui frowned. Why did he have the same tone as before? They had broken up, after all.","Song Luokui sent another message: \"We're enemies.\"","Chi Yu ignored that sentence. \"Or should I come down and play with you?\"","Song Luokui's eyes widened as she took a deep breath. Was he threatening her? He must be!","Chi Yu: \"I'm coming down now.\" Although he said that, he didn't actually move.","Song Luokui quickly typed, \"No! I'll come up. Wait a moment.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay, I'll wait for you!\"","Song Luokui was so angry that she ground her teeth. She suddenly felt that she had made a mistake by going out to dinner with the male lead earlier. Look, he had already caught her!","Fuming, Song Luokui left with her phone. Seeing her leave, Song Luosheng asked, \"Where are you going?\"","Still angry, Song Luokui loudly replied, \"Bathroom!\"","Song Luosheng muttered, \"...Why is she suddenly so irritable? What happened to my gentle and lovely sister? Who made her angry?\"","After going around in circles, Song Luokui finally found the stairs leading to the second floor. However, there was a door to enter the second floor, and someone was guarding the entrance.","When the guard saw her, he immediately approached her, \"Are you Miss Song?\"","Song Luokui nodded.","\"This way, please.\"","Soon, Song Luokui was led to an area where she saw Chi Yu sitting on the sofa with food nearby. There were also two pool tables where they could play.","The pool tables looked very high-end, not like the ordinary ones downstairs. These were made of premium rosewood with gold trim, and the cue sticks were also different.","Seeing Song Luokui looking at the pool tables, Chi Yu stood up. \"Do you want to play? I can teach you.\"","Song Luokui waved her hands, \"I just learned how to play.\"","Chi Yu walked over, picked up a cue stick, and applied some chalk to the tip. His hand was bandaged with gauze. \"I saw earlier that you're not doing it properly.\"","Chi Yu demonstrated a very standard stance and then took a shot, sinking the ball in one stroke. He stood up and looked at Song Luokui, \"That's how it's done properly.\"","Song Luokui: ...She didn't see any difference. And his hand...","Still, Song Luokui walked over, and Chi Yu handed her the cue. \"You try?\"","Song Luokui glanced at him, and Chi Yu was looking at her too. Song Luokui lowered her eyes, took the cue, observed the balls on the table, and then walked to the side. She bent over, gripped the cue with one hand and placed the other on the table to aim. As she was about to take her shot, Chi Yu walked up beside her.","He reached out and held her hand, practically enveloping her. \"You should hold it like this...\"","Song Luokui was stunned, instantly smelling a familiar scent—it seemed to be the perfume she had bought for him before.","Song Luokui turned her head to look at him in a daze. Chi Yu also lowered his head, and the two gazed into each other's eyes, able to see their own reflections. Not only that, Song Luokui could even see that Chi Yu's irises were pure black instead of the usual brownish color.","Suddenly, Chi Yu leaned even closer to her. Song Luokui's eyes widened in surprise as she abruptly stood up, her forehead colliding with Chi Yu's with a \"thump.\" She pushed him away.","Her heart was pounding rapidly. She held her forehead and looked at Chi Yu, who was now two steps away, in disbelief. \"You...\"","Yet Chi Yu approached her again. \"What's wrong? Can't I teach you? That other guy could teach you, but I can't?\"","Song Luokui choked on her words, \"Cough, cough... You... you...\"","Chi Yu stepped closer, and Song Luokui stepped back. They advanced and retreated, but Song Luokui's back was now against the expensive rosewood pool table.","Song Luokui leaned on the table, feeling very confused. If she wasn't mistaken, Chi Yu... he...","\"Don't come any closer,\" Song Luokui said as Chi Yu approached.","Chi Yu took a step forward, still looking at her. \"You haven't answered me yet. Why can't I teach you?\" He extended the cue towards her. \"I'm more skilled than him!\"","Song Luokui didn't respond but suddenly called out, \"Brother!\"","Chi Yu turned his head, and Song Luokui seized the opportunity to run past him and out of there in a panic.","Chi Yu paused for a moment, clicked his tongue—it seemed he had scared her off. But... no matter.","Meanwhile, Song Luokui hurriedly ran downstairs and went home without saying goodbye to Song Luosheng and the others.","Seeing that she hadn't returned, Song Luosheng called her, \"Kuikui, where are you?\"","Song Luokui: \"I went home.\"","Song Luosheng: ???","So who had angered his little princess?","Song Luokui held her chest, her heart pounding rapidly. She felt a mix of emotions—conflicted, afraid, doubtful, disbelieving, embarrassed, and more. She looked out the car window as the sky suddenly darkened, as if a storm was about to arrive.","Shortly after Song Luokui returned home, a heavy rain poured down.","Song Luokui rushed straight to her room. Auntie Gui asked, \"The young miss is back. Did you have fun today?\"","But Song Luokui didn't respond. She quickly ran into her room, locked the door, and collapsed onto the bed, pulling the covers over herself and hiding under them.","After a while, she seemed to smell that familiar scent of perfume again... It must have rubbed off when they were in close contact...","Song Luokui threw off the covers and took a deep breath. Then she sat up, forced to face the probable truth: The male lead! Might be! Interested in her!!"]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Compromise","paragraphs":["Song Luokui immediately began recalling the events that had transpired between her and Chi Yu, and the more she thought about it, the more it felt amiss. When she was young, she was solely focused on surviving, not paying much heed to other matters, so most of what had occurred was not well remembered.","However, she felt that they likely had no interactions as children, not even exchanging greetings.","So, when did it all begin?","It was during their time in Country Y, when she had helped bandage Chi Yu's injury... After she returned to her home country, they would occasionally run into each other. Then, on the night of her high school reunion, Chi Yu had walked her home...","From there, she started owing him favors, one after another. Owing someone favors meant having to repay them, so they ended up dining together numerous times...","The most intimate occasion was probably when they were in Country A, when he had carried her as they fled...","Song Luokui covered her face, how could she have not realized it sooner!","There was also the time when they took graduation photos together. Why did he want to take graduation photos with her? It was such an odd thing, what was she thinking back then! Why didn't she consider the implications?","She lay back down on the bed, rolling around in regret...","Before long, Song Luokui sat up again, feeling that something wasn't quite right. Chi Yu was the male lead, destined to become ruthless and unfeeling, carving out a path in the business world and emerging victorious against various villains. A man like that would never fall for a woman.","Song Luokui picked up a mirror and looked at her own face. She nodded, and the reflection nodded back. She was attractive, but... considering Chi Yu's legendary status, a man like him would never be lacking in female admirers and had likely seen all kinds of beauties.","So!","Chi Yu must have approached her because of her brother! He wanted to extract information from her, or perhaps make her fall hopelessly in love with him before discarding her, breaking her heart and causing her brother immense sorrow, forcing him to acquiesce to Chi Yu's demands...","Song Luokui envisioned herself crying and pleading, \"Don't leave me, don't leave me, I love you!\" But Chi Yu would turn and walk away coldly, while she knelt and begged...","Song Luokui shuddered, snapping out of her thoughts. That would be too tragic, she could never become that kind of person.","Chi Yu, the scoundrel!","Song Luokui got out of bed and rummaged through her belongings, eventually finding the gifts Chi Yu had given her, including the chocolates he had previously sent. No, those had to be returned as well.","She immediately placed an online order, entering Chi Yu's company address as the delivery destination.","She hurriedly packed a large bag of items and rushed downstairs. Aunt Gui saw her and asked, \"Little Miss, where are you taking those things?\"","\"I'm sending them out,\" Song Luokui replied.","Aunt Gui was puzzled, questioning her urgency on a rainy day.","Song Luokui promptly had everything sent to Chi Yu's company. Upon returning to her room, she found that Chi Yu had messaged her again, quoting her previous statement of \"We are enemies\" with the words: \"You can be an insider.\"","Song Luokui: ???","The next day, when Chi Yu received all the returned items, he was both angry and amused.","A few days later, Song Luokui and Xu Jiarong were walking along the campus road, discussing a university essay competition.","Suddenly, a car approached from behind. Song Luokui was on the inner side, while Xu Jiarong was on the outer side, her head turned to speak with Song Luokui, who looked back at her, also catching sight of the vehicle and its occupant.","Song Luokui's eyes widened instantly. Chi Yu arched an eyebrow, about to call out to her, but she cut off Xu Jiarong mid-sentence, \"Class President, let's talk about it later tonight. I have an urgent matter to attend to.\" She abruptly turned and fled in the opposite direction.","Xu Jiarong: ???","Xu Jiarong looked to her side, only seeing a passing car with its windows now rolled up.","In the following days, Song Luokui would spot Chi Yu in various corners of the campus. He didn't do anything inappropriate, merely attempting to greet her in public settings. But how could she respond? Of course not!","If she acknowledged him once, the entire school would learn of their acquaintance by the next day. And if the school knew, it meant her brother would find out too.","She couldn't tell her brother either, as this was the consequence of her misdeeds. So whenever she saw Chi Yu, Song Luokui would simply run away.","Eventually, she grew weary of it.","\"What exactly do you want!\" Song Luokui messaged Chi Yu.","Chi Yu: \"I just want to teach you how to play pool.\"","Song Luokui relented, \"Fine, fine, teach me! Where?\"","Chi Yu: \"The same place as before.\"","Song Luokui: \"When?\"","Chi Yu: \"Whenever you're free.\"","Song Luokui: \"Then after school.\" Surely it would only take one lesson, right?","Chi Yu: \"I'll pick you up.\"","Song Luokui: \"No need, I'll go there myself. Please don't come over.\"","Previously, some people at the school had recognized Chi Yu. She had overheard and read online about people spotting him when she went to eat or browse the university forum.","Yes, Chi Yu was technically a graduate student at Jing University, just like her brother, pursuing his master's degree.","Juggling his graduate studies, managing a major company, and still finding time to teach her pool? He was like a superhero.","Thinking about how busy her brother was, having to seize rare opportunities to take her out for fun, was this the difference between a male lead and a villain?","After class, Song Luokui quickly arrived at the pool hall, on the second floor as before. Chi Yu had already started a game, and as she approached, he sank the final ball with a resounding \"thump.\"","Upon seeing Song Luokui, he wiped the cue stick and handed it to her. Chi Yu racked up the balls into a triangle formation on the table and passed her the cue ball, beginning to instruct her on how to break.","Song Luokui's outfit today was rather form-fitting and short, with a small V-neck top and high-waisted jeans. As she bent over to assume the proper stance, her top rode up, revealing a glimpse of her slender waist.","Song Luokui immediately felt that her attire might not be suitable for playing pool, but Chi Yu had already approached her, maintaining a respectful distance as he earnestly guided her.","He took hold of her hand, \"Like this, aim for that spot and strike...\"","Song Luokui moved her hand, and with a resounding \"thump,\" the cue ball launched forward, scattering the racked balls with a \"whoosh.\" One ball dropped into a pocket, then two, then three...","Song Luokui raised her eyebrows and looked at Chi Yu, impressed by his undeniable skill.","Chi Yu proceeded to explain how to read the table and which ball to aim for next, delving into the physics and mathematics behind it.","Song Luokui: \"...\" While she had performed decently in high school sciences, she didn't quite follow Chi Yu's in-depth explanations.","Noting her bewildered expression, Chi Yu paused, \"Forgive me, you're from the literature department. Just hit this ball.\"","Song Luokui: ... She was irritated and didn't want to play anymore!","Gripping the cue stick silently, Chi Yu suddenly extended his hand toward her, \"You can hit me if you'd like.\"","Song Luokui puffed out her cheeks in annoyance. \"... Am I that kind of person?\"","Chi Yu's eyes crinkled with amusement as he reached out and poked her cheek. \"No, you're not.\"","Song Luokui's eyes widened at his hand, taking a step back. \"Don't touch me.\"","Chi Yu immediately raised his hands in apology. \"Sorry.\""]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: My Friend","paragraphs":["Looking at Song Luokui's somewhat sincere apology, Chi Yu forgave her, and the two continued their sparring session - or rather, Chi Yu was teaching her how to fight.","After an hour of instruction, Chi Yu checked the time: \"Are you hungry?\"","Song Luokui rubbed her stomach, realizing she was indeed a little hungry since she had come straight from school without eating.","Chi Yu picked up his jacket, \"Let's go eat.\"","Song Luokui followed for a couple of steps then stopped abruptly, recognizing this familiar start... why was it always about eating?","Chi Yu turned around when she didn't follow: \"Not eating? Should I drop you back at school then?\"","Song Luokui sighed, since they'd already sparred, eating was inevitable.","Song Luokui: \"Let's eat, let's go.\" She walked ahead of him.","Chi Yu watched her back with a hint of a smile.","They went to a new place to eat, a private banquet room, where dish after dish was ordered until the table was full. Song Luokui blinked at the array of food and looked at Chi Yu, unable to resist asking, \"Why did you order so much?\"","Chi Yu: \"I was wondering if you didn't like the food from before, so I changed the restaurant this time and ordered more dishes for you to choose what you want to eat.\"","Chi Yu: \"Oh, and you returned everything to me, but I still have your things, so it's me who owes you. Let me treat you from now on.\"","Chi Yu: \"Just the watch you gave me alone, I could treat you for a year.\"","Song Luokui: ...","Song Luokui put down her chopsticks and held her head, \"What exactly are you trying to do?\"","Chi Yu suddenly looked at her seriously, \"Don't avoid me anymore.\"","Song Luokui: \"That's impossible, if you call out to me at school others will find out, and there's my brother...\"","Chi Yu: \"I know, I won't call out to you in public, and I won't let your brother know either. We can keep it like before.\"","Song Luokui: \"Before?\"","Chi Yu: \"Before when we ate together, your brother didn't know.\"","Song Luokui hesitated: \"But... my brother...\"","Chi Yu: \"Your brother and I are just business competitors, we're from the same circles. I won't harm him. And he's him, you're you. By being friends with me, couldn't you feed him inside information?\"","Song Luokui felt that made some sense: \"Really?\"","Chi Yu: \"Really.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm afraid you'll trick me and break my heart, and it'll end up hurting my brother...\"","Chi Yu looked puzzled for a moment, \"Trick you and break your heart? You would?\"","Song Luokui suddenly slapped her forehead, \"Oh right! Of course I wouldn't! You're not my type at all!\"","How could she possibly be tricked and heartbroken by Chi Yu? This wasn't a TV drama, and Chi Yu would never harm her - the male lead would never do anything illegal. Plus, her family wasn't one to be easily bullied. She had overthought things before.","As for Chi Yu, he fell silent. This was the first time someone said he wasn't their type. From a young age until now, he had never doubted his looks and abilities. So what exactly was her type?","Chi Yu looked at Song Luokui, who seemed to have figured something out and was now glowing, her bright eyes looking quite attractive.","Chi Yu: \"So...\"","Song Luokui: \"Let me think about it some more.\"","Chi Yu put a piece of meat on her plate, \"Take your time, no rush. Eat first.\"","\"Mm, let's eat.\" Song Luokui picked up her chopsticks and ate.","Chi Yu then made another tempting offer, \"By the way, if we're friends and your friends need sponsorship fees, you can ask me. If your friends want to book escorts at Unnamed Mountain Lake, you can put it on my tab too, but not for you - you can't book anyone.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Unnamed Mountain Lake is yours?\"","Chi Yu: \"Not mine, I have shares in it.\"","Song Luokui recalled the previous three million...","\"Putting it on your tab doesn't seem right, does it?\"","Chi Yu: \"Discount?\"","Song Luokui: \"That works.\" After all, booking male escorts did seem a bit pricey - even if she was wealthy, spending excessively on men didn't seem worthwhile.","Chi Yu: \"So...\"","Song Luokui: \"...Let me think some more.\" Didn't he say there was no rush?","Chi Yu: \"Oh, also when I go abroad I can send you gifts. Hmm... it seems the State Investment Department is going to develop a certain area soon, and I remember your brother...\"","Hearing this, Song Luokui immediately perked up her ears, but Chi Yu didn't continue and instead said to her, \"If you become friends with me...\"","Song Luokui stuffed a chicken drumstick straight into Chi Yu's mouth, \"Eat!\" Always trying to tempt her.","Chi Yu ate the drumstick, while Song Luokui ate a piece of meat, and Chi Yu looked like he wanted to say something again.","Song Luokui: \"Don't say anymore, let me think about it.\"","Chi Yu: \"...That's not what I was going to say.\"","Song Luokui: \"Then what were you going to say?\"","Chi Yu's gaze fell on her chopsticks, and Song Luokui suddenly realized she had just used her chopsticks to feed Chi Yu the chicken drumstick... and she was now using the same chopsticks to eat.","Song Luokui's ears instantly turned red. She glared at Chi Yu and switched to a new pair of chopsticks to eat.","Her glare had no intimidating effect at all, her eyes just looked moist and attractive. Chi Yu only felt a slight tingle, but since she had gotten angry when he poked her cheek before, he didn't want to offend her again in case she refused his offer.","Even though she hadn't agreed yet, Chi Yu felt it was only a matter of time.","After the meal, Chi Yu dropped Song Luokui off at home and handed her a pile of things as she was getting out of the car.","Song Luokui: ?","Chi Yu: \"These are the things you sent back to me before. Now that we're friends, shouldn't you take them back?\"","Song Luokui gritted her teeth: \"Not yet!\"","Chi Yu: \"You don't want them? I'll ask again tomorrow then.\"","Song Luokui was afraid of him now, \"I want them, I want them.\" She didn't want to bring them back openly though, so she got back in the car, \"Just drop me off a little way from my home, and keep an eye out. If you see any of my family, remind me so they don't find out, okay?\"","\"Got it.\"","Chi Yu dropped Song Luokui off near her home, and she looked around furtively, \"Is anyone out there?\"","Chi Yu: \"No one.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, I'm going then. Bye bye.\"","\"Mm.\"","Song Luokui darted back home like a little mouse with her bagful of things.","Chi Yu watched until she got inside, then drove back to his own home.","Aunt Gui watched as Song Luokui returned with a large bag of things that seemed vaguely familiar - weren't those the items the young miss had sent out before?","Aunt Gui: \"Young Miss.\"","Song Luokui: \"Haha, a friend gave them to me. I'll be going to my room, Aunt Gui.\"","Song Luokui hurried upstairs and stuffed the things into her wardrobe.","That night, Song Luokui had a dream where she obtained a lot of information from Chi Yu and passed it to her brother. With this divine assistance, her brother was able to utterly defeat Chi Yu and reach the pinnacle of success. As her brother's sister, of course Song Luokui was also basking in glory!","Many people congratulated her enthusiastically.","Meanwhile, Chi Yu knelt on the ground begging her for mercy. Hahahahaha!","Song Luokui woke up laughing. She opened the curtains to a beautiful day and sent Chi Yu a message: \"Good morning, my friend.\"","Chi Yu had just finished showering and was getting dressed when he saw the message and smiled."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: The New Man","paragraphs":["That day, the ladies of the circle were hosting a tea party, and of course Song Luokui received an invitation. The ladies had previously lived in the grand manor for a while, but she felt it was too small and not fun enough, and the rules were quite strict.","Afterwards, the ladies moved out to live elsewhere, only occasionally returning to the manor to visit their grandfathers and grandmothers.","The lady's name was Weng Jiao. As a child, she loved playing house, and as she grew older, she developed a fondness for the Lolita fashion and hosting small gatherings.","\"This time, I want to introduce a newcomer, so all of you must come,\" she announced regarding this gathering at her small estate.","In the capital city, the newcomers who could join their circle were few and far between.","Zhang Xiyue asked, \"Could it be someone new to the capital, someone who just came up from below? Luokui, are you going?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Yes, I'll go.\" She and Weng Jiao had a good relationship, and she usually attended the gatherings Weng Jiao hosted unless something urgent came up.","Zhang Xiyue said, \"Then I'll go with you. Weng Jiao recently posted in the online group that she bought a new Lolita dress, so she'll definitely wear it this time. I'll wear one too.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"You all can wear them, but I won't.\"","Zhang Xiyue said, \"It's fine, Weng Jiao didn't ask us to wear anything.\" She went up and pinched Song Luokui's cheeks affectionately. \"After all, my Luokui is so beautiful that even a burlap sack would look good on her.\"","Soon, they arrived at Weng Jiao's small estate. Although called a \"small estate,\" it occupied a considerable area, with just the house being a small castle spanning five hundred square meters.","Surrounding the castle were lawns, forests, pools, and more. This tea party was being held on the lawn beside the castle.","When Song Luokui and Zhang Xiyue arrived, the lawn had already been set up with long tables laden with delicious food. Weng Jiao, dressed in a Lolita outfit and holding a small parasol, came to greet them.","\"You're here! Welcome!\" Weng Jiao's voice was whiny, as if she was always pouting. It wasn't an affectation; her voice was just like that.","\"Your outfit isn't bad, but of course, I think mine looks better,\" Weng Jiao appraised Zhang Xiyue's Lolita dress.","Zhang Xiyue didn't mind, \"Yes, yes, yours is the best.\"","Weng Jiao sidled up to Song Luokui and put an arm around hers. \"Luokui is the most beautiful.\" She took a deep breath. \"Luokui even smells lovely. If I were a guy, I'd definitely pursue Luokui.\"","Zhang Xiyue laughed, \"Aren't you afraid her brother would beat you up?\"","Weng Jiao tilted her chin up defiantly. \"Not afraid!\"","Weng Jiao came from a good family, and this estate was a birthday gift from her family. She usually lived here.","Weng Jiao led them to the tea party area, chatted for a bit, then left to welcome other guests who had arrived.","\"Xiyue, Luokui, you're here.\"","\"Come sit over here.\"","\"Xiyue, you look great in that outfit today too. Where did you buy it? Recommend it to me.\"","Zhang Xiyue happily went over to chat with them. \"I had it custom-made at the Suihua Studio. I'll introduce you to the designer.\"","\"Okay, great, I'll have one custom-made too.\"","Song Luokui also went over to chat with everyone. \"Long time no see, what have you all been up to lately?\"","\"Our school has a dance competition coming up, and I'm participating in it,\" said one who studied dance like Zhang Xiyue.","\"My school also has all sorts of activities. I've participated in a lot of them, so I've been quite busy,\" said a popular student leader.","\"Other than attending classes, I've just been traveling around. The school activities don't interest me at all,\" said a travel enthusiast.","Everyone chatted casually, laughing and joking.","Soon, Weng Jiao brought someone over and clapped her hands to get everyone's attention. \"Everyone, look over here, I'm introducing the newcomer.\"","Song Luokui and the others all looked over to see a young girl standing next to Weng Jiao. She had big eyes and looked quite cute, with a dimpled smile, though she seemed a bit shy at the moment.","\"This is Chen Xinyuan, a new member of the Chen family.\"","Upon hearing she was a new member of the Chen family, everyone understood what was going on. Recently, certain departments had been undergoing leadership changes, so it was normal for fresh blood to be coming into the capital.","Chen Xinyuan also nodded at everyone. \"Hello everyone. By the way, since this is my first time at such a gathering, I've brought gifts for you all.\" Chen Xinyuan's servants then brought out the gifts.","Chen Xinyuan handed them out one by one, and as the host, Weng Jiao introduced the other ladies to her.","\"This is Lou Sasa.\"","\"Hello, I'm Lou Sasa. Thank you for the gift.\"","\"This is Song Luokui. We all call her Luokui.\"","Chen Xinyuan paused when she saw Song Luokui, then smiled. \"Hello, Luokui.\"","Song Luokui smiled back. \"Hello, thank you for the gift.\"","Chen Xinyuan's eyes sparkled. \"You're welcome.\"","After everyone received their gifts, they all chatted for a while and became acquainted.","The ladies sipped tea, gossiped about the circle, discussed skincare, bags, clothes, and more. The afternoon passed quickly.","At some point, they even took a group photo.","Weng Jiao hugged Song Luokui for one photo, which turned out great, but Weng Jiao wasn't entirely satisfied. \"Luokui, next time you should wear a Lolita dress too. We need to have matching sister outfits.\"","Song Luokui agreed, \"Okay, let me know when you custom order yours next time.\"","\"Sure, sure.\"","After the afternoon tea concluded, everyone went their separate ways.","However, just a few days later, Weng Jiao angrily posted in their small group chat: \"From now on, I'm not inviting that Chen Xinyuan to our little gatherings anymore. She looked so innocent and sweet that I thought she was a good girl. If any of you invite her to your gatherings, don't invite me!\"","\"What happened? What did she do to upset you?\"","Weng Jiao: \"Don't ask, I've learned there's a type of girl called a 'tea sister,' and I've encountered a real one.\"","Weng Jiao: \"My father originally told me to get along well with her and introduce her to people since her father works with mine. She seemed quite cute and sweet, and she didn't criticize me for how I talk either, so I thought she was alright.\"","Weng Jiao: \"I was being nice by introducing her to people and inviting her to the gathering. Do you know what happened just now?\"","Weng Jiao: \"Today was the Ji Family Patriarch's birthday banquet, right? My family has a decent relationship with the Ji family, so it was just a matter of eating and drinking. I brought her along.\"","Weng Jiao: \"The Ji family has an even better relationship with the Chi family, and the Chi Family Heir was there too. Do you know what the 'tea sister' did?\"","Lou Sasa: \"What did she do? Did she go after the one from the Ji family instead of the Chi family?\"","Weng Jiao: \"She knew better than that and went for the best one. The 'tea sister' pretended to accidentally spill her drink on him, then batted her big eyes and said in a tearful, fairy-like voice that she was sorry and didn't mean it. She even offered to help clean it up and asked for his contact information...\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Hahaha, how ridiculous! Then what happened?\"","Weng Jiao: \"The Chi Family Heir just glanced at her and walked away. The 'tea sister' tried to go after him.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Did she catch up to him?\"","Weng Jiao: \"She was stopped by someone from the Ji family.\"","Song Luokui read what Weng Jiao had written, then looked at the message the Chi Family Heir had sent her: \"Are you going to the Ji family banquet?\""]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: Eight trigrams","paragraphs":["The Song family certainly received the invitation, but Song Luokui did not go, mainly because her parents were away on business trips, and she did not feel comfortable going alone. However, she sent a gift.","As for her brother, he was away on a business trip abroad at the time. All three members of the family were busy with their careers, leaving only her with free time.","Just after Weng Jiao had finished complaining about Song Luokui's absence, Chi Yu sent her another message: \"Your decision not to come was the right choice.\"","Song Luokui: ?","Chi Yu: \"Met an idiot. [Picture]\" The picture showed a slight stain on his clothes.","Song Luokui: \"Was it Chen Xinyuan?\"","Chi Yu: \"Someone I don't know. How did you know?\"","Song Luokui: \"My girlfriend just told me the gossip from the banquet.\"","Chi Yu: \"What are you up to?\"","Song Luokui was lounging on her bed watching TV, \"Watching TV and chatting with my girlfriends.\"","Chi Yu saw that it was still early, so he asked, \"Want to grab a late-night snack? I know your brother is not around.\"","Song Luokui: ...","Chi Yu: \"There's more gossip from the banquet.\"","Song Luokui: \"[Perks up ears]\"","Chi Yu: \"Coming out?\"","Song Luokui: \"Out! Give me a moment.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll be waiting near the gate of the compound.\"","Song Luokui: \"Got it.\"","Song Luokui changed her clothes and tiptoed downstairs. Fortunately, the housekeeper Gui was not in the living room, so Song Luokui quietly opened the door and ran out.","Once outside the compound, she saw Chi Yu's familiar car parked nearby. She ran over, got in, fastened her seatbelt, and said, \"Let's go.\"","Chi Yu immediately started the car.","Chi Yu took her to a small alley and entered a courtyard house. Following the server's guidance, they entered a private room.","Small crawfish, grilled meat, grilled chives, grilled corn - ordinary street food that seemed more upscale in this setting.","Song Luokui, wearing gloves, peeled and ate the crawfish. \"Today at the banquet, besides your encounter with the 'crying beauty,' what else happened?\"","Chi Yu: \"...'Crying beauty'?\"","Song Luokui blinked: \"Yes.\"","Chi Yu: \"That's not a 'crying beauty,' that's a scam.\"","Song Luokui shrugged: \"Alright.\"","Chi Yu: \"Come closer, let me tell you.\"","Song Luokui moved her chair closer, and Chi Yu leaned towards her ear. He could see the small earring hole on her earlobe.","\"The Zhang family's...\"","Song Luokui made sounds of disbelief as she listened: \"Ah?\"","\"Really?\"","\"No way!\"","\"He's actually that kind of person?\"","\"Anything else? More?\"","Chi Yu then leaned down and told her other things.","Song Luokui felt like she had gained more life experience. Since they were gossiping, Song Luokui felt they should speak quietly and secretly, so her voice also became very soft. She did not notice that they were getting closer and closer.","After the gossip session, Song Luokui realized they were too close. She shifted her butt and moved her chair slightly, subtly keeping some distance from Chi Yu.","Of course, Chi Yu noticed. He looked at the distance between their chairs and said, \"Your turn now.\"","Song Luokui swallowed a piece of meat, \"What?\"","Chi Yu: \"Your turn for gossip.\"","Song Luokui: \"I...\" She was about to say she had no gossip, but then remembered the information she had obtained from chatting with her girlfriends at the previous tea party.","Song Luokui looked around to make sure no one was nearby, then whispered to Chi Yu: \"I heard that the second son of the Qian family is not the biological son of the Qian family?\"","Chi Yu looked at her, surprised that she even knew this kind of information.","Song Luokui: \"I found out from chatting with my girlfriends last time. Do you know about this? Is it true?\" She leaned closer as she spoke.","Chi Yu also leaned in: \"I've heard about this before...\"","The two got closer and closer as they spoke.","It was almost 11 pm when they finished their late-night snack and exhausted the gossip. Both felt satisfied as they headed home.","Chi Yu dropped Song Luokui off near her home, and she sneaked back in quietly. The housekeeper Gui was already asleep.","On the weekend, Zhang Xiyue invited Song Luokui to go shopping and see a movie. They went to the L Store to buy handbags.","As soon as they entered, Zhang Xiyue said, \"I heard you recently got a new style? The only one in the country for now? Let me see it.\"","The staff politely seated them on a sofa, served them tea and snacks, and then brought out the newest handbag style.","At that moment, two more people entered and immediately noticed the bag in the staff's hand. \"That bag, pack it up for me!\" one of them demanded rudely.","Zhang Xiyue was furious. She turned to see who was being so rude and disregarding the order of arrival.","To her surprise, it was familiar faces - Li Feiyi, Chen Nan's cousin, and Chen Xinyuan, who had recently been kicked out of Weng Jiao's social circle.","Since Chi Yu and the Song family were not on good terms, Chen Nan, who was on Chi Yu's side, naturally did not get along with them either. Li Feiyi, as Chen Nan's cousin, also did not have a good relationship with Song Luokui, Zhang Xiyue, and their group.","Zhang Xiyue narrowed her eyes: \"Li Feiyi, where are your manners? Don't you know the order of arrival?\"","Li Feiyi spoke without thinking, but when she saw who it was, she did not regret it. \"I was wondering who it was. It's you guys. Since it's yours, I'll take it.\"","Zhang Xiyue rolled her eyes and waved her hand in front of her nose. \"How stinky! I don't know who has bad breath! It stinks to death.\"","Li Feiyi: \"You...\"","Li Feiyi looked at the staff, \"Pack it up for me.\"","At this point, Chen Xinyuan, who was next to Li Feiyi, also spoke up: \"Xiyue, Kuikui, why don't you give the bag to Feiyi?\"","Zhang Xiyue glanced at her: \"Who are you? What makes you think we should give it to you?\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, Chen Xinyuan's eyes widened, her eyes reddened, and tears threatened to fall, as if she had been bullied.","Chen Xinyuan sniffled: \"I... I'm sorry... Did I say something wrong?\"","Li Feiyi shielded Chen Xinyuan protectively. \"Zhang Xiyue, why are you being so harsh? What right do you have to bully Xinyuan?\"","Zhang Xiyue's eyes widened as she pointed at herself. \"Me? Bully her? Are you blind? If you're blind, go to the hospital and get your eyes checked. Maybe they can be saved.\"","Chen Xinyuan continued to sob: \"Never mind, Feiyi. Let's just forget it and let them have it.\"","Zhang Xiyue was speechless. \"What 'let'? First come, first served. It's ours, got it?\"","The staff did not dare say a word, afraid of offending anyone.","Chen Xinyuan was still crying, and Li Feiyi was comforting her. Zhang Xiyue felt utterly annoyed.","Finally, Song Luokui spoke up: \"Xiyue, let's not take it. I just remembered that I have two of these bags. I'll give you one.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Kuikui, how do you have them? I thought there was only one in the country right now?\"","Song Luokui: \"My brother sent them to me from abroad a few days ago. I just remembered. I have other things too. Do you want to come to my place and take a look?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Sure, let's go, let's go.\"","The two linked arms, ready to leave. As they reached the door, Zhang Xiyue suddenly turned and said to Li Feiyi: \"Li Feiyi, I called you stupid before, and you didn't believe me. Now you're friends with that girl who just offended someone from the Chi family at the banquet? Good luck!\"","With that, Zhang Xiyue left with Song Luokui.","Li Feiyi immediately turned to Chen Xinyuan: \"Xinyuan...\"","Chen Xinyuan quickly became flustered and tried to explain: \"It was all a misunderstanding... I accidentally... \" Her face flushed. \"Chi didn't say anything. In fact, he told me he didn't mind.\"","Li Feiyi looked at her strangely: \"He told you he didn't mind?\""]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: Jackass","paragraphs":["Although her cousin was Chen Nan, and Chen Nan did have a good relationship with the person from the Chi family, it didn't mean that she, Li Feiyi, had a good relationship with that person too. She hadn't even spoken to that person before.","Previously, when she went to find her cousin, she had encountered that person once. Chen Nan did say, \"This is my cousin, Li Feiyi.\" But that person had only glanced at her and nodded slightly, without saying a word to her. The attitude was rather indifferent, and Li Feiyi even felt that if they met again, that person might not even remember her.","She wasn't even qualified to attend their gatherings. So how could Chen Xinyuan say that person spoke to her and didn't mind?","How could she believe that?","Li Feiyi looked at Chen Xinyuan with doubt. Chen Xinyuan's heart skipped a beat, \"Feiyi, I... I'm telling the truth, he even smiled at me.\"","Li Feiyi became even more doubtful. \"Smiled? Are you sure? Do you think I'm really that stupid?\" Li Feiyi recalled what Zhang Xiyue had said to her earlier, calling her stupid!","Li Feiyi glared at Chen Xinyuan, then stomped her feet and left.","Chen Xinyuan: ???What did she say wrong?","Nearby, a shop assistant, seeing there was only one person left, immediately approached her, \"Miss, do you still need this bag?\"","Chen Xinyuan looked at the bag. It was indeed very pretty. Thinking about what had just happened, she finally gritted her teeth, \"Yes! Bag it for me.\"","The assistant smiled, \"Sure, this way please. Will you be paying by card or...\"","Chen Xinyuan: \"Card.\"","The assistant: \"Okay, the total is two million.\"","Chen Xinyuan froze, her eyes widening. \"How much?\"","The assistant: \"Two million.\"","Chen Xinyuan's heart ached as she handed her bank card to the assistant. A bag that costs two million! All her savings!!!","Chen Xinyuan picked up the bag and left, her steps somewhat unsteady.","On the other side, after Li Feiyi left, she immediately called her cousin Chen Nan. Chen Nan was a bit busy and didn't answer for a long time. \"Feiyi? What's up?\"","Li Feiyi: \"Brother, I... last time you attended the Chi family's banquet, did anything happen?\"","Chen Nan didn't know what she wanted to ask. \"What do you mean?\"","Li Feiyi: \"That... that person from the Chi family, did someone offend him? Like some girl?\"","Chen Nan: \"Yes, there was an idiot who spilled a drink on the boss. Why? Did you run into the idiot?\"","Li Feiyi: \"Id...idiot?\"","Chen Nan: \"If not an idiot, what else? What does she look like to even dream about the boss? Doesn't she look in the mirror? Remember to stay away from that person, don't play with the idiot.\"","Li Feiyi: \"Got it... brother, I'm good now.\"","\"Yeah.\"","After hanging up, Li Feiyi was so angry that her face turned red. She immediately blocked and deleted the person from her contacts!","On the other side, Chen Xinyuan had just bought the bag and was about to tell Li Feiyi, but when the message was sent, it showed: You are no longer friends with this person...","Chen Xinyuan: ???","In Song Luokui's room, she took out the bags her brother Song Luosheng had sent back and placed them aside, then took out other items he had also sent back.","\"One is pink, and one is blue. Which one do you like?\"","Zhang Xiyue touched this one and that one. \"Wuu wuu, I wish I had a brother like that too.\"","Song Luokui: \"You can call me brother.\"","Zhang Xiyue hugged her: \"You really are my good big brother. I want the blue one; the pink one suits you.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, take a look and see if there's anything else you want.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"No need, this bag is enough.\" Zhang Xiyue carried the bag and looked in the mirror, then examined Song Luokui's belongings. \"Luokui, don't you have too many things? Why don't you get a walk-in closet?\"","Song Luokui: \"I have a small walk-in closet, but it's also full of stuff.\" There was no helping it; the houses in this courtyard were just ordinary residential buildings. The Song family's building had three floors. The first floor was Aunt Gui and Uncle Kang's room, the second floor was where she and her parents lived, and the third floor was where Song Luosheng lived.","Zhang Xiyue: \"You can live outside, right? Don't you have a courtyard house on Shangyuan Road?\"","She was already living outside but would also come back home to stay. The children in the courtyard generally preferred freedom and independence once they became adults, wanting to move out from their families. Only Song Luokui stayed at home every day.","Song Luokui: \"But I want to stay with my family.\" Whenever her parents came back, they would say that seeing her waiting at home for them made all their fatigue disappear.","She did have a courtyard house, a gift from her grandparents. Her brother also had one.","Zhang Xiyue: \"You can live outside usually and come back every week. You can also design your place outside and move your belongings there.\"","Song Luokui: \"I can move my belongings there, but I still want to live at home before graduating.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Whatever makes you happy. Anyway, let's go for afternoon tea.\"","Song Luokui: \"Let's go.\"","...","Another week later, Lou Sasa posted a message in their group: \"Afternoon tea gathering at my place this weekend.\"","Lou Sasa: \"I'll share some gossip with you.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"I'll definitely go.\"","Weng Jiao: \"Me too, it's not about that person again, is it?\"","Zhou Yue: \"Who who who? Who are you talking about? I'll go too; I missed it last time, but I'll go this time for sure.\"","Weng Jiao: \"I've customized new Lolita dresses @buyingcaliflowereatsthecaliflouerseeds, Luokui, remember we'll wear matching sister outfits.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Damn it, I want to wear them too.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Everyone wear them!\"","Tu Shanyue: \"I'll go too! I want to hear the gossip!\"","Lou Sasa: \"I'll give you the invitations tomorrow, don't stand me up.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, I'll wear the outfit and go.\"","On the weekend, Song Luokui woke up early. Aunt Gui came upstairs to call her, \"Young Miss, the makeup artist is here.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'll be down in a bit. Take her to have breakfast first.\"","\"Okay.\"","After washing up, Song Luokui went downstairs and had breakfast first. Then the makeup artist started doing her makeup, with her outfit placed aside.","After more than two hours of preparation, with the help of the makeup artist and Aunt Gui, Song Luokui was dressed in a pink and white princess gown, paired with Mary Jane shoes, matching hair accessories, gloves, and a small flower basket.","Her normally waist-length straight hair was styled in big, wavy curls, and her face was done with intricate makeup, making her look like an exquisite Barbie doll.","The makeup artist and Aunt Gui squealed from the side, \"Aahh, so pretty!\"","\"Young Miss looks so adorable like this, I'll take a photo to show your parents.\"","The makeup artist also took out her phone. \"Miss Song, can I take a picture with you? I won't share it.\"","Song Luokui: \"Sure.\"","Then the makeup artist and Aunt Gui took pictures of her, praising her all the while.","\"Young Miss, you should wear outfits like this more often. I'll ask the young master to buy them for you.\"","\"If Miss Song became a celebrity, I'd definitely be one of your loyal fans!\"","At that moment, Song Luosheng had just entered the door when he heard the screams. \"Aahh, Miss Song, that expression was perfect just now.\"","\"Wuu wuu, my heart has been captured by Miss Song.\"","Song Luosheng: ???"]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: A Man's Voice","paragraphs":["Song Luosheng: \"What are you guys doing...?\"","As Song Luosheng entered, he saw his sister Song Luokui dressed in a lolita outfit, sitting properly on the sofa, holding a teacup and drinking tea. When she looked at him with those eyes, he felt his heart melt - his sister was just so beautiful and cute.","Song Luosheng walked over and poked her face: \"Why are you all dressed up so prettily today? Are you Princess Kuikui today?\"","Song Luokui pushed his hand away: \"Going to Lou Sasa's for afternoon tea in a bit.\"","Song Luosheng: \"I'll drop you off later. Isn't Lou Longwang there?\" Lou Longwang was Lou Sasa's brother. Now that his little sister had grown up, he was worried that some of the boys in their circle might have improper thoughts seeing her looking like this. His little cabbage had grown up, and as a parent, he was afraid the pigs might dig her up.","Song Luokui blinked her big eyes: \"I don't know.\"","The makeup artist became stiff after Song Luosheng returned, her task complete. \"Miss Song, I'll head back then.\"","Song Luokui: \"Mmhmm, thank you for your help today. Auntie Gui, please see her out.\"","\"Alright. This way, Teacher Liang.\"","\"Okay, bye bye.\"","\"Bye bye.\"","In the afternoon, Song Luosheng took his little princess to the Lou family's place. The Lous lived in a villa, and when Song Luokui arrived, Zhang Xiyue and the others were already there.","Seeing her, they all pounced over.","\"Ahhhh, it's my Kuikui, super pretty!\"","Weng Jiao went \"mmm\" and planted a kiss on Song Luokui's face, then hugged her waist. \"Princess Kuikui is mine today.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"I'm hugging Song Luokui's other side, she's mine.\"","On the side, Song Luosheng: \"Ahem!\"","Weng Jiao and the others were still chattering, so Song Luosheng cleared his throat louder: \"Ahem!\"","Finally they heard him and turned around. Upon seeing Song Luosheng, they immediately became well-behaved. \"Hello Brother Luosheng.\"","\"Hello Brother Luosheng.\"","They each grabbed their little dresses and curtsied elegantly, like proper ladies compared to just moments ago.","Song Luosheng: \"...I'll head back first, I'll come pick you up later.\"","\"Okay!\"","After Song Luosheng left, the group reverted to their lively selves. \"Come on, let's go take photos first.\"","Under the trees, the group happily took photos, drank afternoon tea, and ate little snacks. Meanwhile on the third floor of the nearby villa, a few boys were peeping through binoculars.","Lou Longwang sat to the side. \"You guys have been looking for so long? Don't let my sister catch you, or I'll be in big trouble.\"","The other guys ignored him, fighting over the binoculars. \"Let me see, let me see.\"","\"Damn! The Song family sister is really...! Shit, I feel like getting a nosebleed just from her smile.\"","\"Me too, me too.\"","\"The Zhang family girl isn't bad either, those long legs...\"","Lou Longwang stood up and snatched the binoculars. \"What are you guys doing? Not afraid of Song Luosheng finding out?\"","\"But the Song family sister is really hot. What if I try pursuing the Song family sister? She's in college now, right? An adult.\"","Lou Longwang: \"Only if you're not afraid to die. I heard someone harassed Sister Song before, and no one knows where that guy ended up.\"","\"Nevermind then, haha.\"","Lou Longwang looked through the binoculars, and happened to see Song Luokui wink. He covered his nose - damn, she's so damn cute.","Did she just wink at me?","Lou Longwang: \"What do you guys think if I pursue her?\"","The others: ...Do you remember what you just said?","Under the trees, the group rested on the sofa chairs after taking photos, eating tea snacks.","Zhang Xiyue: \"Sasa, you haven't shared any gossip yet.\"","Lou Sasa took a sip of tea and glanced at Weng Jiao. \"Just about that Tea Sister from last time. She has a fan club now, all guys.\"","\"Watch out if any of you have brothers.\"","\"Oh right, do you know what she said about the one she pretended to spill a drink on at the Zhi family banquet? You know what she said? She said that person didn't mind and even smiled at her.\"","After she finished, everyone fell silent.","Zhang Xiyue burst out laughing, covering her mouth as she cackled. \"Hahahahaha.\"","The others covered their mouths and laughed too.","Weng Jiao held her belly as she laughed. \"That's not all, I heard more after.\"","\"What what?\"","Weng Jiao: \"Tea Sister found out where that person's company is located, and has been going there daily to 'accidentally' run into him.\"","\"...\"","\"How shameless and ill-mannered is that? No family taught her manners.\"","Lou Sasa: \"I know, I heard her mother was a mistress who climbed up. As a mistress, she probably learned all those tricks.\"","Weng Jiao went \"huh\" in disgust. \"So gross! I can't believe I invited her before, so unlucky!\"","When Song Luokui heard that Chen Xinyuan had been 'coincidentally' running into someone at Pool Company, she raised an eyebrow. So that's why Chen hadn't bothered her recently - was it because of \"unrequited love tears\"?","If Pool knew, he would say it was a false accusation. He was busy to death these days, his schedule packed full. He couldn't even find time for a late-night snack, much less be bothered by some lunatic outside his company.","\"Boss, there's a civil war erupting in N Country, our investment...\"","Pool frowned. \"Prioritize protecting our people first, evacuate them if necessary. Seal the mines for now.\"","\"Got it.\"","\"Sir, there's an urgent batch of documents that need your signature.\"","\"Mmm.\" Pool took the pen and signed document after document for a while.","Not long after, someone else came in to report on a few projects. After some time, Pool finally stopped and picked up his phone to video call someone directly.","Song Luokui was listening to her friends gossip when her phone suddenly vibrated. She took it out and saw it was Pool. She was about to reject the call, but accidentally slid and answered instead. When Pool saw Song Luokui's current appearance, he froze, then asked: \"What are you doing?\"","Song Luokui panicked and hurriedly hung up.","Pool: ?","The other girls originally chatting turned towards the sound. Song Luokui turned her phone off directly, looking at the others: \"What... what happened?\"","Zhang Xiyue was the first to lean over. \"I heard a man's voice!\"","Weng Jiao: \"Kuikui, who was that just now?\"","Song Luokui laughed it off. \"It was my brother, he was asking when I'll be back.\"","Lou Sasa: \"The voice didn't really sound like him though.\"","Song Luokui: \"It was him, probably just phone issues.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Then why didn't you reply to him?\"","Song Luokui: \"I accidentally hung up when my hand slipped. I've messaged him back.\"","The others reluctantly accepted that reason. Zhang Xiyue stared at her. \"Kuikui, you didn't get a boyfriend, did you?\"","Song Luokui choked. \"Cough cough cough, no! Absolutely not!\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Why are you so worked up then?\"","Song Luokui: \"Really, I don't have one. I'm always playing with you guys, when would I have time for a boyfriend? If I did, I couldn't possibly hide it from you all.\"","The others thought about it and agreed.","Zhang Xiyue nodded too. \"That's true, you're always either at home or at school. There are barely any guys in your class, and you don't participate in activities or attend social gatherings often. You really don't meet many guys.\"","Lou Sasa: \"If I looked like Kuikui, I'd date one handsome guy from high society after another.\"","Song Luokui: \"...But you're quite pretty too, Sasa.\"","Lou Sasa cupped her face. \"But it seems like no one's pursuing me either.\"","Zhou Yue: \"That's probably because your brother won't allow it. Same for Kuikui.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"You both have brothers too? How come?\"","Tu Shanyue: \"I don't have one. So I've dated quite a few already.\""]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: Activities","paragraphs":["The group changed the topic, and Song Luokui also let out a sigh of relief, nearly revealing herself.","On the other side, Chi Yu immediately called back after being hung up, but it showed the other party had turned off their phone.","Chi Yu wondered if her phone had run out of battery? But then he suddenly thought of Song Luokui's appearance in the video - her exquisite little face, her eyes wide open when she saw him, her small mouth slightly parted, then her flustered look, before the video was cut off.","Chi Yu supported his chin with his hand, then leaned back in his chair, covering his eyes with his elbow. How could she be so adorable?","Around 4pm, after the afternoon tea ended, Song Luosheng came to pick her up. \"How was it today? Did you have fun?\"","Song Luokui: \"It was quite fun.\"","In the car, Song Luokui saw a message from Chi Yu asking why she had suddenly cut off the video.","Song Luokui glanced sideways at Song Luosheng, who was driving carefully, and quickly replied to Chi Yu: \"I'll tell you later.\"","Chi Yu quickly responded: \"Okay.\"","After more than half an hour, they finally arrived home. Song Luokui went upstairs to her room, locked the door, and then replied to Chi Yu: \"I was at an afternoon tea party earlier.\"","Chi Yu: \"Can you talk now?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yes.\"","Chi Yu immediately made a video call, which Song Luokui had never done with him before. She found it a bit strange but still answered. \"What's up?\"","Chi Yu finally saw Song Luokui in her lolita dress again. \"Was the theme princess today?\"","Song Luokui: \"Huh?\"","Chi Yu: \"You look like a princess now.\"","Song Luokui felt her face flush and fanned herself. \"It's lolita style. We all dressed like that this afternoon.\"","Chi Yu: \"Pretty cute.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Um...thanks.\"","Chi Yu: \"Having a late night snack?\"","Song Luokui: \"Can't, my brother is home.\" Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu's side, it seemed he was in an office. \"Are you still at work? Isn't it the weekend today?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah, overtime.\"","Song Luokui: \"You must be very hard-working.\" She had thought he had three heads and six arms before, but it turned out he was just like her brother.","Chi Yu: \"Do you want to come see me?\"","Song Luokui: \"...No.\"","Chi Yu: \"Alright, I'll ask again when you're free.\"","After chatting for a while, Song Luokui felt tired and hung up. After ending the call, she immediately changed clothes. The outfit was pretty, but too fussy, and taking off the makeup was also a hassle.","After showering and freshening up, Aunt Gui had finished cooking the meal.","\"Miss, dinner is ready.\"","\"Okay~\"","On Monday when classes resumed, Xu Jiarong suddenly sent a message in the class group, @ mentioning everyone.","\"For those interested, you can participate in this event organized by Songhua Technology. If your article is selected, it can be a bonus point for getting a job at Songhua Technology after graduation.\"","Song Luokui immediately clicked to read about the activity. It turned out Songhua Technology was currently soliciting promotional articles, mainly targeting their latest sports watch.","Song Luokui had actually received information about this watch first-hand, and was even wearing one on her wrist currently.","Writing a promotional article for her brother's company seemed doable to her.","But before she could start writing, self-media on the internet had already begun fighting. Some self-media outlets said Songhua Technology's new product was better than the new product from Shanyu Technology under the Shan Yu Group, while others said Shanyu's was better than Songhua's.","They kept comparing the two companies back and forth.","The next day, Xu Jiarong forwarded another activity in the group: \"This is an activity from Shanyu Technology, similar to the one from Songhua, also promoting their own products with prize money. Feel free to participate if interested.\"","Someone in the group said: \"So this is Songhua and Shanyu fighting each other?\"","\"Which one will you guys write articles for?\"","\"Either one is fine, I heard the two bosses are both alumni from our school.\"","\"Their corporate battles have nothing to do with us. As long as we get prize money, it doesn't matter who wins.\"","\"That's right. I'll participate in both, maybe I can get two prizes, hehehe.\"","\"First, your article needs to be selected. And don't you need to try out the product to write about it?\"","\"Just search online and modify it a bit.\"","Song Luokui also looked at Shanyu's activity but decided not to participate in that one.","The activity deadline was one week. Song Luokui spent three days writing and revising her article before submitting it to Songhua Technology's mailbox using a pen name without her real name.","The staff in Songhua's publicity department was working overtime to review the articles. Song Luokui's was quickly reviewed and forwarded to the manager's mailbox. Articles forwarded to the manager needed further review before being sent to the boss for the final decision.","At the Monday meeting, the publicity manager selected ten articles and handed them to Song Luosheng: \"Boss, these are the ten articles selected from the submissions for the 'Shine' activity. I think this one is the best. This article seems to really understand our product and philosophy. Not only that, but the accompanying photos are super impactful.\"","Song Luosheng took a look. At first, he thought the article was indeed quite good, but then he saw the photos... Wait, that hand looked familiar?","And there was a small mark on the watch strap... that mark... it was his Luokui's!","Song Luosheng looked at the other articles. \"Project the articles and have everyone vote.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luosheng didn't participate in the voting himself, but he watched as his Luokui's article got first place.","\"Notify the winners of these ten articles, then post them online for promotion.\"","\"Sure.\"","When Song Luokui received the notification, she was surprised. She hadn't expected to win at all, given the number of submissions.","Unexpectedly, she got first place, and they even quickly sent her the prize money, and said she could continue submitting to them in the future.","Back at home, Song Luokui looked at her brother Song Luosheng watching the financial news and hesitantly asked, \"Brother, I submitted an article for your company's 'Shine' activity. Did you know about that?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Mmhm.\"","Song Luokui sat beside him. \"How did you know?\"","Song Luosheng grabbed her hand. \"Don't I know your hand? More importantly, the photo you took yourself - look, our products all have serial numbers.\"","Song Luokui hadn't noticed that.","\"So...my first place...\"","Song Luosheng looked at her. \"You earned first place through your own ability. I didn't tell anyone, and I didn't participate in voting or selection.\"","Song Luokui was delighted. \"Thank you, brother.\"","Song Luosheng patted her head. \"What are you thanking me for? You worked hard for it yourself.\"","\"Hehehe.\"","The articles had been published online, and Songhua Technology had even paid to promote them. The first place winner truly deserved it, instantly getting over 100,000 likes."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: Kidnapped","paragraphs":["However, many people were not praising the article because of its content, but because of that picture.","\"I could lick that hand on the screen for a hundred years!\"","\"Damn! The reason I didn't choose the Songhua model originally was because of the design—I didn't think it matched my aesthetics. But after seeing this picture, I'm tempted again!\"","\"Hand fetish treat! That hand looks so good, and that watch looks so good.\"","\"I used to think rose gold looked a bit tacky, but it looks so good now. I've already placed an order!\"","\"The hand and the watch complement each other perfectly. I was going to buy the new model from Shan Yu, but now I'm changing my mind.\"","\"This article is introducing the women's model, but even though I'm a guy, I can buy the couple's edition shown in the picture, heh heh heh.\"","This article kept getting more and more likes. Unexpectedly, just because of one picture, people were walking into Songhua Technology stores and saying while showing the photo on their phones, \"I want this model.\"","\"Sorry, that model is out of stock, but we're rushing to get more. You can pre-order it though~\"","After a week, the sales numbers came out, and Songhua Technology's sales were higher than Shan Yu Company's. The whole office at Songhua was cheering.","Even Song Luosheng didn't expect this.","The marketing manager came to him and said, \"Boss, I suggest we invite the model from that picture over?\"","Song Luosheng waved his hand dismissively. \"No need. She won't agree.\"","Manager: ?","Song Luosheng: \"I know the person whose hand is in that picture. She won't come out.\"","The manager was disappointed. \"Okay then.\"","After leaving the office, the marketing manager suddenly realized—how did the boss know the person in the picture?","Over at Shan Yu Company's office, there was an air of silence. Although their sales were decent, this was the first time they had been outperformed by Songhua Technology.","\"Boss, we've concluded the reason. Their success was mainly due to a picture in an article. The article was very well-written, but the picture was even more eye-catching.\"","As soon as Qi Yu saw the picture, he immediately recognized whose hand it was.","He waved to dismiss everyone, then called Song Luokui. \"Was that article written by you?\"","Song Luokui: \"What?\"","Qi Yu began reciting the article word for word. Song Luokui said, \"...Stop, yes it was me. What's wrong?\"","Qi Yu: \"Nothing, I just wanted to compliment you on your great writing.\" Rather than the picture, he was more impressed by the descriptive writing in the article. Of course, it would be even better if she wrote for his company.","Song Luokui: \"...Thank you for calling just to praise me. You must have recognized it was me who wrote it based on that picture, right?\"","Qi Yu: \"Mmhmm.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" Looks like next time she can't show her hand, or they'll recognize her with their sharp eyes.","...","Song Luokui had just gotten off the bus and was about to cross the street to enter her school when a van suddenly stopped next to her and snatched her inside.","\"Mmph...\" Song Luokui smelled something strange and immediately passed out.","In her class, Xu Jiarong noticed that Song Luokui still hadn't arrived, so she thought maybe Song Luokui was taking the day off. But she sent her a message anyway, which went unanswered.","It was a large lecture class, so the professor didn't take attendance. As a result, the school didn't know Song Luokui was missing. Her roommates Wang Sisi and the others just assumed she had gone home.","Meanwhile, Song Luosheng was in a meeting when he received a call from an unknown number. He didn't answer, but soon after received a photo of Song Luokui tied up and lying on the floor.","Song Luosheng immediately stood up. The manager who had been presenting stopped abruptly, thinking he had said something wrong.","Song Luosheng called the number right away and it was answered. \"Mr. Song, do you remember me?\"","Song Luosheng clenched his fist tightly, the veins bulging. His face was grim but he tried to remain calm. He even hit record. \"What do you want? Li Daqiang, don't you dare touch her!\"","\"Ha ha ha ha ha, does Mr. Song remember the day I begged you for something but you didn't even look at me?\"","\"What do I want? Of course I want Mr. Song dead!\"","Then the call was abruptly hung up. Soon after, he received a message: \"Give me one billion in cash within a day. No reporting to the police, or else... I'll enjoy your sister's tender skin, ha ha ha ha. Get the money ready and I'll tell you where to leave it.\"","Song Luosheng closed his eyes and took a deep breath, his eyes already reddening. \"Meeting adjourned!\"","Lin Xingyan asked, \"What's wrong, boss?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Kuikui has been kidnapped by Li Daqiang. Call the police immediately!\"","Lin Xingyan and Zhou Yuan were both shocked. \"What?!\"","Song Luosheng: \"First, find out where Kuikui is being held captive right away. Zhou Yuan, get one billion in cash ready!\"","Zhou Yuan: \"On it.\"","Lin Xingyan: \"Don't worry boss, I'll call my dad right now.\"","Song Luosheng also made a call, which Song Moqian quickly answered. \"What's going on?\"","Song Luosheng's voice was trembling. \"Dad, Kuikui has been kidnapped.\"","There was some commotion on the other end before Song Moqian's angry yet fearful voice came through. \"What?\"","Song Luosheng quickly explained the situation. Song Moqian soon regained his composure. \"Don't worry, dad will bring Kuikui back safe.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Okay.\"","With one call, the entire city of Jing went on high alert.","When Chen Nan arrived at the company, he complained to Qi Yu, \"I don't know what was going on today, but I saw a bunch of police mobilizing on my way here.\"","Qi Yu was checking up on a restaurant—he wanted to have dinner with Song Luokui.","A little while later, Ji Xiao called Qi Yu. \"Boss, there's some news. Apparently the young Miss from the Song family was kidnapped this morning, and now the whole city is on lockdown.\"","The pen in Qi Yu's hand snapped in half as he gripped it tightly.","Chen Nan was startled. \"B-Boss?\"","Qi Yu stood up, his expression darkening. He made a call. \"I want information on Song Luokui's situation in half an hour.\"","Chen Nan: \"What happened to the Song family's sister?\"","Qi Yu didn't respond. He grabbed his coat and stormed out.","When Song Luokui woke up, she realized a disgusting hand was touching her. She wanted to scream, but her mouth was taped shut—she couldn't make a sound.","However, the fear in her eyes delighted her captor. He patted Song Luokui's cheek. \"Such tender skin.\" Then he tried to reach lower.","Song Luokui immediately struggled, and a voice rang out, \"One-eyed, what are you doing! Don't mess with her!\"","One-eyed turned back. \"I know, I know, this Song family princess is really pretty though. I just wanted to...\"","\"We don't have the money yet. You can do whatever you want after that.\"","\"Heh heh heh, you said it.\"","One-eyed leered at her before leaving with the other man.","Tears streamed down Song Luokui's face, but she took deep breaths to calm herself. From their conversation, it seemed their main goal was money. She was being held in an abandoned construction site.","Her hands and feet were bound, but Song Luokui twisted her body to sit up, recalling what her father had taught her long ago about escaping restraints.","After struggling for several minutes, she untied the ropes on her hands, then ripped the tape off her mouth and untied the bindings on her legs.","She ran to the window and looked out—it was two floors up. Jumping would likely break her legs. But then she noticed a drain pipe nearby.","Hearing voices outside, Song Luokui gritted her teeth, climbed onto the windowsill, grabbed the pipe and slid down. She fell to the ground hard, injuring her hands and feet, but she couldn't worry about that now. She immediately took off running into the woods.","Back on the second floor, One-eyed walked in. \"Damn it! That little brat escaped!\"","\"Damn it, hurry up and chase her!\"","Song Luokui kept running nonstop, stumbling and quickly getting back up to continue running. She only knew that if she were caught, her fate would certainly be miserable!","\"Boom!\" Suddenly, there was a clap of thunder in the sky, and in an instant, it started to pour.","Song Luokui suddenly cried out, \"Ah!\" tripping over something. She then tumbled down a slope, rolling for who knows how long, hitting her head on something, and suddenly passing out.","The place where she fainted was overgrown with dense bushes. The rain was heavy there, washing away her trail of escape. Li Daqiang and One-eyed passed by this spot without noticing her.","On the other side, Song Luosheng and Song Moqian obtained the location of Li Daqiang and the others, and both hurried over.","A helicopter appeared in the sky, while Li Daqiang and One-eyed couldn't find Song Luokui, and they also discovered the special forces' helicopter!","\"Damn! What do we do now?\"","Li Daqiang punched One-eyed, \"You tell me what to do? How did she get away?\"","One-eyed said, \"How would I know that a little woman like her could break free of the ropes and escape! Now what do we do?\"","Li Daqiang replied, \"What can we do? Run!\""]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: Found","paragraphs":["\"Target spotted.\"","\"No hostage found.\"","On the ground, Li Daqiang and One-eyed were running into the woods, with a helicopter quickly descending and several people coming down from above. \"Capture the target, search for the hostage.\"","\"Yes, sir!\"","Soon, Li Daqiang and One-eyed were kneeling on the ground with guns pointed at them. \"Where's the hostage?\"","One-eyed was so frightened that he was almost in tears. \"I don't know, I really don't know. She escaped on her own.\"","On the other side, the police had also searched the abandoned building, only finding the untied ropes.","\"Hurry up and find her!\"","When Chi Yu arrived, he heard that Song Luokui had gone missing, and the kidnappers had been captured alive, but they didn't know where she was either.","Chi Yu immediately headed towards the woods to search for her. Meanwhile, when Song Luosheng received the news, he also rushed into the woods to look for her.","\"Luokui!\"","\"Luokui!\"","Chi Yu was observing the surroundings when he suddenly noticed a shiny hairpin in the bushes. He picked it up and shouted, \"Song Luokui!\"","Song Luokui vaguely heard someone calling her name, but her head was aching, and her body felt freezing cold. The rain had drenched her, her face covered in droplets that washed away the bloodstains on her arms. She moved her lips slightly, whispering, \"I... I'm here.\"","Her voice was faint, and with the heavy rain, no one could hear her.","Chen Nan followed beside Chi Yu with an umbrella. \"Boss, the police are searching. The rain is too heavy here. Shall we head back first?\"","Chi Yu gestured for him to be quiet. \"Did you hear anything?\"","Chen Nan: \"No... no, I didn't.\" All he could hear was the pitter-patter of rain.","Chi Yu called out again, \"Song Luokui!\"","Song Luokui raised her hand. \"I... I'm here.\"","The surroundings were muddy, with dense bushes, trees, and occasional tombstones, creating an eerie scene. Chen Nan cautiously followed Chi Yu, then something white flashed in the corner of his eye on the left.","Chen Nan fixated on it and was nearly scared to death. \"Holy sh*t!\"","Chi Yu immediately stopped. \"What's wrong?\"","Chen Nan pointed to where he had seen the movement. \"I think I saw a pale white hand over there. Boss, this place...\" Could it be haunted?","Before he could finish, Chi Yu had already rushed over. In the bushes, Song Luokui was completely drenched, with blood seeping from her forehead, and she seemed to have lost consciousness. She moved her lips, and when Chi Yu leaned closer, he heard her whisper, \"I'm here.\"","Chi Yu immediately picked her up. \"Contact someone, tell them we found her.\"","Chen Nan: \"Oh, okay, got it.\"","Song Luokui caught a glimpse of Chi Yu in her daze before passing out again.","On the other side, Song Luosheng was still searching when one of the officials accompanying him said they had found her.","\"Young Master Song, she has been found. Let's go back.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Good, let's go.\"","Then, Song Moqian took his daughter from Chi Yu's arms. He looked at Chi Yu and, although unsure why he was there, patted his shoulder gratefully. \"Thank you.\"","Chi Yu: \"She and I are friends.\"","Song Moqian didn't say anything further and left with the ambulance.","As for Chi Yu rescuing Song Luokui, Song Luosheng was unaware of it at the moment.","Song Luokui's injuries weren't severe, just a mild concussion from hitting her head and a fever from being drenched in the rain. After treatment, her condition stabilized quickly.","Everyone felt pained seeing Song Luokui's pale face, fearing a repeat of her childhood struggles. They had raised her with such difficulty, never expecting such an incident to occur.","In the Song family study","Song Luosheng knelt on the ground, shirtless, as Song Moqian wielded a cane, striking his shoulders with \"crack, crack, crack\" sounds, a total of twenty lashes, each leaving a red mark on his body.","Song Luosheng gritted his teeth silently, as this incident was his fault.","After the beating, Song Moqian placed the ointment on the table. \"Next time, you must be more cautious and prevent such an occurrence!\"","\"I understand.\"","Song Luosheng put on his clothes but didn't apply the ointment. He straightened himself up and went to the hospital to see Song Luokui. Although his back was in pain, seeing Song Luokui sitting on the bed, smiling and chatting with Sheng Rong, made the pain more bearable.","Song Luokui stayed in the hospital for two weeks. The school was unaware of what had happened to her; they only knew her family had requested leave.","During one of Song Luosheng's shifts watching over her, he went to buy her food, and Chi Yu came to visit her, bringing flowers.","Recalling the figure she had seen before losing consciousness, Song Luokui asked, \"Was it you who found me? I think I saw you.\"","Chi Yu sat by the bed. \"Yes, it was me.\"","Song Luokui handed him an apple. \"Thank you. When I'm discharged, I'll treat you to a meal or buy you a gift.\"","Chi Yu accepted the apple. \"Okay.\"","\"How did you know I was there?\" Song Luokui was puzzled. Moreover, why was it Chi Yu who came to her rescue? And what about the kidnapping? Why did those people abduct her?","As Chi Yu began peeling the apple with a small knife, a voice came through his earpiece: \"Boss, he's back.\"","Chi Yu continued peeling leisurely. \"Your brother is back. I'll come see you again when I have time.\"","Song Luokui immediately sat up. \"Okay, you should go now.\"","Chi Yu raised an eyebrow, looking at her. \"...So eager for me to leave?\"","Song Luokui became flustered. \"Ah, you should go, hurry, before my brother finds out.\"","Chi Yu handed her the peeled apple. \"Rest well.\"","Then, with long strides, he left. Soon after, Song Luosheng returned with food, noticing the new bouquet of flowers. \"Who just came by?\"","Song Luokui, pretending to play with her phone, felt her heart racing upon hearing the question. \"Huh? Flowers? What flowers?\"","Song Luosheng pointed to the vase with the flowers. \"Weren't those carnations earlier? How did they become tulips?\"","Song Luokui: \"Oh, a friend visited me earlier.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Where did they go?\" That was quick; he had only been gone for about ten minutes.","Song Luokui: \"They had an urgent matter and left first.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Okay, get up. I bought your favorites.\"","\"Thank you, brother.\"","After being discharged, Song Luokui finally learned about the incident. Apparently, Song Luosheng had invested in a project to redevelop a certain area. The demolition and relocation compensation had been settled, and the residents had moved out. The site was already being cleared for reconstruction.","However, some families who had received substantial compensation squandered it on gambling and other indulgences. Li Daqiang and One-eyed were among those families. After losing all the money, they were left with massive debts, with their parents falling ill, wives leaving them, and children suffering from terminal illnesses.","Li Daqiang pleaded with Song Luosheng for additional compensation, even considering breaching the contract they had signed earlier. However, Song Luosheng refused, even when Li Daqiang begged and kowtowed until his head was bleeding.","This fueled Li Daqiang's resentment towards Song Luosheng. Originally, he had intended to do something to Song Luosheng, but when he witnessed Song Luosheng picking up Song Luokui from school, he shifted his focus to her.","One-eyed also wanted the money, so the two conspired and carried out the kidnapping."]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: Company","paragraphs":["Song Moqian: \"From now on, don't take public transportation to school anymore. Dad will arrange a driver for you.\"","As the one in charge of the family, Song Luokui naturally would not object.","Song Luosheng: \"I'll also get Kuikui a car, it'll be safer.\"","No one else objected to this either.","Song Moqian suddenly looked at Song Luokui and hesitated for a moment before asking: \"Are Kuikui and that older brother from the Chi Family on very good terms?\"","Song Luokui was puzzled: \"Huh?\"","Song Luosheng, on the other hand, frowned directly. \"Kuikui has no relationship with that person. Dad, why are you asking this?\"","Song Luokui's gaze shifted, not daring to speak. Could it be that Dad found out? Song Moqian could tell what was going on with just one look, but he didn't ask further: \"Nothing, just asking.\"","Of course he knew that his own son and the one from the Chi Family didn't get along, but he didn't expect his own daughter to seem to have a pretty good relationship with that person from the Chi Family too?","Recalling how Chi Yu said: \"We're friends.\"","Song Moqian studied his precious daughter once more. He was just afraid it wasn't just friendship, but for now he wouldn't meddle in the children's affairs, as long as no major incidents arose.","That night when going to bed, Sheng Rong asked: \"Why were you asking about that child from the Chi Family today?\" Although every parent would feel that their own child is the best, it was undeniable that, in the entire compound, that child from the Chi Family was truly exceptional.","Song Moqian: \"Our daughter was found by that child, and that child even said Kuikui and he are friends.\"","Sheng Rong's eyes widened: \"Friends? Even if they're friends... how did he know what happened to Kuikui, and he even found Kuikui before you did.\" The effort involved in that was no small matter.","Song Moqian: \"For now they're friends, so we won't look too deeply into it.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Aren't you afraid our son will find out and get angry? After all, our son doesn't seem to have a very good relationship with that child from the Chi Family.\"","Song Moqian: \"Young people want to be number one and are full of vigor, it's no big deal. Once they're tempered a bit more, they'll know what's important.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Our daughter has also grown up.\"","Song Moqian: \"Yeah, she used to be so tiny.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Next month, the Cultural Exchange Department will be hosting some VIP guests. I was thinking of bringing Kuikui along to accompany them, what do you think?\"","Song Moqian thought about it and felt it was fine. \"You make the arrangements, and ask Kuikui if she wants to go.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Mm.\"","When Song Luokui heard about this, she was a little surprised, mainly because her parents had never asked her to attend such events before. Why this time...?","\"Kuikui has grown up, so she should go out and socialize more,\" Sheng Rong said as she patted her head.","Song Luokui: \"Mom, I do go out and socialize.\"","Sheng Rong: \"You mean going out with your little girlfriends for tea and chit-chat?\"","Song Luokui: \"Haha... doesn't that count?\"","Sheng Rong: \"Of course it counts, but I hope you can meet more people. Why don't you come with Mom this time?\"","Since her mother said so, Song Luokui naturally didn't refuse. \"Okay~\"","\"I'll help you get excused from classes.\"","\"Mm hmm.\"","It was Song Luokui's first time participating in such an important and serious event, so Sheng Rong even hired an etiquette teacher to come and give her some guidance on things to pay attention to.","Song Luokui studied diligently.","On the day the VIP guests arrived, Song Luokui got up early. She wore a relatively formal qipao dress and did her makeup in a graceful yet innocent style. Standing next to Sheng Rong, the mother and daughter made for a pleasing sight.","The two got into a car and headed to the place where the VIP guests would be received.","They soon arrived at the reception lounge, though the VIP guests had not yet shown up. Song Luokui stayed by Sheng Rong's side as her mother introduced her to everyone.","\"So this is the precious daughter of the Song family? No wonder you're reluctant to let her out, she looks just like a fairy.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Haha, thank you for the praise. Your son is also quite the talent.\"","\"Your son is impressive too. You truly have a pair of outstanding children.\" The person gave them a thumbs up.","The two flattered each other's children.","Song Luokui maintained a smile, standing to the side. She would only say \"hello\" occasionally, answering when someone asked her a question, otherwise just keeping a smiling expression.","After Sheng Rong exchanged some pleasantries with the others, someone came to announce that the VIP guests had arrived.","Soon, the VIP guests walked in from outside. Some of them had also brought their children along.","First were the introductions between the adults, and Song Luokui was brought out to meet the crowd as well, mainly to get acquainted with the children of those VIP guests, aside from her and some other children of elders.","After a while of greetings, everyone took a seat, and of course Song Luokui sat at the \"youth\" table. Soon after sitting, the food was served.","Seated next to Song Luokui was Han Zhengjun, the son of a foreign minister from Country H. He seemed quite interested in Song Luokui. \"Hey, Kui, do you have in-talk? Let's add each other as friends.\" In-talk was a foreign chat app.","Song Luokui: \"Sorry, I don't have that. We don't use in-talk here, we use WeChat.\"","Han Zhengjun: \"Your country really isn't democratic, is your WeChat just a copy of in-talk? Your country loves copying things, like chopsticks - they were clearly invented by our country, but you claim they were invented by yours.\"","Han Zhengjun picked up a pair of chopsticks to pick up some meatballs from the side.","Upon hearing this, the other two young Chinese companions at the table frowned, as did Song Luokui. However, she quickly refuted: \"You probably don't know that WeChat was developed earlier than in-talk. What chat app someone uses has nothing to do with democracy. If chopsticks were invented by your country, then maybe it's because your country originated from ours.\"","Han Zhengjun's eyes went wide, probably not expecting Song Luokui to respond so directly.","The others also watched the two of them, while the other two Chinese accompanying youth, Wang Li and Meng Liangping, immediately tried to stifle their laughter. Wang Li even gave Song Luokui a thumbs up from under the table.","Song Luokui was not intimidated at all. She picked up her chopsticks. \"Also, you're holding the chopsticks incorrectly. With that grip, it'll be very difficult to pick up round foods. You should hold them like this.\" Song Luokui picked up a meatball and placed it in her bowl. \"This way, you can pick up anything.\"","\"Oh, I know, I've seen Chinese people use chopsticks to catch mosquitoes too, right? Just like this, swish swish swish, and you've got the mosquito.\" Another young man from Country D said as he mimicked Song Luokui's grip, even though there were also knives and forks provided.","Song Luokui: \"You're referring to a technique from kung fu movies. I don't think I could pull that off, and there aren't any mosquitoes in this room anyway, otherwise we'd probably all be swatting at them.\" Song Luokui shrugged, and everyone laughed.","Meng Liangping quickly changed the subject by mentioning where he would take them sightseeing tomorrow. As for that Han Zhengjun, he didn't say another word.","The next day, Song Luokui went with Wang Li and the others to take the group to the Great Wall. That Han Zhengjun didn't come near Song Luokui either, instead it was a little girl named Julie from Country Y who held onto her hand the whole time.","\"Kui, you're so pretty.\"","\"Kui, was this Great Wall really man-made?\"","\"Kui, let's take a picture together!\"","\"Kui, can I come study in your country later and hang out with you?\"","Song Luokui: \"Of course.\""]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: The Ball","paragraphs":["In the evening, there was a dance party with more people. When Song Luokui saw Chi Yu at the party, she was somewhat surprised. However, at that moment, the son of a duke from Y Country invited Song Luokui to dance, and she couldn't refuse. Under Chi Yu's gaze, she placed her hand on the duke's son's hand.","Chi Yu took a sip of champagne, refusing a lady's invitation to dance. He walked to a corner, his gaze never leaving Song Luokui in the middle of the dance floor.","On the other side, Song Luokui politely entertained Charlie, the duke's son from Country A, until the music ended. Charlie even kissed the back of Song Luokui's hand, saying, \"You're truly beautiful. When you visit Y Country next time, you can find me.\"","Song Luokui curtsied like a lady, then hurried to the other side. She was about to go to the restroom when a hand reached out from behind a pillar and pulled her into a corner.","Song Luokui: ?","Chi Yu pulled her in front of him. \"Why are you here?\"","Song Luokui shrugged. \"...Didn't you see? I'm accompanying someone. What about you? How did you end up here?\"","Chi Yu took out a handkerchief as he replied, \"I'm a business representative, um... also accompanying someone.\" Then he took Song Luokui's hand and wiped the back of it with the handkerchief.","Song Luokui tried to pull her hand away. \"??? What are you doing?\"","Chi Yu held her hand tightly, not letting her pull it away. \"Helping you clean off the germs.\"","Song Luokui suddenly remembered Charlie kissing the back of her hand earlier. \"You...\"","Chi Yu finished wiping her hand and let go of it. \"Me what?\"","Song Luokui thought back to their previous encounter playing pool and took a step back. \"No... nothing, I'm going to use the restroom.\" She turned and walked away.","Chi Yu leaned against the pillar, watching her leave.","However, when Song Luokui came out of the restroom, she saw Chi Yu leaning against the wall nearby. Her expression immediately became strange. \"What are you doing standing by the restroom?\"","Chi Yu extended his hand to her. \"I want to invite you to dance.\"","Song Luokui's expression was indescribable. \"...\" Why didn't he wait to invite her after she returned to the main hall? What's the point of inviting her right outside the restroom? So, Song Luokui refused.","Song Luokui walked around him, and Chi Yu followed her without getting angry.","When Song Luokui returned to the main hall, she saw Han Zhengjun approaching her, clearly intending to ask her to dance. Did he forget about yesterday's incident?","\"Kui, may I...\"","Song Luokui smiled, turned, and took Chi Yu's arm. \"Sorry, I already have a dance partner.\"","Chi Yu looked down at the hand on his arm, then at Song Luokui as she winked at him. He wrapped his arm around her slim waist and led her to the dance floor.","As for Han Zhengjun, Chi Yu didn't even spare him a glance.","It happened to be a slow dance, but Song Luokui felt a bit awkward. After all, she had just refused someone, then immediately contradicted herself. \"Haha, thank you.\"","Chi Yu: \"Just remember to treat me to a meal.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Sure, sure.\"","Chi Yu reminded her, \"You still owe me from last time.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'll treat you this week. Let me know when you're free and what you want to eat.\"","Chi Yu pondered for a moment. \"I want to try something different.\"","\"Hmm? If not Chinese cuisine, I'm open to other options.\"","\"Accompany me to a private banquet?\"","Song Luokui immediately refused, \"No way.\"","Chi Yu knew she would say that. \"Your brother won't find out.\"","Song Luokui shook her head again. \"Still no.\" Then, realizing she still owed him a meal, she didn't want to outright refuse. \"I can treat you to another meal instead.\"","Chi Yu raised an eyebrow. \"I don't need another meal.\"","Song Luokui pondered for a moment. \"Then I can give you a gift? Or is there something you want?\" She looked up at him.","Chi Yu suddenly said, \"Bring me a meal.\"","Song Luokui: \"What...?\"","Chi Yu: \"Deliver a meal to me at the office.\"","Song Luokui was stunned. \"Huh?\"","Just then, the music ended, and the two walked to the side. Sheng Rong happened to pass by, and Chi Yu greeted her, \"Auntie Sheng.\"","Song Luokui immediately kept her distance from Chi Yu and walked to Sheng Rong's side. \"Mom.\"","Sheng Rong nodded at Chi Yu. \"Don't forget to thank Little Yu for last time. Come to my house for a meal when you're free, Auntie will treat you.\"","Chi Yu: \"No need to be polite, Auntie Sheng. It was something I should have done.\"","Sheng Rong smiled at him. \"Should have?\"","Chi Yu suddenly felt a little embarrassed and didn't say anything else.","Sheng Rong didn't ask further. She patted Song Luokui's hand. \"Have fun. When it's over, let Uncle Kang send you home first. I still have some things to take care of, so I'll stay a bit longer.\"","\"Okay.\"","Sheng Rong said to Chi Yu, \"Little Yu, please take care of Kui Kui.\"","Chi Yu nodded. \"Sure.\"","Sheng Rong soon left. Song Luokui felt a bit tired and moved her feet. The heels she wore tonight were a bit too high, and she had been standing for a while. Out of the corner of her eye, she suddenly saw Han Zhengjun approaching again. Song Luokui immediately grabbed Chi Yu's sleeve. \"Let's go, quickly.\"","Chi Yu turned and understood immediately. He wrapped his arm around Song Luokui's waist, lifted her up, and in a few strides, entered a lounge and set her down.","Song Luokui: ...What just happened? He lifted her up entirely!!!","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu with some embarrassment and indignation. Chi Yu clicked the door shut.","\"Why did you close the door? And earlier...\"","Chi Yu: \"Didn't you not want to see that guy from Country H? Besides, your feet must be tired.\"","Song Luokui: \"But you didn't have to close the door.\" With just the two of them in a lounge, it felt a bit strange. As she spoke, she walked to the couch and sat down. The high heels she wore today were really too high, and her calves were truly tired.","Chi Yu poured her a glass of water from the side. \"If I didn't close the door, you wanted that guy from Country H to come in?\"","Song Luokui: \"...Alright, fine.\"","After taking a sip of water, she felt the atmosphere had become a bit awkward and silent. Song Luokui felt a little uncomfortable, so she continued drinking water, glancing at Chi Yu before looking away.","Chi Yu sat down beside her. \"As for that person earlier, you don't need to pay him any mind. His true identity is actually just a illegitimate son.\"","Song Luokui turned to look at him, her eyes lighting up. \"You even know this kind of gossip?\"","Chi Yu smiled faintly at her reaction. \"Yeah, his family in Country H...\" Then Chi Yu told her the gossip about Han Zhengjun.","After learning that he was an illegitimate son and that his mother had used unscrupulous means and all sorts of other details, Song Luokui wore an expression of disdain. \"No wonder he has no culture or class. He even said our chopsticks were copied from his country. I don't know why he was allowed to come to our country for an exchange program.\"","Chi Yu didn't know about this and frowned slightly. \"You don't need to pay him any mind.\"","Song Luokui agreed, \"You're right.\"","Once the topic opened up, the two quickly became familiar and communicated fluently, moving from gossip and complaints to Chi Yu telling her gossip about the arriving dignitaries, then to the international situation and the global economy.","For the first time, Song Luokui had a direct observation of just how knowledgeable Chi Yu truly was."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: Food Delivery","paragraphs":["As the banquet ended, Chi Yu escorted Song Luokui to her car. As he closed the door, he left her with the words: \"Remember to send the meals.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Yeah, yeah, I know. Bye.\"","\"Goodbye, good night.\"","When she got home, it was already past ten, almost eleven o'clock. Unexpectedly, her brother Song Luosheng was sitting on the sofa in the living room, waiting for her.","Song Luokui took off her high heels and walked over. \"Brother.\"","Song Luosheng was staring at a photo on his phone. Hearing her voice, he immediately turned to look at her, his gaze complex, as if she had betrayed him.","Song Luokui, puzzled: \"Brother?\"","Song Luosheng held up his phone. When Song Luokui saw the photo, her pupils instantly dilated. In the picture, she was dancing with Chi Yu on the dance floor, his arm around her waist, leaning in to speak into her ear.","\"Haha, it's a misunderstanding! Listen to me, brother.\"","Song Luosheng, expressionless: \"You talk.\"","Song Luokui immediately began fabricating in her mind: \"Well, you know, I've been accompanying VIPs these past couple of days. Tonight just happened to be the dance party, so... I couldn't really refuse.\"","Song Luosheng still felt something was amiss. \"Why would he invite you to dance? And he was even talking to you? What did he say?\"","Song Luokui: \"He didn't invite me, I invited him. There was this guy from H Country among the VIPs, and he wanted to come ask me to dance. You know how obnoxious people from H Country can be? He actually said our country isn't democratic! That we plagiarize! He even said our chopsticks were copied from his country!\"","Song Luokui grew increasingly agitated as she spoke. \"Isn't someone like that just infuriating? He even wanted to add me on In-Talk... I shut him down, but the next day he acted like nothing happened and tried to approach me again. I didn't want to deal with him, so I just randomly invited someone nearby to dance. How was I supposed to know it was him?\"","Song Luokui pouted, turning the tables. \"Why didn't you go, brother? He was there. If you'd gone, I definitely would have found you. Brother, is it because you're not as capable as him?\"","Song Luosheng immediately responded: \"I received an invitation too, but I had something to take care of so I didn't go. Which guy from H Country are you talking about? I'll go meet him tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui: \"But tomorrow it'll be mostly over. Who knows if he'll still be around.\"","Song Luosheng loosened his tie: \"Even if he leaves, I'll have ways to find him.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Alright, I'm too tired today. I'll head up first.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Wait!\"","Song Luokui paused, feigning displeasure as she turned around. \"What is it, brother? I'm really tired.\"","Song Luosheng: \"You still haven't told me what Chi Yu said to you.\"","Song Luokui's eyes shifted. \"He asked if you didn't come because you didn't get an invitation. I got angry right away, but you just didn't see it since it was in public and I couldn't make a scene.\"","Song Luosheng frowned: \"He really said that?\"","Song Luokui: \"Mm-hmm.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Don't pay him any mind from now on, Luokui.\"","Song Luokui: \"I know. You and I are on the same side, brother.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Go get some rest now.\"","\"Okay~\"","Song Luokui returned to her room and immediately messaged Chi Yu.","Chi Yu: \"If you don't want to blow your cover, then remember to send me meals a couple more times.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\"","...","Since Song Luokui now had a driver assigned to her home, a former soldier, it wasn't easy for her to just go to the Shanyu Group building to deliver meals to Chi Yu.","She first went to a mall near Shanyu, then snuck over to the Shanyu building. For this, she even wore sunglasses, a hat—luckily the weather had gotten a bit colder, so her bundled-up appearance didn't seem too out of place.","\"I'm at your company's building lobby. Come down quickly to get this, or have someone come down.\" Song Luokui sat somewhat furtively in the first-floor lounge area.","At Chi Yu's desk, the investment manager was briefing him on work. \"I'll have someone escort you up by elevator. I've got something going on right now.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, that works.\"","Soon, a polite receptionist guided her to take the private elevator directly to the CEO's office. \"Ding\"—as the doors opened, Song Luokui saw Chi Yu seated at his desk, with another person standing before him.","That person turned at the sound, laid eyes on her, and immediately widened their eyes in shock.","Song Luokui froze as well, not daring to move.","Seeing her appearance, Chi Yu seemed amused, covering his mouth with a fist to suppress a cough and smile. But his eyes sparkled with mirth as he gestured toward the sofa, telling Song Luokui: \"You can sit over there first.\"","\"Oh... okay.\" Song Luokui obediently took a seat on the sofa, carrying her meal containers.","\"Continue,\" Chi Yu instructed, turning back to the investment manager.","Although curious, the manager proceeded with his briefing. \"Regarding the Ancheng project, we've uncovered some irregularities...\"","Upon hearing \"Ancheng project,\" Song Luokui's eyes blinked—she had overheard Song Luosheng mention it during a phone call that morning as well.","\"The inspection company accepted bribes. That inspection report was likely falsified.\"","Chi Yu: \"Keep investigating. Don't rush into investing for now.\"","\"Understood...\"","After finishing his report, the investment manager left. Chi Yu then walked over and sat down beside Song Luokui. \"Why the disguise?\"","Song Luokui finally removed her sunglasses. \"It's camouflage.\" She handed him the meal containers. \"Here, I need to get going now.\"","Chi Yu: \"So soon?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yeah? Isn't it just to deliver the meals? I've done that now. Uncle An is waiting for me in the car, I can't stay too long or he'll come looking for me.\"","Chi Yu set the containers aside. \"Then let me walk you down first.\"","Song Luokui wanted to refuse, but Chi Yu insisted on accompanying her to the elevator.","The two soon reached the ground floor. Song Luokui put her sunglasses back on. Just as she was about to bid Chi Yu farewell, a familiar young woman approached, delighted upon seeing Chi Yu. \"Brother Chi, did you come down to meet me?\"","Song Luokui: Whoa~","Chi Yu frowned: ?","It was Chen Xinyuan. Song Luokui felt like she had stumbled upon a gossip scene. She prepared to slink behind a nearby pillar and eavesdrop, already taking a step—but her clothes were tugged.","Song Luokui turned toward Chi Yu: Let go.","Chi Yu: \"No, don't sneak off.\"","Song Luokui: ...What did I ever do to you?","Chen Xinyuan had only just noticed Song Luokui, but with her heavy disguise, couldn't tell who she was. As Chen Xinyuan studied her, Song Luokui immediately lowered her head, then turned to stand behind Chi Yu.","If she couldn't leave, she would just hide for now.","Chen Xinyuan craned her neck, trying to get a better look. Song Luokui simply hid directly behind Chi Yu, poking him.","Chi Yu immediately blocked Chen Xinyuan, signaling for security to come over. \"Escort her out. Those without an invitation aren't part of this company—don't let them in again.\"","\"Understood.\"","Chen Xinyuan suddenly looked pitiful. \"Brother Chi, I...\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm an only child in my family, I don't have a sister. This young lady should mind her words in the future.\"","Security: \"Miss, please leave. Otherwise, we'll have to use force.\"","Chen Xinyuan wanted to say something more but was ushered out. However, she lingered outside, still peering in.","Song Luokui wanted to leave but was afraid Chen Xinyuan would see her.","Chi Yu turned to her: \"Let's go upstairs. You can leave after a while if you don't want to be spotted.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Alright, I guess that's the only option. Let me call Uncle An first.\" She explained the situation to the driver Uncle An, saying she had run into a friend and would be staying a bit longer.","Back in Chi Yu's office, she sat playing on her phone while he ate the meal she had brought."]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: You Wanna Kill Me","paragraphs":["After finishing his meal, Chi Yu glanced up and was about to ask Song Luokui if she wanted to tour his company when he saw her asleep on the sofa nearby.","Chi Yu walked over slowly and sat down next to her. After watching her for a little while, he reached out to touch her face, but his hand stopped right before it, and he retracted it. He was about to take off his coat to cover her instead.","Just as he was about to drape the coat over her, Song Luokui shifted slightly, and her eyes shot open. When she saw Chi Yu's face, her gaze instantly turned intense, causing Chi Yu to pause.","It took Song Luokui a moment to regain her composure before her expression softened. She rubbed her eyes, \"Sorry, I didn't sleep well last night.\"","Chi Yu put his coat away and couldn't help but ask, \"Why... do you always look like you want to take me out?\"","Song Luokui: ?","Chi Yu said firmly, \"You wanted to take me out just now, but why?\" He seemed perplexed.","That first glance from her at the mansion felt the same way.","Song Luokui didn't understand, \"What are you talking about?\"","Chi Yu smiled, \"Nothing, should we head back? That person is probably not downstairs anymore.\"","Song Luokui: \"Mm, okay.\"","The two stayed silent as they took the elevator down to the first floor. As Chi Yu saw her out, he couldn't help but ask, \"Is it because of your brother?\"","Song Luokui turned to look at him, blinking, \"You tell me?\"","Chi Yu froze momentarily.","Song Luokui had already waved goodbye and left.","Chi Yu stood there for a while before chuckling and heading back into the building.","In the corner, Chen Xinyuan poked her head out. She finally knew who that woman was - no wonder she seemed so familiar. It was Song Luokui of the Song family. But why was she here?","And why did Chi Yu seem to have such a good relationship with her?","She remembered that the young master of the Song family didn't get along well with Chi Yu. Could it be that...","...","Song Luokui walked for a while before stopping abruptly. It seemed that deep down, she still harbored that thought. Come to think of it, the idea of taking out Chi Yu had been in Song Luokui's mind for a long time.","Back then, she felt that the plot god was being unfair. If the plot god couldn't accommodate her, she would drag the male lead down with her, and they could both be gone.","Maybe then, her brother wouldn't end up as the villain either. On the contrary, without the male lead Chi Yu, her brother might even become the male lead instead.","It was just a thought, she realized later. It wasn't Chi Yu's fault that she felt that way, and he didn't seem to have done anything to her. As for her brother, the two hadn't reached that point yet.","But Chi Yu said \"always\"?","Had she revealed that intention before?","Song Luokui shook her head and left. So what if he knew? She hadn't actually done it. She was probably just tired today, so her subconscious thoughts slipped out when she opened her eyes and saw him.","Song Luokui didn't go straight home but had her driver take her to her brother Song Luosheng's company instead. She even brought afternoon tea.","Song Luosheng: \"Why did you come? Don't you have classes today?\"","Song Luokui: \"Mm-hmm. I came to see you.\" She walked over to his side and happened to notice the plan for the An City Project.","Song Luokui immediately recalled the information she overheard in Chi Yu's office. \"Brother, are you thinking of investing in the An City Project?\"","Song Luosheng didn't hide it from her. \"Still considering it. What's wrong? Suddenly interested in your brother's business?\"","Song Luokui walked over to a potted plant and fidgeted with the leaves. \"Brother, I suggest you don't invest in that project.\"","Song Luosheng: \"What do you know about it?\"","Song Luokui: \"I heard from a friend that there's something fishy about that project. In any case, you should be careful.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Which friend? I didn't know you had friends familiar with An City.\"","Song Luokui: \"Well, it's a classmate from my school. You know there are hidden talents even in schools. I just happened to overhear it. Anyway, I suggest you be cautious.\"","Song Luosheng nodded, \"Alright, I'll look into it thoroughly.\"","\"Mm.\"","\"Since you're free, why don't you join my meeting later? It'll be good practice for when you graduate and work for me.\"","Song Luokui spun around and headed for the door, \"No way. I'm going to take a look around the company. You go ahead.\"","Song Luosheng didn't force her and just smiled and shook his head. However, he did make a call afterward. \"Keep investigating the situation with An City. Send someone undercover to ask around with the locals.\"","\"Yes.\"","Song Luokui left her brother's company after a brief tour, not even staying for half a month. Soon after, some issues with the An City Project were exposed online. First, the land was found to be polluted above safe levels. Not only that, people in the surrounding area had developed cancer, and some even lost their homes and everything. The whole thing blew up, and authorities got involved. Needless to say, the entire project was put on hold.","In the meeting room at Songhua Technology, those who were originally going to invest in the project all breathed a sigh of relief. Initially, when the investment vote started, many had voted in favor. If it had passed, they would have invested five billion into the project.","While losing five billion wouldn't cripple Songhua, their reputation would undoubtedly suffer. Not to mention the potential trouble caused by the aftermath.","However, Song Luosheng directly vetoed it with his single vote in the end. As the primary decision-maker at Songhua, he had the power to veto and make final decisions on everything.","The voting was just to gauge everyone's opinion.","Some didn't understand Song Luosheng's veto at first, as they believed the project would be highly profitable. Someone even asked why on the spot.","Song Luosheng: \"This project has issues. You'll find out later.\" At the time, Song Luosheng's investigation didn't uncover much more, only that there were indeed some red flags.","He then had his people look into Shan Yu Group as well and found no activity on their end. So Song Luosheng knew the project was no good - if it was truly profitable, Shan Yu Group would not have been idle.","As the news report ended, the entire meeting room fell silent. Finally, Zhou Yuan stood up and started clapping, \"Clap, clap, clap,\" the applause echoing through the room.","Lin Xingyan: \"It's all thanks to the boss for vetoing it back then.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Thank goodness, thank goodness.\"","The others in the meeting room also looked relieved. Song Luosheng raised his hand to signal them to stop. \"Alright, that's in the past now. Let's move on to today's new agenda.\"","After the meeting, Song Luosheng immediately called Song Luokui. \"Luokui, you did your brother a huge favor. What do you want?\"","Song Luokui had also seen the news. \"Nothing in particular.\" But then she thought she should probably thank Chi Yu too, so she said, \"If you want to give me something, just give me money.\" She could use it to treat Chi Yu to a meal.","Song Luosheng gave her the money, she treated Chi Yu, and the end result was: Song Luosheng thanked Chi Yu.","Hmm, she didn't know if her brother would be furious if he found out.","What she didn't realize was that because of this incident, the wheels of fate had shifted once again."]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: Evening Party","paragraphs":["Originally, due to the Ancheng project, Song Hua Technology was thrown into a lot of trouble because of this project, falling further and further behind Shanyou. Song Luokui even thought that Zhu Ruan had set a trap for him when he went to Ancheng to resolve the project's issues, leading Song Luokui to despise Zhu Ruan even more.","To the point where in future business competitions, Song Hua Technology began to target Shanyou in many areas, contesting any project Shanyou was involved in. Zhu Ruan gradually started finding Song Luokui annoying as well, and later truly began setting traps for him.","However, since those events haven't happened now, the direction fate's gears are turning has changed from before.","The weather has been getting colder lately, and the New Year has quietly arrived. The school also held an evening gala.","As a rising star in the dance academy, Zhang Xiyue of course participated in this event, even performing a solo dance. With her sister having a performance, Song Luokui definitely had to come and watch.","However, three hours before the gala began, Zhang Xiyue suddenly called, \"Sister, help me!\"","Song Luokui: \"What's wrong?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"My piano partner has a fever and passed out. I don't have a partner now. I asked several people, but none of them feel confident playing 'The Moonlight Serenade.' Luokui, I remember you can play it.\"","Song Luokui could indeed play the piano. Her piano teacher had once said she was a promising student, even suggesting she study abroad and recommending top-level teachers for her in the future.","But back then, she didn't know if she could even live to grow up. Playing the piano was just a hobby for her. If it became a profession, she might not enjoy it anymore, so she declined. Her family, of course, let her do as she pleased, their only wish being for her to live happily and grow up healthy.","Although the teacher thought it was a pity, she taught Song Luokui wholeheartedly, saying she could come back if she changed her mind later.","To this day, Song Luokui still keeps in touch with her piano teacher. 'The Moonlight Serenade' was a piece she played when she was sixteen. It was indeed difficult, but she was rather stubborn and felt she had to learn it. Back then, she practiced for three consecutive months before finally being able to play the entire piece.","\"Okay, I'll come find you.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Thank you, sister.\"","Song Luokui quickly met up with Zhang Xiyue, who was still in the practice room which also had a piano.","When Song Luokui arrived, Zhang Xiyue was warming up. \"You're here. Should we practice once?\"","Song Luokui: \"Will one time be enough?\"","Zhang Xiyue blinked: \"I believe in you.\" From childhood until now, she had never seen Luokui fail to accomplish something she wanted to do.","Luokui was just a bit lazy. Zhang Xiyue felt that if Luokui got serious, her legend would be no less than that of her brother Song Luokui or that Zhiran from the Zhu family.","Song Luokui walked over and sat at the piano. Zhang Xiyue had already assumed her pose. Song Luokui placed her hands on the keys, took a deep breath, and began playing...","The clear, exquisite sound of the piano drifted out from the practice room. Zhang Xiyue followed the music and began to dance gracefully, looking like a princess under the moonlight.","As the piece ended, the sound of applause came from the doorway. Song Luokui and Zhang Xiyue looked over to see a professor from the dance academy.","The professor looked at Song Luokui: \"Are you from the music academy? Which teacher's student are you?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Professor Li, Luokui isn't from the music academy.\"","Professor Li frowned, \"Not from there? Then the theater academy?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"No, Luokui is from the literature academy.\"","Professor Li was surprised to hear this. \"No interest in transferring to the music academy?\"","Song Luokui immediately waved her hand, \"Thank you, professor, but I still prefer the literature academy.\"","Although Professor Li thought it was a bit of a pity - he had thought this young lady was quite good and wanted to introduce her to his wife, a teacher at the music academy, to take her as a student - he understood upon hearing Song Luokui's preference for literature. Although he was from the dance academy, Professor Li had some knowledge of music as well.","Professor Li then turned to Zhang Xiyue, \"Not bad dancing just now. Is that for the evening gala?\"","Zhang Xiyue nodded happily. To be praised by Professor Li was such an honor!","Professor Li: \"Perform well tonight.\"","\"Yes!\"","Professor Li soon left. Seeing that it was almost time, Zhang Xiyue said, \"Let's go to the gymnasium. The gala is being held there.\"","Song Luokui: \"Wait, is it okay for me to just play like this?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"That partner had prepared an outfit, I'll get it for you to wear. Zhu Ruan won't mind.\" Zhang Xiyue sighed, \"With the recent cold weather, Zhu Ruan wore too little and caught a cold. She said she would persist until the end of the gala, but unexpectedly passed out with a fever today.\"","Song Luokui: \"Alright then.\"","The two arrived at the gymnasium's backstage area. Zhang Xiyue went to do her makeup while Song Luokui took the clothes to change.","However, upon opening the outfit, she found that the hem of the dress had been cut into tatters??","Who was trying to sabotage her? That thought flashed through Song Luokui's mind first, but then she realized - no, nobody knew she would be performing.","Song Luokui took the damaged dress and went to find Zhang Xiyue. The backstage area was bustling with people making preparations. Song Luokui approached Zhang Xiyue and whispered to her: \"The dress is ruined, it looks like someone cut it.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"What!\"","Zhang Xiyue took the dress and saw that it had indeed been cut. \"Who would want to sabotage you!\" But then she immediately dismissed her own words, \"No, it's impossible. I only called you for help this afternoon, nobody knew.\"","The two girls looked at each other, both eventually concluding that the target must have been Zhu Ruan. Zhang Xiyue muttered: \"Zhu Ruan is usually a nice person, who would do something like this to her?\"","\"Nevermind, this isn't the time to discuss that. I heard that besides the principal, some important figures are coming to watch the gala tonight. Let me find you another outfit first.\"","Soon, Zhang Xiyue borrowed a dress - although a bit short, it was a strapless princess gown.","The weather was very cold that night. When Song Luokui took the dress to change into it, she immediately broke out in goosebumps.","She quickly put her coat back on, but her legs were still exposed, and the shoes Zhang Xiyue lent her didn't quite fit, though she could still wear them.","After changing into the dress and putting on light makeup, Song Luokui huddled in a corner waiting.","On stage, the host had already announced the start of the gala. Zhang Xiyue also joined Song Luokui huddling in the corner, along with some other performers waiting for their turns.","Zhang Xiyue: \"I should have brought some hand warmers. Luokui, are you cold? Let me go borrow some hand warmers.\"","Of course Song Luokui was cold, she was even afraid her voice would tremble if she spoke. \"It's fine, I can endure it.\"","\"Sorry for the trouble.\" The two girls huddled together.","First on stage was an explosive opening dance performance, followed by singing, skits, and more. Until halfway through the program, it was finally their turn. Zhang Xiyue was the lead, while Song Luokui only needed to play the piano in the corner.","\"Next up, please welcome Zhang Xiyue from our dance academy to present 'The Moonlight Serenade.' A round of applause!\"","*Applause*","Zhang Xiyue took a deep breath and walked barefoot to the center of the stage, assuming her pose. Song Luokui went to the corner and sat at the piano.","With a loud note, the piano music began. A spotlight shone on the center of the stage where Zhang Xiyue, clad in a white tutu, began her graceful dance. The audience let out an awed gasp."]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: Video","paragraphs":["The piano notes gradually climbed to a crescendo, and Zhang Xiyue's dance became increasingly impassioned, as if she were the most beautiful and radiant princess under the moonlight...","Then, with a sudden \"thud\", the piano grew soft and gentle. Zhang Xiyue began to slowly bend down and curl up on the floor, as if all sound had fallen silent and everything around her had become quiet.","The lighting also dimmed, and at the other side in the piano corner, a beam of light shone through, revealing a young girl in a princess gown intently playing the piano. The light illuminated her, making her skin glow like porcelain.","Her hands danced across the piano keys, her eyes lowered and lashes long and curled, inviting one to dance upon them.","\"Wow!\" came a chorus of admiring cries from the audience.","Yet the spotlight quickly faded, and the center stage brightened once more. Zhang Xiyue rose slowly and resumed her lively, unrestrained dance as the piano music grew increasingly urgent and rapid, until it came to an abrupt \"thud\" of an end...","The dance drew to a close, and everyone held their breath. As Zhang Xiyue and Song Luokui bowed, they soon hurried backstage.","\"It's freezing! I'm going to die,\" Zhang Xiyue panted as she scurried away.","Song Luokui was also chilled, hastily grabbing her coat and pulling on her pants, her teeth chattering.","Someone brought them hot water and glanced at Song Luokui several times, for on stage she had been truly breathtaking. As they exited, thunderous applause and cheers echoed through the auditorium.","While Zhang Xiyue was well-known at the dance academy and a frequent guest at school events, many did not recognize Song Luokui. Yet during those brief moments the spotlight fell on her, everyone's breath caught.","Song Luokui accepted the hot water with a \"thank you\" and drank several gulps, finally warming up.","Zhang Xiyue had also warmed up, and by then, videos of their performance had been shared countless times across campus social media groups.","Even before the show ended, Chi Yu had seen the video that Ji Xiao sent him. Chi Yu frowned at the sight of Song Luokui in her strapless mini dress, immediately grabbing a coat and heading to the school.","Backstage, the show finally ended around 9 PM, and Song Luokui left the auditorium with Zhang Xiyue after changing clothes.","\"Are you going home?\" Song Luokui sniffled, her nose already running from those few cold minutes.","Zhang Xiyue shook her head. \"Not tonight. You go ahead, Kukui. Thank you.\" She hugged Song Luokui. \"Remember to have some ginger soup when you get home. I need to see Zhu Ruan and find out if she offended anyone, with her clothes being cut. I'll also investigate that.\"","\"Okay. Call me if you need help.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","\"Bye.\" Zhang Xiyue soon left, while Song Luokui shivered, preparing to go home. But up ahead, Chi Yu appeared, offering her a coat to wear.","Song Luokui looked up in surprise. \"You... what are you doing here?\" Her little face was flushed red from the cold, her makeup still on, giving her an innocent yet alluring look.","Song Luokui glanced around, worried about being seen, then quickly grabbed his coat and hurried to a secluded corner. \"Did you come to watch the show too?\"","Chi Yu caught hold of her clothes. \"My car's over there. It's cold, let's get in?\"","Song Luokui knew this wasn't a good place to talk, especially since she was afraid of being seen by the many people leaving the auditorium.","They soon got into the car, and Chi Yu drove to a quieter area, handing her the hot water and turning up the heat.","Song Luokui sipped the hot water and looked up at him. \"You still haven't answered me.\"","Chi Yu: \"I saw the video of your performance tonight.\"","Song Luokui: \"Hmm?\"","Chi Yu: \"I thought you must be cold.\"","Song Luokui: \"Er... so you came?\" She had indeed been freezing, and while many had complimented their appearance backstage, she hadn't expected Chi Yu to say he thought she was cold.","\"I was really cold, almost frozen, though thankfully it was only for a few minutes,\" Song Luokui added.","Chi Yu: \"Yeah. Why didn't you tell me you were performing? I could have come to watch.\"","Song Luokui sniffled. \"It was a last-minute fill-in. Not a big deal, just a performance.\" Even her family didn't know about it.","Chi Yu: \"Want me to drive you home?\"","Song Luokui nodded. \"Yes, please. Let me call Uncle An so he doesn't need to pick me up.\" She called Uncle An while Chi Yu started the car.","As Chi Yu drove, Ji Xiao suddenly messaged him. Chi Yu had forgotten to put on his headphones, so when he opened the message, Ji Xiao's voice filled the car: \"Bro, should I delete the video of the Sung family girl? A lot of people are sharing it.\"","Upon hearing this, Song Luokui turned her head immediately.","Only then did Chi Yu realize he hadn't put on his headphones. He glanced at Song Luokui, then back at the road. \"Ahem, I...\"","Song Luokui spoke up first: \"What video?\"","Chi Yu: \"Probably the one of your performance tonight.\"","Song Luokui quickly opened her phone. She only had a few group chats: one for her grade and one for her class. Sure enough, someone had shared the video in the class group and even tagged her.","Everyone was complimenting how beautiful she looked and how well she played, along with praising Zhang Xiyue. Overall, people thought the performance was wonderful and a real feast for the eyes.","Those knowledgeable about music said the piece she played was very difficult, but she played it excellently.","The grade group chat also had the video, and even screenshots.","Chi Yu: \"Your performance video has been shared by many people already. Do you want it deleted?\"","Song Luokui closed her phone. \"It's fine, no need.\" Then she thought for a moment. \"If it's being spread online, can it be deleted?\"","Chi Yu: \"It can.\"","Song Luokui: \"Wait, let me ask Xiyue.\" After all, the video featured Xiyue as well, and as a dance student, perhaps Xiyue would prefer the exposure.","It took Zhang Xiyue a while to respond: \"If it's being spread online, we should probably delete it. I think it's better to keep a low profile for now.\"","Song Luokui agreed deleting it was better, so she told Chi Yu: \"If it's being spread online, could you please help delete it? It's fine if people discuss it privately, but is there a fee? I can pay you.\"","Chi Yu: \"No need. I'll have someone delete it. The Ji family has connections, it won't cost anything, and it'll be handled quickly.\"","Song Luokui nodded. \"Okay, thanks. Please thank him for me too.\"","\"Sure.\"","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu for a few moments, biting her lip. For him to come pick her up just because he thought she was cold from her performance, and even help delete the video... If he were just an ordinary friend, she didn't think he'd go to such lengths..."]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: Wei Quan","paragraphs":["Recalling some past events, Song Luokui pondered for a long time.","The car quickly entered the courtyard and stopped not far from the Song family residence, \"We're here.\"","Song Luokui unbuckled her seatbelt, preparing to get out of the car. But she paused for a moment, suddenly leaning closer to Chi Yu, \"What's the matter...?\"","Chi Yu's hands gripped the steering wheel tightly. Turning his head, he looked at Song Luokui who had moved in close. Their faces were just a palm's width apart, and he could clearly see her sparkling eye makeup and smell the faint fragrance on her.","Chi Yu's eyelids flickered as his gaze met Song Luokui's.","Song Luokui could see her reflection in his eyes, but she quickly looked down and reached out to poke his face twice. She could see Chi Yu's eyes widen suddenly, and he swallowed hard. In the dim light of the car, his Adam's apple moved slightly. More than that, Chi Yu seemed to momentarily forget to breathe, not daring to move an inch.","Song Luokui coughed lightly, her fist covering her mouth. Then she returned the coat he had draped over her earlier. \"Thank you for tonight.\" Song Luokui retreated to a safe distance before opening the car door and getting out. She waved at him before running back into her house.","Inside the car, Chi Yu touched the spot where she had poked him. It seemed like someone's scent still lingered. He let out a breath, the corners of his mouth curling up involuntarily, before starting the car and driving home.","...","At the bustling business banquet, glasses clinking and conversations flowing, Song Luosheng was chatting with a business partner.","Suddenly, someone entered the venue and walked straight toward Song Luosheng, catching his attention. Song Luosheng turned to look.","The person smirked, raising his glass to Song Luosheng, \"Long time no see.\"","Song Luosheng blinked, his expression darkening. This troublemaker had actually returned to the country!","Wei Qing, a member of the Wei Family, was a madman who had transferred to Xihua High School during their high school years.","If one were to say that Song Luosheng and Chi Yu had a competitive relationship, leading to a poor relationship and causing the school to be divided into two camps with them as the leaders, then Wei Qing was simply someone who played by his own rules, wandering between the two sides.","He would instigate conflicts, set traps, and use others to achieve his own goals. During high school, there were three major clashes between Song Luosheng and Chi Yu, with \"physical sparring\" sessions arranged between their respective camps.","Originally, Song Luosheng and Chi Yu rarely engaged in physical fights during high school, as they had both matured significantly. However, unpleasant incidents still occurred occasionally.","Two of those larger \"physical sparring\" events involved Wei Qing's instigation, spreading false rumors, and fanning the flames.","It was only later that Chi Yu and Song Luosheng discovered the truth behind these incidents, culminating in their sole collaboration to send Wei Qing out of the country.","At the time, Song Luosheng had asked Wei Qing why he did it. Wei Qing simply smiled happily and innocently replied, \"There's no particular reason. I just found it quite entertaining to watch you two fight. You know, you could never defeat Chi Yu. I told you, if you took him down, you'd be number one forever.\"","\"How about it? Do you need my help?\"","Wei Qing had even stroked his chin then, \"I don't need anything from you. I heard your sister is quite beautiful. Can I play with her?\" At that time, Wei Qing had never actually seen Song Luokui; he had only heard about her.","Initially, Song Luosheng had ignored him, but that final remark had infuriated him completely. Who did Wei Qing think he was? Did he think that just because he was from the Wei Family, Song Luosheng wouldn't dare touch him?","On the other hand, Chi Yu had also asked Wei Qing about his motives. Wei Qing's response was: \"I found it quite exciting whenever you two fought. Don't you think it's fun? Since you find Song Luosheng annoying, always competing with you, why don't I help cripple him? We can watch together as the pride of heaven falls to the dust.\"","\"I don't need anything in return from you. My relative wants to send a gift to your family. Why don't you accept it?\"","Chi Yu narrowed his eyes at Wei Qing. Was he trying to bribe his family? What was he up to? Set a trap for his parents?","Ultimately, Song Luosheng and Chi Yu joined forces to send Wei Qing out of the country. Little did they expect him to return after all these years.","Just like before, Wei Qing seemed more mature, but Song Luosheng's mind immediately set off alarms. This rotten bastard had actually come back to the country.","Seeing that Song Luosheng remained silent, Wei Qing smiled, \"Not welcoming an old schoolmate? Come to think of it, it's been years. I wonder, Mr. Song, or should I say President Song now, if you've ever managed to defeat Chi Yu?\"","At that moment, Chi Yu had just entered the banquet venue, and many people turned to greet him, eager to engage in conversation. Wei Qing, of course, noticed him too. \"Well, speak of the devil,\" he remarked, glancing back at Song Luosheng, \"It seems you still haven't been able to compete with him.\"","Song Luosheng tightened his grip on his glass and glanced at Wei Qing, \"What's it to you?\"","Wei Qing shrugged, saying nothing further, but instead walked over toward Chi Yu, who was conversing with others. Wei Qing inserted himself and clinked his glass against Chi Yu's, producing a \"ding\" sound. \"Old schoolmate, long time no see.\"","Chi Yu looked at him, not recognizing him at first, but then it dawned on him. \"Wei Qing?\"","\"Mmhmm, I didn't expect that after all these years, my old schoolmate would still be so prosperous. It seems that Song fellow still can't beat you,\" Wei Qing remarked with a raised eyebrow. \"Though, I just spoke with Song Luosheng, and his desire to take you down hasn't changed.\"","Chi Yu frowned slightly, not taking Wei Qing's words to heart. He was just surprised that this person had returned to the country. \"It's none of your concern.\"","Wei Qing arched an eyebrow, \"I find that you two speak in the same way. Don't tell me your relationship has improved?\"","Chi Yu didn't respond. While his relationship with Song Luosheng wasn't good, it was still better than with Wei Qing.","Seeing that Chi Yu ignored him, Wei Qing shrugged and left.","Wei Qing ascended to the second floor, looking back and forth between Song Luosheng and Chi Yu, his eyes darting constantly. Those who knew Wei Qing were aware that he was up to no good again.","Meanwhile, Zhang Xiyue had finally identified the person responsible for cutting Zhu Ruan's dress. Or rather, that person's target wasn't actually to ruin Zhu Ruan's dress but to sabotage Zhang Xiyue's show.","The person couldn't afford to offend Zhang Xiyue, so she targeted the more vulnerable Zhu Ruan instead. Zhu Ruan's family situation wasn't great. Her ability to study piano stemmed primarily from her natural talent. The school provided financial aid, and she worked hard to earn scholarships and took on part-time jobs. Zhu Ruan was genuinely talented, or else Zhang Xiyue wouldn't have recruited her to help train for the show.","The gown was a rental for Zhu Ruan, quite expensive for her. That person wanted to mess with her psyche.","However, they didn't expect the performer to be replaced, and the show ended up receiving widespread praise and acclaim.","\"It was Zhao Liya. I had someone warn her before, but I didn't expect her to still want to do something to me,\" Zhang Xiyue fumed.","Song Luokui asked, \"Didn't you get Zhou Yuan to teach that scumbag ex a lesson? Why didn't he deal with her too?\"","Zhang Xiyue replied, \"She's a woman, so Zhou Yuan just had someone warn her. The scumbag ex got taught a lesson long ago. Who would even bother with someone like her now? Her reputation is ruined, isn't it? She can't possibly think it's my fault that she ended up like this, so she wants revenge on me, right?\"","Song Luokui asked, \"Probably. So what are you going to do?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Anyway, I've already informed the school, and they'll definitely punish her. Not only that, but I'll also make her post an apology notice at the school. I want everyone to know her true colors, really, what kind of person is she?\""]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: Hot Spring","paragraphs":["\"Well done, that's how it should be. I thought you'd be hesitant to handle it like before,\" Song Luokui said, satisfied with the result.","Zhang Xiyue: \"Haha, I've learned my lesson. I won't act like that anymore. I still need to explain the situation to Zhu Ruan though, it was my fault. I'll go find her first.\"","\"Okay, bye.\"","\"Bye.\"","On the day winter break started, Chi Yu messaged her, saying he wanted to celebrate her vacation by taking her out for hot pot.","Song Luokui: ...She's on vacation, so she's treating him to hot pot. No problem there.","When the car stopped in the underground parking lot, the two of them got out of the car. On the other side, Wei Qing happened to see them, but Song Luokui's face was hidden under her scarf, so Wei Qing didn't see her face.","However, he was still surprised that Chi Yu was with a girl. As the two walked and chatted, they seemed to have a good relationship. Wei Qing asked the person next to him, \"Who is she? Why is she with Chi Yu? Did Chi Yu get a girlfriend?\"","The person next to him had never seen her either and was also surprised. \"I can't see her face clearly, so I don't know who she is. I haven't heard anything about Chi Yu from that family getting a girlfriend.\"","Wei Qing squinted his eyes as he watched their receding figures.","On the other side, Song Luokui and Chi Yu entered an elevator and arrived at a hot pot restaurant, booking a private room. The two chatted while eating.","\"Do you have any plans for the vacation? Want to go somewhere to play?\" Chi Yu asked.","Song Luokui shook her head, \"It's too cold, I don't want to go out.\"","Chi Yu: \"A friend of mine just opened a new hot spring resort. Do you want to go soak in the hot springs?\"","\"Hot springs?\" Song Luokui thought it sounded nice when she heard it.","Chi Yu: \"You can go with your friends.\"","Song Luokui: \"Let me think about it, I'll ask my friends.\"","\"Mm.\" Chi Yu picked some seared beef slices for her.","After eating their fill, the two left.","On the other side, Wei Qing was having someone investigate who the girl with Chi Yu was.","Song Luokui was completely unaware of this.","After returning, Song Luokui saw that everyone in the group chat was discussing where to meet up next.","Lou Sasa: \"Come to my place? Not outdoors, let's stay indoors.\"","Weng Jiao: \"But what's there to do indoors? It's too cold for me to even want to go out. Why don't we go on vacation in the Southern Hemisphere?\"","Zhou Yue: \"I don't want to go somewhere too far away. Is there a warm and fun place nearby?\"","Song Luokui: \"Hot springs? Want to go?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"That sounds good, soaking in hot springs is the best when it's cold outside. I heard there's a new hot spring resort that just opened in Du Xian Mountain in the suburbs. Should we go there?\"","Du Xian Mountain? Isn't that the one Chi Yu told her about? What a coincidence!","After some discussion in the group, everyone agreed.","Two days later, Song Luokui drove with her sisters to Du Xian Mountain. A line of luxury cars drove up the mountain side by side, and many people were taking photos.","In the room, Zhang Xiyue and the others changed into swimsuits, then wrapped themselves in big towels, ready to soak in the hot springs.","Zhang Xiyue had already changed her clothes, but Song Luokui was still wearing her down jacket and coat. \"Luokui, aren't you going to change?\"","Song Luokui: \"Wait a bit, I'll change soon. You all go ahead.\"","\"Okay, hurry up then.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","Zhang Xiyue and the others went to the hot spring pool they had reserved first. Song Luokui took her swimsuit to change, then also wrapped herself in a big towel before heading to the hot spring pool.","The group soaked in the hot spring pool while chatting, occasionally splashing water at each other and laughing when someone said something funny.","Song Luokui's face was flushed red from the hot water. She put her phone in a waterproof bag and sent a message to Chi Yu: \"The hot spring resort you mentioned is really nice.\"","Chi Yu: \"You went there?\"","Song Luokui: \"Mm-hmm, with my sisters.\"","Chi Yu: \"Have fun.\"","Song Luokui didn't reply again, just chatting and laughing with everyone.","\"The one from the Wei Family is back in the country.\"","\"The Wei Family? That Wei Family?\"","\"Yeah, the crazy Wei Family. Speaking of which, why does the Wei Family always produce crazy people? I heard that a long time ago, before the country was founded, the Wei Family didn't allow marriages outside the family. It was only after the country was founded that they slowly started changing that. So there must be some...you know, genetic issues.\"","\"You mean Wei Qing, right? I heard he went abroad during high school. He only recently came back.\"","Lou Sasa raised her hand and looked at Song Luokui. \"I know about that. It seems like he was sent abroad by your brother, Luokui.\"","Song Luokui frowned. \"Wei Qing? I don't know him, and I haven't heard my brother mention him either.\"","Lou Sasa: \"That's right. Aside from your brother, it seems Chi Yu from that family also helped make it happen.\"","Song Luokui was even more confused. Her brother actually did something together with Chi Yu to send this Wei Qing person abroad?","The name Wei Qing sounded a bit familiar, but she was sure she didn't know this person.","\"My brother didn't mention it,\" Song Luokui said.","Lou Sasa: \"He probably thought it wasn't important, it was just something between the men. My brother told me about it. We have some...minor business dealings with the Wei Family, but our relationship is just average, nothing particularly good. As for Wei Qing...he's a bit abnormal.\"","\"What do you mean?\" everyone asked curiously.","Lou Sasa: \"When Wei Qing was in school, he seemed to keep transferring. At first, many people would become friends with him, but it wouldn't be long before they had a falling out. It happened with everyone.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Ah? Is he like Tea Sis, two-faced? Or what?\"","Weng Jiao: \"Then he and Tea Sis would make a good match.\"","Lou Sasa: \"I'm not sure either. Anyway, he went abroad during high school, and there was no more news of him in our circles. But the Wei Family doted on him a lot, I heard they cleaned up many of his messes. Oh, and many girls also liked him.\"","Everyone was puzzled: \"Why?\"","Lou Sasa: \"He's handsome, and he's from the Wei Family. If they married him, their family's status would rise even higher.\"","Tu Shanyue, who had been silent the whole time, spoke up: \"Speaking of marriage, my family is also planning an arranged marriage for me.\"","Everyone immediately looked at her. \"You?\"","Tu Shanyue: \"Mm-hmm.\"","Zhou Yue: \"Your family...doesn't need an arranged marriage, right?\" Everyone felt it was puzzling since the Tu Family was also a prestigious family, and it seemed unnecessary for them to have an arranged marriage.","Tu Shanyue shrugged. \"It's not exactly called an arranged marriage. Anyway, my mom is already helping me look for potential matches, she thinks it's best if it's someone from our circles. She's afraid I'll fall for some poor guy or something. The people I've dated before weren't from our circles, although they weren't exactly poor, but in my mom's eyes, they weren't good enough.\"","As she finished speaking, everyone looked at Zhang Xiyue, who had previously dated someone they all considered a poor guy.","Zhang Xiyue felt embarrassed. \"Why are you all looking at me? I've already broken up with that scumbag, can't this dark history be left in the past?\"","Tu Shanyue: \"Forget about me, do you all think your families would let you marry a poor guy?\"","Everyone shook their heads. They all knew deep down that even if they couldn't find true love within their circles, they would never be able to marry a poor guy. The idea of abandoning their family to elope with a poor person was impossible.","Of course, there were some romantics in their circles, and such things had happened before. But the outcomes...weren't very good. After that incident, all the parents in their circles used it as a cautionary tale to warn their children."]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: Come","paragraphs":["Weng Jiao: \"Now that you mention it, I also remembered my mom recently asked me if I've been going out, and she even told me to hang out with some of the boys in our circle, to get to know more guys, and not just stay with you guys all the time... I found it strange.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Ah, I didn't expect that we've all reached the age where we can get married.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Let me see which one of us will get married the earliest.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Definitely not me, no one's pursuing me.\"","Zhou Yue: \"Maybe Tu Shanyue. She's started taking a look at potential partners.\"","Tu Shanyue blinked her eyes: \"Not necessarily, it's just taking a look, not getting married. Besides, I haven't graduated yet, I'd have to at least wait until I graduate before getting married, right?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Could it be me? I don't want to be hung up on just one guy now.\"","Weng Jiao: \"If we're talking about paper brides, I could be the first one.\"","Finally, everyone looked at Song Luokui, but they all shook their heads, \"Her brother Chi Yu won't agree, let's not even mention it.\"","Song Luokui: ???","\"Alright, let's not soak for too long, let's head back,\" Lou Sasa stood up first.","Zhang Xiyue followed, \"Yeah, let's go eat something delicious.\"","The group walked along the corridor wrapped in large towels, as there was heating, no one felt cold.","Occasionally, they would bump into one or two people out for a stroll.","After turning a corner, a few people were coming their way. Lou Sasa and Zhang Xiyue at the front instantly stopped, and Song Luokui almost bumped into Weng Jiao in front of her. \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui looked up and made eye contact with Chi Yu. Her eyes widened a little as she saw the people beside him, and she immediately lowered her head. Why was he here too?","Lou Sasa and Zhang Xiyue in the front didn't expect to run into them, and they couldn't help but stop. Weng Jiao had to nudge them from behind before they reacted and quickly walked past.","Song Luokui was at the back, and after walking a distance, she turned her head again, only to find Chi Yu also turning to look at her. Song Luokui immediately turned her head back and caught up with the others.","\"Bro, should I point out a few for you later?\" Zhan Chaozhi noticed Chi Yu turning his head to look at those few girls, thinking he wanted to do...that.","Chi Yu didn't say a word, but Chen Nan gave him a smack, \"Get lost, doesn't the big boss have a cleanliness fetish? Don't ask for dirty stuff.\"","Zhan Chaozhi laughed awkwardly, \"Got it, I thought...\"","Chen Nan: \"The big boss just stopped because he saw someone he knew.\" Chen Nan felt very proud in his heart, heh heh, only he knew the big boss's secret. Wasn't that Song Luokui, the Song family's youngest daughter, just now?","At that moment, Chi Yu was thinking about the long, fair legs of Song Luokui that he had just seen. He asked, \"Don't you have any private hot spring rooms here?\"","Zhan Chaozhi: \"We do, but they were fully booked earlier, and there aren't many of those designed.\"","\"I see.\"","When Song Luokui and the others returned to their room, they ordered a bunch of food to be sent directly to the room. As they ate and chatted, someone said, \"That was a fright earlier, why was Chi Yu from the Chi family here?\"","Weng Jiao: \"Didn't you all know? This hot spring resort belongs to the Zhan family, that was Zhan Chaozhi we saw earlier. It's his place, and Zhan Chaozhi called Chi Yu 'bro'.\"","Everyone immediately understood.","Zhang Xiyue: \"So we ended up at the enemy's resort.\"","Lou Sasa: \"So what? As long as we're having fun.\"","\"You're right, let's eat, it's quite delicious.\"","Song Luokui didn't say anything on the side. She sent Chi Yu a message, \"Why did you come here?\"","Chi Yu: \"Had some business.\"","\"Oh.\" Not because of her coming here, then.","After eating and drinking their fill, everyone felt sleepy and went back to their rooms to rest. Song Luokui also wanted to return to her room to rest, but then Chi Yu sent her a picture of the mountain scenery, \"Want to come?\"","Song Luokui walked to the window and looked up at the mountain peak, unable to see clearly. Then Chi Yu's call came, and Song Luokui immediately answered.","Chi Yu: \"Do you want to come over? This place isn't open to the public.\"","Upon hearing it wasn't open to the public, Song Luokui replied, \"I'll go, wait for me.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll have someone pick you up.\"","Song Luokui quickly changed her clothes and carefully went out. Downstairs, someone was already waiting for her. \"Are you Miss Song?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yes, I am.\"","The staff member: \"Hello, Mr. Chi asked me to pick you up. This way, please.\"","\"Okay, thank you.\"","Following the staff member, they then got into a small vehicle heading towards the mountain peak. After about ten minutes, the vehicle reached the summit.","Chi Yu was already waiting there. He approached and placed his hand on the top of the car door to support her as she got out, preventing her head from hitting the roof.","Song Luokui held his hand as she got out, \"Thank you.\"","After a few steps, they arrived at a pavilion on the summit with a table and a few chairs. On the table were tea sets, with steam rising from the hot tea water and a fragrant aroma.","Chi Yu gestured for her to take a seat, then started brewing the tea. Finally, he poured a cup and handed it to her.","\"Thank you.\" Song Luokui took it and had a sip, tasting the rich tea fragrance. \"It's very good.\"","Chi Yu also had a sip, and the two looked down at the scenery below. It hadn't snowed in Jing City yet, but the higher elevation near the summit was already covered in white snow.","As it was winter, all the trees had shed their leaves, leaving only bare branches that gave a desolate feeling. The hot spring resort stood in the middle of it all, truly a dwelling deep in the mountains.","\"Should I help you take a picture?\"","Song Luokui turned to look at him: ?","Chi Yu took out his phone. \"Want to?\"","Song Luokui: \"Sure!\"","Song Luokui stood up and chose a nice background, while Chi Yu held the phone, finding a good angle to capture her photo.","After taking it, Song Luokui came over to check and found that Chi Yu had taken quite a good shot. \"Send it to me. Do you want me to take one for you?\"","Chi Yu walked to where Song Luokui had stood earlier. Song Luokui opened the camera – truly, good-looking people looked good no matter how they were photographed, without needing any posing. Chi Yu simply stood there, with the white snow behind him, making him look even more aloof and pure.","Song Luokui blinked, clicked the shutter, \"Got it, let me send it to you to take a look.\"","\"Okay.\"","Then the two sat back down, drinking tea while chatting, until Song Luokui noticed the time and was worried that her sisters might have woken up and couldn't find her, so she said, \"I should go back.\"","As she was about to stand up, Chi Yu swiftly reached out and pressed his large, warm hand over hers, preventing her from getting up. Song Luokui: ?","Chi Yu: \"In a few days, Hali Kaisi will come to our country seeking cooperation. He approached me, but I didn't agree. If he approaches your brother, it's best for him not to agree either.\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah?\" She had received some good information, but why was he suddenly telling her this?","Chi Yu smiled: \"Consider this a thank-you gift for accompanying me today.\"","Song Luokui: \"I... I understand. I'll let him know.\"","Chi Yu then withdrew his hand and stood up. \"Let's go, I'll go back with you.\"","The two took the vehicle back down the mountain.","Upon returning to the resort, before getting off the vehicle, Song Luokui turned to look at him again and smiled, \"Thank you.\"","Then she got off and left. Chi Yu paused for a moment, then also smiled.","Watching from the side, Zhan Chaozhi muttered, \"Tsk tsk tsk, I think I understand now.\""]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: The First Snow","paragraphs":["[Translated with glossary terms replaced]:","Chi Yu left the Hotspring Villa that same day, but that evening he posted a friend circle update, which Song Luokui saw.","It was just a picture, a very familiar one, of the table in the pavilion on the mountaintop where the two of them had been. There were teacups and steaming hot tea on the table, with wisps of steam wafting up. It was obvious that two people had been drinking tea there.","As for who he was drinking tea with, only a handful of people knew.","Song Luokui blinked, and eventually gave it a 'like'.","Song Luokui and her group stayed at the Hotspring Villa for three days before returning, while on the other side, Wei Qing finally learned who had been dining with Chi Yu. It turned out to be Song Luosheng's sister, Song Luokui!","Looking at the photo in the file, and the feat Song Luokui had performed at school, Wei Qing's eyes were filled with interest. She hadn't expected Song Luosheng's sister to be so... truly enviable.","However, if Song Luosheng's sister was so close with Chi Yu, did that mean the relationship between Song Luosheng and Chi Yu was just a facade?","Wei Qing never imagined that Song Luosheng was completely unaware of Song Luokui's dinner with Chi Yu.","On Song Luokui's side, when she saw the news that Hali Kaisi was coming to Hua Country, she immediately remembered what Chi Yu had said.","Song Luokui got up and decided to go to her brother's company.","Many people at the company were already familiar with her - the extremely good-looking sister of their great boss who also had a wonderful personality. Just seeing her was a treat for the eyes.","\"Hello, Miss Song.\"","\"Miss Song, are you here to see the boss?\"","Song Luokui: \"Hello, yes I am.\"","She arrived at Song Luosheng's office, and he seemed a bit surprised. \"Why did you come?\" He hadn't asked her to bring him food recently, and Luokui didn't seem too keen on coming here, saying the office had a rather gloomy atmosphere, so she didn't visit often. Song Luosheng was quite surprised to see her come of her own accord.","Song Luokui: \"Nothing much... just came to see you. Oh, I saw in the news that Hali Kaisi has come to our country. I remember when we went to Country A, you seemed to be trying to meet with him?\"","If it weren't for what had happened back then, her brother would probably have met with Hali Kaisi, but it seemed Hali Kaisi hadn't arrived at the venue, and then left Country A a few days later, so Song Luosheng never got to meet him.","Song Luosheng felt Song Luokui was acting a bit strange today. \"Yeah, so what about it?\"","Song Luokui: \"Do you want to work with Hali Kaisi, brother?\"","Song Luosheng put down his pen. \"Who told you anything?\"","Song Luokui: \"...No one. I just looked into it, and it seems Hali Kaisi has some not-so-good reputation. I'm a bit worried that if you work with him, there might be some negative consequences.\"","Song Luosheng: \"A lot of what's online is made up. Don't I also have some bad reviews online myself?\"","Now it was Song Luokui's turn to be surprised. \"You have bad reviews? I thought everyone just praises how good-looking you are?\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Luokui, in the business world, it's not just about looks.\"","Song Luokui shrugged. \"So do people actually praise how good-looking you are?\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Well, there is that.\" There was even a comment online saying that he and Chi Yu had saved everyone's aesthetic standards for business tycoons, since many tycoons really didn't look that great... Then these two extremely outstanding ones suddenly appeared, and people finally felt that the faces of tycoons in novels had become real.","Song Luokui took out her phone to look for bad reviews about Song Luosheng. \"Let me see what people are saying to criticize you.\"","She went directly to Song Luosheng's social media account to check the comments on his posts, which were all just re-shares of Songhua Technology's new product launches and so on.","His newest post had quite a lot of comments, over ten thousand of them. Song Luokui clicked in to take a look...","\"Big brother, you're so handsome! Post a selfie, please!\"","\"Poor big brother boss [pitiful], save these kids, give us some eye candy (post a selfie)\"","\"This is the first time I've seen you online, big brother, and I knew right away my heart had fallen for you [shy]. I've given you my heart, big brother, when will you give me yours? [shy]\"","The top comments were just a string of fawning confessions of love.","Song Luokui showed him the screen. \"Look, where are the criticisms? These compliments outdo even what I could come up with.\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Come to think of it, I haven't seen you buttering me up since you grew up?\"","Song Luosheng immediately commented under his own post. \"Just you wait, I'll leave you a comment.\" After typing for a bit, he posted.","Song Luosheng finally opened the 999+ notifications. The newest one was from Luokui's account saying: My brother is unquestionably the most beautiful person in Hua Country!","Song Luosheng covered his face: \"...\"","Song Luokui: \"Alright, I didn't come here to talk about this. About Hali Kaisi...\"","Song Luosheng cut her off. \"I'll look into everything thoroughly. He did contact me about working together, but a collaboration isn't something to be done hastily. I'll investigate all aspects before making a decision.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, I'll head back then.\"","Song Luosheng stood up. \"So soon?\" He checked the time, then stood. \"Come on, there's a mall nearby. I'll go with you and buy you whatever you want.\"","Song Luokui: \"Alright then.\"","Song Luokui followed Song Luosheng around the mall and left with plenty of purchases. After returning to his office, Song Luosheng called Lin Xingyan. \"Xingyan, find a private investigator overseas to look into Hali Kaisi's background.\"","\"Got it.\"","As the weather grew colder, one evening Song Luokui was reading in her room when Aunt Gui's voice came from outside: \"Young Miss, it's snowing outside.\"","Song Luokui immediately went to the window to look. Sure enough, flakes of white snow were falling. She opened the window and stretched out her hand - a snowflake landed on her palm, icy cold. The snow had arrived particularly late this year.","Meanwhile, Chi Yu was working late in his office. When he looked up, he saw the heavy snowfall outside. After watching for a while, he immediately grabbed his coat and left the office.","He drove back to the mansion and the first thing he did was head towards the Song residence nearby. From his vantage point, he could see Song Luokui's window where a figure was standing - it was clearly her.","Chi Yu took out his phone and dialed a number. \"It's me. Would you like to... come out?\"","Song Luokui: \"Hm?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm downstairs from your home.\"","Song Luokui immediately went to the side balcony and leaned out. She saw the familiar car not far from her house, and could vaguely make out Chi Yu on the phone.","Song Luokui: \"Why did you come?\"","Chi Yu: \"The first snow. Want to watch it together?\" After saying those words, there was a long silence on the other end.","Chi Yu thought she might not come out after all, and his hopeful heart sank a little. Just as he was about to say something, a voice finally came through. \"Okay, wait for me then.\"","\"Sure.\" Chi Yu's sinking heart lifted, pounding hard. A soft laugh came from inside the car.","Song Luokui bundled up warmly, snuck downstairs, and quietly opened the door before running out.","Chi Yu was standing by the car door. Seeing her run over, he opened the door for her to get in.","Chi Yu then got into the passenger seat himself, and drove away.","Song Luokui: \"Where are we going?\" She thought they'd just stay nearby.","Chi Yu: \"To watch the snow.\""]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: Watch the Snow","paragraphs":["Song Luokui never expected that Chi Yu would take her to Jing Mountain Park. At this time, there was no one at Jing Mountain Park. The two climbed up one of the peaks, from where they could see the entire Forbidden City.","Snow flurried, dim lights glowed, Song Luokui looked up at the snow, and Chi Yu looked up for a moment before turning to gaze at her.","\"Achoo!\" Song Luokui suddenly sneezed, rubbing her hands. The scenery was beautiful, but it seemed a little cold.","Chi Yu suddenly took off his scarf and wrapped it around her. Song Luokui looked up at him - his long eyelashes, high nose bridge, exquisite face, as he leaned down to carefully wrap the scarf around her neck.","After he finished wrapping the scarf, Chi Yu looked up, meeting her gaze.","Song Luokui immediately sensed that the atmosphere now seemed a bit ambiguous, no - it should be very... She saw Chi Yu suddenly raise his hand, his fingers gently touching her cheek...","Suddenly, footsteps could be heard coming from the stairs. Song Luokui immediately took a step back, looking towards the stairs, where a man was holding something.","Chi Yu stood up and walked over. The man handed Chi Yu the items, then left. Chi Yu was holding two hot drinks, offering one to her.","Song Luokui took it, appreciating his thoughtfulness. Sipping the hot cocoa and admiring the snowy scenery, she even took a photo. After finishing the hot cocoa and enjoying the view for a while longer,","Chi Yu suddenly asked, \"Do you want to enter the Forbidden City?\"","Song Luokui: \"It seems quite late now, it's probably closed, right?\" Then, recalling the Chi family's status, she realized entering might not be difficult. She shook her head, \"Let's not go in.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then do you want a late night snack?\"","Song Luokui checked the time - it was indeed a good time for a late night snack. \"Where shall we go?\"","Chi Yu led her down, the ground covered in snow. Worried she might slip, he grabbed her wrist through her clothes. \"Hold onto me, so you don't fall.\"","\"Mm.\" Song Luokui didn't act coy either. After they went down, Chi Yu took her to a private club. In a private room with glass walls overlooking the snowy scene, they enjoyed a hot pot meal. Overall, Song Luokui felt very satisfied.","After midnight, Chi Yu finally sent Song Luokui home. She tiptoed back, feeling for the first time that living at home seemed inconvenient, mainly because she didn't want her family to find out.","Back in her room, she realized she was still wearing Chi Yu's scarf. \"I still have your scarf. I'll wash it and return it.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mm, no rush.\"","The next day, she woke up to a snow-white Beijing, with the New Year atmosphere gradually thickening. In less than two weeks, it would be the new year.","Her family had started the big clean-up, and various New Year supplies were slowly being purchased. In addition to the Song family, the entire courtyard was being cleaned, and even the trees were being decorated.","Before the holiday, Song Hua Technology held its annual gala, and Song Luosheng invited Song Luokui to attend.","In addition to dining and prize drawings, there would be performances, and it was said that popular celebrities had been invited to sing.","Of course Song Luokui would go. The gala started at 7pm, held at a venue in an international convention center that had been rented out.","Unexpectedly, Mountain Yu Technology was also holding its gala there. So when Song Luosheng drove Song Luokui to the convention center parking lot, as soon as they got out of the car, they saw Chi Yu getting out of a car on the opposite side, looking both surprised and uncomfortable.","Song Luokui glanced at Chi Yu, then immediately lowered her head. Chi Yu also noticed Song Luokui's exposed ankles and frowned, wondering what kind of brother Song Luosheng was.","Song Luokui was wearing a dress inside, with a long down jacket reaching her ankles. She wore high heels but no socks, so Chi Yu felt she must be cold.","Song Luokui glanced at Chi Yu, then immediately lowered her head again - she still hadn't returned his scarf.","Song Luosheng let out a soft \"hmph\", pulling Song Luokui towards the elevator, while Chi Yu's group did the same.","The elevator ride was silent. Along the way, Chen Nan received a call saying the gala was about to start and asking when the boss would arrive.","Chen Nan: \"We'll be there soon.\"","Hearing that they were also holding their gala here at the same time and place made Song Luosheng even more uncomfortable. What was Chi Yu's intent?","The elevator soon arrived. Song Luosheng muttered, \"Learning from others,\" before pulling Song Luokui out. Chi Yu's group went up to the next floor.","It was only then that Chen Nan said, \"Boss, it seems Song Hua is also holding its gala here.\"","Chi Yu thought of Song Luokui, wondering why she seemed so well-dressed today. Then he worried - would someone invite her to dance at the gala?","Chi Yu's hand instantly clenched.","Meanwhile, Song Luosheng and Song Luokui arrived at the venue, sitting in the front row.","Lin Xingyan: \"Sir, since you're here, shall we begin?\"","Song Luosheng nodded: \"Everyone's arrived, so let's start.\"","Soon, Lin Xingyan took the stage. \"Quiet please, I hereby announce the start of Song Hua Technology's annual gala. First, let's invite our Chairman, Song Luosheng, to give a speech.\"","\"Applause\" rang out from the energetic audience.","Song Luosheng straightened his tie and went on stage. The staff began serving food below, so employees could eat while watching the performances later.","Song Luosheng first greeted everyone, then summarized the year's achievements, praising and encouraging the employees. \"Thank you all for your contributions to the company. Enjoy yourselves tonight, and happy early New Year!\"","The crowd replied, \"Happy New Year!\"","After Song Luosheng stepped down, two hosts appeared on stage to begin the performances.","While eating, Song Luokui watched the performances, which included celebrity singers as well as employee acts.","After returning to his seat, Song Luosheng had barely taken two bites before waves of people started coming over to toast him.","\"Thank you for your leadership, Chairman. It's the reason for Song Hua's growing success.\"","Song Luosheng looked full of vigor. \"Thank you, thank you, it's thanks to your support.\"","Seeing Song Luosheng drinking quite a bit, Song Luokui grew concerned. \"Slow down, Brother.\"","Song Luosheng: \"It's fine, the drinks are half water.\"","Song Luokui: ...I see.","After a few performances, the first round of prize drawings began. Third prizes for fifty people included Honor's sports watches and bands, robotic vacuums, dishwashers, and more, each worth over three thousand yuan.","\"Let's welcome the department managers to come draw prizes.\"","The department managers took turns drawing winners. Song Luokui felt excited too, clutching the small slip of paper given at the entrance for the drawing.","\"First, congratulations to the lucky number 24156. Is 24156 here? 24156, please come up to the stage.\"","From the back, a young woman rushed up. The host asked her to wait aside.","Then the second winner, the third...","After fifty people were selected, the managers handed out the gifts. Finally, Song Luosheng went on stage again for a group photo."]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: Annual Meeting","paragraphs":["The first round of the lucky draw ended, followed by stage performances.","Backstage at this time, popular star Mu Yinger was preparing. Her manager was giving her instructions, \"Remember to give a good performance later? If you perform well, you might get the Song Hua endorsement next year.\"","Mu Yinger: \"I prefer the Shan Yu endorsement.\"","Her manager: \"You really dream big, don't you? Many top stars are fighting for that one. Song Hua isn't bad either.\"","Mu Yinger: \"I mainly like the look of the Shan Yu group's boss.\"","Manager: \"...\"","Manager: \"The Song Hua boss isn't bad either. When you go on stage to sing later, remember to look at the most handsome man at the table right in the front and center, and smile at him, okay?\"","Mu Yinger: \"Got it, got it.\"","Soon, the stage program ended, and the host came on stage: \"...If you ask what the hottest song is recently, it has to be 'Lingering Turn' sung by Yinger. I heard that many people at Song Hua really like this song, right? We've invited Yinger to come and sing it for everyone. Let's welcome her!\"","\"Ahhh!\"","\"Woah!\"","\"Yinger!\"","\"Yinger!\"","Song Luokui didn't follow entertainment news much, but she had heard of this singer. She looked up at the stage, where a beautiful woman walked on, waving at everyone. \"Hello everyone, I'm Yinger. Thank you for having me here to sing for you today. Here's 'Lingering Turn' for you!\"","A beautiful and melodious voice came from her mouth, and Song Luokui listened and applauded. It was really good.","As Mu Yinger sang on stage, she remembered her manager's words and looked towards the front table, then smiled.","However, when she looked over, she saw Song Luokui's face. Song Luokui smiled and nodded at her, waving her hand.","Mu Yinger: ...Damn! Who is she? How can she be so pretty and sit next to the Song Hua boss? Is she from another company here to compete with me?","Mu Yinger's surprise only lasted a moment, and she quickly regained her smiling expression. The four-minute song ended quickly, and she went off stage after wishing everyone an early Happy New Year.","After going off stage, Mu Yinger immediately found her manager. \"I saw a very beautiful girl sitting next to the Song Hua boss. Is she from another company invited here?\"","The manager frowned. \"I don't think so. I didn't hear about that. For this year-end party, I only knew that Song Hua invited you, the SINGboys dance crew, and Liu Zihua, all males. You're the only female. Could she be from Song Hua? Don't worry, I'll go find out.\"","\"Okay.\"","The manager peeked through the curtain towards the front center table and immediately saw the Song siblings. She had seen the Song boss before, but since he was the boss, she looked directly at Song Luokui. One look and she was stunned by her beauty.","That face, that nose - if she entered the entertainment industry, her face alone could make her an instant hit.","As soon as the host came down, the manager quickly pulled him aside and asked, \"Excuse me, may I ask who the beautiful woman next to Mr. Song is? It's mainly because she's so pretty that my professional instincts kicked in. Haha.\"","The host knew she was Mu Yinger's manager. \"That's our boss's sister. Pretty, right? We all think our boss's sister is prettier than anyone in the entertainment industry, but that's just our aesthetics talking.\"","Manager: \"Mr. Song's sister? So she's a wealthy heiress? I wonder if she's interested in joining the entertainment industry?\"","Host: \"She probably isn't interested.\" He had heard that the receptionist asked before, and Mr. Song's sister said she wasn't interested.","The manager was disappointed but relieved that she wasn't there to compete with Mu Yinger for endorsements. \"Okay, thank you.\"","\"You're welcome.\"","Meanwhile, Song Luokui was watching the show when her phone vibrated. It was a message from Chi Yu: \"Our company's year-end party is upstairs. Want to come take a look?\"","Song Luokui immediately refused, \"No.\" She didn't have the guts to go meet her brother's archenemy.","Chi Yu tried enticing her: \"Really not coming? We have Liu Xi, Zhao Huaqian, Chen You, and a performance by Dreamland here.\"","Song Luokui: \"Hmph, no, we have celebrity performances here too.\"","\"Okay. When will you be done?\"","Song Luokui: \"Why?\"","Chi Yu: \"To send you home.\"","Song Luokui: \"Are you looking to die? I won't stop you, but I don't want to die.\"","Chi Yu laughed. \"I won't let you die. If your brother tries to hit you, I'll protect you.\"","Song Luokui: \"My brother wouldn't hit me.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay then.\"","\"What are you doing?\" Song Luosheng suddenly looked over, startling Song Luokui into quickly putting away her phone. \"Nothing, just chatting with my sisters. I should've brought them too if I knew.\"","Song Luosheng: \"You can bring them next year.\"","\"Okay.\"","At this time, the second round of the lucky draw started for Song Hua's phones, tablets, and computers.","This time, Lin Xingyan and Zhou Yuan went up to draw. There were twenty second prizes in total.","Zhou Yuan drew first: \"Okay, the first lucky number is 001888. Lucky number 001888, who could it be?\"","Song Luokui looked at the 001888 number in her hand, stood up abruptly, nearly knocking over the cup in front of her. Song Luosheng next to her quickly steadied it. \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui: \"I won!\"","Song Luosheng: ???","Song Luokui waved at Zhou Yuan. \"It's me!\"","Zhou Yuan was looking behind him because no one was coming up, but when he saw it was his little Kuikui sister, he blurted out, \"Ah, the lucky winner is our Kuikui sister. Please welcome Kuikui sister on stage.\"","Song Luokui happily went up, and Zhou Yuan brought her to the center, handing her the microphone. \"Our Kuikui sister is really lucky today. Anything you'd like to say?\"","Song Luokui shyly played with her hair. \"If I take it, does that mean there's one fewer prize? How about this - can we draw one more winner? I'll provide the prize since I didn't bring anything. I can give 20,000 yuan directly. Is that okay?\"","As soon as she said it, everyone below cheered and applauded. Someone even shouted \"Yes!\" 20,000 yuan was much more valuable than the prizes, which were all worth less than 10,000 yuan.","Zhou Yuan: \"I can't make that decision myself. Let's ask our boss if he agrees.\"","Below, someone immediately handed the microphone to Song Luosheng. Of course he agreed. \"Agreed. I'll add another 20,000!\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Did you all hear that? The boss is adding another 20,000 prize. Let's see who will get the boss and Kuikui sister's 20,000 yuan tonight.\"","Everyone below was excited: \"We heard!\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Okay then, why don't Kuikui sister and the boss draw these two prizes themselves? Everyone agree?\"","\"Yes!\"","Song Luosheng immediately went up on stage. Someone brought over a lucky draw box to them. Song Luosheng let Song Luokui draw first. She reached in, felt around, and pulled out a number, reading it aloud: \"Lucky number 257771.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Okay, lucky number 257771, which lucky winner is it? Come up quickly!\"","\"Ahh! It's me! It's me!\" A woman in the audience quickly ran up."]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: Annual Meeting 02","paragraphs":["The girl was dressed very plainly and was a little plump, but she became extremely excited when she went on stage. Zhou Yuan asked someone to pass the microphone to her, \"How are you feeling right now?\"","The girl said, \"I... I'm very excited and happy, I... I'm really happy.\" The girl started crying.","Song Luokui immediately handed her a handkerchief, \"Don't cry, you should be happy for winning the prize.\"","The girl took Hong Hong's handkerchief but was still very excited, \"Thank you, thank you, I... I just started working here not long ago. I'm a single mother, I really didn't expect that I could work at Song Hua, and... and...\"","The girl was so excited that she could barely speak. She bowed to the few people on stage, \"I'm really grateful to Song Hua for giving me this opportunity. I will work hard, thank you Mr. Chairman, thank you Manager Zhou, thank you Manager Lin, and thank you Miss Song.\"","Song Luokui was a little surprised after hearing her words. She looked quite young, and she didn't expect her to be a mother already.","Zhou Yuan patted her shoulder, \"You can come to the company if you have any difficulties.\"","Song Luosheng also said, \"Work hard.\"","Song Luokui also took out her phone, \"You should be happy for winning the prize. Come, let me transfer some money to you.\"","The girl excitedly took out her phone to show the payment code. Soon, there was a \"ding\" sound, \"Received 20,000.\"","After receiving the money, the girl stood aside to regain her composure. She was too excited earlier and felt a little embarrassed now. But suddenly she remembered when Miss Song came close to her, she saw her face up close. Everyone said Miss Song was beautiful, and she finally experienced that stunning feeling. She really was beautiful everywhere.","The lucky draw continued, and Song Luosheng drew the second prize. A male employee won, and he was also very excited and expressed that he would work hard.","The remaining slots were drawn by Zhou Yuan and Lin Xingyan. Each of the winners stood in a row, and finally, Song Luokui and Song Luosheng took a group photo with them, since Song Luokui was also a winner.","The second round of the lucky draw ended, and Song Luokui happily came down.","Song Luosheng raised his eyebrows, \"So happy?\"","Song Luokui, \"You don't understand, the happiness of winning a prize through a lucky draw is different from getting it in normal times. It shows that I have good luck today. Look, you didn't get to draw, which means your luck wasn't as good as mine today.\"","Song Luosheng, \"...Alright.\" He felt a little hurt.","Soon it was time for the ultimate grand prize draw, with two prizes of a car each.","When the prizes were announced, the screams almost blew the roof off.","\"Now, please welcome our Chairman to draw the winners.\"","Song Luosheng went up again to draw the winners, \"The first is number 333567, and the second is 149003.\"","\"Ahhhh!\"","In the audience, a male student was being shaken by his deskmate. The male student himself couldn't believe it either, \"Ahhhh, it's me, it's me!\"","On the other side, a female student was also very shocked, \"Ahhhh!\"","The two excited winners came up to shake hands with Song Luosheng. First, they expressed their excitement, then they promised to work hard.","At this point, Song Hua Technology's annual event had become a hot topic online, first with the celebrity performances, and now with such generous prizes!","\"No wonder it's Song Hua, they're really wealthy!\"","\"Wah, it's someone else's company. Our company's annual event only had food, what were the prizes?\"","\"Ours was a little better than yours, but our prizes were nowhere near as lavish! Song Hua is really rich.\"","On the other hand, Shan Yu's annual event had also become a hot topic.","\"One is Song Hua, one is Shan Yu, the rest are garbage.\"","\"It seems these two companies are usually competing. I didn't expect their annual events to be in competition too.\"","\"Doesn't matter if they're competing or not, we're the ones benefiting.\"","\"What level of qualification is required to work at these two companies?\"","\"If you want to go to Shan Yu, tell Song Hua you can go to Shan Yu as a spy. If you want to go to Song Hua, tell Shan Yu you'll go to Song Hua as a spy.\"","\"Hahahaha.\"","...","After 10 pm, the annual event ended, and people gradually left. Song Luokui supported Song Luosheng, although the wine was diluted with water, Song Luosheng had still drunk a little too much and was slightly drunk.","Song Luokui and Zhou Yuan supported him on each side and walked him to the parking lot. Coincidentally, Shan Yu's annual event had also ended, and the two groups of people met in the parking lot.","Song Luosheng lifted his eyelids and glanced at Chi Yu, but Chi Yu didn't look at him. Instead, he looked at Song Luokui beside him.","Song Luokui didn't know why, but she felt a little flustered. She quickly pulled Song Luosheng into the car, \"Brother, it's too late, let's go back.\"","\"Mm.\" Song Luosheng leaned back in the backseat, holding his head.","Zhou Yuan, \"Goodbye, Boss. Goodbye, Sister Luokui.\"","\"Goodbye.\"","The driver quickly drove away.","Chi Yu also got into his car, which followed behind Song Luokui's car. The two cars drove one after the other towards the manor.","The cars were driving at normal speed when suddenly another car cut in front of them. Uncle An immediately braked, but they still bumped into it a little. Song Luokui was startled, but Song Luosheng beside her was completely unaware since he had fallen asleep.","\"Uncle An, what happened?\"","Uncle An got out of the car, \"Miss, you don't need to get out.\" It was mainly because several thugs with sticks had gotten out of the other car, clearly intending to extort money by staging an accident.","Song Luokui didn't know what was going on and rolled down the window to look. One of the thugs with a stick saw Song Luokui in the backseat and his eyes lit up, \"Hey! It's a little girl! Why don't you get out and keep us company for a while?\"","Before he could finish speaking, Uncle An immediately stepped in front to block him, \"Don't want to go to jail? Then speak properly.\"","Behind them, Chi Yu saw Uncle An scuffling with those men, and one of the thugs trying to grab Song Luokui.","In an instant, his anger flared. He took two long strides, grabbed the thug and pinned him to the ground.","Song Luokui was already calling the police at this time.","The police and traffic police arrived quickly, and the troublemakers were all arrested. However, the front of Song Luokui's car was slightly damaged from the collision.","Song Luokui was thinking of asking Uncle Kang to come pick them up when Chi Yu said, \"You can ride in my car.\"","Song Luokui looked at Song Luosheng, who was still snoring loudly in his sleep.","Chi Yu, \"I'll carry him over.\"","Song Luokui thought for two seconds, \"Okay!\"","There was no need for Chi Yu to carry him. Uncle An directly carried Song Luosheng over and put him in the backseat of Chi Yu's car. Chi Yu sat in the front passenger seat, and Song Luokui also sat in the back to take care of Song Luosheng.","Uncle An went to deal with the damaged car.","Song Luokui sat in the back, and when she looked up, she met Chi Yu's gaze in the rearview mirror. She winked at him and then lowered her head again.","Chi Yu also started typing something on his phone, and soon Song Luokui received a message, \"Looking at me?\"","Song Luokui, \"Ahem ahem.\"","Chi Yu immediately handed her a cup of water.","Song Luokui glared at him and didn't take it.","Chi Yu didn't get angry but smiled back at her.","Song Luokui looked at Song Luosheng beside her, worried that he might wake up. But Song Luosheng didn't wake up at all.","When they returned to the manor, Song Luokui thanked him, and Uncle Kang carried Song Luosheng back to his room. Chi Yu only left after seeing the lights on in Song Luokui's room, then had his driver take him home."]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: The Seduction","paragraphs":["Song Luosheng was completely unaware of the situation where Chi Yu had sent him back. Song Luokui only told him about the near-car accident last night, but as for how they got back afterward, Song Luosheng thought Uncle Kang had come to pick them up.","Those people from the other cars had already been detained, and they might even end up in prison later on.","After the annual company gathering, it would almost be the Chinese New Year. Song Moqian and Sheng Rong finally had time to stay at home, and Song Luosheng's company didn't have much going on either. The whole family was at home, and there was laughter and joy every day.","\"Dad, Mom, when will Grandpa, Grandma, Grandpa and Grandma from Mom's side be coming over?\" Song Luokui asked.","Sheng Rong stroked her hair, \"I've already asked Uncle Kang and Uncle An to pick them up. They'll be here soon, and we'll all go out for dinner tonight.\"","\"Are we celebrating the New Year in the big courtyard this year or going somewhere else?\" They occasionally went to her grandparents' or her maternal grandparents' places.","Song Moqian said, \"We'll stay in the big courtyard this year.\"","That evening, the whole family had dinner at the Luminous Banquet Hall. Grandma Lin Xianyuan held Song Luokui's hand, \"Our Luokui has grown up so much. I wonder who the lucky one will be in the future?\" She had seen so many young ladies, but their Luokui was still the prettiest.","As soon as Song Luosheng heard this, he immediately said, \"Luokui is still so young. It's fine if she never gets married. I'll take care of her.\"","Song Luokui wrinkled her nose, \"You say that now, but when you get married one day, you might just despise me.\"","Song Luosheng ruffled her hair, \"How could I ever be that kind of person, you little ingrate.\"","Song Luokui pushed his hand away, \"Hey, you messed up my hair.\"","The others smiled as they watched the two siblings banter. Sheng Rong said, \"They grew up so fast. If they like someone, it's okay to have a little romance.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Brother, she's talking about you. You're so old now, it's time for you to find a girlfriend.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"...What do you mean old? I haven't even graduated yet.\"","Song Luokui paused, forgetting that her brother was still in graduate school, even though he rarely went to classes, just like Chi Yu.","Grandma said, \"Whether he's graduated or not, he can still date someone. We're not old-fashioned.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Oh Grandma, I've been busy with work, and I don't have time for that.\"","Song Luokui watched and smiled, not saying anything.","Grandma said, \"Rong, you should see if there are any good girls around and introduce them to Luosheng.\"","Sheng Rong said, \"Okay, Mom, I'll take a look.\"","Song Moqian said, \"I'll also take a look.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"...Why are you suddenly pushing me to get married? I'm not in a hurry, and I don't have time for that. I need to build my career first before I can think about starting a family.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Your career is already big enough.\"","Song Luosheng put a chicken drumstick on her plate, \"Eat and don't talk.\"","Song Luokui pouted, picked up the drumstick, and started eating. She had to admit, it was quite delicious.","Grandma said, \"We can also take a look for Luokui. It's fine to just date, no need to rush.\"","Song Luokui immediately waved her hand, \"Grandma, I'm still young.\"","Grandma said, \"Luokui is still young, but it's okay. She can meet a few more people and take her time choosing. There's no rush. There are plenty of boys in our circle. Our Luokui deserves anyone.\"","Everyone thought it was fine.","Only Song Luosheng disagreed, \"The guys in our circle? There aren't many good ones. If you want to find someone, at least he has to be taller than me, better than me, you know?\"","Song Luokui looked up at him, \"What do you mean not many good ones? Zhou Yuan is great, so is Xing Yan. Sa Sa is nice too.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"They're not good enough. None of them are as outstanding as your brother!\"","Song Luokui said, \"Yeah, yeah, you're the most handsome and outstanding in the whole universe.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"You said it, not me.\"","The whole table looked at the two affectionately as they bickered. For them, seeing the two children grow up happily was already a great joy.","After finishing dinner, the family went home.","The Chinese New Year came quickly. After the reunion dinner, Song Luokui could only cuddle up on the couch and watch the CCTV New Year's Gala since setting off fireworks was not allowed in the courtyard.","Around 9 PM, Chi Yu sent her a message: \"Happy New Year's Eve. Want to come out and see some fireworks?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"Isn't setting off fireworks banned in Jing City?\"","Chi Yu said, \"Some places allow it.\"","Song Luokui saw that her parents and brother were all in the living room. If she said she wanted to go out with friends, her brother would definitely ask questions and might even insist on accompanying her...She had no excuse to go out.","Although she really wanted to see the fireworks, Song Luokui had to refuse, \"Can't go out, or I'll get caught. You have fun.\"","Chi Yu didn't say anything after that.","Unexpectedly, as it approached midnight, Chi Yu messaged her again, \"Can we video call now?\"","By this time, Song Luokui was already sleepy, but she was still trying to stay awake until midnight. She didn't expect Chi Yu to message her, so she replied, \"Okay.\"","Chi Yu quickly video called her. When Song Luokui answered, she only saw darkness. Then Chi Yu's voice came through, \"Wait a moment.\"","Suddenly, a streak of light shot up into the sky, followed by a \"bang\" as fireworks bloomed like scattered petals, lighting up the entire sky.","\"Wow!\" Song Luokui exclaimed in amazement.","It wasn't just one firework. More \"bangs\" followed as several more fireworks shot up and burst open one after another.","Each firework was beautiful, and Song Luokui was fully awake now.","After the fireworks ended, the video showed Chi Yu's face. He asked, \"Did you like it?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Yes, it was super beautiful.\"","Chi Yu said, \"I'll show you some more in a bit. Just wait a little longer.\" He glanced at the time, \"One more minute.\"","Song Luokui checked the time and realized it would be the new year in just one minute.","The minute passed quickly. Chi Yu, holding the phone, ran to the front and lit another firework right at the final second.","The phone moved along with the trajectory of the firework. Then, with a loud \"bang,\" the entire sky seemed to light up, reminding Song Luokui of the line from a poem: \"The east wind blew the petals all night long, scattering them like falling stars.\"","Chi Yu walked back and picked up the phone, \"Happy New Year.\"","Song Luokui squinted her eyes with a smile, \"Happy New Year! Thank you, Chi Yu~\"","Chi Yu gazed at her smiling face and smiled back, \"Mm.\"","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu's smiling face and hesitated before suddenly asking, \"Did you...set off the fireworks just for me to see?\"","Chi Yu's gaze was fixed on her face, \"Mm.\"","Song Luokui fell silent, staring at him in a daze.","Suddenly, Chi Yu noticed white flakes falling. He looked up to see snowflakes drifting down and then looked back at Song Luokui, \"Look, it's snowing.\"","Song Luokui had noticed too and gave a soft, \"Mm.\"","At that moment, there was a knock on the door. Flustered, Song Luokui hastily ended the video call, got out of bed, and opened the door. It was Song Luosheng. \"Brother? Happy New Year!\"","Song Luosheng handed her a big red envelope, \"I knew you weren't asleep. Happy New Year.\"","Song Luokui took the red envelope, \"Thank you, Brother!\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Mm. Go to sleep early.\"","\"Okay!\"","After Song Luosheng left, Song Luokui hid under her blanket, tossing and turning. Many people had sent her New Year's greetings, and she replied to each one. After replying, she noticed that Chi Yu had sent her a red envelope too. Suddenly, she became certain of one thing: Chi Yu was trying to seduce her!"]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: Meet the Guardian","paragraphs":["It had been a long time since Song Luosheng had gathered with his buddies. Since they were all on vacation, Song Luosheng issued an open invitation, and they had a big party.","The party was held at Song Luosheng's courtyard house, where they could barbecue, sing, and play mahjong.","When Wei Qing arrived, he saw Song Luokui, who was still laughing at a joke Zhang Xiyue had told her under the tree. Song Luokui was wearing a red Chinese dress today, with her hair pinned up with two hairpins, and her eyes were crinkled from laughing.","Wei Qing felt his heart flutter a little, and he stopped in his tracks, just watching her.","Song Luokui noticed his gaze and turned to look at him, seeing an unfamiliar person staring at her. The stranger had an exotic look, with narrow, phoenix-shaped eyes and a small mole under one eye.","Not recognizing this person, Song Luokui thought he might be her brother's friend. So, despite feeling uncomfortable with his gaze, she politely nodded at him and left with Zhang Xiyue to go inside the house.","Seeing them leave, Wei Qing immediately wanted to follow, but Song Luosheng, who was sitting nearby holding a glass of wine and chatting with his brothers, noticed Wei Qing and put down his glass, giving him an unfriendly stare. \"What are you doing here? This is my party.\"","Wei Qing shrugged, \"Yeah, it's a party you're hosting for your friends. Aren't I your friend?\"","Song Luosheng: \"...\" He had never met someone so shameless.","Song Luosheng turned to Zhou Yuan and the others, \"Who let him in?\"","One of the guys barbecuing said, \"Brother Song, he said he was your high school classmate who needed to see you, and that you two were close before he went abroad. Since you were hosting a party, he asked me to bring him in.\"","Song Luosheng pursed his lips, waved his hand, and Zhou Yuan immediately took the guy away to chat elsewhere.","Wei Qing acted like he belonged, walking over and sitting down at the barbecue area. \"Classmate Song, don't you welcome an old classmate? I'm not wrong, we used to be quite close, right?\"","Song Luosheng rolled his eyes and sat down next to him. The others moved away, giving them space to talk.","\"Just say it, what do you want?\"","Wei Qing started eating the barbecued meat from a plate, commenting, \"Not bad, who did the grilling?\"","Seeing this, Song Luosheng was annoyed and snatched the plate away - it was grilled by his Kui Kui. Damn! He wanted to hit Wei Qing.","After finishing a skewer, Wei Qing saw Song Luosheng's fiery glare, which meant he'd better speak up or get kicked out.","Wei Qing immediately raised his hands and said softly, \"I know you're trying to do an oil business in Country X. I know the prince of Country X, I can help you make connections.\"","Song Luosheng: \"What's your condition?\"","Wei Qing crossed one leg over the other, \"What condition could I have? I just know that Chi Yu wants to get involved, and I can't stand him right now, so I'm helping you.\"","Song Luosheng: \"What did he do to you?\"","Wei Qing lowered his eyes and didn't respond. Chi Yu hadn't done anything to him personally, but his family and a branch of the Chi family were competing for an important position, and the Chi family's interference caused his family to fail.","The Chi family! They were the stumbling block to the Wei family's growth and prosperity!","Wei Qing: \"He interfered with my company's entry into the Hua Country market.\" Wei Qing's company was overseas, and he recently wanted to develop in the home country, so he set up a company here and would often stay in this area.","Song Luosheng didn't comment on this, as in his opinion, Chi Yu was right to intervene. The Hua Country market was only so big, so if Wei Qing entered, he would be taking a slice of Song Luosheng's pie.","However, in the end, Song Luosheng did say, \"I'll consider it.\"","Wei Qing didn't expect him to agree right away. He helped himself to the grill and started barbecuing meat while looking around to see where the person from earlier had gone.","Song Luokui and Zhang Xiyue had returned to the room to play mahjong. Looking out the window, Song Luokui saw her brother talking to that person, so he must be her brother's friend? She had never seen him before.","Meanwhile, Song Luosheng said, \"Aren't you leaving?\"","Wei Qing rolled the skewer in his hand, \"What's the harm in having one more person at the party?\"","In public, Song Luosheng couldn't directly kick him out since Wei Qing was from the Wei family.","Nearby, Tu Shanyue felt thirsty while playing mahjong. \"Kui Kui, could you grab me a beer?\"","\"Sure.\" Song Luokui immediately left the room. Several boxes of beer were placed near the grill area, so she headed straight there.","Seeing her, Song Luosheng scolded, \"Don't come over, go back inside!\"","Song Luosheng's face looked terrible, and Song Luokui didn't dare say anything, immediately turning around and going back, startled by his reaction.","She returned empty-handed, and Tu Shanyue asked, \"Kui Kui, where's the beer?\"","Song Luokui spread her hands, \"Brother yelled at me and told me to get back.\"","The others playing mahjong all looked up in surprise. \"Huh? Brother Song would never treat Kui Kui like that!\"","Zhang Xiyue, clutching her chest, said, \"I was about to go with her, but as soon as I stepped out, I heard Brother Song's scolding and immediately turned back. Kui Kui, are you okay? Your brother must not have meant it.\"","Though initially hurt, Song Luokui quickly realized her brother must have had a reason, so she waited for his explanation.","Outside, Wei Qing had finally seen the person again, but unexpectedly, Song Luosheng immediately told her to go back inside.","He walked over with the grilled skewers. \"Why were you so harsh? You scared your sister Kui Kui. I'm right, isn't she your sister Kui Kui?\"","Song Luosheng immediately looked at him warily. \"What do you want to do? And don't call her Kui Kui sister, call her Miss Song.\"","Wei Qing: \"I'm not trying to do anything. What's wrong with having an extra brother for your sister?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Sorry, my Kui Kui only has me as her brother.\"","Wei Qing looked at him. \"Are you sure you're her only brother? What about Chi Yu?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Of course!\"","Wei Qing ate a couple more skewers without saying anything, then turned to look at the window again, trying to catch a glimpse of the person inside. But Song Luosheng immediately blocked his view. \"You should leave now.\"","Wei Qing tossed the bamboo skewer aside and dusted his hands off. \"Alright. Think it over carefully.\"","With that, he quickly left.","Song Luosheng waved Zhou Yuan over. \"Boss, what's up?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Check if Wei Qing has left. And investigate if Wei Qing's company really intends to enter the Hua Country market recently. Also, look into whether there are any conflicts between the Wei family and the Chi family.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Got it.\"","After giving the instructions, Song Luosheng walked over to the room and stood at the doorway, waving at Song Luokui. \"Kui Kui!\"","Song Luokui immediately turned away with a \"hmph,\" but after two seconds, she still walked over. \"What is it?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Sorry, brother's tone wasn't good earlier. That person you just saw, stay away from him and don't talk to him in the future. He's even worse than Chi Yu, so if you see him, run away, okay?\"","Song Luokui: \"Huh? You two seemed to be chatting just fine, I thought he was your friend.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Of course not. Brother doesn't have friends like that. That person is a crazy person from the Wei family. I'm afraid he might do something bad to you.\"","Song Luokui pondered, \"Wei Qing? That name sounds familiar.\" Then she remembered, \"Oh, is that the person you and that other guy kicked out of the country back in high school?\"","Song Luosheng nodded."]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: Investment","paragraphs":["Song Luokui felt uncomfortable thinking about the way that man had looked at her earlier. \"I'll definitely stay far away from him.\"","Song Luosheng patted her head. \"Go and play.\"","Song Luokui turned away in a spoiled manner. \"I was going to get some wine earlier but you scared me. Now you fetch it for me.\"","\"Okay, okay, I'll get it for you. You go inside, it's warm in there.\"","\"Mm.\"","The others saw their interactions and the atmosphere became more relaxed.","After 10 PM, the gathering ended and the others gradually went home. Since it was late, Song Luosheng let Song Luokui stay over.","Song Luokui happily agreed, though she didn't have any clothes there. It was fine though, they could ask Aunt Gui to bring some for her the next day.","On the 7th day of the first lunar month, everyone had gone back to work, leaving only Song Luokui at home.","As she went downstairs, she heard Aunt Gui on the phone in the kitchen, sounding quite distressed. \"There's nothing else you can do. Let me see if I can find you a cleaning job. That way you can take care of your child while working as a cleaner, though you might not be able to work at some high-end places.\"","\"I'll look into it for you. For now, that's all.\"","Aunt Gui sighed again.","Song Luokui sat at the dining table, and Aunt Gui soon brought over her breakfast. \"Miss, your breakfast.\"","\"Mm.\" Song Luokui noticed Aunt Gui's worried expression. \"Aunt Gui, what's wrong? You don't look too well.\"","Aunt Gui waved her hand dismissively. \"It's nothing, I'm fine.\"","Song Luokui said, \"I heard you on the phone earlier. Did something happen? You can tell me.\"","Aunt Gui couldn't hold back and told her. \"I have a niece who got married a few years ago and had a daughter. I thought she had married a good man, but after the child was born and turned out to be a girl, her in-laws' attitude changed.\"","\"Not only did they mistreat my niece, but her husband also beat her. This year she finally couldn't take it anymore and divorced him, taking the child with her. She used to be a housewife and didn't know any skills. If that was all, she could get a factory job at her age, but she also has a child to take care of.\"","\"She can't find a job, so she asked me if I knew any jobs where she could bring her child along. Anything would do. I'm thinking maybe she could do street cleaning or toilet cleaning, so she can take the child with her. Ah, it's just so difficult for women!\"","Song Luokui asked, \"What about her parents?\"","Aunt Gui replied, \"Her parents passed away. Otherwise, her in-laws wouldn't have dared to bully her like that.\"","Song Luokui recalled the single mother who had won a job opportunity at the company's year-end party and cried tears of joy. It seemed that for women, surviving in this world was much more difficult than for men.","Song Luokui said, \"Let me ask my brother if he needs any cleaners at his company. It's fine if she brings her child along, as long as she does her job well.\"","Aunt Gui waved her hand. \"No, that won't work. Young Master's company is too high-end. I'm afraid having her bring a child might affect the company's image.\"","Song Luokui took a sip of soy milk and wiped her mouth. \"It would definitely have an impact, but that just shows my brother's company has an even more upscale image now, and it's creating another job opportunity for society. That's a contribution to the country.\"","\"It's no problem. I'll ask him, though we might need to do a background check first.\"","Aunt Gui said, \"I understand. Thank you, Miss.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"No problem. Consider it a good deed. As long as there's no issue with the person, a cleaning position should be fine.\"","\"Okay. My niece used to do very well in school, but after her parents passed away she had to drop out of high school and work. Then she ended up with a scumbag husband. Ah, it's all fate!\"","...","After finishing breakfast, Song Luokui, with nothing else to do, decided to visit her brother's company and ask about the job opportunity.","Song Luosheng was surprised to see her. \"Why aren't you resting at home? It's so cold out.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Aunt Gui's niece is divorced with a child and no job. I wanted to ask if you're hiring any cleaners here?\"","Song Luosheng put down his pen. \"That's a small matter... I'll talk to HR later. Have Aunt Gui bring her over first for a background check. If there's no issue, she can be hired.\"","\"Okay, thank you brother.\"","Song Luosheng asked, \"Did you just come here for this?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"No, I also came to see how you're working so hard for the company as an ox.\"","Song Luosheng pinched her face. \"I'm not working like an ox for the company. I'm doing it for you, earning money to buy you bags.\"","Song Luokui pushed his hand away. \"Lies! Blatant lies!\"","Song Luosheng checked the time. \"I have a meeting to attend. You can stay and play here for a bit.\" He transferred her some money. \"Or you can go shopping nearby.\"","\"Go ahead, go ahead.\"","After Song Luosheng left, Song Luokui was about to leave too, but then she noticed an investment analysis for the Tianyú Company on her brother's desk with a \"rejected\" note.","\"Tianyú Company Acquisition Investment Analysis\"?","Song Luokui couldn't help but open and read it. It mentioned a domestic entertainment company that was about to go bankrupt, but the analysis concluded there was nothing worth investing in.","However, Song Luokui suddenly thought of Aunt Gui's niece and the single mother she had drawn in the lucky draw at the year-end party. Looking back at the investment analysis, she wondered if there was something she could do.","When Song Luosheng returned, he found Song Luokui sitting at his boss' desk, spacing out, with the rejected investment analysis in front of her.","Song Luosheng waved his hand in front of her face. \"Luokui?\"","Song Luokui snapped out of it and said, \"Brother, what do you think about me starting an all-women's company?\"","Song Luosheng frowned as he considered it. If it were him, he would think about many factors for an all-women's company. Of course, an all-men's company wouldn't work either. Usually, a mix of both was ideal to share the workload.","However...","\"Luokui, do you want to start a company just for fun? I'll support you!\"If his sister wanted to play, then let her play.","Song Luokui picked up the investment analysis. \"This one, I'll invest in it. I have savings, and if that's not enough, I can use the properties under my name to get a bank loan.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"...Wait a minute, Luokui. I can set up a new company for you, but the Tianyú Company has absolutely no investment value.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"I looked into it. The management just got into legal trouble and went to jail, right? Plus there was a lot of infighting, and many artists left the company, so there aren't many active people left. But it's already an established company with systems in place. I just need to fire the inactive people and hire active ones, and it'll be fine, right?\"","Song Luosheng shook his head. \"For a company, the most important thing is to produce something of value, and it's clear they can't produce anything of value.\"","Song Luokui said, \"I'll take care of that. I have connections. It's just filming videos, after all.\"","Song Luosheng replied, \"Luokui, filming is very expensive. Companies have poured in billions and might not even recoup a tenth of their investment.\"","Song Luokui said, \"I'm not going to film those billion-dollar blockbusters. I've always felt that women know best what other women want to watch, so I'll film things that women enjoy watching. Brother, I just want to try it out. If it doesn't work, I'll just disband it.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Okay! No need for your money, I'll invest in it for you.\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"No need, I have my own money. If that's not enough, I'll ask my girlfriends to invest. I think they'll be interested.\"","\"Okay then, if you need people, let me know. But if you fail, you have to listen to me.\"","\"No problem! I'll work on a business plan first.\" Song Luokui took the investment analysis and left. \"Brother, I'll give this back to you later.\"","Song Luosheng shook his head as he watched her retreating figure, \"Forget it, spending a few million to make Luokui happy is worth it.\""]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: Eating with Chi Yu","paragraphs":["Song Luokui said she would get right to it. She first made a copy of the investment analysis and took it with her, then proceeded to research.","Before the start of the semester, she finally put together a proposal, and then asked Song Luosheng to take a look at it.","Song Luosheng looked at her proposal, made some revisions, but was still pleasantly surprised. \"Well done! I didn't expect my little Kukui to have this talent. If you can make it big, your brother will increase his investment in you.\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"Slowly but surely. Making it big takes time, and by then you might not even need to invest.\"","Song Luosheng: \"True, maybe many companies will be vying to invest in you.\"","Song Luokui: \"Brother, help me acquire that company first. I'll transfer the money to you. If it's not enough, I'll consider it a loan from you.\" Song Luokui walked around behind Song Luosheng and gave him a shoulder massage.","Song Luosheng enjoyed it, squinting his eyes. \"No need to be so polite about that little sum. Your brother will help you get things done. Keep your pocket money.\"","Song Luokui leaned her head closer. \"No, it's my money, so it will be my company.\"","Song Luosheng waved his hand dismissively. \"Okay, okay!\" At worst, he would just give his little Kukui more pocket money later. Giving her 100 million a day would add up to 3 billion in a month. Not bad at all!","Song Luokui: \"Oh, and help me hire a manager too.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Sure thing! How about Zhou Yuan to help you out?\"","Song Luokui: \"Zhou Yuan would be overqualified for that role. Just get someone ordinary. I have to go to school tomorrow. It seems like there will be a lot going on with the start of the semester, so I won't be coming home for a few days. Let me know once everything is ready.\"","\"Got it.\"","As soon as Song Hua made a move, Shan Yu's side caught wind of it.","Shan Yu Group had actually analyzed the acquisition and investment in Tian Yu Company as well. It was clear to them, just like Song Hua, that there was no value in acquiring it. In their view, it was simply a case of Song Hua having too much money to spend, even though the entertainment industry was very profitable. But it wasn't that easy to get a share of it.","Of course, someone did receive inside information: \"It's not Song Hua making the acquisition. Word is, it's a toy Song's sister fancied, so the Chairman is giving it to her.\"","As soon as those words were uttered, Chi Yu, seated in the middle, immediately looked up. \"Really?\"","The person, seeing the boss inquiring about it, quickly explained, \"My nephew's girlfriend's brother works in one of Song Hua's departments. He said the Chairman's sister took a liking to that company and wanted to play with it.\"","Chi Yu's gaze returned, and he immediately took out his phone to send a message to someone: \"Starting a company to play with? Want me to invest in you?\"","The chat interface was still showing their conversation from the Spring Festival, when Chi Yu invited Song Luokui out to eat and she declined.","Mainly because Song Luokui felt that Chi Yu's intentions seemed a bit too obvious, so she thought it would be better if they didn't meet for the time being.","Song Luokui was in class at the moment. She glanced at the teacher, then picked up her phone under the desk and replied: \"No need.\"","Chi Yu: \"I can invest in you privately, without your brother knowing.\"","Song Luokui: \"I don't even let my brother invest in me, so I definitely won't let you either.\"","Chi Yu: \"Let me know if you need anything. Want to have dinner together tonight? There's a new restaurant that's supposed to be good.\"","Song Luokui: \"No.\"","Chi Yu: \"That's three 'no's from you.\"","Song Luokui realized her tone might have been a bit too abrasive. \"Sorry, I've just been...\"","She was still typing when Chi Yu sent over a sticker - two little mushroom people, one hitting the other. The one being hit had the name \"Chi Yu\" written on it, while the hitter was labelled \"Song Luokui.\"","Chi Yu: \"If you're in a bad mood, you can take it out on me.\"","Then he sent a red envelope with 88,888 in it. \"Or maybe some dessert would help.\"","A moment later, he took a screenshot of a strawberry cake from a dessert shop. \"How about this one? The reviews say it's really good. I can order it for you. Are you at school?\"","Song Luokui deleted what she was going to say earlier, the corners of her mouth turning up slightly as she looked at the little mushroom person getting hit. \"...Thank you, but let's have dinner together instead. I don't need the dessert - I'm in class, so it's not convenient. I'll return the money to you.\"","Chi Yu: \"Consider it a friendly celebration of your upcoming entrepreneurial endeavors.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, I'll pay for dinner then.\"","Chi Yu: \"Sounds good, how generous of the boss.\"","Song Luokui: \"Speak properly. This is unlike you.\" If others knew the arrogant, dignified persona he put on was just an act when chatting with her, their jaws would drop.","Chi Yu: \"Oh. Should I pick you up later then?\"","Song Luokui: \"No need. Send me the address of the new restaurant, and I'll make the reservation.\"","Chi Yu: \"Sure.\"","With that matter settled, Chi Yu smiled too. The person giving him a briefing felt relieved, thinking the boss must be pleased with the results from their side.","As soon as class ended, Song Luokui got into the car and told Uncle An, \"Let's go to Wei Jin Fang in Shuijing Hutong.\"","Song Luokui was still on her way when Chi Yu suddenly had something come up. \"Sorry, I might be half an hour late.\"","Song Luokui: \"No problem, I'll wait for you.\" She had brought her proposal anyway, so she could study up – she was going to be a future tycoon after all.","She arrived at Shuijing Hutong soon after and entered the restaurant, only to run into Wei Qing coming out of a private room.","Song Luokui immediately turned to leave, but Wei Qing had already noticed her and quickly strode over, grabbing her arm. \"Little Sister Kukui, why are you running away when you see me?\"","Song Luokui struggled to break free from his grip and moved aside. \"Sorry, I don't know you.\"","Wei Qing didn't seem bothered. \"I'm an old schoolmate and friend of your brother's. We met at the last reunion. My name is Wei Qing.\"","Song Luokui kept her head down. \"I don't remember. Sorry, I have someone waiting for me, so please excuse me.\"","Wei Qing: \"Who are you meeting? Big Brother Wei Qing can join you, and I'll pay for it.\"","\"No need.\" Song Luokui tried to walk around him into the restaurant, but he blocked her path again.","Wei Qing: \"In that case, let's add each other on WeChat so I can invite you out to play sometime when I'm free.\"","Just as Song Luokui was thinking about how to refuse or whether to accept and then block him later, Chi Yu hurriedly arrived. \"Wei Qing, what are you trying to do?\"","Chi Yu immediately pulled Song Luokui behind him and turned to look at her. \"Did he bother you?\"","Song Luokui shook her head.","Chi Yu then faced Wei Qing again.","Wei Qing was quite surprised to see Chi Yu as well. He glanced at Song Luokui. \"Little Sister Kukui, you're having dinner with him? Does your brother know?\"","Before Song Luokui could respond, Chi Yu answered for her, \"I'm just meeting a friend. It has nothing to do with her. Wei Qing, I heard you're still looking to partner with Song Hua to enter the Hua Country market? If I tell Song Luosheng right now that you were harassing his sister, how do you think that would go over?\"","Wei Qing's expression immediately darkened as he took out a cigarette and lit it. \"Chi Yu, you're just riding on your father's coattails, aren't you? Let's see how arrogant you can be if your father falls from grace.\"","Chi Yu didn't say anything, simply staring at him. As if Wei Qing wasn't doing the exact same thing by relying on his family's wealth and power!","\"Cough, cough, cough!\" The smoke caused Song Luokui to suddenly break into a coughing fit.","Wei Qing instantly froze, then quickly put out the cigarette. \"Little Sister Kukui can't stand the smoke. Big Brother Wei Qing won't smoke anymore from now on. No need to be afraid of me next time we meet. Big Brother Wei Qing just wants to be friends with you.\"","Song Luokui remained hidden behind Chi Yu, not saying a word. What was with all this \"Big Brother\" and \"Little Sister\" business? Song Luosheng was her only brother."]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: The Beauty Trap","paragraphs":["Wei Qing glanced at Chi Yu again before leaving, and the two people behind him followed.","After they left, Chi Yu turned to Song Luokui and scrutinized her, \"Stay away from him in the future, he's not a good person.\"","Song Luokui: \"You said the same thing as my brother. Let's go in.\"","\"Okay.\"","The two entered the private room and ordered food.","Song Luokui also took out a business plan, \"This is the plan for my new company, could you take a look at it? My brother has already helped me revise it once.\"","Chi Yu received it with some surprise, \"Your brother looked at it before giving it to me?\"","Song Luokui nodded seriously, \"Yep, you two are both good at making money, double protection you know. If I make a lot of money in the future, I'll pay for the meals!\"","Chi Yu extended one hand.","Song Luokui: ?","Chi Yu: \"Let's pinky swear.\"","Song Luokui hooked her pinky finger with his and looked up at him, \"How old are you?\"","Chi Yu opened the business plan, \"I'm afraid you'll stop paying for my meals one day if I don't do this.\"","Song Luokui felt a little guilty, she might indeed do that... who knows what the future holds.","Chi Yu looked at the business plan and asked, \"Do you need me to recommend people for hiring?\"","Song Luokui waved her hand, \"No need, I'll ask my brother if needed. You just need to point out the unreasonable parts. There's no rush, let's eat first.\"","Chi Yu flipped through a couple of pages and set it aside, \"So you agreed to come out for a meal just to have me look at your business plan?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, I just suddenly remembered that I still owe you many meals...\" The more she treated him, the more she owed...","Song Luokui was calculating in her heart how many more meals she would have to treat him to. Next to her, Chi Yu watched her pensive profile, \"Calculating how to repay me again?\"","Song Luokui was still calculating, not responding, turning her head towards Chi Yu, \"Huh? What did you say?\"","Chi Yu saw the swinging pearl earrings and was slightly distracted, reaching out to hold the dangling pearl on her earring.","Song Luokui finally came back to her senses and looked at him, then at his hand, \"Hmm?\"","Chi Yu suddenly leaned in close to her. Song Luokui leaned back, but Chi Yu kept moving closer. Song Luokui couldn't lean back any further as she was already against the chair, so she extended her hands to push him away. She didn't know what was going on with this man?","When their faces were about a hand's distance apart, Chi Yu finally stopped, \"I'm asking, do you still want to keep your distance from me?\"","Chi Yu stared into her eyes. Song Luokui didn't dare to look into his eyes, her gaze resting on his Adam's apple, \"No... no.\"","Chi Yu looked at her face, thinking back to Wei Qing earlier, that face of hers was too attractive, maybe she needed to be hidden away.","Song Luokui saw that he wasn't speaking or moving, and pushed him harder, \"What's wrong with you?\"","Chi Yu then grasped her wrist, \"Why did you really come out to eat with me?\"","Song Luokui didn't understand, wasn't it him who asked her out? Although she did have some thoughts in mind.","Song Luokui's eyes flickered but she didn't say anything.","Chi Yu tightened his grip on her wrist, \"The business plan? Or for your brother?\"","Song Luokui raised her eyelids to look at him, \"Didn't you say before... to be an insider?\"","Chi Yu: \"Actually, I don't understand. Your brother and I are just business competitors, but you seem to think I would harm him. I consider myself a law-abiding person.\"","Song Luokui recalled the time she saw him coldly watching as his underlings stepped on someone who had made some unknown mistake in a private room at a club. She also heard from others in the circle that with just a casual remark from him, people could completely disappear from the circle. As a member of the Chi family, he was indeed law-abiding in public, but his private methods...","Song Luokui: \"Maybe not now, but what if my brother's interests conflict with yours one day?\"","Chi Yu: \"So you want to get rid of me?\"","Upon hearing this, Song Luokui immediately lowered her head, \"Uh... no, it was just a thought, like how people might imagine themselves getting rich one day.\" Why did he have to keep remembering that?!","Chi Yu: \"Actually, there is another way to solve all the problems.\"","Song Luokui looked up: \"What?\"","Chi Yu moved the hand grasping her wrist to her palm, \"You can use your feminine wiles on me.\"","Song Luokui's eyes widened and she blinked a few times, \"I don't understand.\"","Chi Yu put one hand on her shoulder, \"You do understand. A beauty's charms, fleeting nights of passion, the king neglecting court affairs. Even King Zhou would have listened to what Daji said.\"","Song Luokui's face instantly turned red, this man...","Seeing her flushed face, Chi Yu's thoughts wandered and he unconsciously caressed her cheek, \"Let me apologize first, but I can't help myself. You can push me away.\" Chi Yu swallowed, his fingers lightly stroking her face.","Song Luokui's heart pounded, she was stunned for a moment. They were so close that she could hear both his heartbeat and her own.","With a loud \"swish\" sound, Song Luokui jumped up, her chair sliding back making a screeching noise. Chi Yu's hand was still suspended in the air.","Standing up, Song Luokui covered her chest and took two steps back, \"I... you...\"","Chi Yu suddenly smiled: \"You should be able to tell my feelings for you.\"","Song Luokui: ... She could indeed tell, but there was still a hint of disbelief in her heart.","Chi Yu looked at her: \"So, what do you think of my suggestion?\"","Song Luokui thought for two seconds then shook her head, \"Not very good? I think... I should leave.\"","She was about to walk out of the private room, but was pulled back by Chi Yu in the next second, \"Your brother is going to Honglomas, the capital of Country X next week. There might be people working against his interests there. I can help.\"","Song Luokui frowned and turned around: \"What do you mean?\"","Chi Yu: \"The public security situation abroad is incomparable to that at home. It's not easy to do oil business overseas. For example, when I met you in Y Country years ago.\"","Song Luokui looked at him, took a deep breath, \"Thank you for the information. But I...\"","Chi Yu: \"Am I not good enough for you?\"","Song Luokui: \"You're very good, but...\"","Chi Yu: \"But your brother won't agree? What if I can get him to agree?\"","Song Luokui looked at him: \"It's related to my brother but that's not the main point. This kind of thing... this kind of thing... needs a lot of consideration.\"","Chi Yu sighed, \"Okay, let's not talk about that. Aren't you still hungry? Why don't we eat first?\"","Song Luokui widened her eyes, he still had the mind for eating now?","Chi Yu looked at the table of dishes: \"It would be a waste not to finish them, right?\"","Song Luokui looked at the table where most of the dishes were barely touched. It did seem... So the two sat back down.","Fortunately, the dishes were being kept warm over a low flame to maintain the temperature, so eating them was still fine.","As they ate, Chi Yu suddenly said: \"I don't think I've properly introduced myself.\"","Song Luokui was gnawing on a rib and looked at him in confusion, was an introduction still needed?","Chi Yu: \"I'm Chi Yu, with 'Yu' meaning 'island' in Shan Yu, 187 cm tall.\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah? I thought you were 185 cm.\"","Chi Yu paused, \"Should I have someone bring a ruler to measure right now?\"","Song Luokui gave him a look of disbelief.","\"We're eating.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll take a picture at home for you. If you don't believe me, you can measure me yourself?\""]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: Tangled","paragraphs":["Song Luokui: \"...No need, I was just saying it casually. Okay, you're 187 cm, anything else?\"","Chi Yu: \"187 cm tall, measurements 103, 77, 95, a PhD student at Peking University, serving as the chairman of Shan Yu Group...\"","Song Luokui: \"...You don't need to mention the measurements, right?\"","Chi Yu looked at her, \"I thought you'd want to know.\" He didn't even mention the fourth measurement, afraid that she'd think he was being crass and get angry.","Song Luokui glared at him, but her gaze lacked any intimidating power. Chi Yu's heart skipped a beat as he looked at her.","Chi Yu continued: \"Come to think of it, I should be considered your senior.\"","Song Luokui: \"Mmhm, hello Senior Chi.\"","Chi Yu: \"You can call me Brother Chi.\"","Song Luokui: What if someone mishears it as \"Lover Chi\"?","Song Luokui didn't say it out loud.","Chi Yu didn't insist either. After they finished eating and drinking, Song Luokui left immediately.","Back in the car, Song Luokui touched her chest. Earlier during the meal, she seemed calm on the surface, but no one knew how flustered she was deep down...","Chi Yu had actually asked her to use her feminine charms!","She almost forgot, he mentioned that her brother Song Luosheng would be going to Country X next week.","Song Luokui immediately called Song Luosheng, \"Brother, are you going on a business trip next week?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Yeah, I'm going to Country X. Let me know if you want any gifts.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Can you not go?\"Although at this stage, her brother should be fine, she was still worried.","Song Luosheng: \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui: \"I heard that Country X's security isn't very good, there might be terrorists and such.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Don't worry, I'll have bodyguards with me.\"","Song Luokui hesitated: \"...Is it absolutely necessary to go?\"","Song Luosheng: \"What's going on? Who told you something?\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm...afraid someone might do something against you.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Luokui, I don't know where you got this information from, but I know all about it. Don't worry, I'll come back safely. Those people in Country X, I don't even take them seriously.\"","Song Luokui decided to trust her brother: \"Then still be careful.\"","\"Mmhm, I'll bring you back a gift.\"","\"Okay.\"","After hanging up, Song Luokui said: \"Uncle An, let's go back to school.\"","\"Alright.\"","Back in the dorm, the three roommates were there. Wang Sisi was painting her toenails while video calling Lin Cheng.","The other two were studying. Song Luokui looked at this one and that one. Su Ziyuan and Zhang Jingfeng were single, and in their dorm, only Wang Sisi was in a relationship.","After Wang Sisi hung up, she saw Song Luokui staring at her. Wang Sisi: \"Luokui...what's...going on?\"","Song Luokui: \"How did you and Lin Cheng get together initially?\"","Wang Sisi didn't know why she was asking this, but she still answered: \"We met at a school event back then, and he pursued me.\"","Song Luokui: \"How did he pursue you?\"","Wang Sisi: \"Just like most others, at first we chatted online, then he asked me out to play, took me out for meals and movies, and gave me gifts...We were in that ambiguous period for a while, then he confessed, and we got together.\"","As Song Luokui listened, she suddenly felt it sounded very familiar - meals, outings, chatting, gifts...","Isn't that exactly how things were between her and Chi Yu?","Song Luokui bit her lip, lost in thought.","Wang Sisi: \"What's wrong? Is someone pursuing you?\"As she said this, Su Ziyuan and Zhang Jingfeng immediately perked up their ears and turned around, looking eager to hear the gossip.","Song Luokui: \"...Well...kind of.\" Thinking back to when Chi Yu took her to see the snow and watch fireworks during the New Year...that scene now seemed so ambiguous.","The three girls' eyes immediately lit up. \"Who is it? Who is it? Is he handsome? If he's not handsome, then forget it, we can't accept you dating an ugly guy. No matter how rich he is, it won't work.\"","\"Nevermind, we probably don't know him anyway.\"","\"Is he from our school? Or from your circle?\"","\"Most importantly, he has to be a good match for you.\"","The three chatted incessantly.","Song Luokui: \"...Uh...he's from our school but also from my circle, and he's decent-looking.\"","Wang Sisi suddenly asked: \"Does your brother know about this?\"","Song Luokui immediately \"shh\"-ed her, \"No, no one knows. No one else knows.\"","The three immediately covered their mouths, indicating they would keep it a secret.","\"But I'm really troubled.\" Song Luokui frowned. She thought about if she rejected Chi Yu, and later her brother and Chi Yu had a major conflict, what if her brother couldn't beat Chi Yu, then she couldn't even plead for him.","But if she accepted Chi Yu...it did seem to have many benefits, but she still felt unsettled, and she recalled the issue of being deceived emotionally and physically.","Wang Sisi observed Song Luokui's expression, \"What's troubling you? Are you worried your family won't approve, or that you don't like him enough? Or...\"","\"Wait, like?\" Song Luokui shook her head, \"I don't like him...well...it's alright I guess.\" She suddenly thought of Chi Yu's face. Like? They're just friends, right? But it's not like she dislikes him either.","Wang Sisi: \"If you don't like him, then just reject him. Or maybe you feel there's a bit of a difference? You're just in an ambiguous period, and the feelings aren't deep enough yet. Maybe you have a bit of a crush, but that little crush isn't quite enough.\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Something like that.\"","Wang Sisi spread her hands, \"Then just keep it in this ambiguous period. If I were you, I'd string him along. Whether he gets anxious is his problem. If he gives up midway, it's no big deal, you can cut it off in time. Since you don't like him that much anyway, right? If I were you, I could string along several at once.\"","Su Ziyuan and Zhang Jingfeng both thought there was nothing wrong with that.","\"Exactly, if I were you, Luokui, I wouldn't be in a hurry at all.\"","\"Right, and I think you deserve the best.\"","Song Luokui's expression relaxed, \"No wonder you were the first one in our dorm to get into a relationship!\" Song Luokui gave Wang Sisi a thumbs up.","Wang Sisi was very proud, \"Let me tell you, this is how you should treat men - be hot and cold, don't cling to them all the time as if you can't live without them. You need to tease their nerves, make them feel like they can't live without you.\"","Su Ziyuan: \"No wonder Lin Cheng calls you every day asking what you're up to. He's probably afraid you'll run away.\"","Wang Sisi: \"For now, my man has been doing very well, so Luokui, have you decided what to do?\"","\"Decided, I'll follow your advice and not respond.\"","Wang Sisi clapped her hands, \"That's right. Being a bit of a jerk can be very enjoyable sometimes.\"","Song Luokui had solved one problem and finally felt relieved. She picked up her clothes and headed to the bathroom, \"I'm going to take a shower first.\"","After she went into the bathroom, Zhang Jingfeng said in a low voice: \"I really can't figure out who is pursuing Luokui.\"","\"Luokui just said it's someone from her circle who also goes to our school, and there are indeed a lot of rich people at our school, but I've never seen Luokui get close with any male students.\"","Wang Sisi somehow thought of what her boyfriend had previously mentioned - that on the day they were playing at the Unnamed Mountain Lake Store No. 1, that night it was Senior Chi who took Song Luokui away.","At the time, her boyfriend had told her to keep it a secret and not tell anyone. Could it be...?","Senior Chi Yu is indeed from their school, and he knows Song Luokui...so...could it be?!","Wang Sisi covered her mouth and immediately turned to send a message to her boyfriend."]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: The Attack","paragraphs":["\"Baby, have you heard any gossip about Senior Chi Yu lately?\" Wang Sisi messaged Lin Cheng.","\"What's up? No, I haven't seen Senior Chi Yu recently.\"","Wang Sisi: \"It seems like someone has been pursuing Song Luokui recently. I suspect it's Senior Chi Yu, shh, no one should know.\"","Lin Cheng: \"[Covers mouth] I know.\"","Lin Cheng: \"Does Senior Chi Yu need to pursue anyone? But... someone like Junior sister Song does need it. Oh no, I remember that Senior Chi Yu and Senior Song didn't get along well.\"","Wang Sisi: \"Shh shh shh, let's just secretly gossip about it, okay?\"","Lin Cheng: \"Got it, got it.\"","...","After showering, Song Luokui saw the photo Chi Yu took of himself, standing next to a ruler, with his palm connecting his head and the ruler showing 187 cm.","Song Luokui: \"...\" Suddenly finding it a bit funny, what's going on? Song Luokui crawled onto the bed and pulled the blanket over her head. Today was too exciting, she didn't want to reply to him.","After a while, Song Luokui lifted the blanket and looked at that message again, who knows if he was wearing shoes? Hmph!","Time to sleep!","A few days later, Song Luokui felt that she hadn't been home for a long time, so she went back for a visit. She turned on the TV, and the news reported on the diplomatic exchange between Country X and Hua Country.","Song Luokui then remembered that her brother Song Luosheng had gone on a business trip to Country X a few days ago.","It was currently night time in Hua Country, so it should still be daytime in Country X. Song Luokui sent Song Luosheng a message telling him to be careful, but he didn't reply.","At that moment, Song Luosheng was meeting with a minister named Xavier from the Commerce Department in a hotel in Country X.","\"I come with sincerity, and I believe our cooperation will bring more job opportunities to your country,\" said Song Luosheng, dressed in a well-fitted suit, leaning confidently on the sofa chair. Although young, no one present dared to underestimate him.","\"Of course, I trust Mr. Song, and I was actually good friends with Mr. Song's father.\"","\"Oh, I know, I've met you when I was little.\"","\"Hahaha.\"","They were chatting pleasantly, both sides quite satisfied, when suddenly there was a loud \"boom,\" as if an earthquake had struck. Everyone instantly dropped to the floor as debris fell from the ceiling.","Xavier shouted, \"What's going on!\"","The bodyguards rushed in to protect them. \"There's a terrorist attack, we must leave immediately!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, a rocket was thrown straight in from outside!","Song Luosheng rolled to the side of a pillar. After the rocket exploded, he immediately crouched down and ran for safety under the protection of the bodyguards, heading toward the hotel's secure area.","Outside, a bearded man was carrying a rocket launcher, shouting, \"The economy of our Country X will never allow interference from other countries! Damn the Malta government, they are traitors!\"","With a \"swoosh,\" a rocket hit the hotel, immediately causing a large part of the building to collapse...","\"Watch out!\" Song Luosheng felt someone push him, then someone shielded him from the blast and collapsing debris...","...","Song Luokui wasn't sleeping well. She had another dream where her brother Song Luosheng jumped off a rooftop, his eyes wide open, his features distorted and bleeding, with many people watching but no one coming forward...","\"Brother!\" Song Luokui woke up drenched in sweat, realizing it was just a dream. But the dream was so vivid that she could still see her brother's open, unblinking eyes. She touched her face, still feeling unnerved.","Song Luokui got out of bed for a drink of water and wiped off her sweat, planning to go back to sleep. But she couldn't fall asleep, so she picked up her phone to check the news. As soon as she opened it, a breaking news alert caught her eye.","\"Terrorist attack in Country X, assailant attacks hotel where Hua Country businessman was staying, casualties still being counted.\"","Song Luokui immediately jumped up and frantically called Song Luosheng, but there was no answer, causing her to nearly cry out of fear.","She rushed out of her room. The lights in the study and downstairs were on. She heard her father Song Moqian on the phone, \"Please notify me as soon as you have any news about my son.\"","After the person on the other end spoke, Song Moqian hung up.","Song Moqian suddenly noticed a shadow at the door. \"Who's there?\"","Song Luokui then entered, looking like she was about to cry. \"Dad, did something happen to Brother?\"","Seeing his younger daughter's fearful expression, Song Moqian immediately hugged her reassuringly. \"Don't worry, your brother will be fine. I've asked to be notified of any news, and the embassy is also handling it. Your brother was often sent for military training when he was young, so he'll be okay. He also had bodyguards with him, don't be afraid.\"","Song Moqian then noticed Song Luokui was barefoot. \"Why aren't you wearing shoes?\"","Song Luokui wiped away tears from the corners of her eyes. \"I was in such a hurry.\"","At that moment, Sheng Rong returned from outside. Seeing Song Luokui, she immediately went over and hugged her. \"Luokui, don't be afraid. I just got more information. Your brother probably escaped, don't worry.\"","\"Okay.\" Song Luokui nodded, burying her face in her mother's embrace.","After Song Moqian and Sheng Rong comforted Song Luokui and had her lie down to sleep, they left her room.","But as soon as they left, Song Luokui opened her eyes again, unable to sleep. She noticed that Chi Yu had called her many times.","Remembering Chi Yu's earlier words, Song Luokui immediately called him back. He answered right away, \"You know what happened?\"","Song Luokui, her voice still nasal, \"Yeah.\"","Hearing her voice, Chi Yu's heart ached a little. If possible, he would have gone straight to her house. \"Don't be afraid, I just received news that your brother was injured but not in any life-threatening danger. Your father should receive the message soon too.\"","Song Luokui: \"How did you know?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm friends with the Third Prince of Country X, he told me.\"","Song Luokui knew Chi Yu's information would be accurate, and her heart settled a bit. \"Is my brother seriously injured?\"","Chi Yu: \"No, not seriously, don't worry.\"","\"Okay. Thank you, Chi Yu.\" Song Luokui twisted the fuzz on her blanket, her damp eyelashes fluttering slightly. The benefits of being on good terms with Chi Yu were quite obvious.","Chi Yu's gaze fell on an album nearby. \"Song Luokui, come to a private party with me.\"","Song Luokui remained silent.","Chi Yu: \"Just a few people. Your brother won't know. You don't need to do anything.\"","Song Luokui: \"When?\"","Chi Yu: \"End of the month.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"Alright, get some good rest. What you're worried about won't happen.\"","\"Okay~\"","\"Good night.\"","After hanging up, Song Luokui hid under the blanket. It wasn't long before she fell asleep.","The next morning, Song Luokui woke up early and also learned about her brother's condition from her parents. He had only suffered minor injuries and a concussion but was in good physical health, similar to what Chi Yu had said last night.","At noon, the family finally had a video call with Song Luosheng. His face looked a bit pale on the video, with his forehead bandaged.","\"I'm fine, Sis. Were you crying last night? Don't worry about me. I'm doing well. I just haven't bought you a gift yet. If I don't bring one back, will Princess Luokui eat me up?\"","Song Luokui was both amused and nearly in tears by his teasing. \"I would never eat you up. You really scared me, Brother.\""]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Safe Return","paragraphs":["Seeing Song Luokui about to cry, Song Luosheng immediately wanted to get out of bed and stand up, \"Luokui, don't cry. Big brother is fine. I can still spar with you.\" He even jumped a little.","Song Luokui's voice became shrill: \"...Big brother, get back in bed.\"","On the other side, Sheng Rong also said, \"Luosheng, get back in bed.\"","Song Moqian said, \"What are you doing? You scared Luokui. Get back in bed.\"","The medical staff also quickly came over and demanded that the patient lie down, \"Sir, you have a mild concussion, and you must rest properly.\"","After a bit of chaos, Song Luosheng obediently lay down, \"Luokui, I'm lying down now, don't be afraid.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\"","Song Luosheng stayed in the hospital for a few days. In the meantime, he didn't forget about business matters. After being discharged, he took care of the business and quickly returned home after buying some gifts.","Song Luokui had just finished school and was about to get in the car at the school gate when she saw Song Luosheng waiting for her.","Song Luokui immediately went over and hugged him, \"Big brother, you're back!\"","Song Luosheng hugged her, \"Are you happy? As soon as I came back, I came to pick you up from school. Let's go home, I bought you some gifts.\"","\"Mmhmm.\"","In the car, Song Luokui asked about what had happened.","\"Your big brother is awesome. The bomb was not far from me, but I reacted quickly and took cover behind a pillar.\"","\"Big brother, that business is so dangerous. Can you not do it anymore?\"","Song Luosheng patted her head, \"That was an accident, a one in a thousand chance. If I don't do it, someone else will. I'm doing it for the country. Don't worry, I have a lot of bodyguards with me.\"","\"I had a close call this time, you know. That guy, when he was in L Country before, rumor has it the local mafia chased him for several blocks, and a bullet even went through his shoulder.\" Song Luosheng pointed to his shoulder.","Song Luokui was stunned, \"That guy is Chi Yu?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Mmhmm.\"","Song Luokui blinked, \"Why?\" So the injury in Y Country was minor?","Song Luosheng: \"Of course, they're all about the same. It's because someone's interests were taken. There are a lot of these things abroad, unlike the good public security in our country.\"","Song Luokui: \"So in our business wars, people just hire others to pour water on their opponents' money trees or buy online trolls to insult them?\"","Song Luosheng laughed when he heard her say that, \"Where did you hear that from? Pouring water on money trees? It seems I need to hire someone to go water that guy's money tree at the entrance of his group.\"","Song Luokui: \"That's what people say online.\"","Song Luosheng: \"That's not wrong. Compared to ours, the assassinations abroad are indeed more serious.\"","Song Luokui: \"Can't we just do business domestically?\"","Song Luosheng: \"That won't work. Although the domestic market is large, the international market offers more challenges. If we don't take from others, they will take from us. It's better for our people to take because it benefits our country. There are limited global resources, and if we don't take them, how can our country become strong and our people eat and dress warmly?\"","Song Luokui felt that made sense.","Song Luosheng: \"Oh, besides pouring water on money trees and online trolls, there's also the honeytrap tactic. Some people become bosses, and a honeytrap can ruin them completely! So Luokui, I've prepared everything for you at Tianyú Company. You'll be the boss from now on. Remember to stay away from men other than your big brother, especially those in the entertainment industry.\"","When Song Luokui heard Song Luosheng mention the honeytrap tactic, her heart tightened... So Chi Yu asked her to use the honeytrap on him... What kind of tactic is this?","When they got home, Aunt Gui had prepared a lot of delicious food, and Song Moqian and Sheng Rong were also there. The family happily sat together to eat.","...","With Song Luosheng's safe return, Song Luokui was completely relieved. It seemed like everything at the company was sorted out, the management was in place, most of the original people were gone, and only a few relatively obedient ones remained.","Chen Ying was one of them. She finally found a job at the company and had been working as a receptionist for half a year. Although she had to do all kinds of odd jobs in addition to being a receptionist, the salary was 7,000 yuan. She had only graduated from high school and didn't dare quit, afraid she wouldn't be able to find a similar job.","Her mother was ill, and she had a younger sister in school. Besides living expenses, she had to send money home every month. If she lost her job, she wouldn't know what to do.","Originally, it was just tiring, and the boss was quite unpleasant, sometimes even sexually harassing her, but for the money, she endured it. However, after only half a year, the boss was arrested, the management was arrested, and many people ran away. The company... the company was then acquired.","Apart from her, there were several other people waiting for the new boss to arrive. They heard the new boss would be coming today.","Song Luokui didn't come, but the manager did.","Yu Hui was the manager hired by Song Luokui and interviewed by Song Luosheng.","As soon as Yu Hui arrived, she made arrangements.","\"Who is Chen Ying?\"","Chen Ying's heart tightened, but she quickly raised her hand and came forward.","Yu Hui looked at her file, \"Chen Ying, right?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Good, from now on, you are promoted to be the head of the administrative department. Your salary will be doubled, and the company will hire two more people to assist you.\"","Chen Ying couldn't believe it, \"Me? But I...\"","Yu Hui: \"No buts. It's you! Can you do it well?\"","\"Yes!\" Chen Ying couldn't believe it, \"I will definitely work hard and do a good job.\"","Yu Hui nodded, \"Okay then. Lin Shuihua.\"","\"Present.\"","\"You are promoted to be the head of the human resources department. You'll be in charge of recruitment going forward. Oh, we only hire women at this company.\"","When she said that, everyone was surprised.","Lin Shuihua: \"Only hire women?\"","Yu Hui: \"Yes. Single mothers, unmarried and childless, married and childless, married with children, any age is fine as long as they're capable. Capability is most important. That's the boss's instruction.\"","Hearing that it was the boss's instruction, no one had any objections.","Next, Yu Hui gave further instructions, and everyone dispersed after the meeting.","Chen Ying watched as everyone busily and energetically went about their work. She felt that this company might actually be pretty good in the future.","Song Luokui didn't go to the company, but she was indeed busy. She had only been an observer of the entertainment industry before, so now that she had to manage it, she definitely needed to study it. She spent a lot of time reading relevant materials and often stayed up very late in the dorm.","Her roommates felt that it wasn't good for her health and wondered what she was studying so hard for.","Zhang Xiyue happened to come by and invited her out to play. Originally, Song Luokui didn't want to go, but her roommates felt she should go and relax a bit.","\"Luokui, come with us.\"","\"You've been working so hard every day. It's okay to unwind once in a while.\"","\"Luokui, I've invited some fresh young undergrad guys to join us. Come with us.\"","Song Luokui's eyes widened, \"Where are we going to play? Are you sure you're bringing undergrads?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"There's one I'm a little interested in. And you, Luokui, you've been hanging out with just girls all the time, everyone thinks you're a lesbian. Come on, it'll be fun with those fresh young undergrads. We're going to the amusement park to ride rollercoasters and go through haunted houses.\"","\"Everyone's coming, let's go.\" Zhang Xiyue pulled Song Luokui along, and Wang Sisi and the others from their dorm also joined them.","Wang Sisi: \"Can I bring my boyfriend?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Sure, sure.\"","Wang Sisi immediately called her boyfriend. When Lin Cheng arrived at the amusement park and saw his girlfriend along with several tall, strapping young undergrads...","Lin Cheng's eyes widened.","Wang Sisi: \"Xiyue invited them to join us.\"","Lin Cheng then noticed a young man next to Song Luokui asking for her contact information on WeChat.","He suddenly remembered Senior Chi... Then, an idea struck him, and he secretly took a photo and sent it to Chi Yu.","Chi Yu quickly replied, \"Where is this?\"","Lin Cheng: \"The amusement park.\""]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: Playground play, Pond Island to catch people","paragraphs":["A group of people went to ride the roller coaster first. Song Luokui sat in the middle, with two guys on either side of her. The one on the left said, \"Senior Song, if you get scared, you can hold my hand tightly.\"","The guy on the right also said, \"Or you can hold my hand tightly.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Hehe.\"","She didn't hold either of their hands, nor did she get scared. Instead, the two guys next to her were screaming at the top of their lungs. After getting off the ride, their legs were wobbly, while Song Luokui stood there steadily.","On the other side, Zhang Xiyue's legs were also wobbly, with a boy supporting her. The others sat down to rest.","Wang Sisi snuggled in her boyfriend Lin Cheng's arms. Lin Cheng didn't go on the ride, so he was perfectly fine.","Song Luokui: \"Do you guys want ice cream? I'll go buy some for you.\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes, yes, yes!\"","Song Luokui immediately crossed the street to get the ice cream, followed by the two guys whose legs were wobbly earlier, who were also farting rainbows.","\"Senior, you're so amazing, not scared at all.\"","\"Yeah, senior is really great. Unlike me, my legs were all wobbly. Hahaha.\"","Song Luokui: \"...It's alright.\"","On the other side, Lin Cheng, watching them, wondered if Senior Chi Yu would come over. He suddenly wanted to see the show.","Wang Sisi noticed him staring at the opposite side. \"What's wrong?\"","Lin Cheng lowered his voice and told her, \"I just sent Senior Chi Yu a photo.\"","Wang Sisi: \"Hmm?\"","Lin Cheng showed her the message. Wang Sisi immediately covered her mouth, her eyes widening as she stared at him. After a while, she stuttered in a low voice, \"You...holy shit...is Senior Chi really going to come?\"","Lin Cheng, also in a low voice: \"I don't know, but I think he will.\"","Not long after, Song Luokui returned with the ice cream. \"Here.\"","Wang Sisi took the ice cream but felt a bit awkward looking at Song Luokui, as her boyfriend had just revealed her whereabouts.","However, Wang Sisi still wanted to know if Senior Chi Yu would show up and what would happen if he did.","\"Rested enough? Let's go to the haunted house.\"","\"Let's go!\"","The group headed towards the haunted house, bought tickets, and lined up for the next round.","At that moment, Chi Yu had just entered the amusement park to look for them. He sent Lin Cheng a message asking where they were. This group had already lined up to enter the haunted house, so Lin Cheng immediately replied, \"At the haunted house.\"","Chi Yu quickly made his way to the haunted house.","Meanwhile, Song Luokui's group had entered the haunted house. It was very dark inside, with dim lighting. After walking for a bit, they came across a room. A male student in the front pushed the door open, making a creaking sound that was particularly scary in the quiet space. Wang Sisi tightly gripped Lin Cheng's clothes.","Song Luokui and Zhang Xiyue walked together, hugging each other.","As the door creaked open, they saw it was a wedding room, with nothing out of the ordinary except for a candle in the corner.","The male student peeked in. \"It's fine, there's nothing here. Let's go in.\"","As the group was about to enter, a figure suddenly dropped from the ceiling. \"Ahhhhh!\"","Several screams rang out as everyone rushed into the room. Lin Cheng hugged his girlfriend. \"Don't be afraid, that's just a prop, a prop. Everyone, don't be scared.\"","On the other side, Song Luokui and Zhang Xiyue clung tightly to each other, as did Zhang Jingfeng and Su Ziyuan, and a few other male students.","Only the student named Fan Yilu, who was in the front, remained relatively calm. He stood next to Zhang Xiyue. \"It's just a prop, don't be afraid. Let's figure out how to get out of this room.\"","The decor inside the room had a Chinese horror vibe. Once everyone calmed down, they started looking for clues.","Outside, Chi Yu had arrived at the haunted house, but he couldn't enter since the current round had already started.","Chi Yu: \"Ten thousand yuan. I want to go in.\"","Owner: \"Handsome guy, come on in! Watch your step!\"","Chi Yu immediately rushed in.","The owner sat outside, legs crossed, thinking to himself after sitting there for so long, finally a rich guy came and threw money at him. Tonight, he would go brag about it!","Meanwhile, in the room, the group was searching for clues. It was clear that this was a bride's room, and for some unknown reason, the bride had died mysteriously in the room, while her new husband—the figure hanging at the entrance—had hanged himself.","\"Where's the bride? Where's her body?\"","Suddenly, a voice spoke up: \"Remember, we're in a haunted house now, so...\"","At that moment, eerie music started playing, sending chills down everyone's spines. Then, with a creaking sound, a cabinet suddenly opened by itself. A window also flung open with a bang. Right after, a figure in a red dress appeared at the window...","\"Ahhhhh!\"","Everyone scattered around the room. \"Hurry, get out! Get out!\"","\"Ahhhhh!\"","Song Luokui suddenly found herself separated from Zhang Xiyue, who had rushed into Fan Yilu's arms.","Song Luokui: ?","Suddenly, the candle in the corner was blown out, plunging the room into darkness. Song Luokui felt someone grab her hand and pull her into a large cabinet.","\"Who is it?\" Song Luokui tried to free her hand from the tight grip, but to no avail.","The person suddenly moved closer to her. Song Luokui caught a familiar scent and looked up, her lips grazing the person's chin, causing them both to freeze.","Song Luokui clearly heard the person swallow, followed by a familiar voice: \"It's me.\"","When she smelled the scent earlier, Song Luokui had already guessed who it might be, but she wasn't sure until now.","\"How...did you end up here?\" Song Luokui tried to move back to create some distance, but they were in a cabinet with no room to move. Her back was against the cabinet wall.","Chi Yu leaned in, their noses nearly touching in the darkness. Song Luokui could even hear his breathing. If they weren't in the dark, her flushed face would have been exposed to Chi Yu.","Chi Yu grabbed her hand, their fingers tightly interlocked. \"You came to play with the boys, so I came too.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\"","Chi Yu suddenly rested his forehead on her shoulder. \"Am I not as fun as them? Why didn't you invite me?\"","Song Luokui's face turned redder, almost smoking. Outside, people were still screaming as the bride figure chased them around the room's table.","Song Luokui wanted to say something but didn't. Chi Yu lifted his head, releasing her hand but grabbing her shoulders instead, pulling her into his embrace. Song Luokui tried to push him away, but Chi Yu said, \"Shall we go out?\"","Song Luokui paused, then hurriedly said, \"No, don't go out!\" There were so many people outside, including Zhang Xiyue. What would happen if they were discovered?","Song Luokui frantically gripped his clothes. \"Don't go out.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then you'll have to give me a reward.\"","Song Luokui swallowed. \"...What kind of reward do you want?\""]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: How Are You Thinking","paragraphs":["Chi Yu: \"Have you considered it?\"","Song Luokui looked puzzled: \"What?\"","Chi Yu: \"The seduction plan.\"","Song Luokui lowered her gaze: \"I'm... still... ahem, still considering it.\"","Suddenly, Chi Yu tilted his head down, and Song Luokui felt a touch on her earlobe. Instantly, she felt her legs go weak. Chi Yu supported her, \"Don't take too long, I'm afraid I can't hold back anymore.\"","Then, the closet door opened. Song Luokui stared wide-eyed at Chi Yu, who scooped her up in his arms. \"No one will notice.\"","The view outside the closet was hazy, and faces were indistinguishable. A group of people ran around the room, some cowered on the bed, trembling. Chi Yu carried Song Luokui to the window and let her out, then swung his long legs over and followed her out.","\"Let's go.\" Chi Yu took her hand and left the bridal suite, heading to their next destination. After encountering and defeating ghosts along the way, a few minutes later, they made their way out of the haunted house, following a winding path.","Song Luokui looked at the bright sky outside, then at Chi Yu. The two made eye contact...","The people outside the haunted house noticed the \"couple\" with such high looks gazing at them. They assumed they were a couple since the two were holding hands, and the girl was blushing, while the guy's ears were even red. Their eye contact exuded intense chemistry. Ah ah ah ah, kiss! Kiss!","Of course, they didn't kiss. Song Luokui blinked and snapped out of it, immediately pushing Chi Yu away. \"Quick, quick, leave now before they come out.\"","Chi Yu: \"You haven't given me my reward yet.\"","Song Luokui thought for a moment, \"Just now wasn't...\" Her face turned even redder.","Chi Yu: \"That doesn't count. That was just my reward for getting you out. It's not enough.\"","Song Luokui: \"...I'll come find you tomorrow. We'll talk about it then.\"","Chi Yu: \"Video call tonight?\"","Song Luokui kept pushing him away. \"Video call, whatever, just leave now.\"","\"Okay.\" Chi Yu was satisfied and stroked her flushed cheek. \"I'll go first then. See you tonight.\"","The girls nearby saw the guy leave while the girl stayed, though he caressed her cheek before leaving. Woo woo, it's so... They wanted to squeal!","It was a pity they didn't kiss goodbye. If they had, the girls would have screamed out loud. Woo woo, that couple was just too good-looking. If they kissed, the girls didn't know how excited they'd get just imagining it. Ah ah ah ah!","Outside, Song Luokui took deep breaths and rubbed her face to try and cool her flushed cheeks so no one would notice.","Back in the bridal suite, Lin Cheng had been holding Wang Sisi on the bed, both trembling. Suddenly, his sharp eyes caught someone leaving through the window. He sat up immediately. \"Baby, I know how to get out.\"","The two climbed out the window. Once outside, they shouted to the others: \"This way, run this way!\"","Everyone scrambled toward the window, climbing out one by one. Outside, they followed the path, running away. They were chased by ghosts twice, but finally, after who knows how long, they saw the exit and ran out.","Panting, everyone caught their breath at the entrance.","\"Damn! That was terrifying!\"","\"Is my face pale? I feel like I've turned pale.\"","\"Me too, me too. Especially in the bridal suite.\"","Zhang Xiyue was counting heads. \"Hey, I think we're missing someone.\"","Wang Sisi looked around. \"Luokui! Where's Luokui?\"","\"Crap! Did we leave Luokui in there?\"","Zhang Xiyue poked her head in and called, \"Luokui!\"","Song Luokui walked over from the side, holding a bottle of water. \"I'm right here.\"","Zhang Xiyue turned and hugged her. \"I thought you were still inside.\"","Song Luokui heard this and immediately said, \"You were so focused on your boyfriend, you forgot about your friend!\" She poked Zhang Xiyue's forehead with her finger.","Zhang Xiyue grinned sheepishly and rubbed her head. \"Well, you know...\" She winked at Song Luokui.","Song Luokui: \"I came out a long time ago. I've been waiting for you all.\"","Lin Cheng suddenly said, \"Were you two the first ones to come out through the window?\"","Song Luokui blinked. \"I was the only one who came out first.\"","Lin Cheng: \"Just you?\" He could have sworn he saw two people, one carrying the other. Maybe he was mistaken? Or was it someone else? And where was Chi Yu? He still hadn't shown up.","Song Luokui: \"Yeah.\"","Zhang Xiyue came over. \"Rested enough? Come on, let's go try another ride.\"","The group headed off to other attractions...","That evening, back in the dorm, Song Luokui was in the shower when Chi Yu's video call came in, but no one answered.","Chi Yu wondered if she had changed her mind.","When Song Luokui came out of the bathroom and saw the missed call, she immediately replied, \"One moment.\"","Song Luokui partially dried her hair, then put on a jacket and took her phone before heading out.","Song Luokui went downstairs to a secluded area with no one around before video calling Chi Yu. He seemed to have just come out of the shower too, his hair still dripping water onto his chest, giving a glimpse of his pecs under his collar.","Song Luokui quickly averted her gaze. \"How did you know I was there today?\" She just realized on her way back that she didn't post anything on her social media, so how did Chi Yu know she went to an amusement park? And with boys? She had only gone with her roommates and Zhang Xiyue. The boys were Zhang Xiyue's friends.","Chi Yu: \"I have connections.\"","Song Luokui wondered if Zhang Xiyue posted something on social media that someone saw and passed on to Chi Yu.","Without dwelling on it, Chi Yu brought up the private party. \"I'll pick you up this weekend.\"","Song Luokui: \"Huh?\"","Chi Yu: \"The private party you agreed to earlier.\"","Song Luokui then remembered. \"Oh, right. Do I need to dress up or can I go casual?\"","Chi Yu: \"Casual is fine. You look good no matter what you wear.\"","Song Luokui's face flushed again. He really wasn't holding back now.","Chi Yu: \"And don't forget what you said about coming to see me tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui: \"But I thought you said video call tonight?\"","Chi Yu: \"The video call was my suggestion. You said you'd come see me tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Alright. Anything else?\"","Chi Yu stared at her intently. \"No, but I want to see you.\"","Song Luokui's ears turned red too as she covered the camera. \"Can't you be a little more restrained?\"","Chi Yu: \"No.\" He had been too restrained before, while she went off playing with boys.","Song Luokui was speechless.","Chi Yu: \"Have you decided yet?\"","Song Luokui knew he meant the seduction plan. \"Why do you keep asking? I'm still considering it.\""]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: Tea in a Teahouse","paragraphs":["\"Alright, then take your hand away for a bit, I want to see you.\"","Song Luokui said, \"There's nothing to see, it's too cold outside, I'm going back.\" With that, Song Luokui stood up.","Chi Yu knew she must have been embarrassed, so he didn't insist. \"Okay, good night.\"","\"Good night.\"","After hanging up the phone, Song Luokui immediately ran back to her dorm room. She wasn't lying, it was indeed quite cold outside, and she certainly couldn't video call him from her dorm.","The next day, she was supposed to go home in the afternoon since she had no classes, but today she had to meet Chi Yu. So after lunch, she sent him a message, \"Where are you?\"","Chi Yu was having lunch with a foreign businessman at a restaurant. Upon seeing her message, he replied immediately, \"Why don't you go to my company first? I'm out right now, but I'll be there soon.\"","Song Luokui: \"Then I'll go drink tea at the place downstairs from your company.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luokui quickly made her way to a hutong near the Shanyu Building, where there was a tea house.","She went straight into a private room, sprawling on the sofa as the tea master prepared tea for her. There was someone playing the guqin and singing in the background.","At Tian Yu, the head of the finance department came to the CEO's office. \"Manager Yu, here's a payroll that needs the boss's signature. Since the company had delayed everyone's salaries before, we've just finished verifying all the payrolls from before and last month. According to our company's policy of paying salaries at the end of the month, it would be best if we could issue them tomorrow. Otherwise, we'll have to postpone it until next month.\"","The coming weekend was the end of the month.","Yu Hui said, \"Wait a moment, let me make a call.\"","On the other end, Song Luokui, who was being attended to by a beautiful woman, received the call. \"Hello?\"","Qin Keling from the finance department had sharp ears. She seemed to have heard a gentle and slightly languid female voice on the other end. So their boss was a woman? Come to think of it, none of them had actually seen the new boss yet.","After the company was acquired, sweeping reforms were made. Not only were all new employees women, but the benefits had also improved greatly. All the employees who stayed were extremely grateful, and Qin Keling herself was just an employee in the finance department before. But since the previous head of finance had left, she got promoted.","Everyone was truly grateful to the boss. Some even wanted to make a statue of the boss and worship it every day.","Song Luokui heard what Yu Hui said and checked the time. \"Signature? Okay, I'm at the Bamboo Creek Tea House on Hua'an Lane, on Menwai Dajie. You can have her come over now. If there are any other documents that need signing, she can bring them over too.\"","\"Alright, I'll have someone go over now.\"","\"Mm.\"","After hanging up, Song Luokui continued sipping her tea and listening to the music.","It didn't take long for Qin Keling and Yu Hui's secretary Huang Xinqiao to arrive at the tea house, as Tian Yu wasn't far from there. As they approached the magnificent tea house, their hearts started pounding.","They entered, and a staff member immediately greeted them, \"Welcome, do you have a reservation?\"","Qin Keling said, \"Hello, we're here to see someone named Ms. Song.\"","Upon hearing that, the staff member led them inside. \"Ms. Song's private room is upstairs, please follow me.\"","They followed the staff upstairs. The entire tea house was built like an ancient structure, with pavilions, towers, carved beams and painted pillars - exquisite and beautiful in every detail.","The staff member knocked on the door upstairs. \"Ms. Song, your guests have arrived.\"","A female voice came from inside, \"Let them in.\"","\"Yes.\" The staff member opened the door, and Qin Keling and Huang Xinqiao entered. They immediately saw a beautiful woman resembling an ancient palace maid playing the guqin on the left. There was a censer emitting fragrant smoke on a small table, and on the spacious sofa to the right reclined a woman. She wore a snow-white sweater, with a red gemstone pendant hanging on her chest. Her long, jet-black hair cascaded behind her, making her look like a languid fairy.","They saw her raise her hand, revealing a jade green bracelet adorning her wrist and a glimpse of her porcelain-like skin. Her slender, jade-like hand held a teacup as she took a sip, then looked up at them.","The two women held their breath, stunned. Was this their new boss?","\"Why are you just standing there? Come have some tea.\"","Song Luokui gestured towards the chairs beside her. \"Did you bring the documents that need signing?\"","Qin Keling stammered, \"Brought... brought them.\"","Qin Keling and Huang Xinqiao approached immediately. \"Hello, Boss.\"","The tea master considerately placed two cups of tea in front of the women.","Song Luokui extended her hand. \"Give me the documents, and you two have some tea.\"","Qin Keling handed over the documents and a pen, with signature tabs marking where signatures were needed. \"This is the payroll...\"","Song Luokui flipped through it quickly and signed her name. Then she started reviewing the other documents that needed signing. For any parts she didn't quite understand, she asked the two women, who provided detailed explanations with their professional knowledge.","Song Luokui swiftly signed each document and handed them back. Qin Keling and Huang Xinqiao carefully collected the documents, preparing to take their leave.","But then Song Luokui asked, \"How many people are in our company now?\"","Huang Xinqiao replied, \"Reporting to the boss, we currently have over thirty employees.\" Originally over a hundred, the company was down to just around ten before recently hiring more people to reach over thirty.","Song Luokui nodded, then turned to the tea master and said, \"Please pack some assorted snacks and sesame seed cakes for them to take back, along with two cans of Biluochun tea.\"","The tea master immediately went to prepare the items. \"Yes, I'll have them packaged right away.\"","Song Luokui told Qin Keling and the others, \"Wait a moment, the snacks are my treat for your afternoon tea. The tea can be placed in the tea room for anyone who wants to drink it.\"","Qin Keling replied, \"Understood, we'll let everyone know.\"","The two sat stiffly, sipping their tea without daring to look around.","At that moment, Chi Yu finished his meeting and called Song Luokui. \"Where are you? Should I come pick you up?\"","Qin Keling and Huang Xinqiao faintly heard a man's voice coming from the phone, with a distinct Beijing accent that was pleasant to the ear and almost coaxing in tone.","But to their surprise, their boss showed no reaction at all. \"I'm at the Bamboo Creek Tea House. Are you done?\"","\"Yeah, I'm coming over now.\"","\"Okay.\"","She hung up and continued calmly drinking her tea, even offering some snacks to the other two women.","Soon, the service staff brought over the packaged items.","Qin Keling and Huang Xinqiao took the items and bid farewell. \"Then we'll head back first.\"","\"Mm.\"","As they were being escorted out and the staff considerately called them a car, a sleek black luxury car pulled up in front of the tea house. Intimidating bodyguards and a driver opened the door, and Chi Yu stepped out, entering the tea house.","In the car, Qin Keling and Huang Xinqiao held each other's hands excitedly. \"We actually got to see our beautiful and kindhearted boss!!!\""]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: The Handle","paragraphs":["Both of them were unusually excited, chatting animatedly in the car.","\"When I first entered the tea house, I thought I had time traveled. The staff members all looked so gorgeous.\"","\"After entering the private room, did you smell the fragrance? It was heavenly. And someone was playing the piano, making it feel like visiting a Brothel from ancient times.\"","\"Did you taste anything special in your tea?\"","\"No, I don't really understand tea. Drinking it was just like drinking water to me. But I noticed how beautiful the owner is! Ahhh, every movement, every glance, every word she spoke, she must be the legendary beauty that could topple nations and cities.\"","\"Did you see her slender jade-like fingers? My goodness, they were glowing white.\"","\"Oh yes, did you try the desserts? They melted in your mouth, absolutely delicious.\"","\"Yup, yup, super delicious.\"","\"Wait, let me see what our beautiful owner's name is.\" Qin Keling opened the signature page of the file, where the name \"Song Luokui\" was written.","\"Her name sounds so lovely too.\"","\"I bet our owner is a daughter from a prestigious family. That kind of grace and elegance is not something ordinary people can possess.\"","\"Did you hear that phone call? It was a man's voice.\"","\"With her looks, it's perfectly normal for her to have admirers. But I wonder who would be worthy of her.\"","\"I can't wait to go back to the office and brag to everyone that I've seen the beautiful owner.\"","\"Me too.\"","...","Meanwhile, Chi Yu walked into the private room and saw the relaxed and leisurely Song Luokui, who was holding a dessert and bringing it to her mouth. He walked straight to her side and sat down, raising his thumb to wipe the corner of her mouth, \"Coming to my place?\"","When he wiped her mouth, Song Luokui immediately shifted away, \"Don't touch me. What do you mean by your place?\"","Chi Yu: \"My company. I've just finished revising the proposal you gave me last time.\"","Upon hearing this, Song Luokui immediately stood up, \"Okay, let's go.\"","The tea master immediately took Song Luokui's coat from the nearby rack and helped her put it on, but Chi Yu took it from her and draped it over Song Luokui himself.","After putting on her coat, the two left the tea house, with Song Luokui getting straight into Chi Yu's car.","Five minutes into the drive, they arrived at the Shanyu Building. When Song Luokui got out of the car, she immediately put on a hat and sunglasses, trying her best not to be recognized.","Chi Yu: \"...Am I really that unsavory to be seen with?\"","Song Luokui: \"You're just realizing that? It's not that you're unsavory, it's our relationship that shouldn't be seen.\"","Chi Yu smiled, \"What's our relationship?\"","Song Luokui: \"...Well, friends, and also boss and informant? Creditor and debtor?\" She owed him quite a few favors.","As they entered the building, the receptionist immediately stood up to greet them, but her eyes were full of curiosity as she looked at the woman beside her boss.","Song Luokui hid behind Chi Yu as they walked towards the private elevator. As soon as the elevator opened, Song Luokui rushed in, and Chi Yu followed, pressing the close button.","\"So we have many kinds of relationships.\" Although he didn't get a satisfactory answer, these relationships showed their close bond.","Upon arriving at Chi Yu's office, he took out the proposal from under his desk, \"I've written some suggestions on the side.\"","Song Luokui took it and sat on the couch to read, \"Thank you.\"","Chi Yu poured her a glass of water and sat beside her, \"Is there anything you don't understand? You can ask me. I remember Tian Yu is now under your name. Have you been there yet?\"","Song Luokui: \"Not yet, I've found someone to help me with the daily management. I mostly just sign things now and then.\"","\"I'll go take a look in a few days when I have time.\"","\"Let me know if you need any help in the future.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'll ask my brother first.\"","Chi Yu didn't get angry at her words, \"That works too.\" He knew Song Luosheng's capabilities well.","At that moment, there were two knocks on the door, and Chen Nan peeked in to see the boss and the young lady of the Song family sitting on the couch. Wow~","Song Luokui immediately adjusted her hat, and Chi Yu walked over, \"What is it?\"","Chen Nan approached Chi Yu and whispered something into his ear. Chi Yu frowned slightly, \"Withdraw all funds first, we'll see about next steps later.\"","\"Got it, I'll let the others know.\"","\"Mm.\"","After Chen Nan left, closing the door behind him and instructing the secretary outside, \"Don't disturb the boss unless it's urgent.\"","\"Understood.\"","Once Chen Nan was gone, Song Luokui turned to look at Chi Yu. She originally wanted to ask if something major had happened, but then realized she would be too blatantly asking for information, so she stayed silent.","However, Chi Yu said to her, \"It's nothing, it has nothing to do with your brother either. There's just a slight issue with one of my overseas collaborations.\"","Song Luokui: \"Do you need to go on a business trip?\"","Chi Yu: \"No hurry.\"","Song Luokui lost interest after hearing that, as she was more focused on her proposal now that her company had started operations and needed to make money.","Song Luokui thought about the first project her company would undertake while writing and drawing on the side, planning the budget and project details.","As for Chi Yu, she ignored him for now, since she had come to find him today but didn't say what she needed to do. Now that she had found him, that was enough.","Chi Yu didn't disturb her either, sitting to the side and working on his laptop, with only the sound of typing filling the office.","Midway, Song Luokui stretched lazily, having drunk too much tea earlier and now needing to use the restroom. She stood up and asked Chi Yu, \"Where's the ladies' room in your company?\"","Chi Yu pointed to the door of the lounge, \"There's a restroom inside.\"","\"Oh.\" Song Luokui went in.","When she came out of the restroom, Chi Yu was no longer in the office. Seeing that it was getting late, Song Luokui decided to head home.","She tore a piece of paper and wrote, \"I'm leaving first,\" placing it on the desk. After gathering her things, she pressed the elevator button.","As soon as the elevator opened, Song Luokui stepped in, only to make eye contact with Chi Yu who had just returned from outside.","?","Song Luokui waved at him as the elevator doors closed. Chi Yu rushed over and repeatedly pressed the elevator button, but the elevator had already descended. He immediately called the reception desk, \"Stop the person in the elevator from leaving.\"","Receptionist: ?","Shortly after, the receptionist saw the lady who had come out of the private elevator and froze, immediately approaching her, \"Excuse me, ma'am, please wait a moment.\"","Song Luokui: \"What's the matter?\"","Receptionist: \"Our boss wants you to wait for him.\"","Song Luokui didn't expect Chi Yu to call the front desk and stop her, but she obediently waited nonetheless.","At that moment, Song Luokui saw Chen Xinyuan, the tea sister she hadn't seen or heard gossip from in a long time, appear there.","As Chi Yu came out of the elevator looking for someone, Chen Xinyuan appeared right in front of him, \"Hello, Chi Yu.\"","Song Luokui sat on the couch in the waiting area, propping her head and watching the commotion.","Chi Yu gestured directly, \"Security, get her out of here.\"","Chen Xinyuan: \"Hey, Chi Yu, I know you and the Song family don't get along, but I have some dirt on Song Luokui, Song Luosheng's sister!\"","Chi Yu shot her a cold, ruthless glare, causing Chen Xinyuan to flinch and want to say something else, but several tall, burly men in black suits appeared, covering her mouth and dragging her into a small room nearby."]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Photo","paragraphs":["On this side, Song Luokui heard it with a puzzled look on her face. How did she not know that she had leverage? Apart from her and Chi Yu's rather familiar relationship that she was trying to hide from her brother, she had a clear conscience about everything else.","Chi Yu walked over, \"Don't worry, I'll handle it.\"","Song Luokui: \"But I haven't seen her in a long time, and what leverage could I possibly have? I haven't done anything wrong.\"","Chi Yu: \"She probably thinks you've done something wrong, or wants to spread rumors. Don't mind her. Are you going back?\"","\"No need, aren't you going to work? Uncle An will come to send me home.\"","\"Okay, I'll see you out.\"","\"Alright.\"","Chi Yu sent Song Luokui off to the car, leaving with the words: \"Remember this weekend.\"","\"Got it, got it. Bye bye.\"","\"Bye.\"","Chi Yu watched the car leave until it was out of sight before returning to the building. In the small house over there, Chen Xinyuan was trembling and cowering in the corner, \"I told you, I told you, wah wah wah. I'll never dare again.\"","Chi Yu walked over, \"What's going on?\"","A man in black: \"She said Miss Song and Wei Qing have an intimate relationship. She said she saw Miss Song's photos on Wei Qing's phone.\"","Chi Yu's eyes immediately narrowed at the mention of Wei Qing. So Wei Qing had previously asked her to call him \"Brother Wei Qing\"? She had never even called him \"Brother Chi\" or \"Brother Yu\". Wei Qing really thought too highly of himself.","As for why Chen Xinyuan saw the photos on Wei Qing's phone, it was clear that the Chen family was trying to attach themselves to the Wei family. Chen Xinyuan had previously attended an event as Wei Qing's female companion, so it was understandable that she could see the photos.","\"Let her go, and tell her that if her family wants to continue operating in Jing City, they'll know what they should and shouldn't say.\"","\"Yes.\"","Back in his office, Chi Yu called Song Luokui, \"That woman said Wei Qing has many photos of you on his phone.\"","Song Luokui looked shocked, \"Huh? That's not... I'm not even close with him.\"","Chi Yu: \"I won't let him harm you.\"","\"No, you mean he's investigating me? To be honest, I've only met him twice. Once was when he directly came to our gathering and said something to my brother that I don't know about. The other time was the last time. There's no conflict between us.\"","Chi Yu caught the key point: \"Your last gathering?\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah, the gathering my brother hosted for people on our side, just eating and drinking and playing in the courtyard. Then he came along with some people. I didn't even talk to him at the time. He was looking for my brother, I don't know what he said, but my brother told me to run if I saw him.\"","\"Someone said that back in high school, you and my brother were the ones who got him sent abroad? What did he do at that time?\" Song Luokui asked again.","Chi Yu: \"Nothing much, just being a sycophant, sowing discord, and so on. Don't mind him. The Wei family wants to vie for some position, and their methods aren't very clever each time, so be careful of their people. Wei Qing especially is not a good person.\"","Song Luokui: \"I see. Just... if he's investigating me, does that mean he also knows about our relationship? Will he tell my brother?\"","Chi Yu: \"What relationship?\"","Song Luokui: \"Right, we don't have a relationship.\"","Chi Yu: ...Even though she said that, why did it feel so uncomfortable?","After hanging up, Chi Yu sat in his chair thinking for a while, then made a call, \"Help me investigate whether there were any other forces behind the terrorist attack that Song Luosheng encountered in Country X, apart from it being a terrorist attack. Also look into whether Wei Qing and Song Luosheng had any cooperation in their previous investigations.\"","\"Yes.\"","On Song Luokui's side, after learning that Wei Qing had photos of her on his phone, she immediately became a little paranoid. Could someone be secretly taking pictures of her outside? She turned to look at the window in the room, with the curtains not drawn, and immediately went to draw them. The balcony also needed to be closed.","It was too terrifying. Was that person a pervert? She and he weren't even close.","After drawing all the curtains on the windows, Song Luokui felt much better. She continued to look at the project plan, flipping through to the end, only to find a line of praise written at the very end: Great job on the project plan, keep it up!","That handwriting was clearly Chi Yu's. He had even praised her in this aspect? Song Luokui immediately felt a sense of pride.","She looked again at the new project plan she had just written recently, and decided to go to the company next week if she had time.","On this weekend, with the whole family at home, Song Luokui was thinking of an excuse to go out, since she had promised to attend some private gathering with someone and couldn't go back on her word.","In the afternoon around 2 o'clock, Song Luokui grabbed her bag and prepared to leave. Song Luosheng saw her heading downstairs with her bag and immediately asked, \"Where are you going?\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah, I'm going back to school.\"","Song Luosheng: \"This early? Don't you usually go back tomorrow morning?\"","Song Luokui: \"I just feel like going back today. I can sleep in a bit tomorrow, and I have a lot of homework lately, so I need to go to the library to do homework.\" Song Luokui lied blatantly, as she actually had no homework at all.","Song Luosheng stood up, \"Alright, I'll send you there.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, thank you brother.\"","Song Luosheng helped her carry her bag, grabbed two apples from the table and put them in, \"Eat some more fruit. Let's go.\"","In the car, Chi Yu texted Song Luokui asking when she would be ready.","Since Song Luosheng was still there, Song Luokui glanced at him but didn't reply. She waited until Song Luosheng dropped her off at the dorm building before replying from the balcony after seeing him leave: \"What time does your private gathering start? Seven?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah. Should I pick you up at six?\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, wait for me at the dorm building. Keep it quiet, you know?\"","Chi Yu: \"...Alright.\"","Song Luokui: \"Oh, and I need to return to the dorm later tonight. There's a curfew, so I can't leave too late.\"","Chi Yu: \"Got it. I'll make sure to send you back before the dorm curfew.\"","After hanging up, Song Luokui immediately went to take a shower and wash her hair. Although Chi Yu said to dress casually, Song Luokui's intuition told her she still needed to prepare.","She wore a rather modest white embroidered cheongsam dress that she had brought from home and kept in her bag, luckily her brother didn't notice. She put her hair up in a bun, wore pearl earrings and a matching pearl necklace, and finally put on a long coat.","Then she put on a pair of high heels. As it was almost time, Song Luokui was about to text Chi Yu that she was ready when her roommate Wang Sisi returned to the dorm with dinner. As soon as she entered, \"Wow, Luokui, where are you going? You look so pretty all dressed up.\"","Song Luokui immediately shushed her, \"I'm going out in a bit and might be back late. Don't tell anyone else, okay?\"","Wang Sisi showed that she understood. On this side, Chi Yu had already called to say he had arrived. Song Luokui grabbed her bag and left. Wang Sisi looked down from the balcony and saw her walk downstairs and get into a car, but couldn't see who was inside.","However, Wang Sisi thought that if it wasn't Song Luokui's family in the car, there was one other possibility – it could be Senior Chi..."]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: A Private Gathering","paragraphs":["Song Luokui got into the car and noticed that Chi Yu looked at her for a while before saying, \"Why don't we skip this?\"","Song Luokui smiled wryly, \"Huh? What are you talking about?\" Going or not was not her decision originally, but she did spend two hours getting ready, so she couldn't bear for that effort to be wasted.","Chi Yu said, \"You look very beautiful today, even more beautiful than usual.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"...Thank you, let's go.\"","Today, Chi Yu didn't drive himself. The driver was behind the wheel since Song Luokui might need to drink alcohol later.","They soon arrived at the private gathering venue, an ancient palace-style residence with two giant stone lions guarding the entrance.","After getting out of the car, Chi Yu went around to open the door for Song Luokui and helped her out. He then gestured for Song Luokui to link her arm with his.","Song Luokui obediently slipped her arm through his elbow, and they entered the courtyard together.","As soon as they stepped inside, a person came to greet them. Upon seeing Chi Yu accompanied by a lady, his eyes widened in surprise, but he quickly recovered and walked over with a smile, saying, \"Brother, you're here.\"","\"Yes,\" Chi Yu nodded slightly and introduced Song Luokui, \"This is Li Yanbei.\"","Song Luokui nodded at him, \"Hello, I'm Song Luokui.\"","\"Hello, hello,\" Li Yanbei exclaimed inwardly. No wonder Brother brought her along - she looked like a celestial beauty.","Chi Yu led Song Luokui to follow Li Yanbei inside. Upon entering the hall, they saw rows of wooden sofas and chairs with soft cushions. The overhead ceiling was also carved from wood.","The few people seated on the sofas stood up. \"Brother.\"","\"Brother, you're here.\"","Chi Yu brought Song Luokui to the center and sat down. \"Yes.\"","Song Luokui also recognized one familiar face, Ji Xiao, but she didn't know the others.","Chi Yu then introduced the rest, \"Yu Heng, Zhou Wenqin, Jiang Xubai, Ji Xiao, and Li Yanbei whom you just met.\"","Song Luokui realized these were the elite members of Jing City's most prominent families.","\"Hello, everyone. I'm Song Luokui.\"","\"Hello, hello,\" they greeted her warmly.","Ji Xiao said, \"You remember me, junior sister?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"Yes, senior brother Ji Xiao.\"","After the introductions, Li Yanbei had someone bring food and drinks, including sweet wines, beverages, and various fruits and pastries, considering the presence of a lady.","Song Luokui didn't know why Chi Yu had brought her here, being the only woman among these men. However, as they started discussing global affairs, she focused intently while snacking and sipping her drink.","\"Country G's economy in the southern hemisphere is already 40% controlled by Country R. If they gain more control, Country G might become a territory of Country R.\"","\"Brother, should we intervene? Country G is rich in mineral resources.\"","Chi Yu said, \"Short their gold, spread rumors about Country R planning to invade Country G. Yu Heng, you disrupt Country R's market to prevent them from reaching Country G. Also, aren't they due for a leadership change? Stir things up.\"","Everyone laughed and toasted with their drinks. \"As always, Brother has a plan.\"","\"We have intel that the oil tycoon Akshvasaren from Country A is critically ill. His sons are already fighting for succession. If this news spreads, it could cause major fluctuations in global oil prices, triggering a chain reaction.\"","\"Countries N and P in Africa are on the verge of war. It's likely to erupt soon. Country N controls 60% of the world's diamond mines.\"","\"Wenqin, watch out for your family's gem business.\"","Zhou Wenqin replied, \"Our previous supplier was indeed Country N, but we've recently found an alternative source, though not a permanent solution. But our family has more than just this one business.\"","Chi Yu swirled the golden liquid in his glass, the light refracting through the transparent crystal creating an aesthetic effect. \"The war won't last long, just a power play between major nations. It should be over in about half a year.\"","Zhou Wenqin said, \"I trust what you say, Brother.\"","Listening to the discussions about war, oil, gold, and minerals, Song Luokui finally understood how Chi Yu became the wealthiest person globally. Was this already a global strategy unfolding?","Song Luokui became a bit distracted and drank a few sips from a bottle she thought contained fruit juice, its sweet flavor lingering on her tongue. She took a few more sips...","Although engaged in conversation with the others, Chi Yu kept an eye on Song Luokui, peeling and passing her some seeds to snack on.","Song Luokui took a few bites, then drank a few more sips of the sweet beverage.","\"By the way, the Wei Family recently allied with the newcomers, the Chen, Zhao, and Sun Families. They seem determined to secure that position.\"","Li Yanbei scoffed, \"But there are still three years left. Aren't they being too hasty?\"","\"Perhaps they don't want to wait three years. I heard they also want to cooperate with the Song Family. Wei Qing has apparently approached someone from the Song Family. The Song Family's support would be crucial.\"","Song Luokui looked up. Were they talking about her family?","She glanced at Chi Yu, who offered her more seeds.","Song Luokui remained silent, lowering her gaze.","Li Yanbei said, \"The person from the Song Family doesn't have a good relationship with Brother. He wouldn't really cooperate with the Wei Family, would he?\"","Ji Xiao nudged him, \"Ahem.\"","Li Yanbei asked, \"What?\"","Ji Xiao gave him a meaningful look.","Li Yanbei finally understood and glanced at Song Luokui. No way...","He immediately fell silent with an awkward chuckle. \"Never mind, Brother will definitely have a way to handle it. Oh, I obtained a treasure. Let me show you.\"","Li Yanbei went to retrieve the treasure.","Meanwhile, Song Luokui had finished the bottle in front of her and suddenly felt dizzy.","She blinked and shook her head, but the dizziness persisted. Was she... drunk?","Chi Yu noticed her strange behavior. \"What's wrong?\"","The others also looked over. Song Luokui's face was flushed, her eyes and brows enchanting as she gazed at Chi Yu with a sweet voice, \"Huh? Why are there two of you?\"","Chi Yu: ?","Ji Xiao picked up the bottle, \"This is sweet wine. Is she... drunk?\"","Chi Yu saw that it was indeed sweet wine. Initially, he thought it was a non-alcoholic beverage since he had asked Li Yanbei to provide drinks. He knew Song Luokui couldn't handle alcohol.","Song Luokui shook her head, \"I'm a bit dizzy.\" The next moment, she collapsed into Chi Yu's embrace.","Chi Yu caught her and said, \"I'll take her back first. Let's call it a day.\"","\"Sure, Brother, take your time.\"","Chi Yu scooped her up in a princess carry and left. Li Yanbei, who had just returned with the treasure, saw them leaving and asked, \"Hey? Brother, where are you going?\"","Ji Xiao held him back, \"Your future sister-in-law is drunk.\"","Li Yanbei exclaimed, \"Ah? That was just a low-alcohol sweet wine!\"","Ji Xiao said, \"Song Luokui can't handle alcohol.\"","Li Yanbei scratched his head, \"My mistake. But Brother brought someone from the Song Family here. As expected of Brother, his methods are brilliant! He's already won over the Song Family. The Wei Family's ambitions are dashed!\"","Ji Xiao sighed, \"...You've misunderstood Brother's intentions for bringing her. This is a declaration of his stance, to make us more vigilant.\""]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: Drunk","paragraphs":["Chi Yu held Song Luokui in his arms and carried her to the car. Originally, he intended to take her back to the dormitory, but in her current state, Chi Yu didn't feel comfortable leaving her there.","\"Go to Wanhai Villa,\" he said, referring to the place where he currently resided.","\"Yes, sir.\"","Song Luokui was a bit dazed and felt a tinge of warmth. She promptly unbuttoned her qipao dress, revealing a glimpse of her fair skin that caught Chi Yu's eyes.","Chi Yu immediately grabbed her hand, \"Be still, my dear.\" He then helped her re-button her dress.","Song Luokui tried to remove her coat, muttering, \"Hot...\"","Chi Yu re-buttoned her dress and helped her take off her coat. Finally, the girl in his arms settled down, resting her head on his shoulder, her breath caressing his neck.","Chi Yu held her in his lap, one arm loosely embracing her waist. He gazed at her flushed face, gently poking her cheek with his finger and then tenderly caressing it.","Not daring to be too bold, he quickly withdrew his hand. The girl in his arms stirred slightly, trying to nestle closer to him, her small hands grasping at the buttons of his shirt.","Chi Yu tensed at her movements but soon relaxed, taking a deep breath. He firmly grasped her slender waist, pulling her closer into his embrace.","They soon arrived at Wanhai Villa, and the car drove straight into the underground garage. Chi Yu bundled Song Luokui in a coat and carried her, princess-style, into the elevator and up to his floor.","He laid her on the bed in the master bedroom, removed her shoes and socks, and upon noticing her reddened lips, made a call: \"Bring me a makeup removal kit.\"","After hanging up, he tucked her under the covers, placing her coat on a nearby sofa. Seeing the petite figure lying on his bed filled Chi Yu with an unprecedented sense of satisfaction.","The makeup removal kit arrived shortly, and Chi Yu meticulously removed her makeup. He noticed that without her makeup, her appearance didn't differ much, except for the absence of the sparkling eyeshadow.","Chi Yu sat by her side for a while before turning off the lights and leaving the room.","The next day, on the gray bed, Song Luokui was entirely buried under the covers, with only one fair foot peeking out from the end of the bed.","After a moment, the little foot twitched, and a hand emerged from the covers. Song Luokui rolled over, suddenly opening her eyes wide. She sat up abruptly, searching frantically for her phone. Oh no, had she missed class?","Unable to find her phone, she rushed out of the room, barefoot...","Chi Yu had just returned from his workout when he saw her hurrying down the stairs, her raven hair cascading carelessly behind her, her expression a mix of confusion and urgency.","He strode over and scooped her up, \"Why are you walking around barefoot?\"","Song Luokui tapped his hand, \"I'm going to be late!\"","Chi Yu reassured her, \"You won't be late. I'll drive you to school, and you'll make it on time. It's only 7:20 right now.\"","7:20? That's a relief.","Song Luokui relaxed, finally realizing that Chi Yu was holding her, and her arms were around his neck.","Chi Yu set her down on the sofa and handed her a pair of slippers. \"First, put on your shoes. The toiletries are in the bathroom. I'll have someone bring your clothes, makeup, and other necessities. Once you're ready, come downstairs for breakfast, and I'll drive you to school.\"","Song Luokui, still a bit dazed, replied, \"Okay, okay.\"","In the bathroom, she looked at her reflection in the mirror – her hair was disheveled, and her face was flushed from the heat. Last night, she... she remembered hearing Chi Yu and the others talking, but after that, her memory was hazy.","Thinking about the drink, could it be... Was it alcohol?","She distinctly recalled Chi Yu asking someone to bring her a beverage.","After splashing some warm water on her face, Song Luokui regained full awareness. Now wasn't the time to dwell on that. She needed to get to school. Within ten minutes, she had gotten ready and hurried downstairs, where the table was set with an array of breakfast options: steamed buns, sandwiches, dumplings, and soy milk.","Song Luokui grabbed a steamed bun and a sandwich, urging, \"Let's go, go, go! I'll be late.\"","Chi Yu handed her a bottle of milk, and they headed to the underground garage, where the driver was waiting.","In the car, Song Luokui wolfed down her breakfast, nearly choking. Chi Yu quickly passed her the milk. \"Don't rush. You won't be late, I promise.\"","After gulping down the sandwich and milk, Song Luokui finally calmed down.","Chi Yu took a napkin and wiped her mouth. \"You could have taken the day off, you know.\"","Song Luokui looked at him, \"No way! I don't want to miss class. There's nothing wrong with me.\"","Chi Yu nodded. \"Alright, no day off. We'll make it on time, so don't worry.\"","\"Mmhmm, where's my phone?\" Now that she had her fill, Song Luokui remembered her phone. \"Oh, and my bag... no, wait, my books! I need to go to the dorm first, and then to the lecture hall.\" She calculated the time in her head.","Chi Yu handed her the phone and bag. \"I had someone take your books to the classroom. I'll drop you off directly at the lecture hall. You can just go straight there.\"","Song Luokui was puzzled. \"When did you arrange all this?\"","Chi Yu patted her head. \"While you were in the bathroom, I took care of everything.\"","Song Luokui relaxed in her seat. \"Thank you.\"","\"By the way, what happened last night? I can't seem to remember clearly.\" And how did she end up at his place? She thought he was taking her back to the dorms.","This morning, things were so rushed that she didn't have a chance to take a good look at the room. All she knew was that it was mostly gray and white, and there were some men's toiletries in the bathroom. Was that Chi Yu's room?","Why did he give her his room?","Chi Yu explained, \"It was my fault. The 'beverage' was actually a sweet wine. I didn't check it carefully.\"","Song Luokui nodded in realization. \"Ah, so it was wine. I thought it was a regular drink.\" It did taste quite sweet, and she had grabbed it herself, so it wasn't really his fault.","Chi Yu stated firmly, \"There won't be a next time.\"","Song Luokui waved her hand dismissively. \"It's not your fault.\"","Chi Yu twirled a strand of her hair. \"I'll be away on a business trip, out of the country. If you need any help, you can reach out to Ji Xiao or someone else. I'll send you their contact information later.\"","\"That's not necessary. I can ask my brother for help,\" Song Luokui said.","\"There may be some things your brother or your father can't conveniently assist with. I'll give you the contacts anyway,\" Chi Yu insisted.","\"Well, thank you,\" Song Luokui conceded. Having more connections never hurt.","They soon arrived at the Literature Department's lecture hall. As Song Luokui prepared to get out of the car, Chi Yu grabbed her hand. \"Wait for me to return. I want to know your answer.\"","Song Luokui blinked her eyes, merely uttering, \"Bye-bye, I'm off to class.\"","\"Mmhmm.\"","Chi Yu watched her retreating figure until she disappeared from sight before instructing the driver to leave."]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: Go to Company","paragraphs":["Song Luokui entered the classroom, and Xu Jiarong waved at her from across the room, \"Luokui, over here.\"","Song Luokui walked over, and Xu Jiarong handed her the textbook and pencil case, \"A boy just brought these over and asked me to give them to you.\"","Song Luokui took the books, \"Thank you.\"","Two minutes later, the teacher walked into the classroom, \"Good morning, students.\"","\"Good morning, teacher.\"","Song Luokui opened her book and listened attentively to the lecture...After class, Song Luokui opened WeChat, and Wang Sisi had messaged her. It turned out that Chi Yu had asked Lin Cheng to have Wang Sisi bring her books down and pass them to someone to take to the classroom for her.","Song Luokui replied to Wang Sisi with \"Thank you\".","Chi Yu did go on a business trip, and he asked if she wanted a gift, but Song Luokui of course didn't want one.","She recently planned to visit the company, so on this afternoon when she got out of school early, she took her overall plan and project plan and headed straight to the Tianyú Company after class.","She arrived at the building with her documents, entered the elevator, and pressed the floor number, but two others soon joined her. Seeing the floor button she had pressed, they glanced at her.","Both were carrying resumes, and when they noticed she was also holding documents, they assumed they were resumes and asked, \"Are you here for an interview too?\"","Song Luokui finally noticed the two of them, \"Are you two here for interviews?\"","\"Yes, we're both here for interviews. We saw Tianyú's job postings online and submitted our resumes. Are you here for that too?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"No, I'm not here for an interview. Good luck to you both.\"","The elevator soon reached the Tianyú Company's floor, and Song Luokui exited first, with the two women following behind her. Hearing that Song Luokui wasn't there for an interview, they breathed a sigh of relief. After all, if someone as beautiful as her was a competing candidate, the pressure would have been immense.","Song Luokui went straight to the Tianyú Company's reception desk, \"Hello, I'm here to see CEO Yu Hui.\"","Receptionist: \"Hello, do you have an appointment?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, but my name is Song Luokui. Just tell her that and she'll know.\"","The receptionist immediately stood up and bowed, \"Hello Boss! CEO Yu is inside, I'll take you to her.\" Earlier, Manager Qin and Secretary Huang had brought back some delicious pastries and mentioned seeing the Boss, describing her as an extremely beautiful young woman. They even mentioned the Boss's name.","Everyone was quite curious about who this amazing Boss was, but they never expected the Boss would actually come by today. Oh my god!","The receptionist was inwardly excited but remained outwardly calm as she led Song Luokui to Yu Hui's office. Some people they passed looked puzzled about who the receptionist was escorting - could it be a new artist the company was preparing to sign?","Meanwhile, the two women who had come for interviews were shocked when they heard the receptionist's words. They looked at each other in disbelief as the two walked away from the reception area. Had their earlier conversation been inappropriate?","The receptionist knocked three times, and after hearing Yu Hui's voice from inside, she opened the door and said, \"Manager Yu, the Boss is here.\"","Yu Hui looked up and immediately stood upon seeing Song Luokui, very excited, \"Boss! You're here!\"","Yu Hui then turned to the receptionist and said, \"Bring some tea in, and buy some snacks and pastries too.\"","Song Luokui: \"No need, I just bought afternoon tea downstairs. It'll be sent up shortly. I came today to discuss some company matters with you.\"","Yu Hui: \"Okay, please have a seat over here... Or should I take you to your office? Your office is ready.\"","\"Okay, let me take a look first.\"","\"This way.\"","On the other side of the office, word quickly spread that the Boss had come to the company. The person the receptionist had just led in was the Boss!","\"Oh my god! I just saw the Boss!\"","\"Where, where?\"","\"She's probably in Manager Yu's office now. They just came out... oh, now they're going into another office. That must be the Boss's office they prepared for her.\"","\"Ahhhh, I had to go out for work today so I missed it! Take a picture for me, I want to see what our beautiful Boss looks like!\"","\"I'll try to once the Boss comes out.\"","\"Waaah, I need to finish up quickly so I can get back and see the Boss too.\"","\"The Boss even ordered us afternoon tea today. Haha, hurry back or you won't get any!\"","\"I'm coming, I'm coming, save me some!\"","...","Song Luokui looked around her new office - there was a desk, a sofa for lounging, and even a table in front of the sofa with a tea set. On a cabinet, there were tea leaves and even some alcohol.","Song Luokui: \"You can keep the alcohol, I can't really drink.\" She laughed.","\"Got it, I'll have someone remove it later.\"","\"You all can have it if you'd like.\"","Yu Hui: \"Would you like to tour the rest of the company? I can have everyone gather so they can meet you since none of them have seen you before.\"","Song Luokui sat down in the Boss's chair, \"Sure, you can go prepare them.\"","\"Okay.\"","Outside, after hearing the news, everyone quickly tidied up their attire and stood when Song Luokui emerged. They all bowed in unison, \"Hello Boss!\"","Song Luokui waved at them, \"Hello everyone. Please sit back down.\"","Yu Hui then introduced Song Luokui to some of the key managers. \"This is Qin Keling, the head of the Finance Department.\"","\"I know, she came to see me before.\"","Qin Keling was delighted the Boss still remembered her. Well, it had only been a few days after all.","\"Over here is the Procurement Department...\"","\"This is the Planning Department...\"","When they reached the Planning Department, Song Luokui shook hands with the department head Zhou Fang and said, \"I'll need to discuss some things with Manager Yu later, so please join us as well.\"","\"Certainly.\" Was it finally time? Was the Boss going to assign them tasks?","After completing the introductions and brief office tour, Song Luokui returned to the office with Yu Hui, and Zhou Fang from the Planning Department joined them as well.","Song Luokui took a seat and retrieved the overall company plan and a new project plan from her bag. \"Take a look at these.\"","\"I wrote these, and had someone revise them. Let me know if you see any issues. Feel free to ask questions.\"","It didn't take long before Yu Hui raised a critical point: \"Our company is currently lacking artists. We've been recruiting but due to the company's history, many are reluctant to join us. We only have two artists left, but they don't have any fan base at all.\"","Song Luokui: \"That's not a problem. Since we don't have any artists, we can recruit from art schools, film schools, and so on. We don't necessarily need to sign them. For example, if we need to film a short drama as one of our projects, we'll obviously need to find good-looking, handsome people with decent acting skills. Their fan base isn't important - we can promote them with money when the time comes.\"","Planning Department: \"But the budget for that...\"","Song Luokui: \"Don't worry about the budget, a few hundred thousand is still a small amount we can work with.\"","The Planning Department member gulped: A few hundred thousand... a small amount? Okay then.","Yu Hui: \"After this, I'll hold a meeting with everyone to nail down the project details.\"","\"Yes. For our first project, don't rush it. Slow and steady to ensure quality. After all, you ladies should understand women's preferences the best.\"","\"I won't be coming to the office often. Just call me if anything comes up and I'll drop by when I'm free.\"","\"Understood.\""]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: The Work","paragraphs":["The boss's task has arrived, and everyone is mobilizing. The head of the HR department goes directly to the doors of the Film Academy and the Drama Academy to recruit part-timers.","They are looking for the most beautiful ones - 3,000 yuan per day, and if they are truly very beautiful and handsome, it can be as much as 5,000 yuan per day. The rest of the personnel are a few hundred to a couple thousand.","Everyone looks at the résumés submitted, and Zhou Fang sighs, \"Actually... as long as the most beautiful ones, the boss can do, and we can save a bit of the budget. If the boss shows up, I really feel that with just her face, we don't even need to do any promotion.\"","On the side, Yu Hui says, \"It's not possible, don't even think about it.\"","Over there, Qin Keling says, \"I looked at it before, you know how much the pastries the boss previously asked me and Secretary Huang to bring back cost? A whole 3,000... and the tea is not even worth mentioning. The budget you save might only allow the boss to go to the teahouse and have one more cup of tea.\"","Zhou Fang: \"Forget it, let's get down to business. Has the Film and TV Department recruited all the personnel yet? We can't let our planning department do everything, the professional work should be done by the professionals.\"","The head of the HR department: \"It's almost done, the personnel will be in place in a couple more days.\"","\"Good, everyone do their own job, let's start early, wasting a day is wasting money.\"","The company finally starts to get busy, and Song Luokui occasionally comes to the company to attend some meetings and also come to sign some documents and materials.","Today, she went to the company after having lunch after school, and by the time she arrived, the company had already off-duty, but there were still some people working overtime. Song Luokui said, \"Those who are not in a hurry can go home first, don't stay here.\"","Then she went back to her own office, where a pile of things that needed her signature had already accumulated, such as various reimbursements, various procurements, and various plan decisions.","Song Luokui quickly started signing, and for some things she didn't quite understand, she just set them aside and would ask about them again the next day before signing. Whatever she could sign, she signed.","After signing, she started reviewing the various materials and documents of the company, so that she could better understand the operation of the company and grasp the direction of the company's future.","After being with Song Luosheng for a while, and hearing what he said about business, Song Luokui of course also learned a little bit.","And Chi Yu...","Come to think of it, he hasn't sent her a message lately.","Without thinking too much about it, Song Luokui continued to look at the materials. By around 9 o'clock in the evening, she saw that it was already dark outside, so she picked up her bag and prepared to leave.","As she walked out, she suddenly saw a faint light in the corner, and there was still someone there? Song Luokui went over and found that it was a colleague diligently typing on the computer, and next to her, her little child was sleeping on a mat on the ground.","\"Why haven't you gone home yet?\" Song Luokui walked over, \"The child is also tired, go home first, and if someone asks for you tomorrow, just say it was what I told you.\"","The woman saw that it was Song Luokui and immediately stood up, a bit nervous: \"Boss!\"","Song Luokui looked at the name tag on her workstation, Liu Panqiao - Graphic Designer.","Song Luokui: \"Go home first.\"","Liu Panqiao: \"No... no problem, I'll be done soon.\"","Song Luokui: \"Look, the whole floor is dark, if it gets too late and you can't find a ride, what if you run into danger? Pack up and leave with me.\"","Liu Panqiao was very restrained, but since the boss had spoken, she didn't dare say anything. She packed up her things and woke up her daughter. \"Manman, let's go home.\"","Her little daughter yawned and woke up, not crying at all, very obedient. \"Mommy, can we finally go home? I want to take a bath.\"","Hearing her daughter's words, Liu Panqiao felt heartbroken. She had just joined this company, and the company even allowed her to bring her child here. She had always instructed her daughter to not make any noise at the company, and her daughter was very obedient, playing with toys on the side or just lying down and sleeping. The other colleagues would also play with her daughter, and someone would even buy her food and toys. No one had discriminated against her for bringing her child to the company. She really felt that this company was very good. Recently, things have been a bit busy, and she has heard that the company's project can be completed earlier, after all, the longer it takes, the more it costs. Recently, there have been a lot of things, so she just wanted to work overtime to get it done as soon as possible.","\"Okay, let's go home.\" Liu Panqiao held her daughter's hand and followed behind Song Luokui.","Song Luokui looked at her daughter: \"Tell the sister how old you are and what's your name?\"","Liu Panqiao looked at her daughter, \"Manman, answer the sister's question.\"","Manman hugged her mother's leg, peeking at the beautiful sister in front of her. The aunts said this was her mother's boss, so Manman answered very obediently, \"My name is Manman, I'm three years old.\"","As she spoke, she also held up four fingers. Yes, she held up four fingers.","Song Luokui smiled and helped her fold one finger down, \"Three years old is like this.\"","She then patted Manman's head.","The elevator soon arrived, and there were very few people left in the entire building, and many of the lights had been turned off, making it a bit dark.","Song Luokui had the two follow her to the entrance, where Uncle An was already waiting. Song Luokui: \"Get in, I'll send you home first.\"","Liu Panqiao immediately waved her hand, \"No no no, that's not necessary, thank you Boss, I can take a taxi myself.\"","Song Luokui: \"Come on, it's too late, it's not safe. And Manman is also tired.\"","Liu Panqiao carefully got into the boss's luxury car with her daughter in her arms. Song Luokui asked, \"Where's your home?\"","Liu Panqiao gave an address.","Song Luokui looked at the already dozing off Manman in her mother's embrace, \"Manman is about three years old, it's about time to go to kindergarten.\"","Liu Panqiao: \"Yes.\"","Song Luokui: \"If there are any difficulties with enrollment, you can ask the administrative department of the company for help, the company has corresponding welfare for tuition and learning materials.\"","\"Okay, thank you boss.\"","After an hour's drive, they finally arrived at Liu Panqiao's residence. The surrounding area was a bit dilapidated, and Song Luokui could faintly smell the stench of the sewers.","Song Luokui looked at the small alley and felt it was a bit unsafe. \"Uncle An, send them to the door.\"","\"Yes, Miss.\"","Liu Panqiao was even more grateful. \"Thank you boss, I'll go back first.\"","\"Mm.\"","...When Song Luokui returned home, it was already past 11 o'clock.","She had been in class all day today, and then went to the company in the evening to look through a lot of things. Song Luokui felt a bit tired, so she took a shower and fell asleep.","On the other side of the earth, on a dark street, with only a dim street lamp on the side of the road, in the distance, a black sedan sped around the corner and rushed towards the distance, and soon, several more sedans chased after it.","On the deserted road, a sedan was being chased by the cars behind it, and soon gunshots could be heard from behind, the gunfire aimed at the car in front.","The bullets hit the window of the car in front, leaving a crack, but did not penetrate the window.","The pursuers still wanted to directly shoot out the tires, but were avoided by the excellent driving skills of the car in front."]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: The Struggle","paragraphs":["In the car in front, Chi Yu was very calm, while Chen Nan next to him was a bit anxious. \"Boss, they are still chasing us.\"","Chi Yu glanced at the time. \"Lin, delay them for three minutes.\" Lin was their driver and bodyguard, with another bodyguard in the passenger seat, holding a gun and getting ready.","\"Yes, boss.\"","The car suddenly veered off the road and onto the side, then snaked back onto the main road. The car behind was still chasing them relentlessly, but no matter how hard they pushed, they couldn't catch up. Just as they thought they were about to catch up, the distance between the cars widened again.","\"Damn it! Hurry up, faster! Stop their car!\"","In the car, Chen Nan kept looking behind. \"Adela betrayed us! He must have leaked our whereabouts. I don't know who the mastermind is.\"","Chi Yu remained calm. \"We'll find out soon.\" He wondered what that person was doing now. He had been out for a few days, and she still hadn't messaged him. If he didn't message her, she wouldn't message him either.","With a sigh, Chi Yu sent a message to Song Luokui: \"What are you doing?\"","Suddenly, a gunshot hit the rearview mirror. Chi Yu didn't even blink, but Chen Nan immediately ducked down. \"Boss, we should be more careful.\"","Chi Yu looked up. \"Time's up. Lin, call in the others.\"","\"Yes, boss!\"","As soon as he said that, several cars suddenly appeared from the surrounding area and charged towards the cars chasing them. Some people even pulled out AK-47s and opened fire on the chasing vehicles.","The sound of cars colliding echoed, and then many men in black emerged from the cars. In the dim light, the sound of gunfire rang out, and people started falling...","\"Damn it!\"","\"Retreat! Retreat!\"","However, they couldn't retreat, as all of them had guns pointed at their heads. Some people on the ground were screaming for help.","In front, Chi Yu was still sitting there, looking at his phone. Song Luokui still hadn't replied to his message. He suddenly realized that in Hua Country, it must be nighttime, and she might already be asleep.","\"Boss, it's all taken care of.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","Chi Yu got out of the car. He was wearing a dark-striped suit, had gold-rimmed glasses, and a ring on his middle finger, which was also a hidden weapon.","He walked like a noble emperor, followed by Chen Nan and two bodyguards. They approached a blond, blue-eyed foreigner who was being held down and had a gun pointed at his chin.","Seeing Chi Yu, the man immediately begged for mercy. \"Chi, I was wrong, I was wrong. I can tell you who planned this. Let me go, let me go.\"","Chi Yu didn't say anything. Chen Nan approached the man, pressing a gun to his head. \"Betraying my boss? You're asking for death. Hurry up and say who did this.\"","\"It...it was...Bourne. Bourne made me do it.\" The man's words were recorded on video.","Chi Yu said, \"Take them all back to the police station.\"","Chen Nan hesitated. \"Boss, they'll be out soon.\"","Chi Yu understood. \"Send the video to Bourne.\"","Bourne was running for a major election. If this footage of him orchestrating the assassination of a foreign businessman was released, he would never be seen again.","Chen Nan asked, \"Boss, what about Adela?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"Someone will take care of him. Let's go back.\"","A few days later, the news reported: \"A man committed suicide at home...\"","Chen Nan watched the news, admiring his boss's wisdom. \"Boss, Adela is dead.\"","Chi Yu said, \"Buniel's votes are catching up to Bourne. He won't let Bourne go any further. We'll just wait and see.\"","Chen Nan asked, \"Boss, what's our next step?\"","Chi Yu answered, \"Go to Bullis.\"","\"I'll arrange it right away.\"","Chi Yu looked at his phone again, still no message.","At that time, Song Luokui had just woken up and was on her way to school when she saw Chi Yu's message. She didn't know why he had messaged her so late at night, but she replied, \"I'm going to school now.\"","Chi Yu didn't respond, and Song Luokui didn't think much of it. After her classes, she went to the company, where things had been busy with many meetings. She went there to speed up the progress of the projects.","Around 4 o'clock in the afternoon, she had some ideas about the company's management and wanted to discuss them with Song Luosheng. She immediately had Uncle An drive her to Hua Tech.","When she passed by the conference room, she saw her brother and someone called Wei Qing inside. The room quickly pulled down the curtains, blocking her view of what they were doing with the documents in front of them.","Song Luokui went to Song Luosheng's office, and the secretary brought her some tea.","\"How did Wei Qing get here?\" she asked.","The secretary replied, \"I'm sorry, Miss Song, I'm not sure about that.\"","Song Luokui didn't ask further. After the secretary left, she waited for Song Luosheng in his office.","About half an hour later, Song Luosheng returned to the office and saw Song Luokui. \"What brings you here?\"","Song Luokui said, \"I have some questions about the company that I wanted to ask you for advice, but...brother, I think I just saw Wei Qing. Are you two working together again?\"","Song Luosheng placed his hand on her shoulder. \"We have a small collaboration.\"","Song Luokui frowned. \"But didn't you say he's not a good person? Chi Yu said the same thing.\"","Song Luosheng sighed. \"In the business world, there are no permanent enemies or permanent friends, only permanent interests. The same goes for countries.\"","Song Luokui thought about it. \"Then why haven't you collaborated with Shan Yu?\"","Song Luosheng chuckled. \"Ah, Luokui, you know your brother's heart.\"","Song Luokui didn't understand what he meant. She just knew that her brother's self-esteem was always hurt by being outperformed by Chi Yu and even herself.","\"Don't worry, Wei Qing can't do anything to me. He's not worthy yet. Now, what's the problem with the company?\"","Song Luokui didn't ask further, as the books didn't mention her brother having any trouble related to Wei Qing."]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: The Assistant","paragraphs":["After work, Song Luokui went home with Song Luosheng.","\"I heard you've been coming home quite late recently? If your studies are too heavy, just stay in the dormitory. No need to trouble yourself,\" said Song Luosheng.","\"It's not about school, it's the company work that's keeping me busy lately,\" replied Song Luokui.","\"Weren't you the one who least wanted to work? Isn't Yu Hui handling things well? If not, find someone else. You used to complain about me working like an ox and that the company was a source of grievances.\"","\"But I want to learn more things too. Yu Hui is doing fine, no need to replace her. The company has just been quite busy with production recently.\"","Song Luosheng sighed, \"I recall getting you a spacious apartment near your company. If it gets too late, just stay there.\"","Song Luokui looked puzzled, \"Huh? I have an apartment there?\"","\"I'll find you a personal assistant. You're now a working person, no need to handle everything yourself. I'll hire you a life assistant to take care of all arrangements.\"","Song Luokui thought that every boss seemed to have a secretary around, but she didn't. Previously, she didn't go to the company much, but now with increased workload, she needs to visit more frequently, so an assistant would be helpful.","\"Okay, thank you brother,\" Song Luokui hugged Song Luosheng's arm.","Song Luosheng patted her head, \"You can always be a carefree little princess. I'll handle everything else or find someone to help. You don't have to work so hard, but seeing you grow up so quickly makes me proud.\"","Song Luokui said, \"When my company makes money, if you ever face a crisis, I can contribute more funds to support you. It's all for you.\"","Song Luosheng laughed, \"You cheeky mouth, I'll never face a crisis.\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Okay, I hope your company never faces a crisis and becomes one of the top ten enterprises in Hua Country, or even the world's top ten!\"","\"Why not the first?\" asked Song Luosheng.","Song Luokui replied, \"...That first position might be for the male lead.\"","\"Let's not aim too high, the top ten will do for now.\"","Song Luosheng smiled, \"...Well, it's about the same. But I'll work hard, just wait and see.\"","True to his word, Song Luosheng quickly hired an assistant for Song Luokui. As soon as she finished classes, her new assistant Li Bei was already there to greet her, \"Hello Miss Song, I'm Li Bei, your new assistant.\"","Song Luokui nodded in acknowledgment, \"Let's go to the company.\"","\"Yes.\"","After getting into the car, Li Bei started by understanding some things from Song Luokui, then began arranging her schedule, \"Your brother, Mr. Song, said that the house near your company needs to be designed for you to move in. Shall I contact some designers to come up with proposals for you?\"","Song Luokui had no objections, \"Go ahead and arrange it.\"","\"Okay. Do you need a housekeeper for the new place?\"","\"Just hire someone to come and cook and clean on fixed timings. I'll be going back home sometimes, not living there permanently.\"","\"Got it, we'll hire a part-time worker then.\"","...","With an assistant, Song Luokui indeed felt much more at ease. She didn't know how this assistant was hired, but one word described her: professional!","Sometimes, Song Luokui didn't even need to go to the company. The assistant would directly bring documents from the office for her signature and could clearly explain any issues with them. Song Luokui was very satisfied with her.","One day, when she had some free time, Song Luokui wanted to check on the progress of her company's filming project. It was a very cliched story of an overbearing CEO forcefully pursuing a woman, but the focus was on the intense push-and-pull between the male and female leads, aiming to create an irresistible sexual tension for the viewers.","The male lead chosen was tall and handsome, while the female lead was beautiful. Although their acting skills were not exceptional, they were adequate.","When Song Luokui arrived, the male lead was supposed to portray an imposing, domineering CEO. Even if he wasn't one in reality, he needed to have that aura.","However, the actor was too young, only in his early twenties. His demeanor lacked the necessary gravitas, and everything about him felt off-kilter. He didn't exude the slightest aura of a powerful CEO.","The female director kept scratching her head, dissatisfied with the unconvincing CEO persona. But the male lead just couldn't capture the essence she wanted.","\"Look up the CEOs of Shan Yu Group or Songhua Technology online. You don't need to mimic them exactly, even half the resemblance would suffice. But you don't even have a third of it,\" the director said.","The male lead replied, \"I've searched online, but the photos are all blurry. And I've never seen how a top executive's office looks like. I can only act based on my understanding. If I could see it once, I'm sure I can capture it. I don't want to delay the progress.\"","Song Luokui walked over, \"You can act it after seeing it once? I'll take you to see.\"","The director and male lead looked puzzled.","\"Boss, you're here?\" the director asked.","\"I came to take a look. You, come with me,\" Song Luokui gestured to the male lead.","In the end, the director and male lead followed Song Luokui to her car, and they soon arrived at Songhua Technology. People quickly realized that the boss's sister had brought a young man.","\"Could it be her boyfriend?\"","\"Doesn't look like it, though.\"","\"If it's true, the boss might not be in a good mood today, after all, the family's cabbage has been stolen by a pig. Everyone, be on alert.\"","Song Luokui went straight to Song Luosheng's office door without announcement. The secretary just stepped out and left the door slightly ajar at Song Luokui's request.","Song Luokui pointed at Song Luosheng working diligently at his desk, \"See, look.\"","The male lead and director stared in amazement!","After half a minute, Song Luokui said, \"Alright, you've seen enough. You can go back and continue filming.\"","Hearing the noise, Song Luosheng walked over, \"Why are you here?\" Noticing the young man, his gaze hardened as he sized him up, \"Who's this?\"","\"He's the male lead of a short film my company is shooting. He said he couldn't portray the overbearing CEO, so I brought him here to see how you are. He should know how to act now,\" Song Luokui explained.","Song Luosheng stared at the male lead, \"If he can't act it, just replace him!\"","The male lead felt a chill run down his spine. He'd better act it properly when he went back.","\"Anything else?\" Song Luosheng asked.","\"No, you can go back,\" Song Luokui replied.","\"Yes.\"","The two left, and Song Luokui was about to leave too, but Song Luosheng stopped her, \"That's the only reason you came?\"","Song Luokui said matter-of-factly, \"Of course.\"","\"You little ingrate, why didn't you say you came to see if your brother was working hard?\" Song Luosheng remarked.","\"No need to see, I know you're working hard every day. So I didn't want to disturb you too much. Disturbing you for a minute means you'd earn one billion less, right?\" Song Luokui teased.","If Song Luosheng could earn a billion per minute, he'd probably become the nation's richest man in under a week.","\"Just go, just go,\" Song Luosheng said.","Song Luokui winked, \"Oh right, I've ordered afternoon tea for everyone. Your share is included, of course.\"","\"At least you have a conscience,\" Song Luosheng remarked.","Back at the filming location, the male lead exuded an air of nonchalance mixed with cool indifference, \"If he can't do it properly, just replace him.\"","The director exclaimed, \"Perfect!\"","The young man heaved a sigh of relief. He had just acted based on the way Song Luosheng had looked at him earlier. He had actually just seen Song Luosheng, even though it was only for a brief half a minute, and Yu Hui was actually Song Luokui's sister!","The director was also very surprised. She had never thought that the boss was the sister of Song Luosheng, the head of Songhua Technology. No wonder she was so wealthy and influential!"]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: Chi Yu Back","paragraphs":["Chi Yu had been on a business trip for almost a month and finally returned. The first thing he wanted to do upon his return was to find a certain someone for an answer.","He had even bought her a gift, and this time he would hand it to her himself. He was eager to see her now.","At this time, however, Song Luokui was still at the company. Everyone was arguing about the plot of the film they were shooting, with some people thinking one approach was better, while others preferred another.","\"This only shows the male lead's rudeness. If I were the female lead, I'd want to throw him in jail.\"","\"But this adds more impact, and you're not the female lead anyway.\"","...","Song Luokui watched them argue from the sidelines, looking at this person and then that person, mainly because she didn't really understand the debate.","\"Boss, which one do you choose?\"","Song Luokui blinked, \"Why don't we call it a day? It's already quite late. Everyone should go home, and we can vote on which approach is better tomorrow.\"","Hearing this and seeing the late hour, everyone started packing up to leave, and Song Luokui left with them.","As the group exited the company, Song Luokui was about to ask Uncle An to bring the car around when she stopped upon seeing the person ahead.","Chi Yu had returned, and he was now leaning against a car not far from her.","One of her colleagues had just said goodbye to Song Luokui when, turning around, they saw Chi Yu and exclaimed, \"Holy sh*t!\"","Immediately, everyone looked over, while Song Luokui wanted to run away because Chi Yu's gaze was too intense.","Song Luokui took a step back, but Chi Yu quickly approached and stopped in front of her, \"Have you considered it?\"","Seeing her colleagues' prying eyes, Song Luokui said, \"...This isn't a good place to talk, and how did you get back?\"","Chi Yu grabbed her hand and took out a bracelet from his pocket, putting it on her wrist. \"A gift for you. Let's go.\" He then pulled her hand, heading straight for the car.","Song Luokui stumbled a bit, and Chi Yu immediately put his arm around her waist to support her into the car. As soon as the door closed, the black car quickly drove off.","The remaining colleagues huddled together, squealing excitedly. One person clapped their hands, \"That's the atmosphere we need! It's decided, we'll go with that!\"","\"Agreed!\"","\"Agreed!\"","Great, there were no more disagreements now.","\"Who was that just now? I couldn't see clearly.\"","\"I don't know. Could it be the boss's boyfriend? I don't recall hearing about one before.\"","\"Although the lighting was dim, he looked tall and handsome. And considering the boss's family background, he must be a wealthy, good-looking guy, right?\"","\"True, I recognized the car's logo. It's a luxury car. And did you see? The driver was wearing a suit and white gloves, just like in the movies.\"","\"It would be great if the boss and her boyfriend could act in the film. They'd be perfect for it. We wouldn't even need them to act. Just the two of them standing there created such an atmosphere.\"","\"Keep dreaming.\"","\"Alright, let's go.\"","...","Meanwhile, after being put in the car by Chi Yu, Song Luokui hurriedly took out her phone. \"I haven't told Uncle An yet.\" Uncle An was still waiting for her at the parking lot. Fortunately, she had sent Li Bei to her new house, or else she wouldn't know what to do if Li Bei was there too.","Chi Yu waited for her to finish speaking to Uncle An before grabbing her hand. \"You still haven't answered me yet.\" He stared into her eyes, then at her nose and lips.","Song Luokui felt they were too close, and Chi Yu was still holding her hand. She shifted slightly to the side. \"I... well, you were away on a business trip for a long time.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mm.\" He suddenly leaned his head on her shoulder. \"I missed you. I wondered what answer you would give me.\"","Song Luokui: \"About that... can I have some more time to consider?\"","Chi Yu: \"Sure. Give me your answer tomorrow.\" Considering it might have been too sudden today, she might not have had time to process it, so he could give her some time to react.","Song Luokui: \"...Where are we going now?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll drop you off at home, or we could grab a late night snack?\"","Song Luokui: \"When did you get back?\"","Chi Yu: \"I just arrived.\"","Song Luokui: \"You came to find me as soon as you returned?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes. I wanted to see you.\" Seeing her in person finally put him at ease, even if she hadn't given him an answer yet. But she hadn't rejected his closeness either, so he was already ninety-nine percent there.","Song Luokui then noticed the hint of weariness in his tone and felt a twinge of guilt. She raised her hand, put it down, then raised it again and placed it on his face. Chi Yu immediately grabbed her hand and caressed his face with it.","Song Luokui: \"Take me home first, then you should go home and rest too. We can talk about anything else tomorrow.\"","\"Okay.\" Chi Yu agreed and instructed the driver to head back to the estate.","At that moment, Song Luokui's phone vibrated. It was her brother. Feeling uneasy, she answered the call and gestured for Chi Yu to be quiet.","\"Brother?\"","Song Luosheng had returned home and found his sister wasn't back yet, so he called. \"Still working? This late again?\"","\"No, I'm on my way back now. I'll be home soon.\"","\"Alright, be careful.\"","\"Okay.\"","Chi Yu listened from the side, holding her other hand.","After hanging up, Song Luokui leaned towards him again. \"Oh, there are more gifts. I'll give them to you tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui waved her hand. \"Isn't this already a gift?\"","Chi Yu: \"There are more. I got you something from every city I visited.\"","Song Luokui: \"You went to many cities this time?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes.\" This past month, besides encountering betrayal, gunfights, assassination attempts, and various honey traps, he had even been injured, which delayed his return. Otherwise, he would have come back sooner.","They soon arrived at the estate. Of course, the car didn't stop in front of the Song family's building, as Song Luokui was afraid her brother might see her from upstairs.","As she was about to get out of the car, Chi Yu held her back, gazing deeply into her eyes. \"Bye, good night. See you tomorrow.\"","\"See you tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui got out and returned home. Uncle An had already come back and asked Song Luosheng who had picked up Song Luokui.","Uncle An: \"The young lady got into a friend's car and told me to come back first.\"","Song Luosheng was about to call Song Luokui again when he saw her coming in from outside. \"Which friend dropped you off?\"","Song Luokui: \"Just a friend. Why are you asking so many questions, brother? I'm tired. I'm going to rest now.\"","Seeing her weary face, Song Luosheng didn't press further. Her friend was probably not Zhang Xiyue, but maybe Zhou Yuan's sister or someone from the Tu family. He knew it would be a woman. \"Alright, but next time, bring Uncle An or your assistant with you.\"","\"Got it. I'm going up now.\"","\"Mm.\"","Once in her room, Song Luokui flopped onto the bed. Chi Yu had returned, and he wanted her to give him an answer tomorrow. But Li Bei usually accompanied her everywhere... so how could she meet him without Li Bei? This was a problem.","Song Luokui rubbed her face. How had things reached this point?","She raised her wrist and looked at the bracelet, which sparkled beautifully under the light. Chi Yu's gifts were always something she liked. If she agreed... it didn't seem like a bad thing.","Perhaps she could start a secret relationship first? She needed to get Chi Yu to agree to that first and then figure out a way to make it work."]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: Hearsay","paragraphs":["Because Song Luokui had been pondering things late into the night, she woke up late. \"Oh no, I'm going to be late!\"","Song Luokui rushed downstairs in a hurry. She grabbed a steamed bun from the table and left immediately. As soon as she got into the car, she said, \"Uncle An, hurry up!\"","Uncle An stepped on the gas and drove away. By the time they reached the gates of the Faculty of Liberal Arts, the bell had already rung. Song Luokui dashed into the classroom. The professor was about to start the lecture. She snuck in through the back door and took a seat at the very last row.","The professor didn't notice her. Song Luokui heaved a sigh of relief. Xu Jiarong, sitting in front of her, turned around and said, \"The professor didn't take attendance.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"Thanks.\"","She rested for a bit before focusing on the lecture.","During the lunch break after class, Song Luokui returned to her dorm room. The others hadn't come back yet. Li Bei, her assistant, messaged her about the house renovation, asking some detailed questions.","Song Luokui thought to herself that she could check on the renovation progress after class. That way, if Chi Yu asked if she was free or wanted to meet up for answers, she would have an excuse to say she was busy today.","After all, she could procrastinate for one more day!","Song Luokui nodded to herself, that's the plan!","Meanwhile, Chi Yu was in a private dining room at a restaurant. He had achieved several major deals during this business trip, so he invited his brothers to celebrate upon his return. As for why they weren't having dinner, it was obvious that he wanted to have dinner with Song Luokui in the evening.","Chi Yu was messaging Song Luokui: \"Are you done with classes? Should I pick you up from school this afternoon?\"","The joy was evident in his eyes and expression. Chen Nan, who had drunk too much, went out to relieve himself. One of the younger brothers happened to pass by Chi Yu from behind and accidentally caught a glimpse of the Boss sending a message to a girl.","A girl?","The profile picture clearly belonged to a girl, and the contact name seemed to be something like \"Cute XX.\"","The young brother sat down, grinning at Chi Yu. \"Boss, are we going to have a sister-in-law?\"","Chi Yu glanced at him but didn't deny it. The other brothers immediately turned their attention towards them. \"No wonder the Boss has been in such a good mood today. It turns out he has a girlfriend!\"","\"Really? Whose daughter is she? To be with the Boss, she must be a stunning beauty!\"","\"It doesn't matter if she's beautiful or not. What's important is that the Boss likes her.\"","\"Exactly!\"","\"Boss, when are you going to introduce her to us? I want to meet our sister-in-law.\"","Chi Yu looked up at them. \"When there's an opportunity.\"","\"Wow!\"\" Everyone became excited upon hearing this.","Chen Nan had just returned. \"What's got you all so riled up?\"","One of the younger brothers exclaimed, \"We're going to have a sister-in-law!\"","Chen Nan was surprised for a moment and looked at Chi Yu. Had the Boss finally won over Song Luokui? Then he proudly said, \"You guys are just finding out.\"","One of the younger brothers quickly walked over, flattering him. \"Brother Chen, do you know what our sister-in-law looks like? Tell us!\"","But Chen Nan wouldn't reveal anything. \"What's there to say? You'll find out later.\" Then he said to Chi Yu, \"Boss, I've settled the bill.\"","Chi Yu replied, \"Mm, get it reimbursed.\"","Everyone had mostly finished eating. Chi Yu had something else to attend to, so he left first. Chen Nan followed him, with a few others trailing behind, whispering in discussion. \"Do you think she's someone from our circles?\"","\"Not necessarily. Given the Boss's family background, he doesn't need any arranged marriages. He can choose whoever he likes. The Boss often goes on business trips, and he's been keeping this very well-protected. Could it be someone from abroad? A foreign student or even a foreigner?\"","\"A foreigner seems unlikely. Considering the Boss's family background, it's probably not a foreigner. A foreign student is possible.\"","\"Let's see which young lady from our circles is studying abroad. Come on, let's go ask around.\"","...","Within an hour, news had somehow leaked out, and many people in their circles knew about Chi Yu having a girlfriend.","\"I heard she's a foreigner?\"","\"Didn't they say she's studying abroad? Doesn't he often go on business trips abroad?\"","\"Which country? Country A? No, how did you guys find out?\"","\"One of the Boss's younger brothers said so. It's probably Country A. The Leng Family, Qin Family, Ji Family, and Lan Family all have young ladies studying in Country A. I think it's one of them.\"","\"That makes sense. Their family backgrounds also match. After all, I don't think he would fall for some Cinderella-type girl. As an heir, he would definitely go for someone from a similar background, at least not too far below.\"","\"Good point! Let's make a bet and see whose family she's from.\"","...","In the afternoon, Song Luokui was diligently attending her class when Zhang Xiyue forwarded her some chat records.","\"Luokui, listen to this gossip. That guy has a girlfriend now.\"","Song Luokui glanced at the professor and opened the message. She immediately saw messages about \"Chi Yu's girlfriend.\"","Song Luokui: ???","She then checked the group chat with Weng Jiao and the others, where they were all discussing this matter. Messages from Weng Jiao, Sa Sa, and others kept pouring in one after another.","\"Did you hear that guy has a girlfriend now? Someone from our circle, studying abroad.\"","\"Which guy?\"","\"The young master of the Chi Family, who else?\"","\"Doesn't this mean that Tea Sister is crying now?\"","\"Tea Sister is old news. He doesn't even pay attention to her anymore. She's clinging to the young master of the Wei Family now.\"","\"So who is it then? Who's studying abroad?\"","\"It's either the Leng Family or the Lan Family. People think these two families have a higher chance. The Leng Family is more likely - first, they have a good relationship with the Chi Family, and second, the Leng Family's daughter is studying in City N, Country A, which is where that guy often goes on business trips. That's what people are saying.\"","\"Why can't it be someone from within the country?\"","\"Impossible. If she were from here, people would have found out by now.\"","They then discussed more details, like how the Leng Family's daughter once posted on her social media about meeting a \"certain brother\" and saying he was very handsome, blah blah blah.","As Song Luokui read these messages, she was fuming with rage! Initially, she thought there might be a misunderstanding, but then the evidence kept piling up, especially since it was one of his own subordinates who leaked the information. How could it be false? She wondered what Chi Yu saw in her - her looks? Or did he see her as a way to humiliate her and get revenge on her brother, Song Luosheng?","Hmph! Scumbag!","Yes, the books always talked about how the male lead would slap the villains and win over his subordinates, but there were bound to be temptations from women in between!","Song Luokui immediately recalled that Chi Yu did frequently travel abroad, supposedly for business and collaborations. But could he really be that pure and not seek out women?","Song Luokui immediately found Chi Yu's contact. He even had the nerve to message her during lunch, that scumbag! Block him!","Song Luokui blocked him right away!","Thinking about the gifts he had given her, she was glad she didn't wear that necklace today. Otherwise, it would be tainted and filthy!","When she got back, she would throw away all his gifts!","She still felt uneasy, so she decided to block his number too.","Xu Jiarong, sitting next to her, could sense her anger. She asked cautiously, \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui's voice was cold. \"Nothing. I just saw something filthy and disgusting.\"","Xu Jiarong: ...?"]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: Cheating on philanderers","paragraphs":["Song Luosheng, who was currently at work, also knew about it. It was Zhou Yuan who came to tell him, \"Boss, rumor has it that the daughter of the Chi family has a boyfriend, possibly the one from the Leng family, maybe it's a marriage alliance.\"","Song Luosheng looked up: ???","Song Luosheng's first reaction was disbelief, but then Zhou Yuan immediately showed him the conversations in their circle, and he analyzed it in a logical manner.","Gradually, Song Luosheng also believed it!","He clapped his hands, \"Good!\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Hmm? Boss, won't he become even more powerful if he marries into an alliance?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Whatever, let him marry whoever he wants.\" He had previously worried that his own Kuikui might have some relationship with that person, although he trusted his own people, but he still had a little bit of worry.","Well, now he's not worried anymore!","Chi Yu had no idea what was going on here, because he was in a meeting, occasionally glancing at his phone, wondering why Song Luokui wasn't responding to his messages.","Thinking about it, he sent another message to her: \"I've booked Chunyu Building, they have new dishes, shall we go eat together?\"","The next second, a red dot appeared on the left side of the message, and it prompted that the message had been sent but rejected by the other party.","Chi Yu: ???","Chi Yu sent another sticker again, still the same.","He was a bit at a loss, inquiring the secretary next to him, \"What does this mean?\"","The secretary took a look and was immediately shocked, \"Boss, you... have been blocked by the other party.\" The secretary said it very softly.","Chi Yu directly stood up, and the person who was reporting was immediately startled, thinking he had made a mistake, \"Please point out where the boss is unsatisfied.\"","Chi Yu waved his hand and took a deep breath, \"Continue.\"","\"Oh, okay.\"","The secretary next to him really wanted to cover his face, he was even afraid that he would be silenced soon, where was Elder Brother Nan? Originally he was sitting next to the boss, wuwuwu.","Chi Yu tried another way to send a message to Song Luokui, he sent her a text message, it was sent, but there was no reply.","Chi Yu endured for about twenty minutes, took a ten-minute break in the middle, and immediately called her, but it was also blocked.","Chi Yu was a little panicked in his heart, but his face still maintained that cold and aloof look, his gaze towards everyone was full of coldness.","The rest of the reporting, everyone was trembling with fear, no one really understood why the boss, who originally looked so happy, suddenly became so terrifying.","\"Go back and do it again!\"","\"Data error! Go back and modify a copy!\"","\"This won't do! Go back and redo it!\"","Each manager: \"Yes.\"","After the meeting, the secretary was also very careful, \"Boss, there's another meeting next.\"","Chi Yu stood up: \"Postpone the meeting.\"","\"Okay!\"","On the other side, those who were preparing to have a meeting with the boss heard that the meeting was postponed and immediately heaved a sigh of relief.","\"May the boss be in a better mood next time we have a meeting.\"","\"Bless, bless.\"","Chi Yu hurriedly went downstairs, he didn't even call the driver, he drove the car directly to Peking University.","He checked Song Luokui's class schedule for today, and immediately went to the Faculty of Liberal Arts, but when he arrived, it was just the end of the school time, and Chi Yu waited at the Faculty of Liberal Arts for a while but didn't see Song Luokui come out.","Song Luokui had angrily returned to the dormitory, and Wang Sisi and Zhang Jingfeng were in the dormitory. She first took out the necklace that Chi Yu had given her yesterday, and directly threw it into the trash can with a \"bang\".","This movement immediately startled Wang Sisi and Zhang Jingfeng, and they immediately looked over, only to find that Luokui today looked a bit different from usual, her little face was tightly clenched.","\"Luokui, what's wrong? Did someone bully you?\" Wang Sisi asked carefully.","Song Luokui: \"Nothing! Seeing dirty stuff makes me disgusted.\"","Thinking about it, she was still very angry, and it seems there are still that person's things at home, no way, she'll go home first and throw away that person's things.","Song Luokui picked up her bag and left the dormitory again, her footsteps thundering.","Wang Sisi and Zhang Jingfeng immediately went to Song Luokui's trash can and took a look, seeing the diamond necklace inside, Zhang Jingfeng even picked it up and took a look, \"It looks very expensive, but Luokui threw it away.\"","Wang Sisi and she exchanged a glance, both of them were very puzzled, they had never seen Luokui so angry before.","Soon, Wang Sisi received a call...","Song Luokui angrily went downstairs, she even forgot to let Uncle An come pick her up, she walked out of the school gate, directly took the bus back home, and that side Chi Yu got the news from Lin Cheng that Song Luokui had just left the dormitory and should be going home.","When Chi Yu drove out of the school gate and saw the bus stop, he saw Song Luokui getting on the bus, he immediately drove to chase after her.","The bus stopped near the residential area, Song Luokui got off the bus, and Chi Yu also parked the car and ran over, he grabbed Song Luokui's arm.","Song Luokui was startled and turned around to see Chi Yu, she immediately shook off his hand, her face cold: \"Scram! I don't know you.\"","She looked up and saw Chi Yu's eyes were a little red, Song Luokui was startled, immediately lowered her head and turned to leave, but Chi Yu took a deep breath and grabbed her arm again, \"Song Luokui, have you gotten tired of me?\"","Song Luokui: ??? When did she get tired of him? At most, they were just a bit ambiguous.","Chi Yu closed his eyes and opened them again, \"If you still want to think about it, then I'll give you time to think about it, don't do this...\"","Song Luokui: \"How am I doing? What did I do wrong? What relationship do we have? We have no relationship at all! You don't think we have a relationship just because we've eaten together, do you? Who knows if we've ever eaten together?\"","Song Luokui looked at the hand that was grabbing her arm, \"Let go. You say I'm playing you? Aren't you the one playing me?\"","Song Luokui raised her foot and kicked Chi Yu, \"Let go! Scumbag!\"","On the other side, the gatekeeper of the residential area poked his head out to take a look, and immediately retracted it, tsk tsk tsk, how did the young lady of the Song family suddenly become so fierce? Hmm... it must be the young master of the Chi family's fault.","Chi Yu was quite innocent, \"How am I a scumbag?\" He had kept himself pure for more than twenty years, and didn't have a single female friend, his secretary was all male.","Chi Yu: \"If you want to reject me, at least let me know what I did wrong.\"","Song Luokui: \"You already have a girlfriend, and you're still telling me this? I really misjudged you. In the future, I'll work with my brother to get rid of this male protagonist!\"","Song Luokui's inner business fire was burning fiercely, that's it, she's going to get stronger and get rid of him!","Chi Yu: \"No... isn't my girlfriend you?\"","Song Luokui sneered, \"If I'm your girlfriend, how come I don't know? We have no relationship at all!\"","Chi Yu: \"But other than you, I don't know any other women.\"","Song Luokui: \"Don't pretend, don't deny it. Let me show you.\" Song Luokui took out everyone's chat records to show him.","\"Tell me, is it the Leng family or the Lan family, or is it a foreigner? Of course, no matter what kind of person it is, it has nothing to do with me.\"","Chi Yu looked at it a little confused, \"Who is the Leng family? Who is the Lan family? I only know their family heads.\"","Song Luokui: \"Don't pretend, your little brothers have all said it.\"","Chi Yu denied it in a completely puzzled manner: \"No... I really don't know them.\""]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: Clear the Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["Chi Yu: \"I will find out who spread the rumors, that's slander!\" At this moment, Chi Yu's phone kept vibrating. He looked and saw it was a call from Chen Nan, so he immediately turned it off. No matter what the issue was, clearing his name was the most important thing right now.","Seeing Chi Yu's serious expression, Song Luokui wondered if she had really misunderstood him. Song Luokui wanted to withdraw her hand. \"Please let go of me.\"","Chi Yu: \"I won't. If I let go, you'll run away. Give me three minutes, and I'll find out who's spreading the rumors.\"","Song Luokui: \"Let go of me first. I won't run away.\"","\"Really won't run away?\"","\"Won't run away.\"","\"Okay.\" Chi Yu immediately let go of her. Song Luokui crossed her arms, \"You said three minutes.\"","\"Okay!\" Chi Yu immediately called Chen Nan. On the other end, Chen Nan immediately said, \"Big boss, something big has happened. Someone said you have connections with the Leng family or the Lan family or someone else!\"","Chi Yu's expression turned stern. \"Who exactly said that?\"","Chen Nan hesitated a bit. \"Uh... I think it was around noon. Everyone heard that you have a girlfriend, so they speculated about who your girlfriend might be, and it just spread like that.\"","Chi Yu put the phone on speaker. \"Say that again.\"","Chen Nan, still not understanding, repeated, \"Around noon, everyone found out you have a girlfriend, so they speculated that maybe it's someone from the Leng family? Or the Lan family? Or even a foreigner. A lot of people guessed, and it just spread without anyone knowing the source.\"","Chi Yu looked at Song Luokui: \"So, who do you think my girlfriend is?\"","Chen Nan: \"Haha! It must be Miss Song.\"","Hearing Chen Nan's words, Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu again, wondering if it was really a misunderstanding.","Chi Yu: \"Resolve this by tomorrow.\"","Chen Nan: \"This Miss Song...\"","Chi Yu: \"Keep it confidential.\"","Chen Nan: \"Got it, I'll definitely solve it tonight.\"","\"Mm.\"","After hanging up the phone, Chi Yu looked at Song Luokui: \"Now do you see that I'm wronged?\"","Song Luokui didn't say anything, her expression still serious.","Chi Yu felt anxious, immediately grabbing her hand with a worried look on his face. \"I really don't know them. You heard what Chen Nan said, it's all a misunderstanding. You heard it, right?\"","Song Luokui's expression was still conflicted. \"Okay, I'll believe for now that you don't know them, but... do you really have no other women?\"","Chi Yu was very firm. \"No, I swear, except for my family members, from childhood until now, I've never gone out to eat, chat, or do anything with any woman other than you.\"","Song Luokui scrutinized him. \"...So you're still a...\"","Chi Yu's ears turned a bit red. \"...Yes.\"","In the distance, a familiar car approached the gate of the courtyard. Chi Yu quickly embraced Song Luokui, guiding her in front of him and walking with her to the car, letting her sit inside. \"I see your brother's car.\"","Song Luokui's expression changed drastically, and she quickly hid inside the car. \"Did he see me?\"","Chi Yu looked at the rearview mirror. Song Luosheng's car had quickly entered the courtyard. \"Seems like he didn't. The car went in.\"","\"Really?\"","\"Mm.\"","Song Luokui let out a sigh of relief, then realized Chi Yu was still embracing her. She immediately pushed him away.","Chi Yu looked a bit dejected. \"It really was all a misunderstanding. I originally planned to take you to Chunyu Building for dinner... Can you please unblock me on WeChat and give me back my phone number?\"","Song Luokui: \"What 'unblock' and 'give back'?\"","Chi Yu: \"WeChat. And my phone number.\"","Song Luokui then remembered she had blocked him. \"...Okay.\" She quickly unblocked him and added him back.","Chi Yu felt a weight lifted off his heart. \"Shall we have dinner together?\"","Suddenly, Song Luokui's expression changed. \"Oh no! I threw away the necklace you gave me. Back to the school!\"","Chi Yu: \"...The necklace is thrown away, let it be. I'll buy you another one.\"","Song Luokui glanced at him. \"I was originally coming back to throw away the things you gave me.\"","Chi Yu: \"...It's fine, I'll buy you another one.\" Luckily he explained quickly, or else it seems like she might have thrown away everything he gave her.","Song Luokui: \"Hurry back. I need to go pick it up.\"","Chi Yu returned to the driver's seat and drove toward the school. \"Then shall we still go to Chunyu Building?\"","Song Luokui glanced at him. \"No, I have something to do tonight.\"","Chi Yu was still a bit tentative. \"...Then our...\"","Song Luokui: \"We'll talk about our matters when I have time. On the weekend, I'll definitely give you an answer.\"","\"Okay.\" At this point, Chi Yu didn't dare say anything more.","Song Luokui suddenly asked, \"Do you think I'm asking you to sleep with me?\"","Chi Yu stiffened, turning to look at her briefly before turning back to focus on the road. \"If it's you, I don't mind whatever you want to do.\"","Song Luokui looked at him, then lowered her gaze. \"You haven't confessed to me yet.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll prepare it when I get back!\" He had originally planned to make a formal confession tonight.","Song Luokui nodded. \"Then I won't give you an answer yet.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay.\"","Soon they arrived at the female dormitory. Song Luokui quickly opened the car door and ran back to her dorm. \"Sisi, Jingfeng, I... my necklace, where is it?\"","Wang Sisi: \"Is that the one you just threw away? I picked it up, I was afraid you had thrown it away by mistake or something, since it looked so expensive, so I kept it.\" The necklace could practically buy a down payment on a house in Jing City.","Wang Sisi handed the necklace wrapped in tissue paper to Song Luokui. Song Luokui took it, opened it, and sure enough, it was the one she had thrown away. She was terrified, thinking it was lost.","\"Thank you.\" Song Luokui took the necklace to the bathroom, turned on the faucet, rinsed it, then used tissue paper to dry it before putting it back in the box in the drawer.","Song Luokui sat down in the chair to rest. Suddenly she remembered that Chi Yu was still outside, not knowing if he had left yet. Song Luokui ran out to the balcony to look down, and the car was still parked there. She was considering just calling him to leave, but remembering the misunderstanding earlier, she decided to go down.","She wasn't angry anymore.","Song Luokui went back downstairs and got into Chi Yu's car. \"Give me a ride home?\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay... but your brother just came back to the courtyard, is that okay?\"","Song Luokui hit her forehead. \"Oh right.\" She looked at Chi Yu. \"Then... can you go back first? I'll have Uncle An come pick me up.\"","After a moment, she shook her head. \"Never mind, take me to ChunWang Manor.\"","Chi Yu: \"How do you get there?\"","Song Luokui: \"I've been going to the company there lately. Sometimes I stay late, so my brother gave me a large unit there to stay if I'm too late. I'm going to check on the renovation progress.\"","Chi Yu: \"I think I also have a unit there.\"","Song Luokui looked at him. \"You live there too?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm not living there right now.\" The future was yet to be determined."]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: Refuting Rumors","paragraphs":["Soon they arrived at ChunWang Manor, and Song Luokui called her assistant Li Bei from the car, \"Are you at ChunWang Manor?\"","Li Bei: \"Yes. Boss, do you want to come and take a look?\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm in the parking lot, I'll go up in a bit.\" She prepared to get out of the car, then turned to look at Chi Yu, \"My assistant is up there, so I can't take you up with me. My assistant is someone my brother got for me.\"","Chi Yu had no objections, \"Okay, I'll wait for you here.\"","Looking at his expression, Song Luokui suddenly felt sorry for him, \"I remember you should have been at work this afternoon?\"","Chi Yu: \"Mm, I tried to send you a message but it wouldn't go through, so I immediately came to find you. I went to the school but couldn't find you, and they said you had gone home, so I drove out of the school and just happened to see you get on the bus, so I followed you by car.\"","Thinking of how Chi Yu had found her, Song Luokui felt even more guilty. Today had been quite chaotic. \"Come over here a bit.\" Song Luokui said to Chi Yu.","Chi Yu approached, not understanding. Song Luokui directly gave him a hug, and Chi Yu stiffened for a moment before tightly embracing her, burying his head in her neck and taking a deep breath. \"I thought...the final result was that you would reject me.\"","Actually, rejection would have been fine, but the way she had looked at him made it seem like she would never want to see him again, so he had been so anxious.","Song Luokui patted his back, \"I forgot to say yesterday, welcome back safely from your business trip, and I'm very sorry for the misunderstanding, it was my fault.\"","Chi Yu: \"No, it was my problem. I should have told them to shut up and not spread rumors. And...you still haven't given me an answer, I shouldn't have let everyone think I have a girlfriend.\"","Song Luokui: \"Don't you think it's despicable of me to keep you hanging without giving you an answer?\"","Chi Yu stroked her long hair, \"That's still better than rejecting me. If you want to keep it this way, that's fine too.\"","Song Luokui: \"Aren't you afraid I'm just a flaky girl who wants to stay in a grey area without taking responsibility?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm not afraid. As long as you're only in a grey area with me, it's fine.\"","Song Luokui released him, but Chi Yu didn't want to let go of her. Song Luokui pushed him a bit before he finally released her, but his hand still held hers. Song Luokui looked at him seriously and said, \"I should agree to you, but I... I have some conditions. Wait until you confess to me, then I'll tell you.\" Now, I have to go up.","Song Luokui patted his cheek, \"You should leave first if you have something to do.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll wait for you.\"","Song Luokui got out of the car, waved her hand, and quickly disappeared.","Chi Yu felt the lingering warmth on his hand, and thinking of Song Luokui's words, she should agree to him... Chi Yu suddenly couldn't help but smile a little, that's great.","Over there, Chen Nan quickly sent a message: \"Boss, I've clarified it, soon everyone in the circle should know.\"","\"Good.\"","The news from within the country to abroad would have a slight time difference. As Leng Ruohan was chatting and drinking with her little brother in an ambiguous way, her good sister suddenly called her. Leng Ruohan originally wanted to hang up directly, but her little brother gently said, \"It's okay, answer it.\"","Leng Ruohan immediately answered the phone, \"Hello?\"","Her sister: \"Ruohan! You're amazing! You actually got together with such an impressive person!\"","Leng Ruohan: \"Huh? Who are you talking about?\" Could it be about her little brother? But they were still in an ambiguous relationship.","Her sister: \"Sister, don't pretend, and don't hide it. It's been spread throughout the circle.\"","Leng Ruohan was puzzled, \"What has been spread? What circle?\"","\"What circle? Of course the entire Capital Circle! How did you get to know the young master of the Chi Family?\"","Leng Ruohan almost sprayed out a mouthful of water, \"No... no, what relationship with the Chi Family? I'm not even familiar with them! I haven't even seen that person in Country A.\"","She kept tapping the table, and the little brother next to her, afraid that her hand would get hurt, grabbed her hand.","Her sister: \"Really? Isn't it the young master of the Lan Family then? Are you really not familiar with the young master of the Chi Family?\"","Leng Ruohan felt ridiculous, \"So who the hell is spreading rumors about me and him? I'm now afraid that he'll think I'm the one spreading it and come to seek revenge on me.\"","Her sister: \"...You should check the chat groups in the Capital Circle. If it's not you, you'd better clarify it early.\"","Leng Ruohan: \"I'll go check it out right away.\"","The little brother next to her: \"What's wrong?\"","Leng Ruohan didn't even bother to talk to him, waving her hand, \"It's nothing, I have something to do, you just sit here.\"","She immediately went to check the chat groups she had muted, and there were people tagging her. After half an hour, she finally understood.","Leng Ruohan immediately posted in the group: \"I don't know the young master of the Chi Family, please don't spread rumors.\"","Finally, she also posted a friends circle, of course blocking her family members.","Lan Chunjin from the Lan Family was about the same. When she heard the news, she was also stunned. She quickly clarified, \"Who the hell is spreading rumors about me? If I had a good relationship with the young master of the Chi Family and became his girlfriend, I could laugh for three days and three nights. Alas, he probably doesn't think much of me.\"","Soon, the others also started spreading rumors, although they didn't mention names, but everyone actually knew who they were talking about. The parties involved quickly clarified.","After the clarification, everyone started guessing again who could have gained the favor of the young master of the Chi Family. In the end, they didn't expect the boss's good buddies to come out and clarify.","\"The rumor-mongers have been given thirty lashes, don't believe the rumors. My brother doesn't know any of those people. As of today, he still doesn't have a girlfriend.\"","Indeed, as of today, he doesn't have a girlfriend, no problem.","\"I knew it, if the young master of the Chi Family had a girlfriend, how could he be hiding it?\"","\"He still doesn't have a girlfriend, I don't know who's spreading rumors.\"","\"It even involved so many people, luckily it's not me.\"","\"Not you...it seems not very good either. Means you're not outstanding enough.\"","\"...Seems to be the case.\"","On the other side, Song Luosheng, who had just gone to the manor to get some documents and then left, also quickly heard the news: ...Isn't this Chi Yu just playing with everyone?","Over there, the few little brothers who had spread the news that Chi Yu had a girlfriend were now doing frog squats on a large open ground.","\"Nan-ge, we were wrong, waaah!\"","Chen Nan was holding a camera and filming, \"The boss said, two hundred frog squats for each of you. If you can't finish, you'll be sent to the countryside to teach. You're all too idle, don't you know the danger of loose talk?\"","\"But the boss really...\"","Chen Nan: \"Shut up! Whether he has a girlfriend or not is none of your business? From now on, just call her 'big sis' when you see her, okay? Now hurry up and do it. I still have other work to do.\"","\"Okay, I see. The boss has a lot of enemies, so he needs to keep it a secret.\"","\"That's right, that's right.\" Anyway, having a girlfriend should be confirmed, back in the box, the boss didn't deny it. But the boss is still not strong enough, after all, not the strongest in Blue Star, the boss must be afraid that his woman would be hurt by the enemy, so he kept it a secret, yes, it must be like this!","One by one, they all felt that this must be the case!"]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: Ritual Planning","paragraphs":["Song Luokui took the elevator up to the 26th floor, where her apartment was located. One of the units on this floor seemed to be unoccupied.","However, she was unaware that as soon as she arrived, Chi Yu had already made a call, \"Help me buy a house, right in ChunWang Manor...\"","When Song Luokui arrived, the renovation workers were hard at work, and Li Bei was overseeing them. Upon seeing Song Luokui, Li Bei immediately approached her, \"Boss.\"","Song Luokui covered her nose and went inside. \"Mm.\" She looked around, and although the place was a mess due to the ongoing renovation, she could see the general shape of the space.","Song Luokui stayed for a while and then left, mainly because of the dust and smoke.","\"You can go buy some food for the workers later, and I'll transfer the money to you. You don't need to keep an eye on things here all the time. Your shift is over, so you can leave. If there are any issues, just give me a call.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luokui: \"Then I'll be leaving now. Be careful on your own.\"","Li Bei: \"Okay, do you need me to give you a ride back?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, it's fine. I'm leaving now, bye.\"","Song Luokui quickly went downstairs, and of course, she also transferred the money to Li Bei.","Song Luokui returned to the underground parking lot. She had only been upstairs for about half an hour, but she knew that Chi Yu was still waiting for her there.","She got in the car, \"I don't know if my brother is still in the compound.\"","Chi Yu: \"I just asked, and your brother has left. I'll take you home first.\"","\"Okay.\"","Back at home, Song Luokui picked up her phone and checked the messages. The group chat was already buzzing with talk about a rumor that had been debunked.","Song Luokui clicked in and saw Weng Jiao, Zhang Xiyue, and others chatting enthusiastically.","\"So it was just a rumor after all. Sigh, who started this gossip anyway?\"","\"It sounded so convincing, I even thought it was about the Cold family. I was betting on that.\"","\"I was betting on the Lan family.\"","\"...In the end, the one from the Pool family didn't even know the person!\"","\"I was wondering from the start how there could be no news about it beforehand. Turns out it was just a rumor.\"","Song Luokui looked at the screenshots they had, including Leng Ruohan's Moments post debunking the rumor, the Lan family member's clarification, and others' denials.","Song Luokui sat on the sofa, covering her eyes. She had indeed misjudged the situation, and now she felt embarrassed, especially since she had even kicked someone. She also thought about Chi Yu's expression at the time and felt sorry for him.","Going back to her room, she saw the exquisite music box that Chi Yu had previously given her. It seems she'll need to make it up to him more in the future.","On the other side, Chi Yu was already planning the location and details of his confession, wanting it to be a surprise for her and not letting too many people know.","In the end, Chi Yu decided on his own villa, which was large enough. He directly called Ji Xiao, \"I want to plan a confession... Just you guys, don't let anyone else know. \"","Ji Xiao: \"Don't worry, brother, we'll get it done before the weekend.\"","Chi Yu: \"By the weekend.\"","Ji Xiao: \"No problem!\"","After ending the call with Chi Yu, Ji Xiao immediately called Li Yanbei, Zhou Wenqin, and the others, \"Brothers, the boss has a task for us...\"","Li Yanbei heard this and immediately got excited, \"Wow, Xiao, wait for me, I'm heading to your place now, let's discuss and get this done!\"","...","\"The flowers need to be directly imported from Country H, the freshest ones.\"","\"We also need to lay out a red carpet.\"","\"Should we use red silk?\"","\"...This isn't a wedding! But we can decorate it on the flowers.\"","\"Has the boss ordered a custom suit yet? Call him quickly and have him order the most handsome one. Although the boss looks good in anything.\"","\"We need a makeup artist to do his hairstyle too.\"","\"What about the food? Which restaurant should we order from? We'll need to eat later, right?\"","\"And what about the activities after the confession? Does it just end there?\"","\"...This is not a wedding!\"","\"Okay, okay... Do we need to decorate the room as well? After the confession, the two of them can...\"","\"...This is not a wedding, not a wedding, not a wedding. I'll say it three times.\"","\"Don't be so worked up, it feels almost like a wedding.\"","\"You better not get beaten up by the boss.\"","\"Got it, I'll shut up.\"","While these guys were running around, when Chi Yu joined them to hear their suggestions, he said, \"This is a confession ceremony, not a wedding ceremony.\"","Li Yanbei blinked, \"Ah... so...\"","Chi Yu: \"Remove the red silk, use more flowers, arrange them in a heart shape, all red roses. No need to prepare the room, we'll have dinner after, and then prepare the fireworks.\"","Li Yanbei: \"Yeah, yeah, fireworks too!\"","Chi Yu: \"One of you will be the photographer.\"","Ji Xiao: \"Brother, I'll do it.\"","Chi Yu: \"And we need gifts...\"","Chi Yu discussed with them for a day, and finally, they settled everything. Now it was time to prepare.","On this end, Song Luokui was still running between school and the company. Recently, there wasn't as much work at the company, so she didn't spend too much time there, and if she got home late, she wouldn't go to the office.","On Saturday, Song Luokui woke up early to find a message from Chi Yu: \"Shall we have dinner together tomorrow night?\"","Of course, Song Luokui hadn't forgotten. \"Sure.\"","Chi Yu: \"I've booked Chunyu Building, and then we can go to another place afterward, is that okay?\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\" She thought they would go somewhere else to hang out.","Song Luokui: \"By the way, come pick me up at school tomorrow, I'll be going back to school.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay... See you tomorrow.\"","\"See you tomorrow.\"","At this time, Chi Yu was preparing the decorations at the villa for tomorrow's event. He had already planned everything out. He would go pick her up earlier, they would have dinner first, and before 9 pm, they would arrive at the villa, where he would cover her eyes...","The next morning, Sheng Rong asked Song Luokui to accompany her to meet a foreign friend who had come to visit. Sheng Rong's friend had also brought a child around the same age, so Sheng Rong asked Song Luokui to come along.","Song Luokui went with them, thinking it would be a quick visit, but she didn't expect it might take until dinner time.","However, she had already made plans with Chi Yu.","Around 4 pm, Sheng Rong and the foreign friend were chatting, and Song Luokui kept glancing at the time and the sky outside, which Sheng Rong noticed.","When the friend went to the bathroom, Sheng Rong quickly asked, \"What's wrong? Do you have something else to do?\"","Song Luokui felt a little embarrassed. \"I'm sorry, Mom, I made plans to go out with someone tonight.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Is it Xiyue?\"","Song Luokui hesitated a bit, \"No... just a friend.\"","Sheng Rong didn't ask further, as her daughter was grown up and had her own matters now. \"It's okay, I'll let you leave first, and I'll call someone else to keep them company. But next time, remember to tell me earlier, okay?\"","Song Luokui: \"Understood, Mom. I thought it would be quick.\"","Sheng Rong: \"No problem, go ahead, and Mom will explain it. Have fun.\"","\"Thank you, Mom.\" After hugging Sheng Rong, when the friend returned, Song Luokui quickly apologized and left, and Sheng Rong explained the situation.","The friend was very understanding: \"No problem, go ahead. With your mom keeping me company, I'll be fine.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Don't worry, I'll keep you company these next few days, and make sure you have a wonderful time.\"","\"It's settled then, haha haha.\""]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: Confessions","paragraphs":["After Song Luokui left the International Friendship Hotel, she immediately had Uncle An take her back to the university. It should take her about an hour to get back, and she should still make it in time.","The reason she didn't go directly to the Chunyu Building is mainly because it's on the other side, which is further away. Besides, Chi Yu had messaged her at 4 o'clock saying he had arrived at the university, but told her not to hurry, as he had some matters to attend to, and they could meet up at 5 o'clock.","She thought it would be better to go to the university first and meet up with Chi Yu. As she got in the car, Song Luokui first sent a message to Chi Yu, \"I had some matters to attend to, so I might be a little late. I'll probably get to the university around 5:30.\"","Chi Yu, who had been waiting without a reply, was no longer worried after receiving her message. \"No problem, take your time. I'll wait for you.\"","\"Okay.\"","When they arrived at the university, after Uncle An left, Song Luokui rushed to where Chi Yu was waiting. By the time she got in the car, it was almost 6 o'clock.","\"Sorry, I'm late.\"","Chi Yu looked at her. \"It's okay, you're here now. Shall we go to the Chunyu Building?\"","\"Okay.\"","About half an hour later, they arrived at the Chunyu Building. As they waited for the food to arrive, Song Luokui took out a small box and handed it to Chi Yu. \"This is an apology gift.\"","Chi Yu accepted it. \"Apology gift? What for?\"","Song Luokui felt a bit embarrassed. \"For the misunderstanding earlier. Open it and see.\"","Chi Yu, though saying the misunderstanding was no problem, opened the gift excitedly. Inside was a stylish men's lapel pin.","\"I really like it. Can you help me put it on?\" Chi Yu asked with a smile, looking at Song Luokui.","\"Sure.\" Song Luokui took the pin from the box and, sitting next to Chi Yu, leaned in to pin it on his lapel.","Chi Yu kept his head down, able to smell the fragrance of her hair.","\"There, all done.\" Song Luokui sat up straight, looking at him. \"How does it look?\"","Chi Yu glanced at it. \"It looks good.\"","Song Luokui: \"I think so too.\"","She sat back across from Chi Yu, and the food arrived just then.","As they ate, Chi Yu told her some interesting stories about his business trip. \"The beaches in Banras are beautiful, worth a visit. Maybe in the future...\"","Song Luokui: \"Hmm?\"","Chi Yu: \"Maybe in the future, I can take you there, if you'd like?\"","Song Luokui paused for a moment, then nodded. \"Okay.\"","Chi Yu immediately smiled.","After finishing their meal, Chi Yu reached out his hand to Song Luokui. She looked up at him, then at his palm - his hand was large, and she had held it before, it was warm.","Song Luokui placed her hand in his, and Chi Yu grasped it firmly, his tone joyful. \"I'll take you somewhere.\"","He led her to a slightly secluded area, not too remote, but the surrounding houses were quite far apart, and there were few people on the road.","The car stopped at the entrance of a traditional courtyard house. There were two red lanterns hanging at the entrance, and the ancient-style architecture made Song Luokui think of a horror movie setting.","Song Luokui's voice lowered. \"What are we doing here?\"","Chi Yu suddenly said to her, \"Could you please cover your eyes for a moment?\"","Song Luokui: ? Does this mean they're entering some kind of secret place where she needs to have her eyes covered to go in? Song Luokui's mind was now weaving a little story.","Chi Yu used a band to blindfold her eyes, then took her hand. \"We're going in, there are some steps, be careful...\"","As they went through the door, Song Luokui heard the creaking sound of the door closing, followed by the sound of it being locked.","Song Luokui: ... This is getting more and more ominous.","What she didn't know was that behind her, as they entered, two people had immediately closed the door, and in front of her, Ji Xiao was holding a camera, filming this moment. Beneath her feet was a red carpet, with the most fresh and beautiful roses from overseas lining the sides.","As they entered, all the surrounding lights turned on, illuminating the house as bright as day. Lanterns were also hanging from the trees.","They continued walking, then Chi Yu finally told her to stop. Song Luokui: \"What are you doing?\"","Chi Yu: \"Just a moment.\"","He suddenly let go of Song Luokui's hand, and Zhou Wenqin immediately handed him a bouquet of flowers, while the others took their positions.","Finally, Chi Yu said, \"Song Luokui, you can open your eyes now.\"","Song Luokui pulled off the blindfold. Her eyes took a moment to adjust to the brightness. She shielded them with her hand, and then saw Chi Yu kneeling before her, holding the bouquet.","Behind him, on the wall, were the words \"Song Luokui, I like you,\" surrounded by fresh flowers and prayers.","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu, her heart racing. She already knew what he was about to do.","Chi Yu offered her the bouquet. \"Song Luokui, I like you. Will you be my girlfriend?\"","Song Luokui took a step back, and Chi Yu's face grew tense. The people watching also held their breath, anxious.","But then Song Luokui reached out and took the bouquet. \"I accept.\"","\"Yes!\" The hidden observers let out a relieved sigh.","Chi Yu beamed with happiness as he stood up and took out a box, opening it to reveal a necklace. \"This is a gift for you. Can I put it on you?\"","Song Luokui nodded. \"Okay.\"","Chi Yu, still a bit nervous, put the necklace on her. Then he tightly embraced her, and Song Luokui wrapped one arm around him.","Suddenly, fireworks burst forth, similar to the ones Chi Yu had set off for her before.","The two looked up at the fireworks, and Song Luokui smiled happily. \"Did you prepare this?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes.\"","Song Luokui: \"I thought it was like a horror movie when I was standing at the door, and when I heard the door closing, it made me think of the time I went to a haunted house... I had no idea you were going to confess!\"","Chi Yu: ... Everyone agreed the lanterns were festive, and there were many lanterns lining the hallway, all red.","Song Luokui: \"But now it doesn't seem scary at all.\"","The fireworks ended, and Li Yanbei gave a thumbs up, then the group quietly left.","As Song Luokui walked to the exit, she saw the entire path was lined with roses. To be honest, she was quite touched. She looked up at Chi Yu, \"I really liked the ceremony tonight.\"","Chi Yu kept holding her hand, and hearing her say that made him very happy. He looked down at her, and suddenly cupped her face, leaning in...","But Song Luokui quickly covered his mouth with her hand. \"Wait, even though I've accepted you, I have a small request.\"","Chi Yu: ?","Song Luokui: \"Come, let's go to the living room and talk.\"","She led Chi Yu to the living room, placing the flowers aside. She poured hot tea for both of them, taking a sip before looking at Chi Yu. She sighed. \"You know, I have an unavoidable predicament.\"","Chi Yu: ?"]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: The Underground Lover","paragraphs":["Bitterness? Chi Yu was completely perplexed.","Song Luokui sighed, poking his hand with her finger before hooking his index finger, \"You know, my brother doesn't approve of you. In principle, I'm on my brother's side. If he finds out, can you guess what my brother would do?\"","Chi Yu gripped her hand, following her finger, \"So you want me to work out more? Let your brother beat me up?\" Getting beaten up by his brother-in-law seemed acceptable.","Song Luokui: \"...No, why would you think that? I mean...let's keep our relationship a secret for now. Especially from my brother and his friends.\"","Chi Yu looked at her, \"So I'm still not allowed to be seen with you?\"","Song Luokui felt a little guilty, \"Not exactly, but you know, this involves a lot...You saw how much of a scene it caused in our circles when news of you having a girlfriend came out. Imagine what would happen if I was exposed.\"","Chi Yu: \"When can we go public?\"","Song Luokui: \"After I prepare my brother a little.\"","Of course, Chi Yu wanted nothing more than to announce their relationship to the world, but he had no choice. \"Okay, I can be your underground lover, but you need to reward me.\"","Upon hearing \"underground lover,\" Song Luokui instantly blushed. \"What underground lover...This is just a self-protection measure. We don't expose our relationship, so you can avoid getting beaten up by my brother, and I can avoid gossip. And what if you have enemies who might kidnap me to get back at you?\"","Thinking of this, Song Luokui recalled the previous kidnapping incident - she was taken hostage to get revenge on her brother. \"You don't have any enemies, do you?\"","Chi Yu thought back to the intense firefights he was involved in overseas...It wasn't as intense domestically, but there was still covert conflict.","Chi Yu: \"...I do.\"","Song Luokui stared at him for a moment, recalling the villains from books. Then she clapped her hands!","\"That's it, you have too many enemies, so we can't expose me.\"","Chi Yu: \"...\" He suddenly thought of such a scenario too. Chi Yu pulled her into an embrace, squinting as he started considering hiring bodyguards for Song Luokui - the kind that would secretly watch over her.","Song Luokui checked the time. \"It's late, I need to head back to school.\"","Chi Yu: \"Why not stay here? There are guest rooms.\"","Song Luokui: \"No, I'm going back to school.\"","Chi Yu didn't insist, feeling elated that she had agreed to be his girlfriend tonight. \"I'll drive you back.\"","\"Okay.\"","On the drive back to school with soothing music playing, Chi Yu drove with one hand while holding Song Luokui's hand, occasionally exchanging smiles.","Song Luokui: \"Drive carefully, don't look at me. You'll get mocked by your enemies if you get pulled over for reckless driving.\"","Chi Yu: \"...Got it.\"","Upon reaching the dorm building, Song Luokui remembered Chi Yu mentioning a reward. Her face instantly flushed as she unfastened her seatbelt and leaned towards him. Chi Yu held his breath, watching her move closer.","Song Luokui kissed his cheek, \"That's your reward, boyfriend. I'm heading up now, good night.\"","The moment her lips touched his skin, Chi Yu swallowed hard, his pupils dilating as his grip on the steering wheel tightened. After a while, he finally found his voice, though it was a little hoarse. \"Yeah, good night.\"","Carefully listening, his voice did sound raspy.","Song Luokui waved at him from the car while holding the bouquet before entering the dorm. Meanwhile, Chi Yu touched his cheek, covering his mouth with a fist as he coughed, failing to hide his elation.","He sat in the car for a while, touching the badge on his chest at one point before opening photos of Song Luokui that he had taken earlier, realizing they forgot to take a selfie together.","Ding, Song Luokui messaged him: \"Why aren't you leaving yet?\"","Chi Yu looked up at the girls' dorm, knowing she must be watching from the balcony even though he couldn't see her.","Chi Yu immediately replied: \"Yeah. Heading back now. Good night.\"","\"Good night.\"","Soon, Chi Yu drove off.","The first thing he did upon arriving home was remove the badge from his chest and place it in a box. Finally unable to resist, he took another photo of it before touching his cheek again and heading to the bathroom.","Back in the dorm, when Song Luokui returned with a blushing face and a bouquet of vibrant roses, her roommates Wang Sisi and the others immediately exclaimed in surprise.","The three of them quickly surrounded her. \"Who sent these?\"","\"Are you being courted?\"","\"That's a huge bouquet of roses, 99 of them?\"","Song Luokui felt a little shy. \"I don't know how many, probably 99. As for who sent them, that's a secret. It's late, I need to shower.\"","She set the bouquet down and quickly grabbed her sleepwear, preparing to enter the bathroom. Before doing so, she glanced out towards the balcony, noticing Chi Yu's car hadn't left yet, so she quickly messaged him.","Only after Chi Yu's car departed did Song Luokui enter the bathroom.","Now as an official couple, Chi Yu no longer needed excuses to meet up, and their dates weren't limited to just dining out.","On Monday morning during the report meeting, the managers noticed the boss seemed exceptionally amiable today, occasionally even smiling while glancing at his phone! Suddenly they felt a bit unsettled - what was going on?","After the meeting ended and everyone filed out of the room, the last person heard the boss making a call, his tone unexpectedly gentle: \"I booked two movie tickets, want to catch a movie tonight?\"","So that's why the boss was so approachable today! It sounded like he was dating someone!","Song Luokui declined Chi Yu's movie proposal since she had assignments to work on that evening. To focus on her work, she went to the campus study hall, but soon regretted it when the couple in front of her started making out passionately mid-study...","They weren't the only ones - there were two or three other groups scattered around. Finally, a student in black had seen enough and rapped on the table: \"Dude, this is a study hall.\"","That shameless couple wasn't pleased about the interruption. The guy snapped, \"So what if it's a study hall? Mind your business, single loser!\"","\"Watch your tone!\" The student in black stood up.","Next thing you know, they were squaring up, shoving each other until an all-out brawl broke out, books flying everywhere. One nearly hit Song Luokui in the head, forcing her to use her laptop as a shield before grabbing her bag and bolting out the back exit while others tried to break it up.","Song Luokui patted her hair, shaken by the close call. She rarely visited the study hall and never expected something like that to happen. She immediately wanted to vent - but to whom? Normally she'd complain to her girlfriends, but now she had a boyfriend to rant to.","Meanwhile, Chi Yu had intended to surprise her at the study hall that evening, having just arrived at the campus gates."]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: True Sisters","paragraphs":["\"Hello?\"","Song Luokui heard his voice and immediately blurted out, \"I was just doing my homework nicely, when suddenly there was a fight in front of me. It was a couple kissing in the study room, and another guy couldn't stand it, and the two guys...\"","Chi Yu: \"Where are you now?\"","Song Luokui: \"I've come out, I'm afraid it will affect me. It's better to go watch a movie with you.\"","Chi Yu: \"Wait for me downstairs, I'm coming over now.\"","Song Luokui: \"Huh? You're at school now.\"","\"En, wait for me.\"","Soon, Song Luokui saw Chi Yu's car parked by the side of the road, she walked over and knocked on the window, then opened the car door and got in. \"Why did you come over?\"","Chi Yu: \"I wanted to see you, so I came.\"","Song Luokui's face blushed again, she blinked, \"Then...\"","Chi Yu held her hand, \"Didn't you need to do your homework? I'll take you to another study room.\"","\"Huh?\"","Then Chi Yu took her to a research institute building, they went upstairs and entered a private study room with only two people. Chi Yu directly swiped his student card to open the door.","Song Luokui looked at him, Chi Yu: \"This building was donated by my family, the school said as long as I'm still in school, this study room will be reserved for me.\" Not only that, his graduate dorm was also a luxurious single room, it's just that he didn't live on campus.","Song Luokui: ...","Song Luokui sat down and opened her computer to continue doing her homework, Chi Yu also took out his computer and started working.","The only sound in the study room was the tapping of keyboards, Chi Yu didn't disturb her, he just occasionally glanced at her, then continued his work.","By the time it was past 9 o'clock, Song Luokui had finally finished her homework. She stretched and took a sip of water, then closed her laptop.","\"I'm done, how about you?\"","Chi Yu: \"En, just wait 10 more minutes.\"","Song Luokui didn't disturb him, after tidying up, she just sat on the side scrolling on her phone. 10 minutes passed quickly, Chi Yu closed his laptop, helped her pick up her bag and put it on his back, then held her hand and left the study room.","After putting the bag and computer in the car, Chi Yu invited her, \"Want to take a stroll?\"","Song Luokui looked around, it was indeed not very crowded here, but there were still some people, she was still a bit worried, \"Won't we be discovered?\"","Chi Yu tightly held her hand, \"That path over there is a bit darker, you can't see people clearly, and there are fewer people.\"","Song Luokui looked at him, \"You're talking like you want to do something bad.\"","Chi Yu: \"Hmm... what if I just want to do something bad to you?\"","Song Luokui joked, \"Then I'll just yell 'help' and let you suffer public humiliation. Let's go, isn't it just a stroll?\"","The two of them walked for a while, turning into the path Chi Yu mentioned. The streetlights here seemed quite old, occasionally flickering and making a sizzling sound, with moths flying around the bulbs.","There were also bushes on the side, this place did seem like a good place to do something bad, and there were indeed fewer people, just occasionally seeing someone jogging by, then no one else.","As they walked, under a willow tree there was a chair, and it seemed like a couple was sitting on it. If the girl's appearance wasn't someone Song Luokui recognized, she wouldn't have immediately hugged Chi Yu and buried her head in his chest.","Song Luokui whispered, \"Look over there, that couple, the girl, do you recognize her?\"","Chi Yu looked over, he couldn't see the girl's appearance, but he saw the boy, the boy's whole face was flushed red and he looked flustered because the girl was sitting on his lap.","\"I don't know the girl, but I recognize the guy. He's from our old neighborhood, but later he moved somewhere else.\"","Song Luokui: \"Look again... Wait, the guy you recognize? Who is he?\"","Chi Yu: \"His brother is Fan Yifeng, his name should be Fan Yilu. In the past, his brother used to fight with me and your brother.\"","Song Luokui: \"Wait a minute, Fan Yilu? Isn't that the one Zhang Xiyue brought a group of underclassmen to invite me to hang out with before?\"","At that time, Xiyue had even hidden in the guy's embrace, abandoning her friend...","\"So, Fan Yilu should know you.\"","Chi Yu: \"En, he calls me 'brother'.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" So Xiyue was secretly dating the enemy's brother!","Song Luokui glanced at Chi Yu, then lowered her eyes. Well, she and Xiyue really were good sisters, they were both dating the other side's people.","Chi Yu: \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui covered her face, \"Nothing, what do you think of the Fan family's brother?\"","Chi Yu: \"His personality is fine.\" And judging from just now, he seems to really like that girl.","Song Luokui: \"Okay. Me and Xiyue really are good sisters.\" She just wanted to know if Xiyue knew about the identity of the Fan family's brother.","Chi Yu chuckled, pulling her into a hug, \"Just now, your friend was sitting on that guy's lap, as your sister, do you want to...\"","Song Luokui covered his mouth, \"No.\" Mainly because she felt it would be too embarrassing, that kind of intimacy was too much.","...","It wasn't until the dorm was about to close that Song Luokui went back. She had thought Zhang Xiyue would tell her the news about dating the Fan family's brother, after all, last time when she got a boyfriend, she told her very quickly.","However, after some time passed, Zhang Xiyue didn't mention it to her at all, and even the times she invited her to hang out had decreased, but she would still chat in the sisters' group, yet never revealed anything about her love life.","Of course, Song Luokui didn't blame her, because she was the same. Well, they really were good sisters.","The short drama at the company had been produced, and was already prepared to be released online with promotions. Song Luokui watched a bit and thought it was still pretty good, the rest of the employees would arrange the rest, she just needed to know the final result.","Assistant Li Bei recently told her that the apartment across from her at ChunWang Manor had been sold.","\"Do you know who bought it?\"","\"I couldn't find out, but I heard from the property management that it was handled by a secretary, so it should be a big boss, and maybe he will only come occasionally, or maybe he won't come at all.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, then it's fine.\"","The company's short drama went online and was quickly praised, the number of views kept rising rapidly, it even trended on search engines, and many people were recommending it.","Some industry insiders were quite surprised.","\"Didn't Tian Yu go down? The boss even went to jail.\"","\"I heard it was acquired, and started anew.\"","\"Which bastard dared to acquire it?\"","\"I heard they laid off most of the people, only a small group remained, and they've recruited a lot of new people, it's no longer the old Tian Yu, it's a new company now. The production quality also seems pretty good.\"","The data was great, advertisers were also lining up to offer deals, and the next project already had people reserving ad slots.","Song Luokui was also very happy to see the results, but a few days later, Li Bei reported to her that the two lucky bamboo trees in front of the company had been scalded with hot water.","Song Luokui: ... This despicable business war has even reached her?"]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: The Date","paragraphs":["When Song Luokui told Song Luosheng that someone had poured water on her lucky plant, he laughed heartily.","\"I had previously told you to be careful on your end, but I never expected that I would need to be the one to watch out,\" Song Luokui said, a bit dejected.","Song Luosheng laughed and said, \"Our company is big, and our competitors are also large corporations. Getting caught doing such things that can damage the company's image is something that most people wouldn't do. We usually just wait for them to make a mistake, then buy a trending topic to criticize them.\"","Song Luokui said, \"So you mean that since my company is small and I'm competing with other small companies, it doesn't matter?\"","Song Luosheng patted her shoulder, \"It's okay, don't worry. I'll get you two more lucky plants. You'll need to install a security camera at the entrance to catch the culprit.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"I did, but the person was completely covered up, and we're still investigating.\"","Song Luosheng asked, \"Do you need me to help?\"","Song Luokui said, \"Not for now.\" She couldn't always rely on her brother.","After venting to Song Luosheng, Song Luokui left his office. Song Luosheng thought about it and called Li Bei, \"Keep a closer eye on your boss lately.\"","Li Bei quickly understood that it was likely due to the lucky plant incident, so she knew what to do.","As a result, when Song Luokui went to school, left school, and returned home, Li Bei would show up, waiting for her in the car. This made it inconvenient for Song Luokui to call or meet with Chi Yu.","\"I don't need you to follow me around all the time,\" Song Luokui said.","Li Bei explained, \"Your brother asked me to keep a closer eye on you recently, probably because he's worried someone might do something to you due to the lucky plant incident.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"I have Uncle An. And no one at school would be so blatant. How's the house renovations going?\"","Li Bei said, \"It's almost done. I'll come by next time and show you a video.\"","\"Okay,\" Song Luokui responded.","At that moment, Song Luokui's phone rang, and she saw it was Chi Yu. She immediately hung up and sent him a message, \"Not a good time to call.\"","It had been several days since their last meeting, and Chi Yu's previous invitations had been rejected.","Song Luokui felt this couldn't continue, so she sent him another message, \"I'll come to your office later.\"","\"Okay,\" Chi Yu replied.","When Song Luokui returned home, Li Bei left. Song Luokui waited a bit, then quietly snuck out, telling Aunt Gui, \"I'm going out with a friend tonight, won't be home for dinner.\"","Aunt Gui shook her head as she watched Song Luokui's retreating figure. It seemed the young miss had been going out with friends frequently lately.","After leaving, Song Luokui took a ride directly to the Shan Yu Group. It was the end of the workday, so she didn't go inside. Instead, she waited in a coffee shop across the street and called Chi Yu, \"Are you off work yet? I'm in the coffee shop across from your company.\"","\"I'll be right down,\" Chi Yu responded, immediately standing up. He told his slightly confused secretary, \"I'm leaving now, we can deal with whatever it is tomorrow.\"","The secretary was puzzled - this was the first time she'd seen the boss leave work earlier than her.","Chi Yu hurried downstairs, crossing the lobby and ignoring the greetings from several employees, heading straight for the coffee shop across the street. He spotted Song Luokui sitting in the corner and she noticed him at the same moment, standing up and raising her hand to wave.","He quickly walked over and pulled her into an embrace, \"Have you been waiting long?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"No, I just called you as soon as I got here.\"","Holding her hand, Chi Yu asked, \"Have you had dinner yet? Shall we go eat?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Yes, and later we can go see a movie. I told Aunt Gui I'm spending the night with a friend.\"","For this, she had changed into an oversized outfit and put on a hat, so that if she ran into any familiar faces on the way, they might not recognize her.","\"Okay, I'll make the arrangements,\" Chi Yu said, keeping his arm around her as they left.","Two women who had been buying coffee saw the intimate scene and gossiped, \"Is that the boss's girlfriend?\"","\"The way he's holding her, it must be!\"","\"I've heard there's a woman who often comes to see the boss.\"","\"Not the same one, this one looks different. But I can't see her face clearly, don't know who she is.\"","\"Well, whoever she is, the boss sure seems to really care about her.\"","\"Ah well, it's not our business. Let's go.\"","Chi Yu and Song Luokui got into the car, and the driver took them to a nearby restaurant. After dinner, they went to the movie theater, where the tickets had already been purchased. Chi Yu's formal attire stood out a bit among the other moviegoers.","Song Luokui nudged him, \"Next time, wear something more casual. This is too flashy.\"","Holding her hand, Chi Yu replied, \"Okay.\"","After the movie, which ended around 10 PM, Chi Yu still wanted to spend more time with Song Luokui, so they walked around leisurely.","Suddenly, Chi Yu said to Song Luokui, \"I need to be honest with you about something.\"","She looked up at him, \"What is it?\"","\"I bought the apartment across from your place at ChunWang Manor, and I'm having it renovated.\"","Song Luokui was surprised, \"But that's not very close to your company.\"","Previously, when Li Bei had mentioned it, Song Luokui had wondered who had bought it, not realizing it was her own boyfriend.","Chi Yu explained, \"I want to be closer to you. At least then we won't have to sneak around so much when we see each other.\" He hadn't seen her in several days and was worried she might be losing interest in him.","Seeing the sincerity in his eyes, Song Luokui's heart softened. \"When school's out for the summer, I'll come see you more often. But I'm worried you might be too busy then.\"","Chi Yu suddenly asked, \"How about we go to Banras during the break?\"","Song Luokui hesitated, \"But then I'll need to make up an excuse. I'm not sure what I'll say.\"","\"I'll take care of it, as long as you want to go,\" Chi Yu assured her.","Song Luokui looked at him. He had mentioned taking her to Banras before, and he seemed really excited about the idea. She nodded.","Chi Yu smiled and squeezed her hand tightly, \"I'll make the arrangements.\"","\"Okay,\" Song Luokui agreed.","Suddenly, a cotton candy vendor appeared in front of them. Chi Yu said, \"Can I get one, boss?\"","\"Sure thing!\" the vendor replied.","After paying, Chi Yu handed the cotton candy to Song Luokui. She always felt like he was bringing her down to earth a bit when he did things like this.","\"Why did you want to buy me cotton candy?\" she asked.","Chi Yu explained, \"Other people do it, so I thought you should have some too.\"","Song Luokui's heart melted a little. She took a bite and then offered it to Chi Yu, \"You try some.\"","Chi Yu leaned down and took a bite. It was his first time eating cotton candy, and he ended up with some of it around his mouth. Song Luokui laughed at the sight.","Chi Yu wiped his mouth and laughed as well."]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: Daily","paragraphs":["When Song Luokui returned home, it was already past 11 o'clock. As soon as she stepped in, she saw Song Luosheng sitting in the living room. Her heart skipped a beat, but she pretended nothing was wrong. \"Brother, why are you back so late today? And why aren't you asleep yet?\"","Song Luosheng looked at her. \"Tell me, where have you been? And so late at night without anyone with you?\"","Song Luokui pouted her lips. \"I just went out to play. Jing City isn't that dangerous, is it? Or is it that you've offended someone again recently?\"","Hearing this, Song Luosheng's guilt immediately resurfaced. When Song Luokui came over and patted his head, he said, \"No, it's just that your company's cash cow had some trouble recently. I was worried someone might target you.\"","Song Luokui said, \"I don't go to the company that often, so I don't think many outsiders know about me.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Tell me, did you go to the club and pick up some male models again?\"","Song Luokui: ???","Song Luosheng: \"I know you too well. Did you go to the club with your girlfriends and pick up some male models? Otherwise, why would you come back so late? Have you forgotten about the incident with the police station before?\"","Song Luokui: \"Uh... well, it was just for some entertainment, that's all.\"","Yes, Chi Yu could also be considered the male model she had picked.","Song Luosheng: \"The men outside are dirty. Just look, don't play with them. You shouldn't do that.\"","Song Luokui: \"I haven't played with them at all.\"","Song Luosheng: \"I know you've grown up, and I shouldn't be so strict with you. But next time, remember to call and let me know where you are. Aunt Gui was worried.\"","Song Luokui hugged Song Luosheng's arm. \"Okay, okay, I'll let you know next time.\"","\"Alright, go upstairs and rest.\"","\"Mm.\"","Back in her room, Song Luokui let out a sigh of relief, thinking that she might need to go to the club with her girlfriends to patch up the holes in her lie.","Falling in love is too difficult. Then she thought about Chi Yu's appearance tonight, oh well, even if it's hard, it's worth it. Dating an exceptional person requires some hardships.","Soon, it was the end of the semester, and Song Luokui had to take the final exams, so she didn't go on any more dates with Chi Yu. However, she's been staying on campus lately, so they could still talk on the phone, but Song Luokui always wore earphones when making the calls.","Wang Sisi and the others suspected that Song Luokui was in a relationship. Originally, only Wang Sisi would call her boyfriend in the evenings, but now there's another person - Song Luokui.","Sure enough, the phone rang again, and the others all turned to look at her.","Song Luokui calmly coughed a few times, put on her earphones, and answered the call. \"Hello?\"","On the other end, Chi Yu had just gotten off work. He was sitting in the backseat of the car, looking at the bustling traffic outside. Hearing Song Luokui's voice through the earphones, his fatigue dissipated a great deal.","Chi Yu's voice was a bit hoarse, as he had attended many meetings today and talked a lot. He leaned back in his seat, rubbing his eyes with one hand. \"I heard you had an exam on Marxist philosophy today? How did it go?\"","Song Luokui could hear the tiredness in his voice. \"Where are you? Have you gotten off work?\"","The three listening in: Off work? That means he's a working professional, not a student!","Chi Yu: \"Yes, I just got off work and am on my way home.\"","Song Luokui: \"You just got off work? Then take care of yourself. And don't ask about my exam results, or it might affect my performance in tomorrow's exam.\"","The three listeners: Overtime work? So late at night! There are two types of people - one is the company boss or executive who doesn't mind working overtime for the company, and the other is the laborer who has no choice. Of course, they're leaning towards the first type, but the truth is, there aren't many good-looking company bosses out there.","Wang Sisi: ... I hope it's Chi Senpai!","On the other end, Chi Yu chuckled after hearing Song Luokui's words. \"My bad, I won't ask then. No matter how you did, I'll get you a gift as a reward.\"","Song Luokui: \"A gift? For just taking an exam?\"","The three: Exam results get a gift? He's not bad!","Chi Yu: \"Of course, it's a reward for your hard work on the exam.\"","Song Luokui was quite pleased. \"Haha, then I'll be waiting for it.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mm.\"","As they were chatting, Song Luokui's phone rang again. She saw it was Zhang Xiyue and said to Chi Yu, \"Hold on, I need to take another call.\"","\"Hello? Zhang Xiyue?\"","On the other end, Zhang Xiyue was also chatting with her boyfriend, but Weng Jiao had called her, saying the girls should get together after the exams and have a reunion, as they hadn't met up in a long time.","Zhang Xiyue happily agreed, \"I'll let Luokui know.\"","Weng Jiao: \"Great, make sure she comes. I'll be upset if she doesn't.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"No problem!\"","Song Luokui heard about the reunion plans and had no objections. \"Okay, I'll be there.\"","After finishing the call with Zhang Xiyue, Song Luokui called Chi Yu back.","Chi Yu had suggested taking her out to celebrate the end of exams on the same day, but Song Luokui had already agreed to the reunion with her girlfriends. \"I can't, I just promised my girlfriends that I would join them for a get-together.\"","Chi Yu raised an eyebrow, sitting up straight. \"Going to pick up some male models?\"","Song Luokui: \"Huh? You're just like my brother. Why do you both think I'm going to the club to pick up male models?\"","Chi Yu: \"What do you mean?\"","Song Luokui quietly said, \"Last time when I went to the movies with you and came back late, my brother thought I went to the club with my girlfriends to pick up male models. Why do you and him think that whenever I'm going out with my girlfriends?\"","Chi Yu could only say that he and Song Luosheng's thoughts were quite similar, otherwise how could they be competing rivals.","Chi Yu: \"I'm sorry, I... I just, if you're going to pick someone up, why not pick me? I can do anything.\"","Song Luokui's face immediately flushed red, and she spoke softly with some indignation. \"You... How could you say that?\"","Chi Yu let out a low chuckle, and that laughter seemed to resonate in Song Luokui's heart. Speaking in a low voice, he said, \"So... will you pick me?\"","Song Luokui: \"No! I'm not going to the club to pick up male models, and you're not allowed to go either. Anyway, it's late, I need to take a shower and go to sleep. I have an exam tomorrow.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay, I've never done that before.\" He only went to the club when there was business to be done, not for those kinds of things, as he found it too dirty.","\"Alright, good night.\"","\"Good night.\"","After hanging up, Song Luokui turned around and saw the three with their ears perked up, listening intently.","Song Luokui: ...","Wang Sisi: \"Hey, uh... Luokui, are you in a relationship? You've been making a lot of phone calls lately.\"","Song Luokui's blush hadn't fully faded yet, but she didn't deny it. \"I guess you could say that.\"","\"Wow~\" The three immediately got excited, since the person involved had admitted it.","Song Luokui: \"Are you guys that excited? But keep it a secret, I don't want everyone to know yet.\"","Wang Sisi: \"I know, I know. In the future, you can just change boyfriends as you please.\"","Zhang Jingfeng and Su Ziyuan suddenly understood, \"Yeah, yeah, we won't tell. You can just change whenever you're not happy.\"","Song Luokui couldn't help but chuckle. \"I'm not that fickle. I'm going to take a shower now.\""]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: Sisterhood","paragraphs":["After the exams were over, everyone was freed. Zhang Jingfeng bought a train ticket for that day and went home straight away, while Wang Sisi stayed at school for a part-time job, mainly to accompany her boyfriend. Su Ziyuan bought a ticket for the next day.","Song Luokui finished her last exam, then went back to the dorm to pack up and headed home. After changing into a new outfit, she went out again as she had a gathering with her girlfriends today.","The venue for today's gathering was not at a clubhouse, nor was there any male model, but rather at the villa of Weng Jiao.","When Song Luokui arrived, she saw Weng Jiao and Lou Sasa already in the swimming pool wearing bikinis, swimming freely like beautiful mermaids.","Near the pool, there were food and drinks laid out. Zhang Xiyue was sitting on a chair by the pool sipping a cocktail, with someone giving her a leg massage with essential oils.","Upon seeing Song Luokui, she asked the two masseuses to leave and stood up to welcome her, \"Luokui, you're here!\" she said, pulling her into a hug.","Song Luokui's face was buried in her soft chest, almost suffocating.","Song Luokui pushed her away and looked toward the people in the pool, \"A pool party today?\"","Zhang Xiyue said, \"Did you bring your swimsuit? It's too hot, swimming would be so nice.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"I haven't eaten yet, let me grab some food first.\"","As soon as Zhang Xiyue heard this, she followed her to the table filled with delicacies and sat down, \"Now that we're on vacation, do you have any plans? We're thinking of going abroad for a trip, do you want to join us?\"","Song Luokui asked, \"Where to?\"","Zhang Xiyue said, \"Not decided yet, maybe a few places.\"","Song Luokui suddenly remembered Chi Yu mentioning taking her to Banras. After considering it, she decided to prioritize her relationship over her friends, plus her company might have some business to attend to, so she declined.","\"I have things at my company. I won't go.\"","\"Speaking of your company, I heard your brother gave you an entertainment company to play with. How's it going?\" Zhang Xiyue rested her chin on her hand, \"An entertainment company, huh? Your company must have lots of handsome guys and pretty girls. Why don't you bring some of them to our next gathering?\"","Song Luokui glanced at her, \"You make me sound like a pimp. The company just got on track, and we only have a few signed talents, all of them women.\"","\"What do you mean no men?\" The others walked over, their hair slightly damp and wearing bathrobes.","Zhang Xiyue said, \"Luokui and I were talking about her company.\"","Weng Jiao went and sat on the other side of Song Luokui, \"Oh right, we knew you started a company. How's it going? Need any help from us sisters?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"Not for now, but I'll definitely ask you if I need help.\" She picked up a drink and clinked glasses with Weng Jiao, but asked if it was really just a drink before drinking.","Lou Sasa said, \"Ah! I can't believe the pleasure-seeking Luokui is actually doing business now. Remember us when you make money. I'll start sucking up to you in advance.\"","Song Luokui waved her hand, \"I'm just playing around. You might not even care about that, Sasa. And who are you calling a pleasure-seeker? Compared to you girls, I'm a small-time player.\"","In their friend circle, her sisters were all intoxicated by wealth and indulgence, with extensive social circles. Today they would socialize here, tomorrow somewhere else - their lives seemed nothing like ordinary college students. Well, they weren't really ordinary students either.","Lou Sasa smiled shyly and turned to Tu Shanyue, \"Xue, how about that blind date you mentioned before? It's been so long, what happened?\"","Tu Shanyue was taking small bites of cake, \"I went on a few dates, but didn't feel anything, so we're just friends.\"","Zhang Xiyue said, \"Xue, you're quite popular, huh? Tell us about those guys.\"","Tu Shanyue replied, \"If you girls went on blind dates, I'm sure you'd be even more popular than me.\"","Weng Jiao said, \"Let's stop talking about that. Are we going to go play during the vacation?\"","Zhang Xiyue pointed at Song Luokui, \"Luokui said she can't, she has things at her company.\"","Song Luokui swallowed a mouthful of pasta, \"I can't do a month or two abroad, but a few days should be fine, as long as I make arrangements to avoid business conflicts.\"","Weng Jiao shook her head, \"Never mind then, let's not get in the way of Businesswoman Song making her fortune. After all, I want her to take me along to get rich too. What about the rest of you?\"","Zhang Xiyue's eyes shifted as she thought of the freshman boy she had recently hooked, and raised her hand, \"I don't want to go too long either.\"","Weng Jiao said, \"Let's plan for a month then. We can come back in between if anything comes up, no need to stay out the whole summer vacation.\"","Zhang Xiyue hesitated for a bit, \"When are we going?\"","Weng Jiao replied, \"As soon as we decide, we'll go. Tomorrow even.\"","Zhang Xiyue said, \"Give me two hours to think about it.\"","Weng Jiao said, \"No time to waste.\"","Zhang Xiyue nodded, \"Got it, got it.\"","The rest had no objections to going either, as they had no commitments.","They played so late that they ended up staying over at Weng Jiao's villa that night. Earlier, Zhang Xiyue had secretly called her little boyfriend to reassure him before quickly announcing that she would be going on the trip too.","The next afternoon, the group flew abroad, while Song Luokui stayed home lounging around.","In the evening, she snuck out again to meet up with Chi Yu for a date. She grabbed Chi Yu's hand and said, \"My girlfriends all went traveling, but I stayed for you. Aren't I so good to you?\"","Chi Yu smiled, \"Yes. So I've already made the arrangements for us to go to Banras. Just let me know when you want to go.\"","Song Luokui was surprised, \"That fast?\"","Chi Yu nodded, \"Yes, you can go whenever. But going now would be better, I heard Banras is at its best during this time.\"","Song Luokui considered it, \"How many days should we go for?\"","Chi Yu asked, \"How many days do you want to go?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"Maybe a little over a week or half a month would be enough, since you need to work too.\" She was afraid of being found out if they stayed too long.","\"Okay,\" Chi Yu had no objections.","Song Luokui said, \"Let me come up with an excuse when I get back.\"","Chi Yu replied, \"No need, I've already thought of an excuse for you.\"","Song Luokui was puzzled.","...","\"So you're going to a summer camp?\" Song Luosheng looked at the invitation letter.","Song Luokui nodded, \"Yep, I was invited, so of course I have to go. I'm on vacation anyway, I want to go out and play.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"But didn't you say yesterday that your girlfriends went out to play without you?\"","Song Luokui whined, \"Ah, this is different. I'm going for an exchange program. Anyway, I'm going.\"","Song Luosheng couldn't resist when she acted cute, \"Alright, alright, go ahead. Let me check if it's legitimate first though.\"","Song Luokui assured, \"Of course it's legitimate.\" Although she knew Chi Yu's arrangements should be fine, she was still worried about being found out.","Song Luokui added, \"But you should still check.\"","\"Okay then.\"","After investigating, it did appear to be legitimate. Song Luokui kept nagging as she packed her things, even wanting Li Bei to join her, but eventually had to cancel that plan since they couldn't accommodate another person.","Song Luokui breathed a sigh of relief, thankfully."]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: Banras","paragraphs":["Of course, Song Moqian and Rong Cheng did not object, as they felt it was good for their children to go out and have a look around.","Before leaving, Song Luokui also went to visit her grandparents, both on her paternal and maternal sides.","Grandmother Lin Xianyuan held her hand and said, \"Last time I was chatting with my sisters, each one of them was boasting about how wonderful their grandchildren were. I thought to myself that none of them could compare to my granddaughter.\"","Song Luokui smiled, \"Grandma, everyone thinks their own family members are the best.\"","Lin Xianyuan said, \"There was even someone bragging to me about how amazing her granddaughter's boyfriend is. I didn't think much of it. Luokui, in the future, Grandma will introduce you to an even better one, so I can brag about you too.\"","Song Luokui smiled without saying anything. She already had a boyfriend, and as for whether her grandmother could brag about him, she felt that she probably could.","Grandfather Song Ruhui said on the side, \"My Luokui is still young, let her play for a few more years before finding a boyfriend.\"","Lin Xianyuan retorted, \"When I was with you, you didn't say that.\"","Song Ruhui smiled sheepishly, \"Times have changed, you see.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Okay, okay, I came today to tell you all that I'm going abroad for a few days. I'll bring you back some gifts when I return.\"","Song Ruhui said, \"Do you have enough money? Grandpa will transfer some to you, I've just learned how to do that.\"","Lin Xianyuan chimed in, \"Let me do it, let me do it, I've learned too.\"","Song Luokui happily leaned into Grandmother Lin Xianyuan's embrace. The happiest thing in her life was having such a loving family, so she would never allow the tragic ending of the Song family in the book to happen.","Song Luosheng saw Song Luokui off at the airport. \"Don't talk to strangers, don't accept anything from strangers, and don't go out alone with boys, they all have ulterior motives...\"","Song Luokui: ...Sorry, brother, but this time she was going out alone with a boy.","After boarding the plane, she thought she would only see Chi Yu when they landed, but when she was about to lie down and sleep in her first-class seat, a hand passed her a blanket.","Song Luokui looked up and saw Chi Yu's face. She immediately sat up, slightly surprised, \"How are you here? I thought you'd be waiting for me over there.\"","Chi Yu gripped her hand tightly, \"I wanted to be with you.\" He was definitely going to be with her.","Song Luokui said, \"Okay, okay, the journey ahead is a bit long, but with you, I won't feel lonely.\"","In fact, she wouldn't feel lonely at all, because she slept the whole way, and when she woke up, they were almost there. As she opened her eyes, she was still a bit disoriented.","Chi Yu, however, had been watching her for a long time, and seeing her disoriented expression, his heart softened. He reached out and cupped her face, drawing closer to her. \"You've woken up? We're about to arrive.\"","Song Luokui was still a bit groggy, her voice soft, \"Okay~\"","Chi Yu had the flight attendant bring him a cup of warm water, and then he fed it to Song Luokui. The flight attendant next to them glanced over and sighed appreciatively at the good-looking couple.","When they got off the plane, Song Luokui was still a bit droopy. Chi Yu kept his arm around her. \"Let's go to the hotel first, then you can decide where you want to play.\"","Song Luokui: \"But what about the summer camp...\"","Chi Yu: \"I've already arranged that.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","They were greeted by a driver outside the airport, who took them to a five-star hotel and helped them check in before leaving.","The room was a luxurious suite, and from the balcony, they could see the beach and the nearby forest.","The blue ocean was sparkling in the sunlight, and there weren't too many people on the beach. They could even see coconuts on the palm trees, with one randomly falling down, luckily not hitting anyone.","Song Luokui stretched as she stood on the balcony, and her spirits finally lifted. She first sent a message to her family to let them know she had arrived safely, then took out her camera and started filming the beautiful scenery in the distance.","Chi Yu was unpacking the luggage, and he had helped Song Luokui pack as well. When he came across her black undergarment, his face suddenly turned red, but he still carefully put everything away in the closet.","Song Luokui finished taking some photos and turned around, just in time to see him hanging up her clothes. She quickly snatched them from him, \"Uh, I can take care of my own clothes.\"","Chi Yu looked at her reddened ears and couldn't resist reaching out to touch them. Song Luokui jumped back, her voice becoming coy, \"Don't touch me.\"","\"Ahem, I'll go order some food to be delivered.\" Chi Yu, afraid he wouldn't be able to control himself, went out to make a call.","Song Luokui, blushing, prepared to put away her own clothes, only to find that they had already been neatly organized, including her delicates.","Song Luokui covered her face, suddenly realizing that they would be staying together tonight. Not exactly staying together, but in the same suite, with two rooms. Still, she felt a bit bashful.","Their relationship had progressed a bit quickly. She had wanted to take things slow and keep it ambiguous, but then Chi Yu had prepared a confession ceremony with a nice atmosphere, and she didn't want to seem too callous, so she agreed.","After that, they hadn't gone on many dates, and when they met, it wasn't much different from before, except now they could hold hands, and she had kissed his cheek once, but never again.","Chi Yu was very respectful of her, occasionally just unable to resist touching her face or hugging her, but otherwise quite gentlemanly.","Now, they were going to be staying in the same suite. Song Luokui patted her face, deciding to trust in Chi Yu's character...although later she felt she had trusted too soon.","After washing her face, she came out and saw the food had been delivered.","Song Luokui sat down, seeing that it was all her favorite dishes. \"It looks amazing.\"","Chi Yu had set the table nicely. \"Shall we take some photos?\"","He picked up the camera from the sofa. \"I'll take them for you.\"","Song Luokui still trusted his photography skills, \"Okay, take some.\"","Song Luokui struck several poses, and Chi Yu's photos turned out great, capturing her beauty. Song Luokui sighed, \"It's just a pity I can't post them on WeChat.\"","Not being able to post on WeChat was definitely the saddest part for Chi Yu, as he really wanted to make their relationship public. But Song Luokui only emo-ed for a second before happily coming over to him, \"I want to take some with you.\"","Chi Yu immediately brightened up, \"Okay.\"","In the photos, Chi Yu had his arm around her shoulders, and they both smiled at the camera. In the next one, Song Luokui was smiling, while Chi Yu gazed at her.","After a few more photos, Song Luokui said, \"Okay, okay, let's eat now.\"","She picked up her fork and took a bite of the meat, nodding in satisfaction, \"It's delicious!\"","After finishing the meal, Chi Yu had the staff clear the table and then asked, \"Shall we go out and play now?\"","Song Luokui looked outside, she was indeed itching to go, but she needed to change clothes to go to the beach. \"I'll go change first, do you need to change too?\"","Chi Yu of course needed to change as well, \"Mmh, let's both go change.\"","\"Okay.\"","Back in the room, Song Luokui looked at the clothes in the closet, unsure of what to wear."]}]);
